rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the spell is not countered (because the spell it targets can\'t be countered), then it does not get exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card does not go to the graveyard before being exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "If you name a card that has both a mana ability and another activated ability, the mana ability can be activated but the other ability can\'t be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "Pithing Needle affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards. For example, a player can\'t cycle Eternal Dragon or return an Eternal Dragon from their graveyard to hand if Pithing Needle naming Eternal Dragon is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "You can name any card, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You can\'t name a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Once Pithing Needle has left the battlefield, activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can be activated again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form "[cost]: [effect]." Triggered abilities and static abilities of the named card work normally.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You may reveal the card even if it\'s not an instant or sorcery. Whether or not you reveal it, the card stays on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If Unruly Mob and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both attacking or blocking), Unruly Mob won\'t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can\'t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may choose Timberland Guide as the target of its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "A spell that can\'t be countered is a legal target for Devious Cover-Up. The spell won\'t be countered when Devious Cover-Up resolves, but you\'ll still shuffle cards into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Devious Cover-Up can\'t target itself at all. You can\'t try to counter it with itself and shuffle cards in, and you can\'t use its effect to shuffle itself into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'You may target zero cards in your graveyard and still shuffle your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Thermo-Alchemist\'s activated ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Thermo-Alchemist\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered. Players can cast spells and activate abilities (such as Thermo-Alchemist\'s own activated ability) after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As Clear Shot tries to resolve, if either creature is an illegal target, the creature you control won\'t deal damage. If the creature you control is a legal target but the other creature isn\'t, your creature will still get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Clear Shot unless you choose a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Bladebrand tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Field of Ruin\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. No players search for a basic land card or shuffles. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), each player does search and shuffle."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A creature with disturb is one that has the disturb keyword ability in its text box. Notably, permanents that were cast using the disturb ability rarely end up having disturb on the battlefield. Barring some very weird circumstances with copy effects, if a card\'s front face has disturb but its back face is on the battlefield, that permanent doesn\'t have disturb."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A transforming permanent doesn\'t leave the battlefield as it transforms. If Brutal Cathar transforms into Moonrage Brute, the exiled cards remain exiled. If it transforms with its triggered ability on the stack, that ability will still exile the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Brutal Cathar\'s ability creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Brutal Cathar (or Moonrage Brute) leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Brutal Cathar leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield/transforms-into ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Brutal Cathar\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Moonrage Brute leaving the battlefield will also cause the exiled card to return to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after this creature leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. The two creatures aren\'t on the battlefield at the same time. For example, if the returning creature is a Clone, it can\'t enter the battlefield as a copy of Brutal Cathar or Moonrage Brute."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "After Arlinn, the Moon Fury\'s second loyalty ability resolves, she is a Werewolf creature and not a planeswalker, so she doesn\'t lose loyalty counters when she\'s dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Arlinn, the Moon\'s Fury\'s first loyalty ability is not a mana ability. It uses the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Arlinn, the Moon Fury\'s second loyalty ability is making her a Werewolf creature and it somehow becomes day, Arlinn will transform, but the effect making her a Werewolf creature will continue to apply for the rest of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "After Curse of Leeches transforms into Leeching Lurker, it will become unattached from the player it\'s attached to as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Attaching Curse of Leeches as it transforms doesn\'t target a player, so it can be attached to a player with hexproof this way."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Leeching Lurker is on the battlefield during night, and the active player casts two or more spells during the turn, it will become day as the next turn begins. This will cause Leeching Lurker to transform into Curse of Leeches and become attached to a player. This all happens before that turn\'s upkeep, so the triggered ability of Curse of Leeches will trigger at the beginning of that turn\'s upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast Curse of Leeches while it is night, you must still choose a target player, and that player must be a legal target as Curse of Leeches resolves. It enters the battlefield transformed and is not attached to that player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "All costs to cast a spell are locked in before mana abilities are activated and those costs are paid. If Vadrik\'s power changes after costs are locked in, or if Vadrik leaves the battlefield while you are activating mana abilities or paying those costs, the cost reduction effect won\'t be affected and the total cost to cast the spell won\'t change."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability triggers whenever day becomes night or night becomes day, it only triggers if it was already either day/night and becomes the other. It does not trigger when the game becomes day or night for the first time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Although the returned creature is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Effects that say that the returned creature can\'t attack (if the creature has defender, for example) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the returned creature from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple creatures dying will cause Bereaved Survivor to transform only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the returned creature is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker Dauntless Avenger is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Applying the replacement effect can\'t cause Enduring Angel to transform if it isn\'t a double-faced permanent; that is, if it\'s a token or if a single-faced permanent has become a copy of it. In that situation, you will lose the game."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Enduring Angel\'s last ability is a replacement effect. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Notably, players cannot try to destroy Enduring Angel to prevent it from transforming and cause you to lose the game."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a transforming double-faced card has somehow become a copy of Enduring Angel, the replacement effect will apply, the copy of Enduring Angel will transform, and your life total will become 3. However, because the copy effect that makes it Enduring Angel continues to apply to it after it transforms, it will still be a copy of Enduiring Angel. This means that the replacement effect will be applied again if your life total would be reduced to 0 or less a second time while that copy effect is still applied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To double a player\'s life total, that player gains an amount of life such that their new life total is twice its current value. (In some very unusual cases, a player may have a negative life total and will still be in the game. In those cases, the player will lose an amount of life such that their new life total is twice its current value.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Arrogant Outlaw\'s ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "As Poppet Factory transforms back into Poppet Stitcher, the effect making your creature tokens 3/3 and making them lose their abilities ends. Their base powers and toughnesses will revert to whatever they were before that effect started applying, although other effects that modify power and/or toughness, such as ones created by Auras, counters, and the like may still apply. They\'ll also have whatever abilities they had before they lost them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Poppet Factory\'s first ability removes all abilities from creature tokens you control, including ones they were created with and ones they gained since the last time Poppet Factory transformed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Attaching an Equipment with its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability isn\'t the same as using its equip ability. You don\'t pay mana for the attachment, and the timing restrictions for equip abilities don\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, the Equipment remains on the battlefield unattached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "Bramble Armor doesn\'t enter the battlefield attached to a creature. Instead, the Equipment enters the battlefield and then a triggered ability attaches it to a creature. You may cast Bramble Armor even if you don\'t control any creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to an exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Borrowed Time\'s ability is a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the permanent when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Borrowed Time leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Borrowed Time leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Borrowed Time\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Bat Whisperer\'s ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Bloodtithe Collector\'s triggered ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Creeping Inn will phase in during its controller\'s untap step. It will be able to attack the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Each Aura and Equipment attached to a permanent that\'s phasing out also phases out. They will phase in with that permanent and still be attached to it. Similarly, permanents that phase out with counters phase in with those counters."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If Creeping Inn is attacking or blocking when it phases out, it is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of Creeping Inn and it phases out and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases in, it phases in under your control as that opponent\'s appropriate untap step begins. If they leave the game before that untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after that turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Phasing out doesn\\\'t cause any "leaves the battlefield" abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\\\'t cause any "enters the battlefield" abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Phasing out or phasing in doesn\'t affect which face of a double-faced card is face up."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'When Creeping Inn phases in, it still remembers what cards were previously exiled with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "While Creeping Inn is phased out, it\'s treated as though it doesn\'t exist. It can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, its static abilities have no effect on the game, its triggered abilities can\'t trigger, it can\'t attack or block, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Falkenrath Pit Fighter\'s ability can be activated if any opponent lost any amount of life this turn, even if they also gained life at some point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Olag becomes a copy of another transforming double-faced card that doesn\'t have nightbound, such as Delver of Secrets, abilities of it gains or other effects may cause it to transform. If it transforms this way, it does not become Ludevic again. The copy effect continues to apply and its characteristics don\'t change. If the creature it is a copy of has a triggered ability that occurs when it transforms, that ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If there are no creature cards exiled with Ludevic as it transforms, perhaps because those cards were removed from exile in response to its activated ability or it transformed another way, Olag won\'t be a copy of anything. Olag will simply be its 4/4 self with no +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "It\'s possible for Olag to become a copy of a card with the daybound keyword ability as it transforms. If this happens, it doesn\'t transform as it becomes night."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Olag remains a copy of the creature card you choose even if that card later leaves exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You choose which exiled creature card Olag is copying as it transforms. It doesn\'t transform and then become a copy."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If The Meathook Massacre enters the battlefield and it wasn\'t cast (or it was cast without paying its mana cost), X will be 0. The first ability will trigger, but it won\'t be much of a massacre."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s power is less than 0 when it\'s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Bear Cub, a 2/2 creature, -4/-0 so that it\'s a -2/2 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+2, and it becomes a -4/4 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to "double" a creature\\\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. Similarly, a creature whose toughness is doubled gets +0/+X, where X is its toughness as the effect begins to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Unnatural Growth, each one applies independently. For example, if you control two copies of Unnatural Growth, a 2/2 Bear Cub becomes a 4/4 creature when the first ability resolves and then becomes an 8/8 creature when the second one resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a non-Horror creature with a slime counter on it somehow becomes a Horror, the effect making it 2/2 and making it lose its abilities ends. Its base power and toughness will revert to whatever it was before that effect started applying, although other effects that modify power and/or toughness, such as ones created by Auras, counters, and the like may still apply. It\'ll also have whatever abilities it had before it lost them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Sludge Monster\'s last ability affects all non-Horror creatures with slime counters on them, not just creatures that had slime counters put on them with Sludge Monster\'s first ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an effect causes Vengeful Strangler to transform on the battlefield, rather than leaving it and returning transformed, then Strangling Grasp doesn\'t become attached to any object and is put into your graveyard. This won\'t cause abilities that trigger when a creature leaves the battlefield to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If another effect modifies how much damage a spell would deal to an opponent or a permanent they control, including preventing some of it, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses an order in which to apply those effects. If all of the damage is prevented, Rem\'s effect no longer applies."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control, divide the original amount before adding 1. For example, if you cast a spell that deals 4 damage divided among any number of targets and you choose to have it deal 2 damage to a creature and 2 damage to that creature\'s controller, that spell will deal 3 damage to each of them instead."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Rem Karolus, Stalwart Slayer\'s last two abilities apply only to damage dealt by spells on the stack. A spell that becomes a permanent and then deals damage won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Some spells cause other objects to deal damage, such as spells that cause two creatures to fight. Rem Karolus, Stalwart Slayer\'s last two abilities don\'t apply to damage from such effects."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The additional 1 damage is dealt by the original source of damage. The additional damage isn\'t dealt by Rem Karolus."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If one or more targets are illegal as the first ability resolves, but at least one target is still legal, the ability will affect only the remaining legal targets and you\'ll gain 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you create an emblem with the last ability, your permanents will untap at the same time as your opponent\'s permanents during their untap step. They will draw a card during their draw step and then you will draw a card during their draw step. No player gets priority to cast spells or activate abilities between those card draws."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If, while activating mana abilities during the resolution of Jerren\'s last ability, you somehow gain or lose life, you will still be able to finish paying the cost and Jerren will still transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Jerren\'s last ability will trigger only if you have exactly 13 life at the beginning of your end step. You will be able to pay {4}{B}{B} only if you have exactly 13 life as that ability begins to resolve. If your life total isn\'t 13 at that point, the ability will have no effect. You won\'t be able to pay {4}{B}{B} and Jerren won\'t transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of lifelink are redundant, so giving lifelink to a Human that already has it gives no additional benefit.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Lambholt Harrier\'s ability must be activated before blockers are declared to have any effect. Activating it after a creature has been declared as a blocker will not remove that creature from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Most mana abilities found on artifacts are activated mana abilities. An activated mana ability is an activated ability that could produce mana as it resolves, does not require a target, and isn\'t a loyalty ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Some artifacts, such as Gauntlet of Power, have triggered mana abilities. A triggered mana ability is a triggered ability that could produce mana as it resolves, triggers on the resolution of an activated mana ability or on mana being added, and doesn\'t require a target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Mounted Dreadknight\'s last ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Saryth\'s first ability doesn\'t care whether Saryth is tapped or untapped. The same is true for the second ability. Both abilities apply as long as Saryth is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Since Siege Zombie\'s activated ability doesn\'t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began (including Siege Zombie itself) to pay the cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Since Skaab Wrangler\'s activated ability doesn\'t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began (including Skaab Wrangler itself) to pay the cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Stromkirk Bloodthief\'s ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The blocking restriction is applied only when blockers are declared. Once a creature equipped with Hedgewitch\'s Mask becomes blocked by a creature with power less than 4, increasing that creature\'s power won\'t cause the equipped creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The controller of Curse of Surveillance chooses the targets for its triggered ability, no matter which player it is attached to. If you control Curse of Surveillance and it\'s attached to another player, you can (and probably should) choose yourself as a target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The controller of the enchanted creature creates the Human token, even if they aren\'t the controller of Cathar\'s Call."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The enchanted creature can still be untapped in other ways. Locked in the Cemetery will remain attached, and the creature will continue to not untap during its controller\'s untap step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Triskaidekaphile\'s triggered ability will trigger only if you have exactly thirteen cards in your hand as your upkeep starts. If you have fewer cards in your hand, you won\'t be able to draw cards during your upkeep in time to cause the ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Use Willow Geist\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life you will gain as its last ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Use the enchanted creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Use the equipped creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must pay exactly X life or nothing. You can\'t pay less life to draw fewer cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Vampire Socialite\'s last two abilities care whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Voldaren Ambusher\'s ability cares whether an opponent lost life this turn, not how their life total changed. For example, an opponent who gained 2 life and lost 1 life in the same turn still lost life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Voldaren Ambusher\'s ability counts the number of Vampires you control as it resolves. If something happens in response such that you don\'t control any Vampires when it resolves, Voldaren Ambusher won\'t deal damage to the target creature or planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You choose whether to return a creature to your hand and which creature to return as Loyal Gryff\'s triggered ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose the land card you will return to your hand until after you have milled three cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You will note your life total as the second ability resolves, even if you don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You won\'t draw a card if you don\'t control the target permanent as Geistwave resolves, even if you controlled that permanent at some previous point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A copy is created even if the spell that caused Galvanic Iteration\'s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Galvanic Iteration\'s ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you resolve one Galvanic Iteration after another (or cast the same one with flashback), the second Galvanic Iteration will be copied. That copy and spell each resolve, creating two delayed triggered abilities. The next spell you cast after that will be copied twice. If that spell is also a Galvanic Iteration, the following spell will be copied three times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The copy that Galvanic Iteration\\\'s ability creates is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Only you get to look at the exiled card. Its owner doesn\'t get to know what it is while it is in exile unless you tell them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to disclose which card you exiled and which card you put on the bottom of the library. For example, if your opponent knows what the top card of their library is and you cast Siphon Insight, you don\'t have to tell them where you put that card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You may play the card even if it is a land.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You must still follow all normal timing rules to play a card exiled with Siphon Insight.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"A spell you control" means a spell on the stack. Usually, spells on the stack can deal damage only as part of their own resolution.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A spell that becomes a permanent and then deals damage, such as one that has a triggered ability when it enters the battlefield, will not cause Embodiment of Flame\'s abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A spell that becomes a permanent and then deals damage, such as one that has a triggered ability when it enters the battlefield, will not cause Flame Channeler\'s abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Some spells cause other objects to deal damage, such as spells that have two creatures fight. In those cases, it\'s those other objects that are dealing damage, not the spell itself, and this will not cause Embodiment of Flame\'s abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Some spells cause other objects to deal damage, such as spells that have two creatures fight. In those cases, it\'s those other objects that are dealing damage, not the spell itself, and this will not cause Flame Channeler\'s abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs and follow all timing rules for cards you play with Embodiment of Flame\'s activated ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Disturb [cost]" means "You may cast this card transformed from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast this way enters the battlefield with its back face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A token dying will never cause the triggered ability to trigger because a token is not a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Disturb is found only on the front faces of some double-faced cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you copy a permanent spell cast this way (perhaps with a card like Double Major), the copy becomes a token that\'s a copy of the card\'s back face, even though it isn\'t itself a double-faced card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The back face of each card with disturb has an ability that instructs its controller to exile if it would be put into a graveyard from anywhere. This includes going to the graveyard from the stack, so if the spell is countered after you cast it using the disturb ability, it will be put into exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The second ability of Dennick, Pious Apprentice affects only spells and abilities that actually target cards in graveyards. Spells and abilities that affect cards in graveyards without targeting them may still affect them, move them to other zones, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Dennick, Pious Apparition looks at what type the cards are after they move to the graveyard to determine whether the ability should trigger, regardless of any types they may have had before they were in the graveyard. For example, a creature card that has become a noncreature permanent, perhaps because it was enchanted by Minimus Containment, will cause the ability to trigger when it\'s put into a graveyard. By contrast, a noncreature card that has become a creature on the battlefield will not cause the ability to trigger when it\'s put into a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a disturb cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of a spell cast using disturb is determined by the mana cost on the front face of the card, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was. (This is a special rule that applies only to transforming double faced-cards, including ones with disturb.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "When you cast a spell using a card\'s disturb ability, the card is put onto the stack with its back face up. The resulting spell has all the characteristics of that face."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Disturb [cost]" means "You may cast this card transformed from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast this way enters the battlefield with its back face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Disturb is found only on the front faces of some double-faced cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you copy a permanent spell cast this way (perhaps with a card like Double Major), the copy becomes a token that\'s a copy of the card\'s back face, even though it isn\'t itself a double-faced card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The back face of each card with disturb has an ability that instructs its controller to exile if it would be put into a graveyard from anywhere. This includes going to the graveyard from the stack, so if the spell is countered after you cast it using the disturb ability, it will be put into exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a disturb cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of a spell cast using disturb is determined by the mana cost on the front face of the card, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was. (This is a special rule that applies only to transforming double faced-cards, including ones with disturb.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "When you cast a spell using a card\'s disturb ability, the card is put onto the stack with its back face up. The resulting spell has all the characteristics of that face."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Duelcraft Trainer\'s triggered ability checks to see if you have three or more creatures with different powers both when it triggers and as it tries to resolve. If you don\'t have three creatures with different powers as it tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If Memory Deluge is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so X will be 0. The amount of mana spent to cast the original spell is not copied. You won\'t look at any cards from your library as Memory Deluge resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast Memory Deluge without paying its mana cost, X will be 0. Memory Deluge will resolve, but you won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an effect requires you to pay some amount of mana to prevent Memory Deluge from being countered, as Flip the Switch does, that mana wasn\'t spent to cast Memory Deluge and will not be taken into account."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Memory Deluge cares about the mana you actually paid to cast it, not its mana cost. If you cast Memory Deluge for {2}{U}{U}, you will look at four cards. If you cast it with flashback for {5}{U}{U}, you will look at seven cards. Any effects that increase or decrease the cost to cast it will also be taken into account.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The effects of Might of the Old Ways happen in the listed order, so the +2/+2 bonus happens before you check the powers of creatures you control. For example, if you control two 2/2 creatures and a 5/5 creatures, choosing one of the 2/2 creatures as the target will allow you to draw a card. Conversely, if you control a 1/1 creature, a 3/3 creature, and a 5/5 creature, targeting either of the two smaller creatures will not allow you to draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If only one target is still legal as Wake to Slaughter resolves (or if you only chose one target), that\'s the card your opponent will have to choose to put into your hand. They can\'t choose to have you return it to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If the target permanent became an illegal target by the time Dire-Strain Rampage tried to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No player will search their library for any cards. However, if the target is still legal but wasn\'t destroyed, perhaps because it was indestructible, its controller may still search their library for a basic land card (even if the target was a land)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast Seize the Storm with no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard and no cards with flashback in exile, the Elemental will start as a 0/0 creature. However, state-based actions won\'t be checked until after Seize the Storm has finished resolving. The Elemental will then be a 1/1 creature and survive because Seize the Storm will either be in your graveyard or in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The power and toughness of the Elemental token will change as the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard and the number of cards with flashback you own in exile change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "While a spell is on the stack, it is neither in your graveyard nor in exile, so it won\'t contribute to the Elemental\'s power and toughness. For example, with Seize the Storm in your graveyard and no cards in exile, the 1/1 Elemental in the above scenario will become 0/0 and die if you cast Seize the Storm from your graveyard using flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you control three or more creatures with different powers and the target creature you control is still a legal target as Duel for Dominance resolves but the target creature you don\'t control isn\'t, you will still put a +1/+1 counter on the creature you control. It isn\'t much of a duel, but your creature is still dominant."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Only the +1/+1 counter is contingent on having three or more creatures with different powers. The target creatures will still fight even if you don\'t have three or more creatures with different powers when Duel for Dominance resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast Corpse Cobble using flashback, you still pay its additional cost of sacrificing any number of creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You may choose to sacrifice no creatures to pay the additional cost. If you do, you\\\'ll create a 0/0 Zombie token. Unless something else is raising its toughness, the token will subsequently die, but any "enters the battlefield" or "dies" triggered abilities will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast Rite of Oblivion using flashback, you must still pay its additional cost of sacrificing a nonland permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Except for power, toughness, creature type, and color, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or it is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the new token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token, with the exceptions noted above."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied, with the exceptions noted above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Each affected library is shuffled only once, even if multiple cards are being shuffled into it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you choose target cards in graveyards and all of those targets are somehow illegal as Turn the Earth tries to resolve (perhaps because your opponent responded with a Turn the Earth of their own), the spell will not resolve and you will gain no life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You may choose no targets for Turn the Earth. In that case, no libraries will be shuffled and you\'ll just gain 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple instances of flashback, you may choose any of its flashback costs to pay.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with no mana cost gains flashback, it has no flashback cost. It can\'t be cast this way."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a split card gains flashback, you pay only the cost of the half you\'re casting."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with flashback, you can\'t pay any alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell with flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A creature has different power from another if their powers are different numbers. For example, a 1/1 creature and a 2/1 creature have different powers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Augur of Autumn doesn\'t change the times when you can play a land card from the top of your library. You can play a land only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty. Doing so counts as your land play for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Essentially, Augur of Autumn lets you play with the top card of your library revealed only to you. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand. You may look at the top card of your library whenever you want, even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "For three creatures to have different powers from one another, each of their powers needs to be different. A 1/1 creature, a 2/1 creature, and another 2/1 creature aren\'t three creatures with different powers, even though both 2/1 creatures have different power than the 1/1 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes during the process of casting a spell or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until the process of casting the spell or activating the ability ends (all targets are chosen, all costs are paid, and so on)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Many coven abilities, such as that of Dawnhart Wardens above, are triggered abilities with intervening if clauses. You must control three or more creatures with different powers at the time the ability triggers and at the time the ability tries to resolve. They do not, however, need to be the same set of creatures in both cases.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The top card of your library isn\'t in your hand, so you can\'t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "While you have three creatures with different powers, Augur of Autumn allows you to cast the top card of your library if it\'s a creature card, it\'s your main phase, and the stack is empty. If that creature card has flash, you\'ll be able to cast it any time you could cast an instant, even on an opponent\'s turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A creature has different power from another if their powers are different numbers. For example, a 1/1 creature and a 2/1 creature have different powers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "For three creatures to have different powers from one another, each of their powers needs to be different. A 1/1 creature, a 2/1 creature, and another 2/1 creature aren\'t three creatures with different powers, even though both 2/1 creatures have different power than the 1/1 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Harvesttide Sentry\'s triggered ability checks your creatures\' powers both when it triggers and as it tries to resolve. If you somehow don\'t have enough creatures with different powers as it tries to resolve, nothing happens and Harvesttide Sentry can be blocked as normal."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Many coven abilities, such as that of Dawnhart Wardens above, are triggered abilities with intervening if clauses. You must control three or more creatures with different powers at the time the ability triggers and at the time the ability tries to resolve. They do not, however, need to be the same set of creatures in both cases.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Once its ability resolves, removing one of the creatures with different powers won\'t allow a player to block Harvesttide Sentry with creatures with power 2 or less."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The blocking restriction is applied only when blockers are declared. After the coven ability resolves, if a player blocks Harvesttide Sentry with a creature with power greater than 2, reducing that creature\'s power won\'t make Harvesttide Sentry unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A creature has different power from another if their powers are different numbers. For example, a 1/1 creature and a 2/1 creature have different powers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "For three creatures to have different powers from one another, each of their powers needs to be different. A 1/1 creature, a 2/1 creature, and another 2/1 creature aren\'t three creatures with different powers, even though both 2/1 creatures have different power than the 1/1 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Many coven abilities, such as that of Dawnhart Wardens above, are triggered abilities with intervening if clauses. You must control three or more creatures with different powers at the time the ability triggers and at the time the ability tries to resolve. They do not, however, need to be the same set of creatures in both cases.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast this way enters the battlefield with its back face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Disturb is found only on the front faces of some double-faced cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you copy a permanent spell cast this way (perhaps with a card like Double Major), the copy becomes a token that\'s a copy of the card\'s back face, even though it isn\'t itself a double-faced card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The back face of each card with disturb has an ability that instructs its controller to exile if it would be put into a graveyard from anywhere. This includes going to the graveyard from the stack, so if the spell is countered after you cast it using the disturb ability, it will be put into exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a disturb cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of a spell cast using disturb is determined by the mana cost on the front face of the card, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was. (This is a special rule that applies only to transforming double faced-cards, including ones with disturb.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "When you cast a spell using a card\'s disturb ability, the card is put onto the stack with its back face up. The resulting spell has all the characteristics of that face."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'“Disturb [cost]” means “You may cast this card transformed from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than its mana cost.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when a creature "becomes blocked" resolve before combat damage is dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'After you pay the {1}{G} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers and you choose the targets for it. Players may respond to the new ability at that point. As that ability resolves, Primal Adversary gets its +1/+1 counters and the target lands become Wolf creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Any land that becomes a Wolf creature this way will retain any supertypes, card types, subtypes, and abilities it had.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'After you pay the {1}{U} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers and you choose the targets for it. Players may respond to the new ability at that point. As that ability resolves, Spectral Adversary gets its +1/+1 counters and the target permanents phase out.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Any continuous effects with a "for as long as" duration ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\\\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire. For example, phasing out Mind Flayer will cause the duration of its continuous effect ("for as long as you control Mind Flayer") to expire.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "As a permanent phases out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that permanent does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of one of your permanents, that permanent phases out, and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases back in, that permanent phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents that are phased out are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Phasing out doesn\\\'t cause any "leaves the battlefield" abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\\\'t cause any "enters the battlefield" abilities to trigger.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'After you pay the {1}{W} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers and players may respond to it. As that ability resolves, the Intrepid Adversary gets its valor counters.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'After you pay the {2}{B} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers. Players may respond to the new ability at that point. As that ability resolves, Tainted Adversary gets its counters and the tokens are created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'After you pay the {2}{R} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers and you choose the targets for it. Players may respond to the new ability at that point. As that ability resolves, Bloodthirsty Adversary gets its counters and the target cards are exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Copies cast this way are cast during the resolution of the ability. You don\'t have to follow normal timing requirements and you can\'t wait and cast them later."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Whether or not you cast the copies this way, the original cards will remain in exile.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Although the Human tokens created by the triggered ability are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Attacking with any creatures will cause Adeline\'s last ability to trigger. Adeline doesn\'t have to be among them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Adeline\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield. As long as Adeline is on the battlefield (and still a creature), that ability will count Adeline itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Tokens will be created for each of your opponents, not just opponents that you attacked.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You choose whether each token is attacking that opponent or a planeswalker they control as those tokens enter the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Because creatures controlled by opponents aren\\\'t dying due to Gisa\\\'s replacement effect, any "when [this creature] dies" triggered abilities those creatures have won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Gisa does not grant haste to the creatures that are returned to the battlefield, so you normally won\'t be able to attack with them the turn they are returned."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a creature your opponent controls would die and more than one effect would cause it to be exiled, that opponent chooses which one to apply. If the creature is exiled due to some other replacement effect, it will not be returned to the battlefield with Gisa.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a creature you control that\'s a Wolf and a Werewolf deals combat damage to a player, the first ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The first ability of each of Tovolar\'s faces triggers once for each Wolf or Werewolf you control that deals combat damage to a player. For example, if you attack with three Wolf creatures and they all deal combat damage to a player, the ability triggers three times."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The second ability of Tovolar, Dire Overlord seems a little strange because Tovolar and other Human Werewolf creatures in this set transform when it becomes night anyway. Tovolar, however, isn\'t content to transform Werewolf creatures from just one set. This ability will allow you to transform Human Werewolf creatures from previous visits to Innistrad as well."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Double-faced permanents with daybound transform to their nightbound faces as it becomes night. Similarly, double-faced permanents with nightbound transform to their daybound faces as it becomes day. This happens immediately and is not a state-based action. It happens any time it becomes day or night, not just during the untap step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, permanents with daybound that enter the battlefield without being cast will enter with their nightbound faces up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If it\'s neither day nor night, and a creature with daybound and a creature with nightbound somehow appear on the battlefield at the same time, it becomes day. The creature with nightbound will transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with daybound during night, that spell will be front face up (that is, daybound face up) on the stack. However, it will enter the battlefield with its back face up (that is, with its nightbound face up). It won\'t enter with its daybound face up and then transform."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Permanents with daybound and nightbound can\'t transform via any means other than their daybound and nightbound abilities. Notably, older cards such as Moonmist that instruct a player to transform permanents don\'t affect permanents with daybound or nightbound."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability triggers whenever day becomes night or night becomes day, it only triggers if it was already either day/night and becomes the other. It does not trigger when the game becomes day or night for the first time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The card you don\'t put into your graveyard stays on top of your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability triggers whenever day becomes night or night becomes day, it only triggers if it was already either day/night and becomes the other. It does not trigger when the game becomes day or night for the first time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You may choose to discard no cards when the Obsessive Astronomer\'s triggered ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If a triggered ability triggers whenever day becomes night or night becomes day, it only triggers if it was already either day/night and becomes the other. It does not trigger when the game becomes day or night for the first time.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If you choose to draw a card with The Celestus but some effect replaces that card draw with something else, you will still have to discard a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Before a player untaps their permanents during the untap step, the game checks to see if the day/night designation should change.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Day and night are designations that the game itself can have. The game starts as neither. Once the game becomes day (or less commonly, night), the game will be exactly one of them—day or night—going back and forth for the rest of the game.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If a triggered ability triggers whenever day becomes night or night becomes day, it only triggers if it was already either day/night and becomes the other. It does not trigger when the game becomes day or night for the first time.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If it is day, and the active player of the previous turn cast no spells during their turn, it becomes night.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If it is night, and the active player of the previous turn cast two or more spells during their turn, it becomes day.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Consuming Blob counts card types, not individual cards. If the only card in your graveyard is an artifact creature card, Consuming Blob will be 2/3. If the only cards in your graveyard are ten artifact creature cards, Consuming Blob will still be 2/3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell deals damage to Consuming Blob or reduces its toughness to 0, that spell is put into its owner\'s graveyard before state-based actions are performed. If that card is the first of its type to enter the graveyard of Consuming Blob\'s controller, it will raise Consuming Blob\'s toughness before the game checks to see if it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Consuming Blob\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Consuming Blob is in your graveyard, it will count itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The above rulings are also true for Consuming Blob\'s children (except the first one, as Junior tends to not hang out in graveyards)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The card types in this set that can be in a graveyard are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, and sorcery. Some older cards also have the card type tribal. Legendary, basic, and snow are supertypes, not card types.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Florian\'s ability checks only how much life opponents lost during the turn, not by how much their life totals decreased compared to the start of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life before Florian\'s ability resolves, you\'ll look at the top two cards of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life and subsequently loses the game before your postcombat main phase, Florian\'s last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life but Florian leaves the battlefield before your postcombat main phase begins, its last ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you somehow have more than two main phases in a turn, each main phase after your first one is a postcombat main phase, and Florian\'s last ability triggers at the beginning of each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You get a postcombat main phase even if no creatures attacked during a turn. Florian\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs and follow all timing rules for cards you play with Florian\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose any targets for Rotten Reunion. However, if you do, and that target is illegal as Rotten Reunion tries to resolve (perhaps because your opponent responded with their own Rotten Reunion), it will be removed from the stack and you won\'t create a Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You will create a Zombie creature token even if the spell\'s controller pays {4}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not create any attacking requirements. You may choose not to attack with a creature that has decayed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed does not grant haste. Creatures with decayed that enter the battlefield during your turn may not attack until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Decayed represents a static ability and a triggered ability. "Decayed" means "This creature can\\\'t block" and "When this creature attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Once a creature with decayed attacks, it will be sacrificed at end of combat, even if it no longer has decayed at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'For more information about Day and Night and the Daybound and Nightbound abilities, please see the Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Mechanics atricle (https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/innistrad-midnight-hunt-mechanics-2021-09-02).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The phrase "if it\\\'s night" refers to the day or night designation the game can have. It does not refer to whether or not it\\\'s dark outside as you play the game.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'Heirloom Mirror will still be tapped after it transforms into Inherited Fiend unless some other effect has untapped it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If a player who has already cast a spell this turn becomes enchanted by Curse of Shaken Faith, casting more spells the same turn will cause the ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If some, but not all, of the target creatures are illegal targets as Defend the Celestus resolves, the original distribution of counters remains the same. Counters that were to be put on the now-illegal targets are lost.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'You decide how to distribute the counters as you cast Defend the Celestus. You must distribute at least one counter to each creature you target.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of other lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If you cast Electric Revelation using flashback, you must still pay its additional cost of discarding a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast a colorless spell, you may choose to discard your hand and draw no cards. Less great plan?\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand as Moonveil Regent\'s first ability resolves, you may still choose to discard your hand. You\'ll just draw a card for each of that spell\'s colors. Great plan!"}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Moonveil Regent\'s last ability triggers even if you control no permanents that are one or more colors when it dies. The amount of damage is calculated as the ability resolves. Consider only the permanents you control at that time to determine how much damage Moonveil Regent deals."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The colors of a transforming double-faced card that was cast with the disturb keyword ability are determined by its color indicator, not the mana cost on the front face of the card.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines the power and toughness of Old Stickfingers functions in all zones, not only while Old Stickfingers is on the battlefield. While Old Stickfingers is in a graveyard, the ability will count Old Stickfingers itself, presumably using a single, withered stickfinger.'}, {'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'The triggered ability will resolve before Old Stickfingers does. If Old Stickfingers is countered in response to its own triggered ability, you will still follow all the instructions of the triggered ability, using the chosen value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'The triggered ability adds {R}{R}{R} if any opponent lost any amount of life this turn, even if they also gained life at some point.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You choose how many counters to remove from Geistflame Reservoir as you activate its second ability, not as it resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still pay all costs and follow all timing rules to play a card exiled with Geistflame Reservoir\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]']
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abendliches Gelage', 'text': 'Falls ein Gegner mehr Lebenspunkte hat als du, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nFalls ein Gegner mehr Kreaturen kontrolliert als du, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nFalls ein Gegner mehr Karten auf der Hand hat als du, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535112&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd74c6997-5a1b-4584-ba76-91a64a6d04a9', 'multiverseId': 535112}, 'multiverseid': 535112}, {'name': 'Fiestas del ocaso', 'text': 'Si un oponente tiene más vidas que tú, ganas 4 vidas.\\nSi un oponente controla más criaturas que tú, crea dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\\nSi un oponente tiene más cartas en la mano que tú, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535428&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cfe350a-e3ac-4294-a6ca-87c3a9f04469', 'multiverseId': 535428}, 'multiverseid': 535428}, {'name': 'Festivités du couchant', 'text': 'Si un adversaire a plus de points de vie que vous, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nSi un adversaire contrôle plus de créatures que vous, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nSi un adversaire a plus de cartes en main que vous, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535744&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae6633fd-72c8-4fc4-bb13-6270d311811c', 'multiverseId': 535744}, 'multiverseid': 535744}, {'name': 'Celebrazione del Tramonto', 'text': 'Se un avversario ha più punti vita di te, guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nSe un avversario controlla più creature di te, crei due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nSe un avversario ha più carte in mano di te, peschi una carta.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536060&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7e51778-3dc2-4ff9-8509-bf48ec11fa0e', 'multiverseId': 536060}, 'multiverseid': 536060}, {'name': '黄昏の享楽', 'text': '対戦相手１人のライフがあなたより多いなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n対戦相手１人があなたより多くのクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、あなたは白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n対戦相手１人の手札にあるカードがあなたより多いなら、あなたはカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536376&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7296a22-6221-4d4a-8b6e-cc45a8a1805b', 'multiverseId': 536376}, 'multiverseid': 536376}, {'name': '해질녘의 축제', 'text': '당신보다 생명점이 높은 상대가 있다면, 당신은 생명 4점을 얻는다.\\n당신보다 많은 생물을 조종하는 상대가 있다면, 1/1 백색 인간 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n당신보다 손에 카드를 더 많이 가진 상대가 있다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536692&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa04e359-eec9-4511-bb65-e9aaa342d5ac', 'multiverseId': 536692}, 'multiverseid': 536692}, {'name': 'Festança do Ocaso', 'text': 'Se um oponente tem mais pontos de vida que você, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nSe um oponente controla mais criaturas que você, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nSe um oponente tem mais cards na mão do que você, compre um card.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537008&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3923f8cd-3733-4af5-adaa-d39d94de64f0', 'multiverseId': 537008}, 'multiverseid': 537008}, {'name': 'Закатная Пирушка', 'text': 'Если у оппонента больше жизней, чем у вас, вы получаете 4 жизни.\\nЕсли под контролем оппонента больше существ, чем под вашим, создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nЕсли у оппонента в руке больше карт, чем у вас, возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537324&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3873492-624b-4474-9a96-41397ac4b29b', 'multiverseId': 537324}, 'multiverseid': 537324}, {'name': '日落狂欢', 'text': '如果某对手的总生命比你多，则你获得4点生命。\\n如果某对手操控的生物比你多，则你派出两个1/1白色人类衍生生物。\\n如果某对手的手牌比你多，则你抓一张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537640&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '007d200a-f850-4552-b662-dbf738f21fdb', 'multiverseId': 537640}, 'multiverseid': 537640}, {'name': '日落狂歡', 'text': '如果某對手的總生命比你多，則你獲得4點生命。\\n如果某對手操控的生物比你多，則你派出兩個1/1白色人類衍生生物。\\n如果某對手的手牌比你多，則你抽一張牌。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537956&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a348f06-3f39-4439-bc00-6fb6285fe3d3', 'multiverseId': 537956}, 'multiverseid': 537956}]", '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine Kreatur aus Stein war nie zum Fliegen gemacht. Und ich sehe, der Ulvenwald stimmt mir zu."\\n—Halana, Waldläuferin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535298&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc8567d-aea0-45ff-b66c-8205e278dfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 535298}, \'multiverseid\': 535298}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las criaturas de piedra no deben volar. Veo que Ulvenwald está de acuerdo conmigo".\\n—Halana, guardabosque de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1868d50-f2b3-4400-bba9-462824f5dc95\', \'multiverseId\': 535614}, \'multiverseid\': 535614}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Une créature de pierre n\'est pas faite pour voler. Et je vois qu\'Ulvenwald est d\'accord avec moi. »\\n—Halana, ranger de Kessig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f5c20a-d63e-413e-8f16-598fb3cd52ec\', \'multiverseId\': 535930}, \'multiverseid\': 535930}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una creatura di pietra non dovrebbe volare. E vedo che l\\\'Ulvenwald è d\\\'accordo."\\n—Halana, ranger di Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3120697-459c-4878-9eca-2a1609c9f1d0\', \'multiverseId\': 536246}, \'multiverseid\': 536246}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「石の生物が飛べるはずがありません。どうやらウルヴェンワルドも私と同意見のようですね。」\\n――ケッシグのレインジャー、ハラナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c18df76-4546-41ea-b2b9-55fab9f03e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 536562}, \'multiverseid\': 536562}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"돌로 된 생물은 날기 위해 만들어진 게 아니야. 울벤왈드도 이 점에 대해선 내 의견에 동의하는 것 같군."\\n—케시그 사냥꾼 할라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f313bdf7-d38c-4d20-ad88-8fef92bc434f\', \'multiverseId\': 536878}, \'multiverseid\': 536878}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma criatura de pedra não foi feita para voar. Estou vendo que o Ulvenwald concorda comigo."\\n— Halana, patrulheira de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042acfd7-2f94-4560-8888-e4c4cf906736\', \'multiverseId\': 537194}, \'multiverseid\': 537194}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Существо из камня не должно было летать. И я вижу, что Уленвальд со мной согласен».\\n— Халана, кессигская лесничая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc890cdb-5300-4f6c-a00c-48d2d213c7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 537510}, \'multiverseid\': 537510}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「石头变成的生物本该不能飞。原来沃文森看法跟我一样。」\\n～凯锡革护林者荷拉娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01ca374-30a1-462d-8b4e-1d6137dfedd4\', \'multiverseId\': 537826}, \'multiverseid\': 537826}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「石頭變成的生物本該不能飛。原來沃文森看法跟我一樣。」\\n～凱錫革護林者荷拉娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8886926e-929a-486c-96e9-6df81fe98c46\', \'multiverseId\': 538142}, \'multiverseid\': 538142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwägen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold schnappte überrascht nach Luft. Entweder war ein sehr merkwürdiges Insekt auf eine der Linsen gekrabbelt, oder es war ihm gelungen und er sah endlich Geister!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70af022e-f909-40bb-bb8e-bcbbb4a0d7a9\', \'multiverseId\': 535119}, \'multiverseid\': 535119}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold jadeó, sorprendido. O un insecto muy raro se había colado en una de sus lentes o… ¡por fin podía ver geists!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1504517c-5e06-452d-b410-5ec6ddf72ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 535435}, \'multiverseid\': 535435}, {\'name\': \'Scruter\', \'text\': \'Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ivold poussa un cri de surprise. Ou alors un bien étrange insecte s\'était aventuré sur l\'une des lentilles, ou alors il voyait enfin des geists !", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535751&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e92dd8d-316e-4a5a-979c-d206d04b273c\', \'multiverseId\': 535751}, \'multiverseid\': 535751}, {\'name\': \'Considerare\', \'text\': \'Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold rimase a bocca aperta. A meno che uno strano insetto non si fosse arrampicato sulle sue lenti, aveva finalmente visto un geist!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e9039d-1443-4ee1-9052-eb228433f61c\', \'multiverseId\': 536067}, \'multiverseid\': 536067}, {\'name\': \'考慮\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イヴォルドは驚愕のあまり息を呑んだ。とても奇妙な虫が視界をよぎったか、ついに霊を見ることが出来たかどっちかだ！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d339cc17-8e01-406c-b4f3-aa2bdf48069e\', \'multiverseId\': 536383}, \'multiverseid\': 536383}, {\'name\': \'고려\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'이볼드는 놀라서 숨을 헉 들이쉬었다. 아주 이상한 곤충이 렌즈 중 하나에 기어들어 온 것이 아니라면 그는 마침내 유령을 직접 보고 있는 것이었다!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7acc7ee-4d0a-4735-a1e8-0aa011aa71ca\', \'multiverseId\': 536699}, \'multiverseid\': 536699}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card em seu cemitério.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold arquejou, surpreso. Ou um inseto muito estranho estava rastejando numa das lentes, ou ele estava finalmente enxergando os geists!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829e5018-d050-4dd6-97ca-e4587d1b2d84\', \'multiverseId\': 537015}, \'multiverseid\': 537015}, {\'name\': \'Рассмотрение\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту на ваше кладбище.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Ивольд поперхнулся от неожиданности. Либо к нему в линзу заползло очень странное насекомое, либо он наконец-то видит привидение!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e858f1-7954-4a69-b2e5-e742987ce658\', \'multiverseId\': 537331}, \'multiverseid\': 537331}, {\'name\': \'详加考虑\', \'text\': \'检视你的牌库顶牌。你可以将该牌置入你的坟墓场。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'伊沃德吓得吸了一口气：除非是有特别怪异的虫子爬到镜头前，否则他总算是亲眼看到了游魂！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5aef76b-253c-4756-9f71-4a3321c0d617\', \'multiverseId\': 537647}, \'multiverseid\': 537647}, {\'name\': \'詳加考慮\', \'text\': \'檢視你的牌庫頂牌。你可以將該牌置入你的墳墓場。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'伊沃德嚇得吸了一口氣：除非是有特別怪異的蟲子爬到鏡頭前，否則他總算是親眼看到了遊魂！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71df54d-1199-4067-8cfb-555acc4550e2\', \'multiverseId\': 537963}, \'multiverseid\': 537963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwägen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold schnappte überrascht nach Luft. Entweder war ein sehr merkwürdiges Insekt auf eine der Linsen gekrabbelt, oder es war ihm gelungen und er sah endlich Geister!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a97aad-b2d5-4dcf-9492-b30a8bbe7bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 539061}, \'multiverseid\': 539061}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold jadeó, sorprendido. O un insecto muy raro se había colado en una de sus lentes o… ¡por fin podía ver geists!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271315fb-b4a4-4274-9efd-68c9d04b6514\', \'multiverseId\': 539066}, \'multiverseid\': 539066}, {\'name\': \'Scruter\', \'text\': \'Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ivold poussa un cri de surprise. Ou alors un bien étrange insecte s\'était aventuré sur l\'une des lentilles, ou alors il voyait enfin des geists !", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'760f6dbc-8f34-415a-aca8-58bdf033f666\', \'multiverseId\': 539071}, \'multiverseid\': 539071}, {\'name\': \'Considerare\', \'text\': \'Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold rimase a bocca aperta. A meno che uno strano insetto non si fosse arrampicato sulle sue lenti, aveva finalmente visto un geist!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a80bef-0c11-474e-80dc-7d0a1ae1545a\', \'multiverseId\': 539076}, \'multiverseid\': 539076}, {\'name\': \'考慮\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イヴォルドは驚愕のあまり息を呑んだ。とても奇妙な虫が視界をよぎったか、ついに霊を見ることが出来たかどっちかだ！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc46727b-da2b-4afe-9078-751f2f5e41ee\', \'multiverseId\': 539081}, \'multiverseid\': 539081}, {\'name\': \'고려\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'이볼드는 놀라서 숨을 헉 들이쉬었다. 아주 이상한 곤충이 렌즈 중 하나에 기어들어 온 것이 아니라면 그는 마침내 유령을 직접 보고 있는 것이었다!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b72048-d8f1-4b4c-bb5b-d854954dd326\', \'multiverseId\': 539086}, \'multiverseid\': 539086}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card em seu cemitério.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Ivold arquejou, surpreso. Ou um inseto muito estranho estava rastejando numa das lentes, ou ele estava finalmente enxergando os geists!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97f1135-44fc-4325-8256-28d1ed9649b1\', \'multiverseId\': 539091}, \'multiverseid\': 539091}, {\'name\': \'Рассмотрение\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту на ваше кладбище.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Ивольд поперхнулся от неожиданности. Либо к нему в линзу заползло очень странное насекомое, либо он наконец-то видит привидение!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730c5622-b58f-4af5-85e0-a931c40b4877\', \'multiverseId\': 539096}, \'multiverseid\': 539096}, {\'name\': \'详加考虑\', \'text\': \'检视你的牌库顶牌。你可以将该牌置入你的坟墓场。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'伊沃德吓得吸了一口气：除非是有特别怪异的虫子爬到镜头前，否则他总算是亲眼看到了游魂！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f61e4d-10d9-473e-9129-ade0d0e7019d\', \'multiverseId\': 539101}, \'multiverseid\': 539101}, {\'name\': \'詳加考慮\', \'text\': \'檢視你的牌庫頂牌。你可以將該牌置入你的墳墓場。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'伊沃德嚇得吸了一口氣：除非是有特別怪異的蟲子爬到鏡頭前，否則他總算是親眼看到了遊魂！\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44043ee2-555c-4b5c-9b00-ab78792fd6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 539106}, \'multiverseid\': 539106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adeline, strahlende Katharerin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nDie Stärke von Adeline, strahlende Katharerin, ist gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn du angreifst, erzeuge für jeden Gegner einen getappten und angreifenden 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein, der jenen Spieler oder einen Planeswalker, den er kontrolliert, angreift.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10630111-537c-468e-b270-562ee7bdfb29\', \'multiverseId\': 535067}, \'multiverseid\': 535067}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, cátara fulgurante\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nLa fuerza de Adeline, cátara fulgurante es igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\\nSiempre que ataques, por cada oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1 que está girada y atacando a ese jugador o a un planeswalker que controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a77a72c-f294-4932-9914-8b7c9a3f6762\', \'multiverseId\': 535383}, \'multiverseid\': 535383}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, cathare resplendissante\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nLa force d\'Adeline, cathare resplendissante est égale au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez, pour chaque adversaire, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain qui est engagé et attaquant ce joueur ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61aa8401-7511-48a3-97c2-2c76f23b9762\', \'multiverseId\': 535699}, \'multiverseid\': 535699}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, Catara Splendente\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nLa forza di Adeline, Catara Splendente è pari al numero di creature che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi, per ogni avversario, crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca TAPpata e che attacca quel giocatore o un planeswalker che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b8c8e7-54d9-455d-9a74-13bfb5afb3fe\', \'multiverseId\': 536015}, \'multiverseid\': 536015}, {\'name\': \'輝かしい聖戦士、エーデリン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n輝かしい聖戦士、エーデリンのパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\\nあなたが攻撃するたび、対戦相手１人につき１体の白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつそのプレイヤーまたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃している状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c58fae47-c786-4510-90b4-5fbbbbb2a458\', \'multiverseId\': 536331}, \'multiverseid\': 536331}, {\'name\': \'휘황찬란한 성전사, 아델린\', \'text\': \'경계\\n휘황찬란한 성전사, 아델린의 공격력은 당신이 조종하는 생물의 수와 같다.\\n당신이 공격할 때마다, 각 상대에 대해, 탭되어 그 플레이어 또는 그 플레이어가 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격 중인 백색 인간 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7541fed2-50de-4b70-befd-8017406a0737\', \'multiverseId\': 536647}, \'multiverseid\': 536647}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, Cátara Resplandecente\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nO poder de Adeline, Cátara Resplandecente, é igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\\nToda vez que você atacar, para cada oponente, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1 virada e atacando aquele jogador ou um planeswalker que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a86f291-ad36-4b3f-a27c-f09a59b6e960\', \'multiverseId\': 536963}, \'multiverseid\': 536963}, {\'name\': \'Аделина, Блистательный Катар\', \'text\': "Бдительность\\nСила Аделины, Блистательного Катара равна количеству существ под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы атакуете, за каждого оппонента создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек повернутой и атакующей того игрока или planeswalker\'а под его контролем.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39439c4a-cb97-42da-b467-47f426c4eb37\', \'multiverseId\': 537279}, \'multiverseid\': 537279}, {\'name\': \'华辉护教军艾德琳\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n华辉护教军艾德琳的力量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n每当你攻击时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个1/1白色人类衍生生物，其为横置且正向该牌手或一个由其操控的鹏洛客进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'964190a8-d7a5-49c3-b8c2-16766c84bf8f\', \'multiverseId\': 537595}, \'multiverseid\': 537595}, {\'name\': \'華輝護教軍艾德琳\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n 華輝護教軍艾德琳的力量等同於由你操控的生物數量。\\n 每當你攻擊時，為每位對手各進行以下流程～派出一個1/1白色人類衍生生物，其為橫置且正向該玩家或一個由其操控的鵬洛客進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c46110-408d-413d-979d-b5665dccb542\', \'multiverseId\': 537911}, \'multiverseid\': 537911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adeline, strahlende Katharerin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nDie Stärke von Adeline, strahlende Katharerin, ist gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn du angreifst, erzeuge für jeden Gegner einen getappten und angreifenden 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein, der jenen Spieler oder einen Planeswalker, den er kontrolliert, angreift.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad3babc-9204-4c2c-9132-de6faed861a9\', \'multiverseId\': 538508}, \'multiverseid\': 538508}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, cátara fulgurante\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nLa fuerza de Adeline, cátara fulgurante es igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\\nSiempre que ataques, por cada oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1 que está girada y atacando a ese jugador o a un planeswalker que controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74a9020-be76-4e77-9aa8-3fe0ed903f37\', \'multiverseId\': 538525}, \'multiverseid\': 538525}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, cathare resplendissante\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nLa force d\'Adeline, cathare resplendissante est égale au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez, pour chaque adversaire, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain qui est engagé et attaquant ce joueur ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4f9440-e4e7-4961-8c5b-2e2e1dca5273\', \'multiverseId\': 538542}, \'multiverseid\': 538542}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, Catara Splendente\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nLa forza di Adeline, Catara Splendente è pari al numero di creature che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi, per ogni avversario, crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca TAPpata e che attacca quel giocatore o un planeswalker che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a84b3c7-2460-4ccd-98a4-61c43c08bb6f\', \'multiverseId\': 538559}, \'multiverseid\': 538559}, {\'name\': \'輝かしい聖戦士、エーデリン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n輝かしい聖戦士、エーデリンのパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\\nあなたが攻撃するたび、対戦相手１人につき１体の白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつそのプレイヤーまたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃している状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a1051c-2dcc-4c34-9299-2e87251bf584\', \'multiverseId\': 538576}, \'multiverseid\': 538576}, {\'name\': \'휘황찬란한 성전사, 아델린\', \'text\': \'경계\\n휘황찬란한 성전사, 아델린의 공격력은 당신이 조종하는 생물의 수와 같다.\\n당신이 공격할 때마다, 각 상대에 대해, 탭되어 그 플레이어 또는 그 플레이어가 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격 중인 백색 인간 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849dd4b6-2cdc-4bb3-9da6-00c4d28a1f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 538593}, \'multiverseid\': 538593}, {\'name\': \'Adeline, Cátara Resplandecente\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nO poder de Adeline, Cátara Resplandecente, é igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\\nToda vez que você atacar, para cada oponente, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1 virada e atacando aquele jogador ou um planeswalker que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1206427-5ccd-44ae-acf1-73759d62cb77\', \'multiverseId\': 538610}, \'multiverseid\': 538610}, {\'name\': \'Аделина, Блистательный Катар\', \'text\': "Бдительность\\nСила Аделины, Блистательного Катара равна количеству существ под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы атакуете, за каждого оппонента создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек повернутой и атакующей того игрока или planeswalker\'а под его контролем.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9ba157-0485-48c3-ad6b-32d1057a77fd\', \'multiverseId\': 538627}, \'multiverseid\': 538627}, {\'name\': \'华辉护教军艾德琳\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n华辉护教军艾德琳的力量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n每当你攻击时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个1/1白色人类衍生生物，其为横置且正向该牌手或一个由其操控的鹏洛客进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50eef9d8-760c-49c0-af90-9d51ea55c764\', \'multiverseId\': 538644}, \'multiverseid\': 538644}, {\'name\': \'華輝護教軍艾德琳\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n華輝護教軍艾德琳的力量等同於由你操控的生物數量。\\n每當你攻擊時，為每位對手各進行以下流程～派出一個1/1白色人類衍生生物，其為橫置且正向該玩家或一個由其操控的鵬洛客進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7445f3e2-fccc-47cf-b43d-5fe260525cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 538661}, \'multiverseid\': 538661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akrobatentruppe\', \'text\': \'Die Akrobatentruppe kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nHexenzirkel — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'„Willkommen zum größten Spektakel in Kessig!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a04bd1d-5cc2-412d-b837-291077bcf359\', \'multiverseId\': 535280}, \'multiverseid\': 535280}, {\'name\': \'Compañía de contorsionistas\', \'text\': \'La Compañía de contorsionistas entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nAquelarre — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si controlas tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Les damos la bienvenida al mejor espectáculo de Kessig!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a1b1730-3bcd-408e-9ffd-cfcc16ee4c70\', \'multiverseId\': 535596}, \'multiverseid\': 535596}, {\'name\': \'Troupe de contorsionnistes\', \'text\': \'La Troupe de contorsionnistes arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nCongrégation — Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': \'« Bienvenue au plus grand spectacle de Kessig ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34420ffc-2498-482a-be4f-e5ae95f94f64\', \'multiverseId\': 535912}, \'multiverseid\': 535912}, {\'name\': \'Compagnia di Contorsionisti\', \'text\': "La Compagnia di Contorsionisti entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nCongrega — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Benvenuti al più grande spettacolo di tutto il Kessig!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da689ae-9339-4a05-9a51-fbe11b3dd282\', \'multiverseId\': 536228}, \'multiverseid\': 536228}, {\'name\': \'曲芸師の一座\', \'text\': \'曲芸師の一座は、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n集会 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'「ケッシグ最高のショーへようこそ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82df05ad-7978-4741-aadb-afd9279efcd3\', \'multiverseId\': 536544}, \'multiverseid\': 536544}, {\'name\': \'곡예단\', \'text\': \'곡예단은 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n집회 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 서로 공격력이 다른 생물을 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간\', \'flavor\': \'"케시그에서 가장 위대한 공연에 찾아오신 것을 환영합니다!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625cd758-db35-4020-b95a-2ec8636a5734\', \'multiverseId\': 536860}, \'multiverseid\': 536860}, {\'name\': \'Trupe Contorcionista\', \'text\': \'Trupe Contorcionista entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nConventículo — No início de sua etapa final, se você controlar três ou mais criaturas com poderes diferentes, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem-vindos ao maior show de Kessig!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7f78d40-a412-47c0-9e05-e5eb06a6fb39\', \'multiverseId\': 537176}, \'multiverseid\': 537176}, {\'name\': \'Труппа Акробатов\', \'text\': \'Труппа Акробатов выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\nШабаш — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если вы контролируете не менее трех существ с различными значениями силы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек\', \'flavor\': \'«Добро пожаловать на величайшее представление в Кессиге!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b784910-4160-4077-9f6b-fbd6d6e3e6f1\', \'multiverseId\': 537492}, \'multiverseid\': 537492}, {\'name\': \'柔术艺团\', \'text\': \'柔术艺团进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n鸠集～在你的结束步骤开始时，若你操控三个或更多力量各不相同的生物，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': \'「欢迎来到凯锡革最精彩的演出现场！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55185ecc-2aa1-46af-88c7-ff83fcbfa8db\', \'multiverseId\': 537808}, \'multiverseid\': 537808}, {\'name\': \'柔術藝團\', \'text\': \'柔術藝團進戰場時上面有X個+1/+1指示物。\\n鳩集～在你的結束步驟開始時，若你操控三個或更多力量各不相同的生物，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類\', \'flavor\': \'「歡迎來到凱錫革最精彩的演出現場！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55767cfb-02a7-46a4-bc66-48827b00adb6\', \'multiverseId\': 538124}, \'multiverseid\': 538124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allesfressender Glibber\', \'text\': \'Die Stärke des Allesfressenden Glibbers ist gleich der Anzahl an Kartentypen in deinem Friedhof, und seine Widerstandskraft ist gleich dieser Zahl plus 1.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen grünen Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Die Stärke dieser Kreatur ist gleich der Anzahl an Kartentypen in deinem Friedhof, und ihre Widerstandskraft ist gleich dieser Zahl plus 1."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bce51c6-fd61-43a3-abd6-b62af0000777\', \'multiverseId\': 535279}, \'multiverseid\': 535279}, {\'name\': \'Amasijo consumidor\', \'text\': \'La fuerza del Amasijo consumidor es igual a la cantidad de tipos de cartas entre las cartas de tu cementerio y su resistencia es igual a esa cantidad más 1.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de criatura Cieno verde con "La fuerza de esta criatura es igual a la cantidad de tipos de cartas entre las cartas de tu cementerio y su resistencia es igual a esa cantidad más 1".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f38161d1-1cef-463a-816a-8e3e1b02c572\', \'multiverseId\': 535595}, \'multiverseid\': 535595}, {\'name\': \'Masse dévorante\', \'text\': \'La force de la Masse dévorante est égale au nombre de types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière et son endurance est égale à ce nombre plus 1.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature verte Limon avec « La force de cette créature est égale au nombre de types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière et son endurance est égale à ce nombre plus 1. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50e964c-74ac-469d-a96e-1374600a4e42\', \'multiverseId\': 535911}, \'multiverseid\': 535911}, {\'name\': \'Ammasso Distruttore\', \'text\': \'La forza dell\\\'Ammasso Distruttore è pari al numero di tipi di carta tra le carte nel tuo cimitero e la sua costituzione è pari a quel numero più 1.\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina creatura Melma verde con "La forza di questa creatura è pari al numero di tipi di carta tra le carte nel tuo cimitero e la sua costituzione è pari a quel numero più 1".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec756775-3141-47bf-bd72-94f238669643\', \'multiverseId\': 536227}, \'multiverseid\': 536227}, {\'name\': \'消化の泥塊\', \'text\': \'消化の泥塊のパワーはあなたの墓地にあるカードの中のカード・タイプの種類数に等しく、タフネスはその値に１を足したものに等しい。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、「このクリーチャーのパワーはあなたの墓地にあるカードの中のカード・タイプの種類数に等しく、タフネスはその値に１を足したものに等しい。」を持つ緑のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dcd6ba1-5c7e-4adb-a264-9c389a7bbf65\', \'multiverseId\': 536543}, \'multiverseid\': 536543}, {\'name\': \'먹어치우는 형체 덩어리\', \'text\': \'먹어치우는 형체 덩어리의 공격력은 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 유형의 수와 같고 방어력은 그 수에 1을 더한 값과 같다.\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, "이 생물의 공격력은 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 유형의 수와 같고 이 생물의 방어력은 그 수에 1을 더한 값과 같다."를 가진 녹색 점액 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 점액괴물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae229c04-0491-4402-8d7e-138a972c3cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 536859}, \'multiverseid\': 536859}, {\'name\': \'Bolha Consumidora\', \'text\': \'O poder de Bolha Consumidora é igual ao número de tipos de card dentre os dos cards em seu cemitério, e a resistência dela é igual àquele número mais 1.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, crie uma ficha de criatura Lodo verde com "O poder desta criatura é igual ao número de tipos de card entre os dos cards em seu cemitério e a resistência dela é igual àquele número mais 1."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce52561-9322-4c54-a859-d5166120d1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 537175}, \'multiverseid\': 537175}, {\'name\': \'Пузырь-Пожиратель\', \'text\': \'Сила Пузыря-Пожирателя равна количеству типов карт среди карт на вашем кладбище, а его выносливость равна тому количеству плюс 1.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага создайте одну фишку существа зеленая Тина со способностью «Сила этого существа равна количеству типов карт среди карт на вашем кладбище, а его выносливость равна тому количеству плюс 1».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670a4306-2a07-412d-89ee-47336ff75f10\', \'multiverseId\': 537491}, \'multiverseid\': 537491}, {\'name\': \'噬物黏浆\', \'text\': \'噬物黏浆的力量等同于你坟墓场中牌的牌张类别数量，其防御力等同于该数量加1。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，派出一个绿色流浆衍生生物，且具有「此生物的力量等同于你坟墓场中牌的牌张类别数量，其防御力等同于该数量加1。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aced75d3-df6a-4219-a623-8e4778cc4f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 537807}, \'multiverseid\': 537807}, {\'name\': \'噬物黏漿\', \'text\': \'噬物黏漿的力量等同於你墳墓場中牌的牌張類別數量，其防禦力等同於該數量加1。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，派出一個綠色流漿衍生生物，且具有「此生物的力量等同於你墳墓場中牌的牌張類別數量，其防禦力等同於該數量加1。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～流漿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86edee41-98ba-4e50-aea4-f67b07c6c6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 538123}, \'multiverseid\': 538123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allesfressender Glibber\', \'text\': \'Die Stärke des Allesfressenden Glibbers ist gleich der Anzahl an Kartentypen in deinem Friedhof, und seine Widerstandskraft ist gleich dieser Zahl plus 1.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen grünen Schlammwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Die Stärke dieser Kreatur ist gleich der Anzahl an Kartentypen in deinem Friedhof, und ihre Widerstandskraft ist gleich dieser Zahl plus 1."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538779&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b5a1b5-b317-4516-a69f-7280b5b4ca2e\', \'multiverseId\': 538779}, \'multiverseid\': 538779}, {\'name\': \'Amasijo consumidor\', \'text\': \'La fuerza del Amasijo consumidor es igual a la cantidad de tipos de cartas entre las cartas de tu cementerio y su resistencia es igual a esa cantidad más 1.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de criatura Cieno verde con "La fuerza de esta criatura es igual a la cantidad de tipos de cartas entre las cartas de tu cementerio y su resistencia es igual a esa cantidad más 1".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbbdcd2-6f2a-477d-95dc-4d1a2c408416\', \'multiverseId\': 538839}, \'multiverseid\': 538839}, {\'name\': \'Masse dévorante\', \'text\': \'La force de la Masse dévorante est égale au nombre de types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière et son endurance est égale à ce nombre plus 1.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature verte Limon avec « La force de cette créature est égale au nombre de types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière et son endurance est égale à ce nombre plus 1. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c57e78fc-92f6-4684-a327-c51b07d70bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 538899}, \'multiverseid\': 538899}, {\'name\': \'Ammasso Distruttore\', \'text\': \'La forza dell\\\'Ammasso Distruttore è pari al numero di tipi di carta tra le carte nel tuo cimitero e la sua costituzione è pari a quel numero più 1.\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina creatura Melma verde con "La forza di questa creatura è pari al numero di tipi di carta tra le carte nel tuo cimitero e la sua costituzione è pari a quel numero più 1".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7779add3-878e-4aa1-bbb7-a75d49cbb63e\', \'multiverseId\': 538959}, \'multiverseid\': 538959}, {\'name\': \'消化の泥塊\', \'text\': \'消化の泥塊のパワーはあなたの墓地にあるカードの中のカード・タイプの種類数に等しく、タフネスはその値に１を足したものに等しい。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、「このクリーチャーのパワーはあなたの墓地にあるカードの中のカード・タイプの種類数に等しく、タフネスはその値に１を足したものに等しい。」を持つ緑のウーズ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7cc67c-ee81-4460-bc79-6eb9c017a904\', \'multiverseId\': 539019}, \'multiverseid\': 539019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Knochenspreizer\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du X Kreaturenkarten aufdeckst. Lege alle Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, auf deinen Friedhof und lege dann den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Alten Knochenspreizers sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa02489f-c61f-4018-aca0-d782f78f9677\', \'multiverseId\': 535346}, \'multiverseid\': 535346}, {\'name\': \'Viejo Dedos de Palo\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres X cartas de criatura. Pon todas las cartas de criatura mostradas de esta manera en tu cementerio y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Viejo Dedos de Palo son iguales a la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7c1365-33dd-4981-99e5-d9a3272cfdd0\', \'multiverseId\': 535662}, \'multiverseid\': 535662}, {\'name\': \'Vieux brindodactyle\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez X cartes de créature. Mettez toutes les cartes de créature révélées de cette manière dans votre cimetière, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Vieux brindodactyle sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535978&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc86b36-b985-4573-bb8b-3e5c744b3d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 535978}, \'multiverseid\': 535978}, {\'name\': \'Vecchio Ditalunghe\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli X carte creatura. Metti nel tuo cimitero tutte le carte creatura rivelate in questo modo, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Vecchio Ditalunghe sono pari al numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c66b1a1-aedf-4e9c-8452-df9bf9d22b83\', \'multiverseId\': 536294}, \'multiverseid\': 536294}, {\'name\': \'年経た枝指\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー・カードＸ枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。これにより公開されたすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたの墓地に置き、その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n年経た枝指のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac20a46-43fd-4561-8bf6-b808cad4caf6\', \'multiverseId\': 536610}, \'multiverseid\': 536610}, {\'name\': \'늙은 막대손가락\', \'text\': \'당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신이 생물 카드를 X장 공개할 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 이런 식으로 공개된 모든 생물 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣은 후, 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위 순서로 놓는다.\\n늙은 막대손가락의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드의 수와 같다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9a7bf2-0e4b-4dd0-b4ec-ffe7e5e05990\', \'multiverseId\': 536926}, \'multiverseid\': 536926}, {\'name\': \'Velho Dedos-de-palito\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar X cards de criatura. Coloque todos os cards de criatura revelados dessa forma em seu cemitério e os demais no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nO poder e a resistência de Velho Dedos-de-palito são ambos iguais ao número de cards de criatura no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb2ea1e-1722-493c-95a1-a0d7157d449a\', \'multiverseId\': 537242}, \'multiverseid\': 537242}, {\'name\': \'Старик Клейкопалый\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете X карт существ. Положите все показанные таким образом карты существ на ваше кладбище, затем положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nСила и выносливость Старика Клейкопалого равны количеству карт существ на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda30cd9-4949-4b1a-961d-4936de59740e\', \'multiverseId\': 537558}, \'multiverseid\': 537558}, {\'name\': \'老枯指\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出X张生物牌为止。将以此法展示的所有生物牌置入你的坟墓场，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n老枯指的力量和防御力各等同于你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122f0e32-c7ce-4dca-8a9b-788996a70746\', \'multiverseId\': 537874}, \'multiverseid\': 537874}, {\'name\': \'老枯指\', \'text\': \'當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出X張生物牌為止。將以此法展示的所有生物牌置入你的墳墓場，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n老枯指的力量和防禦力各等同於你墳墓場中的生物牌數量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620599e2-edbd-424e-b79e-72c8223480ee\', \'multiverseId\': 538190}, \'multiverseid\': 538190}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Knochenspreizer\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du X Kreaturenkarten aufdeckst. Lege alle Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, auf deinen Friedhof und lege dann den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Alten Knochenspreizers sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100f675c-fd79-4fad-b8df-fc1982b46a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 538520}, \'multiverseid\': 538520}, {\'name\': \'Viejo Dedos de Palo\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres X cartas de criatura. Pon todas las cartas de criatura mostradas de esta manera en tu cementerio y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Viejo Dedos de Palo son iguales a la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d49e6bc5-8f28-4ad6-8d98-48d019b1069f\', \'multiverseId\': 538537}, \'multiverseid\': 538537}, {\'name\': \'Vieux brindodactyle\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez X cartes de créature. Mettez toutes les cartes de créature révélées de cette manière dans votre cimetière, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Vieux brindodactyle sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab87f861-b755-4f19-9208-6498d7cf20f8\', \'multiverseId\': 538554}, \'multiverseid\': 538554}, {\'name\': \'Vecchio Ditalunghe\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli X carte creatura. Metti nel tuo cimitero tutte le carte creatura rivelate in questo modo, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Vecchio Ditalunghe sono pari al numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee6970c-d9aa-43a7-a920-29442f53e188\', \'multiverseId\': 538571}, \'multiverseid\': 538571}, {\'name\': \'年経枝指\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー・カードＸ枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。これにより公開されたすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたの墓地に置き、その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n年経た枝指のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581fb1fb-3717-4ae3-a0c7-e6ef6392398a\', \'multiverseId\': 538588}, \'multiverseid\': 538588}, {\'name\': \'늙은 막대손가락\', \'text\': \'당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신이 생물 카드를 X장 공개할 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 이런 식으로 공개된 모든 생물 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣은 후, 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위 순서로 놓는다.\\n늙은 막대손가락의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드의 수와 같다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bedd170-c1ab-445c-a932-11b8bb0d5dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 538605}, \'multiverseid\': 538605}, {\'name\': \'Velho Dedos-de-palito\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar esta mágica, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar X cards de criatura. Coloque todos os cards de criatura revelados dessa forma em seu cemitério e os demais no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nO poder e a resistência de Velho Dedos-de-palito são ambos iguais ao número de cards de criatura no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3fc083-df3a-4daa-b50e-63062f55a554\', \'multiverseId\': 538622}, \'multiverseid\': 538622}, {\'name\': \'Старик Клейкопалый\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете X карт существ. Положите все показанные таким образом карты существ на ваше кладбище, затем положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nСила и выносливость Старика Клейкопалого равны количеству карт существ на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d49d4d6-7723-470b-963d-a77a3b7f51b2\', \'multiverseId\': 538639}, \'multiverseid\': 538639}, {\'name\': \'老枯指\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出X张生物牌为止。将以此法展示的所有生物牌置入你的坟墓场，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n老枯指的力量和防御力各等同于你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ff2ab27-bf9a-404c-a468-b4079a84d26b\', \'multiverseId\': 538656}, \'multiverseid\': 538656}, {\'name\': \'老枯指\', \'text\': \'當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出X張生物牌為止。將以此法展示的所有生物牌置入你的墳墓場，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n老枯指的力量和防禦力各等同於你墳墓場中的生物牌數量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f54ed67c-4935-4864-a43e-529bc5694314\', \'multiverseId\': 538673}, \'multiverseid\': 538673}]', "[{'name': 'Ans Fenster klopfen', 'text': 'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\\nRückblende {2}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535306&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab3e0586-0db8-4be5-8a6d-ccba3ec7cb1b', 'multiverseId': 535306}, 'multiverseid': 535306}, {'name': 'Roce en la ventana', 'text': 'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535622&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8b43134-0e38-4fd0-ad9a-3635d8029c74', 'multiverseId': 535622}, 'multiverseid': 535622}, {'name': 'Tapotements à la fenêtre', 'text': 'Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {2}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535938&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5f470bb-1416-4123-b972-7fb54710c342', 'multiverseId': 535938}, 'multiverseid': 535938}, {'name': 'Picchiettio alla Finestra', 'text': 'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {2}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536254&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9876d0f6-dc6d-419d-8aa5-71766715c8b1', 'multiverseId': 536254}, 'multiverseid': 536254}, {'name': '窓を叩く', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。あなたは「その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536570&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fde84338-7b9e-4707-bab9-8058ce228c18', 'multiverseId': 536570}, 'multiverseid': 536570}, {'name': '창문 두드리기', 'text': '당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 생물 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n회상 {2}{G} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536886&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ddb094d-284b-4e7f-a2fe-7b98b56ff433', 'multiverseId': 536886}, 'multiverseid': 536886}, {'name': 'Batida na Janela', 'text': 'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.\\nRecapitular {2}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537202&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55fe3cfd-11d9-4727-a6d9-5300d8280124', 'multiverseId': 537202}, 'multiverseid': 537202}, {'name': 'Стук в Окно', 'text': 'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.\\nВоспоминание {2}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537518&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6b6a0ab-6a49-431b-b444-01869dd17412', 'multiverseId': 537518}, 'multiverseid': 537518}, {'name': '轻敲窗户', 'text': '检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张生物牌并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。\\n返照{2}{G}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537834&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad6b7162-4047-45a9-b721-999dfdeaf5a9', 'multiverseId': 537834}, 'multiverseid': 537834}, {'name': '輕敲窗戶', 'text': '檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張生物牌並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌置入你的墳墓場。\\n返照{2}{G}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538150&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c12ee21d-ea72-4aa8-838e-135b39703641', 'multiverseId': 538150}, 'multiverseid': 538150}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arkane Infusion\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {3}{U}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05bebf9-81c3-4508-8848-4c828b1c9aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 535317}, \'multiverseid\': 535317}, {\'name\': \'Infusión arcana\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{U}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e028eed-767b-49b2-96ba-c96311d4cb4d\', \'multiverseId\': 535633}, \'multiverseid\': 535633}, {\'name\': \'Infusion arcanique\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nFlashback {3}{U}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1adc3e-0482-4a5a-b02e-75660b1748a4\', \'multiverseId\': 535949}, \'multiverseid\': 535949}, {\'name\': \'Infusione Arcana\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nFlashback {3}{U}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684b9883-621c-4a70-94d7-6c5ecff4e355\', \'multiverseId\': 536265}, \'multiverseid\': 536265}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の注入\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。あなたは「その中からインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{U}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53cb4c32-9cc3-4e9f-a0ae-03395860b505\', \'multiverseId\': 536581}, \'multiverseid\': 536581}, {\'name\': \'비전 주입\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\\n회상 {3}{U}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c37f1e3-8970-4962-a99a-164b3b69e5d7\', \'multiverseId\': 536897}, \'multiverseid\': 536897}, {\'name\': \'Infusão Arcana\', \'text\': \'Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nRecapitular {3}{U}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a80422-99ec-419d-936d-19bed3704573\', \'multiverseId\': 537213}, \'multiverseid\': 537213}, {\'name\': \'Волшебное Вливание\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nВоспоминание {3}{U}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f320472e-b554-4511-b947-59adfed007f5\', \'multiverseId\': 537529}, \'multiverseid\': 537529}, {\'name\': \'玄秘灌输\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中的一张瞬间或法术牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n返照{3}{U}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e03afcc8-2848-4a97-9d10-a3ca094c6423\', \'multiverseId\': 537845}, \'multiverseid\': 537845}, {\'name\': \'玄秘灌輸\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中的一張瞬間或巫術牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n返照{3}{U}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d8699b-9c96-4de8-9ec2-63cc15d7c931\', \'multiverseId\': 538161}, \'multiverseid\': 538161}]', "[{'name': 'Arroganter Bandit', 'text': 'Wenn der Arrogante Bandit ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, verliert jeder Gegner 2 Lebenspunkte, und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir, Adliger', 'flavor': 'Die erbärmlichen Reste der Falkenrath-Blutlinie durchstreifen die Pässe nahe den Ruinen ihrer Burgen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535167&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da647ced-47ea-4a49-8430-42ca0ce9c76f', 'multiverseId': 535167}, 'multiverseid': 535167}, {'name': 'Forajido arrogante', 'text': 'Cuando el Forajido arrogante entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente perdió vidas este turno, cada oponente pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Noble vampiro', 'flavor': 'Los viles supervivientes del linaje de los Falkenrath merodean por los caminos cercanos a sus castillos en ruinas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535483&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1aae292-6be6-4bc9-953f-21f301caeee1', 'multiverseId': 535483}, 'multiverseid': 535483}, {'name': 'Hors-la-loi arrogant', 'text': 'Quand le Hors-la-loi arrogant arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci, chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : vampire et noble', 'flavor': 'Les descendants corrompus de la lignée des Falkenrath rôdent aux alentours de leurs châteaux en ruines.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535799&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd4dcbde-7cde-4e8f-8f23-aff9168cacfe', 'multiverseId': 535799}, 'multiverseid': 535799}, {'name': 'Fuorilegge Arrogante', 'text': 'Quando il Fuorilegge Arrogante entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno, ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Nobile Vampiro', 'flavor': 'I resti degradati della stirpe dei Falkenrath si aggirano nei pressi dei loro castelli in rovina.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536115&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e941d710-79f8-40b7-8e8d-fef05cf3e594', 'multiverseId': 536115}, 'multiverseid': 536115}, {'name': '尊大な無法者', 'text': '尊大な無法者が戦場に出たとき、このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていた場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・貴族', 'flavor': '堕落したファルケンラスの残り少ない末裔は、廃城近くの道路を徘徊している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536431&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b098775-5958-417d-aaba-97147428d45d', 'multiverseId': 536431}, 'multiverseid': 536431}, {'name': '거만한 무법자', 'text': '거만한 무법자가 전장에 들어올 때, 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있다면, 각 상대는 생명 2점을 잃고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.', 'type': '생물 — 흡혈귀 귀족', 'flavor': '비천한 신세가 된 팔켄라스 혈통의 잔재들은 이제는 폐허가 된 그들의 성 주변 길목을 배회한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536747&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4079028-d3fd-42bf-8f9e-6655fb5804af', 'multiverseId': 536747}, 'multiverseid': 536747}, {'name': 'Fora da Lei Arrogante', 'text': 'Quando Fora da Lei Arrogante entra no campo de batalha, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno, cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro Nobre', 'flavor': 'Os últimos sórdidos descendentes da linhagem Falkenrath espreitam nas passagens próximas às ruínas de seus castelos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537063&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49dcd688-5b37-4b1b-af79-d5683a16365a', 'multiverseId': 537063}, 'multiverseid': 537063}, {'name': 'Высокомерный Преступник', 'text': 'Когда Высокомерный Преступник выходит на поле битвы, если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу, каждый оппонент теряет 2 жизни, а вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Существо — Вампир Аристократ', 'flavor': 'Деградировавшие уцелевшие из рода Фалькенратов бродят по дорогам близ своих разрушенных замков.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537379&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5206d678-24a3-484b-93ce-aae2adb42db5', 'multiverseId': 537379}, 'multiverseid': 537379}, {'name': '傲慢亡命客', 'text': '当傲慢亡命客进战场时，若有对手本回合中失去过生命，则每位对手各失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～吸血鬼／贵族', 'flavor': '伐肯纳血脉的落魄遗民仍围聚自家城堡废墟附近，于周遭通路徘徊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537695&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61881870-0fd3-414b-9901-c77fa27efe00', 'multiverseId': 537695}, 'multiverseid': 537695}, {'name': '傲慢亡命客', 'text': '當傲慢亡命客進戰場時，若有對手本回合中失去過生命，則每位對手各失去2點生命且你獲得2點生命。', 'type': '生物 ～吸血鬼／貴族', 'flavor': '伐肯納血脈的落魄遺民仍圍聚自家城堡廢墟附近，於週遭通路徘徊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538011&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a5609e9-558e-477b-b1f0-6626f9be1b50', 'multiverseId': 538011}, 'multiverseid': 538011}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auf zum Tanz\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nRückblende {3}{G}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir können entweder Hand in Hand oder alleine in die Dunkelheit gehen. Ich weiß, was mir lieber ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535339&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c98eeca-97ab-45e8-b311-d002d0401f74\', \'multiverseId\': 535339}, \'multiverseid\': 535339}, {\'name\': \'Unirse al baile\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{G}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos adentrarnos en la oscuridad solos o acompañados. Yo sé qué prefiero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d1b9ea-994d-489f-b365-073165971f80\', \'multiverseId\': 535655}, \'multiverseid\': 535655}, {\'name\': \'Venez danser !\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nFlashback {3}{G}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous pouvons aller dans les ténèbres main dans la main ou seuls. Je sais ce que je préfère. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535971&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09f7ab23-eb56-46d9-b034-82d41e0f12ab\', \'multiverseId\': 535971}, \'multiverseid\': 535971}, {\'name\': \'Unirsi alle Danze\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nFlashback {3}{G}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Possiamo affrontare il buio mano nella mano o da soli. Io so quale preferisco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c110ff03-4967-41bd-8c3e-523da5b37431\', \'multiverseId\': 536287}, \'multiverseid\': 536287}, {\'name\': \'踊りへの参加\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「手を取り合って闇の中に入ってもいいし、独りで入ってもいい。僕はどっちがいいか決めたよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59806800-89d7-4128-9cee-093206ad1c76\', \'multiverseId\': 536603}, \'multiverseid\': 536603}, {\'name\': \'함께 춤추기\', \'text\': \'1/1 백색 인간 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n회상 {3}{G}{W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 어둠 속으로 혼자서 갈 수도, 함께 손을 잡고 갈 수도 있어. 난 내가 어느 쪽을 좋아하는 지 알지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fa6870-2c5e-4eaa-99e4-7a283e5250ed\', \'multiverseId\': 536919}, \'multiverseid\': 536919}, {\'name\': \'Entrar na Dança\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nRecapitular {3}{G}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos mergulhar nas trevas de mãos dadas ou sozinhos. Eu sei qual eu prefiro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169c7479-b6f9-412f-9e96-2cd9ea9828a9\', \'multiverseId\': 537235}, \'multiverseid\': 537235}, {\'name\': \'Айда Плясать\', \'text\': \'Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nВоспоминание {3}{G}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы можем пойти в темноту вместе, рука об руку, или поодиночке. Я знаю, что мне больше нравится».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b24d11-6fd7-4077-a396-15265ad5fe4f\', \'multiverseId\': 537551}, \'multiverseid\': 537551}, {\'name\': \'携手共舞\', \'text\': \'派出两个1/1白色人类衍生生物。\\n返照{3}{G}{W}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「黑暗降临之时，我们可以携手同行，也可孑然面对。我知道我会选哪样。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c54cd9-702b-4132-9bd8-5aace2bcac27\', \'multiverseId\': 537867}, \'multiverseid\': 537867}, {\'name\': \'攜手共舞\', \'text\': \'派出兩個1/1白色人類衍生生物。\\n返照{3}{G}{W}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「黑暗降臨之時，我們可以攜手同行，也可孑然面對。我知道我會選哪樣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ecce27-dbfc-4fc2-9023-af78c258b1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 538183}, \'multiverseid\': 538183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf zum Tanz\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nRückblende {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir können entweder Hand in Hand oder alleine in die Dunkelheit gehen. Ich weiß, was mir lieber ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d48c56f-975c-4a42-8048-a0ab2b7c72d2\', \'multiverseId\': 539064}, \'multiverseid\': 539064}, {\'name\': \'Unirse al baile\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos adentrarnos en la oscuridad solos o acompañados. Yo sé qué prefiero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df648df-91fa-402e-b661-27be92d91eae\', \'multiverseId\': 539069}, \'multiverseid\': 539069}, {\'name\': \'Venez danser !\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nFlashback {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous pouvons aller dans les ténèbres main dans la main ou seuls. Je sais ce que je préfère. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78514e76-b205-47a0-baf3-ac5703ada170\', \'multiverseId\': 539074}, \'multiverseid\': 539074}, {\'name\': \'Unirsi alle Danze\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nFlashback {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Possiamo affrontare il buio mano nella mano o da soli. Io so quale preferisco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99dd26af-96c2-4535-bd15-75361024056c\', \'multiverseId\': 539079}, \'multiverseid\': 539079}, {\'name\': \'踊りへの参加\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「手を取り合って闇の中に入ってもいいし、独りで入ってもいい。僕はどっちがいいか決めたよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977b62a5-f410-4f58-b6b5-86cc8f3ded8e\', \'multiverseId\': 539084}, \'multiverseid\': 539084}, {\'name\': \'함께 춤추기\', \'text\': \'1/1 백색 인간 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n회상 {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 어둠 속으로 혼자서 갈 수도, 함께 손을 잡고 갈 수도 있어. 난 내가 어느 쪽을 좋아하는 지 알지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68750d88-9784-42cb-b4b2-d1f0052f6bac\', \'multiverseId\': 539089}, \'multiverseid\': 539089}, {\'name\': \'Entrar na Dança\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nRecapitular {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos mergulhar nas trevas de mãos dadas ou sozinhos. Eu sei qual eu prefiro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02cdc858-0af5-4ea0-b43f-d0e570705151\', \'multiverseId\': 539094}, \'multiverseid\': 539094}, {\'name\': \'Айда Плясать\', \'text\': \'Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nВоспоминание {3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы можем пойти в темноту вместе, рука об руку, или поодиночке. Я знаю, что мне больше нравится».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e18903b-57af-46d7-9a8c-f5c29cc4bad2\', \'multiverseId\': 539099}, \'multiverseid\': 539099}, {\'name\': \'携手共舞\', \'text\': \'派出两个1/1白色人类衍生生物。\\n返照{3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「黑暗降临之时，我们可以携手同行，也可孑然面对。我知道我会选哪样。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8fe557-d5ed-469a-92db-442fe05859bf\', \'multiverseId\': 539104}, \'multiverseid\': 539104}, {\'name\': \'攜手共舞\', \'text\': \'派出兩個1/1白色人類衍生生物。\\n返照{3}{G}{W}\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「黑暗降臨之時，我們可以攜手同行，也可孑然面對。我知道我會選哪樣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a39286e-ed31-456c-bea0-43c615d27177\', \'multiverseId\': 539109}, \'multiverseid\': 539109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgepfropfte Identität\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Der eigene Wille ist nur oberflächlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535135&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fccb40c-4462-4500-a6ed-cdacf19598f6\', \'multiverseId\': 535135}, \'multiverseid\': 535135}, {\'name\': \'Identidad injertada\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nTú controlas la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La autonomía no va más allá de la piel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43a63bf-65db-4dc7-9c28-4f7c71f72e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 535451}, \'multiverseid\': 535451}, {\'name\': \'Identité greffée\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nEnchanter : créature\\nVous contrôlez la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Il faut savoir faire peau neuve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2421cad-52e9-48bc-91eb-9f628af4d8d4\', \'multiverseId\': 535767}, \'multiverseid\': 535767}, {\'name\': \'Identità Innestata\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nIncanta creatura\\nControlli la creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "L\'autonomia è a fior di pelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd44950-6c47-496c-aef2-37378b8af31d\', \'multiverseId\': 536083}, \'multiverseid\': 536083}, {\'name\': \'移植された自我\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nあなたはエンチャントしているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'自主性は所詮、表面的なのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f64c58-0fe9-4fb1-899d-63f42a8de781\', \'multiverseId\': 536399}, \'multiverseid\': 536399}, {\'name\': \'이식된 정체성\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n생물에게 부여\\n당신이 부여된 생물을 조종한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'자율성은 가죽 한 꺼풀에 불과하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed4e1b30-8f06-4534-9794-78a43b67f63b\', \'multiverseId\': 536715}, \'multiverseid\': 536715}, {\'name\': \'Identidade Enxertada\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nEncantar criatura\\nVocê controla a criatura encantada.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A autonomia é superficial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bf9763-c54e-44a0-a7c9-e0c68f11c27b\', \'multiverseId\': 537031}, \'multiverseid\': 537031}, {\'name\': \'Привитая Личность\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nЗачаровать существо\\nВы контролируете зачарованное существо.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Свобода воли — тонкая материя, не толще кожи.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fe67a7-fe32-4a7b-9bea-65fd6f17f593\', \'multiverseId\': 537347}, \'multiverseid\': 537347}, {\'name\': \'身份强殖\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n结附于生物\\n你操控所结附的生物。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'自主仅存肌肤表面。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1272d4e2-d4fc-4521-bd04-3e2c51a91fff\', \'multiverseId\': 537663}, \'multiverseid\': 537663}, {\'name\': \'身份強殖\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n結附於生物\\n你操控所結附的生物。\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'自主僅存肌膚表面。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd77253-cb9d-4d47-8cf3-bc9be329f426\', \'multiverseId\': 537979}, \'multiverseid\': 537979}]', "[{'name': 'Aufgepfropfte Identität', 'text': 'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538748&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26738c9c-6893-4da2-b360-19c6e3fbf01f', 'multiverseId': 538748}, 'multiverseid': 538748}, {'name': 'Identidad injertada', 'text': 'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nTú controlas la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538808&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c4d9c30-8701-4a23-a440-3873cd65dcdd', 'multiverseId': 538808}, 'multiverseid': 538808}, {'name': 'Identité greffée', 'text': 'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nEnchanter : créature\\nVous contrôlez la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538868&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2f4b22c-14f6-4a5e-b433-dd438012c194', 'multiverseId': 538868}, 'multiverseid': 538868}, {'name': 'Identità Innestata', 'text': 'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nIncanta creatura\\nControlli la creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538928&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f335070-7294-44a2-8f1e-f000fee16e2f', 'multiverseId': 538928}, 'multiverseid': 538928}, {'name': '移植された自我', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nあなたはエンチャントしているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538988&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f160a57-33d7-4e36-a228-3da45a9dba77', 'multiverseId': 538988}, 'multiverseid': 538988}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auflösung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Morgenlicht, Tag erwacht,\\nverjagst sogleich die Angst der Nacht."\\n—Kinderreim aus Gaven\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8348b502-51ea-4c19-8899-d9fbaf55ef53\', \'multiverseId\': 535126}, \'multiverseid\': 535126}, {\'name\': \'Disipar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Luz matutina, luz matutina,\\na los miedos nocturnos elimina".\\n—Rima infantil de Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b70918c-22d6-4df6-9a8e-117af8d2db3c\', \'multiverseId\': 535442}, \'multiverseid\': 535442}, {\'name\': \'Dissipation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Lumière du matin, je t\'en prie,\\nchasse les terreurs de la nuit. »\\n—Comptine pour enfant de Gavonie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8823ea7-4c47-4f68-9195-f20cf2e68270\', \'multiverseId\': 535758}, \'multiverseid\': 535758}, {\'name\': \'Dissipare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Luce d\\\'aurora, luce d\\\'aurora,\\nScaccia le tenebre e la paura."\\n—Filastrocca di Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b642494e-2277-4fd0-92f7-7c03ca50e97a\', \'multiverseId\': 536074}, \'multiverseid\': 536074}, {\'name\': \'雲散霧消\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。これによりその呪文が打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「朝日よ朝日、\\n夜のおばけを追っ払え。」\\n――ガヴォニーの童謡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1de33fd-0495-456a-95ce-c91197e5f074\', \'multiverseId\': 536390}, \'multiverseid\': 536390}, {\'name\': \'일소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 이런 식으로 그 주문이 무효화되면, 그 주문을 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아침 햇살아, 아침 햇살아.\\n무서운 밤을 몰아내 주렴."\\n—가보니의 어린이 동요\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f5fb2c7-b681-45ea-9419-4e34f226c336\', \'multiverseId\': 536706}, \'multiverseid\': 536706}, {\'name\': \'Dissipar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Luz da aurora, luz da aurora,\\nLeve os horrores da noite embora."\\n— Parlenda infantil de Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0ee4964-4940-4d95-87f4-9d4404092314\', \'multiverseId\': 537022}, \'multiverseid\': 537022}, {\'name\': \'Развеивание\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Свет зари прогонит ночь,\\nУходите, страхи, прочь».\\n— гевонская детская считалка\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f723a97-8fc5-4ec0-b0b0-347dc5f0e29e\', \'multiverseId\': 537338}, \'multiverseid\': 537338}, {\'name\': \'云消雾散\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「天光光，亮光光，\\n黑夜怪物驱光光。」\\n～加渥尼童谣\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb71fc1-79d0-4d4a-aade-85e68ae8408a\', \'multiverseId\': 537654}, \'multiverseid\': 537654}, {\'name\': \'雲消霧散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「天光光，亮光光，\\n黑夜怪物驅光光。」\\n～加渥尼童謠\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d2d3ea-d49b-41dd-a989-169702963a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 537970}, \'multiverseid\': 537970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufopferung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts ist für einen Teufel lustiger, als jemanden — irgendwen — in Brand zu stecken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc8ffce4-6cde-46b2-a9cd-4ea6fc8c2292\', \'multiverseId\': 535239}, \'multiverseid\': 535239}, {\'name\': \'Inmolación\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'No hay nada más divertido para un diablo que quemar a alguien, sea quien sea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580f081d-9b92-4053-b4d2-88fc862c53aa\', \'multiverseId\': 535555}, \'multiverseid\': 535555}, {\'name\': \'Immolation\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Rien n\'amuse plus un démon que de mettre le feu à quelqu\'un.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f901208-2ab7-4a13-8e64-4dae05ce9523\', \'multiverseId\': 535871}, \'multiverseid\': 535871}, {\'name\': \'Immolazione\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Non c\'è niente di più divertente per un diavolo che dare fuoco a qualcuno, chiunque esso sia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b3c94d-eb90-4b90-b8a6-5889f6499ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 536187}, \'multiverseid\': 536187}, {\'name\': \'炎の供犠\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'悪魔にとって誰かに火をつけること程に面白おかしいことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6515f252-51de-4382-8800-f3f8ca850952\', \'multiverseId\': 536503}, \'multiverseid\': 536503}, {\'name\': \'제물\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'악령에게 있어 가장 재미있는 일은 누군가—아무나—를 불붙이는 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea285f07-612a-4ec9-b38a-52bb6d1df1aa\', \'multiverseId\': 536819}, \'multiverseid\': 536819}, {\'name\': \'Imolação\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nada é mais engraçado para um diabo que fazer alguém, qualquer um, pegar fogo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4288d2d-13b5-4eed-9986-a09bb726051c\', \'multiverseId\': 537135}, \'multiverseid\': 537135}, {\'name\': \'Всесожжение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Для дьявола нет ничего смешнее, чем кого-нибудь поджечь — кого угодно!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88b57de-f6c7-4f34-b397-c94d545d219a\', \'multiverseId\': 537451}, \'multiverseid\': 537451}, {\'name\': \'赤炎献祭\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/-2。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'对魔鬼来说，最有趣的事情莫过于把人点着～谁都行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317c30a1-14fd-4166-a6e2-1e7e393a970e\', \'multiverseId\': 537767}, \'multiverseid\': 537767}, {\'name\': \'赤炎獻祭\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/-2。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'對魔鬼來說，最有趣的事情莫過於把人點著～誰都行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdd6dce-47ef-4dec-863d-7901b8ebf23c\', \'multiverseId\': 538083}, \'multiverseid\': 538083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufschrecken\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verwesung. (Er kann nicht blocken. Wenn er angreift, opfere ihn am Ende des Kampfes.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b66834-dc9c-440b-9f11-8c20a991c73f\', \'multiverseId\': 535160}, \'multiverseid\': 535160}, {\'name\': \'Asustar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-0 hasta el final del turno. Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición. (No puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'681ef60e-9f93-4f19-8da0-2fc20d06eb4a\', \'multiverseId\': 535476}, \'multiverseid\': 535476}, {\'name\': \'Surprise\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition. (Il ne peut pas bloquer. Quand il attaque, sacrifiez-le à la fin du combat.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9764e3-98dc-44a8-9236-27f6f0ec23a2\', \'multiverseId\': 535792}, \'multiverseid\': 535792}, {\'name\': \'Spaventare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno. Crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera con decomposto. (Non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27751641-854e-4a26-8e6c-2a6b05800725\', \'multiverseId\': 536108}, \'multiverseid\': 536108}, {\'name\': \'驚愕\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－０の修整を受ける。腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。（それではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271b3eda-9ffb-422d-b043-7a42d23d4f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 536424}, \'multiverseid\': 536424}, {\'name\': \'놀래키기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-0을 받는다. 부패를 가진 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (그 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b788f0f-90cc-4dfa-9e2c-ece6bf4e7f35\', \'multiverseId\': 536740}, \'multiverseid\': 536740}, {\'name\': \'Alarmar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -2/-0 até o final do turno. Crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2 com decomposto. (Ela não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154014df-3a3a-4fd5-bff1-5487ec73131d\', \'multiverseId\': 537056}, \'multiverseid\': 537056}, {\'name\': \'Напугать\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -2/-0 до конца хода. Создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби с Трупной гнилью. (Она не может блокировать. Когда она атакует, пожертвуйте ее в конце боя.)\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7d52c3-b22b-49c8-9bf7-0f821b3578f6\', \'multiverseId\': 537372}, \'multiverseid\': 537372}, {\'name\': \'惊跳\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。派出一个2/2黑色，具败朽异能的灵俑衍生生物。（它不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a0762e-4362-447f-a7ae-11c345f664ab\', \'multiverseId\': 537688}, \'multiverseid\': 537688}, {\'name\': \'驚跳\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-2/-0直到回合結束。派出一個2/2黑色，具敗朽異能的殭屍衍生生物。（它不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5938ea-a658-4c3a-942b-86bbf05b386f\', \'multiverseId\': 538004}, \'multiverseid\': 538004}]', "[{'name': 'Aufstieg der Ameisen', 'text': 'Erzeuge zwei 3/3 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nRückblende {6}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535301&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5c797f2-c2d3-4deb-894c-445fea19b241', 'multiverseId': 535301}, 'multiverseid': 535301}, {'name': 'Levantamiento de las hormigas', 'text': 'Crea dos fichas de criatura Insecto verdes 3/3. Ganas 2 vidas.\\nRetrospectiva {6}{G}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535617&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8cee108-3bf5-418f-bc80-4d1ec06adfe7', 'multiverseId': 535617}, 'multiverseid': 535617}, {'name': 'Soulèvement des fourmis', 'text': 'Créez deux jetons de créature 3/3 verte Insecte. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nFlashback {6}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535933&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ef17a49-25c5-4575-be13-8f6b87fbe57a', 'multiverseId': 535933}, 'multiverseid': 535933}, {'name': 'Rivolta delle Formiche', 'text': 'Crea due pedine creatura Insetto 3/3 verdi. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nFlashback {6}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536249&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '962591ed-ccec-4452-8741-a2834269b198', 'multiverseId': 536249}, 'multiverseid': 536249}, {'name': '蟻の隆盛', 'text': '緑の３/３の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536565&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd659c6ba-8777-46b4-a35b-e040b16677cc', 'multiverseId': 536565}, 'multiverseid': 536565}, {'name': '개미들의 봉기', 'text': '3/3 녹색 곤충 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n회상 {6}{G}{G} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536881&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a83ad3a0-8e06-424d-bb83-ba3c44bf265a', 'multiverseId': 536881}, 'multiverseid': 536881}, {'name': 'Ascensão das Formigas', 'text': 'Crie duas fichas de criatura Inseto verde 3/3. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nRecapitular {6}{G}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537197&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fc13483-9b00-4fd1-9ea9-ab1aa9bed6c2', 'multiverseId': 537197}, 'multiverseid': 537197}, {'name': 'Восстание Муравьев', 'text': 'Создайте две фишки существа 3/3 зеленое Насекомое. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nВоспоминание {6}{G}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537513&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5d7caa3-10f6-4d95-9b8f-c1aa7520e1ea', 'multiverseId': 537513}, 'multiverseid': 537513}, {'name': '蚁群崛起', 'text': '派出两个3/3绿色昆虫衍生生物。你获得2点生命。\\n返照{6}{G}{G}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537829&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc5baf30-1a2d-408d-8d5b-368416c8469c', 'multiverseId': 537829}, 'multiverseid': 537829}, {'name': '蟻群崛起', 'text': '派出兩個3/3綠色昆蟲衍生生物。你獲得2點生命。\\n返照{6}{G}{G}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70e348b7-67e8-4f6f-9f12-b48db819a38a', 'multiverseId': 538145}, 'multiverseid': 538145}]", '[{\'name\': \'Augurin des Herbstes\', \'text\': \'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Länder oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen.\\nHexenzirkel — Solange du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, kannst du Kreaturenzauber oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca41efc-6726-464e-8367-54d23d3c53d2\', \'multiverseId\': 535268}, \'multiverseid\': 535268}, {\'name\': \'Augur del otoño\', \'text\': \'Puedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nAquelarre — Mientras controles tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, puedes lanzar hechizos de criatura desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cacb9c2-7c96-47e5-ad55-df44b7c99c5d\', \'multiverseId\': 535584}, \'multiverseid\': 535584}, {\'name\': "Augure de l\'automne", \'text\': \'Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nCongrégation — Tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, vous pouvez lancer des sorts de créature du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80935b3-d51a-47d4-b12f-f16ab871721d\', \'multiverseId\': 535900}, \'multiverseid\': 535900}, {\'name\': "Augure dell\'Autunno", \'text\': \'Puoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi giocare terre dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nCongrega — Fintanto che controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, puoi lanciare magie creatura dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2361d375-7b7c-48c0-b459-1794e24a3956\', \'multiverseId\': 536216}, \'multiverseid\': 536216}, {\'name\': \'秋の占い師\', \'text\': \'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n集会 — あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'807c4da1-1f5a-4268-bcbc-e48ac81863d6\', \'multiverseId\': 536532}, \'multiverseid\': 536532}, {\'name\': \'가을의 징조\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 언제든지 볼 수 있다.\\n당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 대지를 플레이할 수 있다.\\n집회 — 당신이 서로 공격력이 다른 생물을 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 생물 주문을 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad80ce3-ef69-4964-83b5-fbf187b203fd\', \'multiverseId\': 536848}, \'multiverseid\': 536848}, {\'name\': \'Áugure do Outono\', \'text\': \'Você pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nVocê pode jogar terrenos do topo de seu grimório.\\nConventículo — Enquanto você controla três ou mais criaturas com poderes diferentes, você pode conjurar mágicas de criatura do topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87445caf-8386-496a-b4d2-3817b8467851\', \'multiverseId\': 537164}, \'multiverseid\': 537164}, {\'name\': \'Гадательница Осени\', \'text\': \'Вы в любой момент можете посмотреть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыгрывать земли с верха вашей библиотеки.\\nШабаш — Пока вы контролируете не менее трех существ с различными значениями силы, вы можете разыгрывать заклинания существ с верха вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65e21eb-aab1-4875-9742-8d005915dbde\', \'multiverseId\': 537480}, \'multiverseid\': 537480}, {\'name\': \'暮秋卜算师\', \'text\': \'你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用地。\\n鸠集～只要你操控三个或更多力量各不相同的生物，你便可以从你的牌库顶施放生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f45ada-dcfa-463d-9c63-1f92c5e49ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 537796}, \'multiverseid\': 537796}, {\'name\': \'暮秋卜算師\', \'text\': \'你可以隨時檢視你的牌庫頂牌。\\n你可以從你的牌庫頂使用地。\\n鳩集～只要你操控三個或更多力量各不相同的生物，你便可以從你的牌庫頂施放生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241719bb-7bbf-4e0a-9e86-752dee7505c9\', \'multiverseId\': 538112}, \'multiverseid\': 538112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augurin des Herbstes\', \'text\': \'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Länder oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen.\\nHexenzirkel — Solange du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, kannst du Kreaturenzauber oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f75d7c4-5218-4ca9-95c8-651893cbe4af\', \'multiverseId\': 538777}, \'multiverseid\': 538777}, {\'name\': \'Augur del otoño\', \'text\': \'Puedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nAquelarre — Mientras controles tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, puedes lanzar hechizos de criatura desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d830a85f-56a3-4121-9970-cbef636fe5fe\', \'multiverseId\': 538837}, \'multiverseid\': 538837}, {\'name\': "Augure de l\'automne", \'text\': \'Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nCongrégation — Tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, vous pouvez lancer des sorts de créature du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cf89d43-a44e-4a9c-a3bd-4aca26fc089b\', \'multiverseId\': 538897}, \'multiverseid\': 538897}, {\'name\': "Augure dell\'Autunno", \'text\': \'Puoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi giocare terre dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nCongrega — Fintanto che controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, puoi lanciare magie creatura dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c19209a-0796-4dc7-8591-484b27033a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 538957}, \'multiverseid\': 538957}, {\'name\': \'秋の占い師\', \'text\': \'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n集会 — あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83562227-cd38-440d-a8ac-bd432e933446\', \'multiverseId\': 539017}, \'multiverseid\': 539017}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Keller kriechen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu einen Zombie deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\\nRückblende {3}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535178&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'635cb0a8-6f25-4532-a7ca-c3c8da0653c9\', \'multiverseId\': 535178}, \'multiverseid\': 535178}, {\'name\': \'Surgir de la bodega\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta un Zombie objetivo que controlas.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3edbeb-a624-4156-90a9-cdd9b9ccbe5d\', \'multiverseId\': 535494}, \'multiverseid\': 535494}, {\'name\': \'Ramper hors de la cave\', \'text\': "Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Ciblez jusqu\'à un zombie que vous contrôlez. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nFlashback {3}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5be58ffb-347f-4739-9c4c-6fef8b5889dc\', \'multiverseId\': 535810}, \'multiverseid\': 535810}, {\'name\': \'Strisciare dalla Cantina\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Scegli fino a uno Zombie bersaglio che controlli. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\\nFlashback {3}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1cbd363-180f-45dc-9193-70f14ba4d62d\', \'multiverseId\': 536126}, \'multiverseid\': 536126}, {\'name\': \'地下室からの這い上がり\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚とあなたがコントロールしているゾンビ最大１体を対象とする。その前者をあなたの手札に戻す。その後者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ad5004-a15c-43d8-8700-3d0161edadd0\', \'multiverseId\': 536442}, \'multiverseid\': 536442}, {\'name\': \'지하실에서 기어나오기\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 조종하는 좀비를 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n회상 {3}{B} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d37217-06d7-4ce8-8cc5-d6cfd23615e6\', \'multiverseId\': 536758}, \'multiverseid\': 536758}, {\'name\': \'Rastejar do Porão\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até um Zumbi alvo que você controla.\\nRecapitular {3}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfc06f55-e817-4b76-92e4-ee2bb49ba619\', \'multiverseId\': 537074}, \'multiverseid\': 537074}, {\'name\': \'Выползти из Подвала\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одного целевого Зомби под вашим контролем.\\nВоспоминание {3}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb70f879-0f1b-496c-96ad-ddfd1cdbad09\', \'multiverseId\': 537390}, \'multiverseid\': 537390}, {\'name\': \'爬出地窖\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。在至多一个目标由你操控的灵俑上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n返照{3}{B}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af8d71a3-5f2e-4f59-a76f-90f21c973d2a\', \'multiverseId\': 537706}, \'multiverseid\': 537706}, {\'name\': \'爬出地窖\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。在至多一個目標由你操控的殭屍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n返照{3}{B}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf1bb3d-cb2f-4f21-a773-32fe06170fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 538022}, \'multiverseid\': 538022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestopfter Bär\', \'text\': \'{2}: Der Ausgestopfte Bär wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 4/4 grünen Bär-Artefaktkreatur.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nur ein außergewöhnlich geschickter Präparator kann eine Bestie sauber ausstopfen und aufstellen, ohne ihren urtümlichen Jagdinstinkt zu zerstören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51645418-6bc5-4c22-8595-3ebdd3876e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 535373}, \'multiverseid\': 535373}, {\'name\': \'Oso disecado\', \'text\': \'{2}: El Oso disecado se convierte en una criatura artefacto Oso verde 4/4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo un taxidermista muy versado puede rellenar y preparar una bestia sin despojarla de su ímpetu de depredación primordial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8324bc9f-ed2c-4ba5-beb4-0985738002f1\', \'multiverseId\': 535689}, \'multiverseid\': 535689}, {\'name\': \'Ours empaillé\', \'text\': "{2} : L\'Ours empaillé devient une créature-artefact 4/4 verte Ours jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Seul un taxidermiste hors-pair sait empailler et exposer une bête sans la priver de son instinct primaire de prédateur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536005&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f24f949-eeae-4c45-a0ae-967f2b502ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 536005}, \'multiverseid\': 536005}, {\'name\': \'Orso Imbalsamato\', \'text\': "{2}: L\'Orso Imbalsamato diventa una creatura artefatto Orso 4/4 verde fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo un tassidermista di straordinaria abilità può imbalsamare e montare una bestia senza rimuovere il suo istinto predatorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d09118f-705d-4a4b-921d-2b68c1a37cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 536321}, \'multiverseid\': 536321}, {\'name\': \'熊の剥製\', \'text\': \'{2}：ターン終了時まで、熊の剥製は緑の４/４の熊・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'剥製師が、獣の原始的な捕食者的本能を損なわずに丁寧に詰めて飾るには、特別な技術が必要になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa09edb1-738a-47c3-aaff-ebd4e77cb14a\', \'multiverseId\': 536637}, \'multiverseid\': 536637}, {\'name\': \'배를 채운 곰\', \'text\': \'{2}: 배를 채운 곰은 턴종료까지 4/4 녹색 곰 마법물체 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'특출난 솜씨를 가진 박제사만이 짐승의 원시적이고 흉포한 본성이 그대로 드러나게 유지하면서 깨끗하게 속을 채워넣어 세울 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a379273a-ee87-497c-ac70-29327f6f6514\', \'multiverseId\': 536953}, \'multiverseid\': 536953}, {\'name\': \'Urso Empalhado\', \'text\': \'{2}: Urso Empalhado torna-se uma criatura artefato Urso verde 4/4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'É preciso um taxidermista de habilidade excepcional para empalhar uma fera sem danificar o instinto predatório primário.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07810465-fad9-45ca-b266-5f0e42fc0f99\', \'multiverseId\': 537269}, \'multiverseid\': 537269}, {\'name\': \'Чучело Медведя\', \'text\': \'{2}: Чучело Медведя становится артефактом существом 4/4 зеленый Медведь до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы набить и поставить такого зверя, не потеряв его природный хищный облик, нужен чучельник выдающегося мастерства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f312b6-2347-4f9c-8fd0-c8c1903fa2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 537585}, \'multiverseid\': 537585}, {\'name\': \'填充熊\', \'text\': \'{2}：填充熊成为4/4绿色的熊神器生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'仔细填充野兽尸身令其站立，同时又不失却其原初猎捕本能，这需要超凡技艺的标本师才能做到。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f09405-febe-4411-b5f4-ab345a868815\', \'multiverseId\': 537901}, \'multiverseid\': 537901}, {\'name\': \'填充熊\', \'text\': \'{2}：填充熊成為4/4綠色的熊神器生物直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'仔細填充野獸屍身令其站立，同時又不失卻其原初獵捕本能，這需要超凡技藝的標本師才能做到。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc25a705-8168-45d5-8f4b-370aaf4b6ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 538217}, \'multiverseid\': 538217}]', "[{'name': 'Belagerungszombie', 'text': 'Tappe drei ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst: Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Eine Barrikade bringt nur Zeit. Also kaufen die Reichen mehr Barrikaden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535212&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb21e365-2c55-4379-9ba4-b1d051b0df4c', 'multiverseId': 535212}, 'multiverseid': 535212}, {'name': 'Zombie de asedio', 'text': 'Girar tres criaturas enderezadas que controlas: Cada oponente pierde 1 vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Con las barricadas ganas tiempo, así que los ricos invierten en barricadas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535528&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '698b5c29-0f95-4c30-9a8c-285a9ee72644', 'multiverseId': 535528}, 'multiverseid': 535528}, {'name': 'Zombie de siège', 'text': 'Engagez trois créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez : Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie', 'flavor': 'Une barricade fait seulement gagner du temps. Alors les riches achètent plus de barricades.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535844&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a998c036-f358-446a-b803-d7b4a7dd1cc0', 'multiverseId': 535844}, 'multiverseid': 535844}, {'name': 'Zombie da Assedio', 'text': 'TAPpa tre creature STAPpate che controlli: Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Una barricata fa solo guadagnare tempo. Quindi i ricchi ne acquistano di più.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536160&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '467b1a75-cd74-4881-8ad6-b9632fb0aecb', 'multiverseId': 536160}, 'multiverseid': 536160}, {'name': '包囲ゾンビ', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー３体をタップする：各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': 'バリケードの役割は時間を稼ぐことだけである。つまり、金持ちはより多くのバリケードを購入するのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536476&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f81542f1-0580-44db-ab59-6630f78b184f', 'multiverseId': 536476}, 'multiverseid': 536476}, {'name': '공성 좀비', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 언탭된 생물 세 개를 탭한다: 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.', 'type': '생물 — 좀비', 'flavor': '바리케이드는 시간을 벌어줄 뿐이다. 그래서 부자들은 바리케이드를 더 많이 사들인다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536792&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6af22bf3-5b24-4fd0-b92e-c2b70df2a28b', 'multiverseId': 536792}, 'multiverseid': 536792}, {'name': 'Zumbi de Cerco', 'text': 'Vire três criaturas desviradas que você controla: Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi', 'flavor': 'Uma barricada só faz ganhar tempo. Portanto os ricos investem em mais barricadas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537108&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '853e9dcb-5c6b-4379-bf4f-9580f8de6f95', 'multiverseId': 537108}, 'multiverseid': 537108}, {'name': 'Осадные Зомби', 'text': 'Поверните три неповернутых существа под вашим контролем: каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.', 'type': 'Существо — Зомби', 'flavor': 'Баррикада только выигрывает время. Так что богатые покупают больше баррикад.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537424&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08041e79-b2b8-4f97-8e64-534ebca10c9c', 'multiverseId': 537424}, 'multiverseid': 537424}, {'name': '围城灵俑', 'text': '横置三个由你操控且未横置的生物：每位对手各失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～灵俑', 'flavor': '工事只能拖延时间。所以富人买下了更多工事。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537740&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef376179-5107-47cc-8059-83d5986a5b32', 'multiverseId': 537740}, 'multiverseid': 537740}, {'name': '圍城殭屍', 'text': '橫置三個由你操控且未橫置的生物：每位對手各失去1點生命。', 'type': '生物 ～殭屍', 'flavor': '工事只能拖延時間。所以富人買下了更多工事。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538056&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '145ec723-a809-49e3-8580-d1d5d8066b16', 'multiverseId': 538056}, 'multiverseid': 538056}]", '[{\'name\': \'Berittener Schreckensritter\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Berittene Schreckensritter kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Markov-Vampire pflegen ein Auftreten von so dekadenter Eleganz, dass man leicht vergisst, was für tödliche Kämpfer sie sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0b50a5-151b-4d95-b837-c64a2893f67e\', \'multiverseId\': 535245}, \'multiverseid\': 535245}, {\'name\': \'Caballero del pavor montado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Caballero del pavor montado entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él si un oponente perdió vidas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Los vampiros Markov transmiten una imagen de tal exceso de elegancia que es fácil olvidarse de que pueden desplegar unas tropas letales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d023036e-2390-4688-92a3-220a9a52394b\', \'multiverseId\': 535561}, \'multiverseid\': 535561}, {\'name\': "Chevalier de l\'effroi à cheval", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Chevalier de l\'effroi à cheval arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Les vampires de Markov cultivent une telle image d\'élégance décadente qu\'il est facile d\'oublier qu\'ils peuvent s\'avérer être une force de combat mortelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d418a08d-d3be-4693-ac6b-f3f36ada0e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 535877}, \'multiverseid\': 535877}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere Terrificante a Cavallo\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nIl Cavaliere Terrificante a Cavallo entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Vampiro\', \'flavor\': "I vampiri Markov coltivano un\'immagine di tale eleganza decadente che è facile dimenticare la loro abilità nel combattimento.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea66f607-df2c-4ad6-8af1-53a84327a09a\', \'multiverseId\': 536193}, \'multiverseid\': 536193}, {\'name\': \'馬上の戦慄騎士\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nこのターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていたなら、馬上の戦慄騎士は、＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'マルコフの吸血鬼からあまりに退廃的な優雅さが醸し出されるので、彼らが致命的な戦力を展開できることを忘れてしまいそうになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f605c9-c427-48fd-8917-db3ce5201716\', \'multiverseId\': 536509}, \'multiverseid\': 536509}, {\'name\': \'말에 탄 공포기사\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n말에 탄 공포기사는 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있다면 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 기사\', \'flavor\': \'마르코프 가문의 흡혈귀들은 그들이 치명적인 전투력을 가지고 있다는 것을 쉽사리 잊을 수 있을 정도로 퇴폐적인 우아함의 이미지를 기른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516945f6-d3bf-4760-a316-279ed42c5b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 536825}, \'multiverseid\': 536825}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro do Pavor Montado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCavaleiro do Pavor Montado entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os vampiros Markov cultivam uma imagem tão convincente de elegância decadente que é fácil esquecer que são capazes de convocar uma tropa mortífera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f3c3d2-f68a-48ad-a42b-924db9f51b4e\', \'multiverseId\': 537141}, \'multiverseid\': 537141}, {\'name\': \'Жуткий Рыцарь-Наездник\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nЖуткий Рыцарь-Наездник выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем, если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'Вампиры из рода Марковых культивируют такой образ декадентской элегантности, что можно легко забыть, что на поле битвы они представляют собой смертоносную силу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2c58be3-af54-4b84-8938-43d872d77bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 537457}, \'multiverseid\': 537457}, {\'name\': \'乘驹恐惧骑士\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n如果有对手本回合中失去过生命，则乘驹恐惧骑士进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'马可夫吸血鬼营造出的颓废而不失优雅形象，常让人们忘记他们尚有致命战力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddcb068-10a0-464e-a385-95901359bda3\', \'multiverseId\': 537773}, \'multiverseid\': 537773}, {\'name\': \'乘駒恐懼騎士\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n如果有對手本回合中失去過生命，則乘駒恐懼騎士進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'馬可夫吸血鬼營造出的頹廢而不失優雅形象，常讓人們忘記他們尚有致命戰力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205ab54f-6645-42f0-a801-9993b38064a0\', \'multiverseId\': 538089}, \'multiverseid\': 538089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestialischer Widersacher\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Bestialische Widersacher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {1}{G} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Bestialischen Widersacher. Dann werden bis zu entsprechend viele Länder deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, zu 3/3 Wolf-Kreaturen mit Eile, die immer noch Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535299&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0814237f-8c79-4aa5-9130-98ea55bb94c6\', \'multiverseId\': 535299}, \'multiverseid\': 535299}, {\'name\': \'Adversario primordial\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Adversario primordial entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}{G} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Adversario primordial, luego hasta esa misma cantidad de tierras objetivo que controlas se convierten en criaturas Lobo 3/3 con la habilidad de prisa que siguen siendo tierras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03463ecc-7027-46c7-b175-cb364a29a121\', \'multiverseId\': 535615}, \'multiverseid\': 535615}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire primordial\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand l\'Adversaire primordial arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}{G} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Adversaire primordial, puis jusqu\'à autant de terrains ciblés que vous contrôlez deviennent des créatures 3/3 Loup avec la célérité qui sont toujours des terrains.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd196127-8d12-4420-9b43-ef9d718646e9\', \'multiverseId\': 535931}, \'multiverseid\': 535931}, {\'name\': \'Avversario Primordiale\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nQuando l\'Avversario Primordiale entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}{G} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Avversario Primordiale, poi fino ad altrettante terre bersaglio che controlli diventano creature Lupo 3/3 con rapidità che sono ancora terre.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397045ee-2651-4476-986e-571310a0e778\', \'multiverseId\': 536247}, \'multiverseid\': 536247}, {\'name\': \'原初の敵対者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n原初の敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{1}{G}を望む回数支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、あなたがコントロールしている、その回数を最大とする数の土地を対象とする。原初の敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。その後、それらの土地は速攻を持つ３/３の狼・クリーチャーになる。それらは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47334df2-9d87-4e06-ba72-2abfaced9675\', \'multiverseId\': 536563}, \'multiverseid\': 536563}, {\'name\': \'태고의 적수\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n태고의 적수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 원하는 횟수만큼 {1}{G}를 지불할 수 있다. 당신이 이 비용을 한 번 이상 지불할 때, 태고의 적수에 그 수만큼 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓은 후, 당신이 조종하는 대지를 최대 그 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 대지들은 신속을 가진 3/3 늑대 생물이 되며 여전히 대지이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7185feb7-a819-406d-b681-55a114a2a936\', \'multiverseId\': 536879}, \'multiverseid\': 536879}, {\'name\': \'Adversário Primal\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Adversário Primal entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {1}{G} qualquer número de vezes. Quando pagar esse custo uma ou mais vezes, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 em Adversário Primal. Depois, até aquela quantidade de terrenos alvo que você controla se tornam criaturas Lobo 3/3 com ímpeto que ainda são terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016015f9-9140-4578-81a7-fb1c18a6d234\', \'multiverseId\': 537195}, \'multiverseid\': 537195}, {\'name\': \'Первобытный Противник\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Первобытный Противник выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заплатить {1}{G} любое количество раз. Когда вы оплачиваете эту стоимость один или несколько раз, положите такое же количество жетонов +1/+1 на Первобытного Противника, затем не более такого же количества целевых земель под вашим контролем становятся существами 3/3 Волк с Ускорением, которые при этом остаются землями.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f12cbe-7e2c-48fa-baa6-7d57412183dc\', \'multiverseId\': 537511}, \'multiverseid\': 537511}, {\'name\': \'原初仇敌\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当原初仇敌进战场时，你可以支付{1}{G}任意次数。当你支付一次或数次此费用时，根据该数量在原初仇敌上放置等量的+1/+1指示物，然后至多等量目标由你操控的地成为3/3，具敏捷异能的狼生物，并且仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b59f49-2315-469f-a743-a93959da738f\', \'multiverseId\': 537827}, \'multiverseid\': 537827}, {\'name\': \'原初仇敵\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當原初仇敵進戰場時，你可以支付{1}{G}任意次數。當你支付一次或數次此費用時，根據該數量在原初仇敵上放置等量的+1/+1指示物，然後至多等量目標由你操控的地成為3/3，具敏捷異能的狼生物，並且仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615f530c-1675-4f99-a3d0-52104671957d\', \'multiverseId\': 538143}, \'multiverseid\': 538143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestialischer Widersacher\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Bestialische Widersacher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {1}{G} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Bestialischen Widersacher. Dann werden bis zu entsprechend viele Länder deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, zu 3/3 Wolf-Kreaturen mit Eile, die immer noch Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538780&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9e6c0e0-2e2e-4d60-a7a1-4bde271bae3a\', \'multiverseId\': 538780}, \'multiverseid\': 538780}, {\'name\': \'Adversario primordial\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Adversario primordial entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}{G} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Adversario primordial, luego hasta esa misma cantidad de tierras objetivo que controlas se convierten en criaturas Lobo 3/3 con la habilidad de prisa que siguen siendo tierras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872f00b0-87a3-432e-ad7e-c0e63ddc0339\', \'multiverseId\': 538840}, \'multiverseid\': 538840}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire primordial\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand l\'Adversaire primordial arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}{G} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Adversaire primordial, puis jusqu\'à autant de terrains ciblés que vous contrôlez deviennent des créatures 3/3 Loup avec la célérité qui sont toujours des terrains.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33467196-6aee-4566-8a1c-64f259c73568\', \'multiverseId\': 538900}, \'multiverseid\': 538900}, {\'name\': \'Avversario Primordiale\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nQuando l\'Avversario Primordiale entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}{G} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Avversario Primordiale, poi fino ad altrettante terre bersaglio che controlli diventano creature Lupo 3/3 con rapidità che sono ancora terre.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e887cb1e-9dd5-4a05-ada2-339a5ba01003\', \'multiverseId\': 538960}, \'multiverseid\': 538960}, {\'name\': \'原初の敵対者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n原初の敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{1}{G}を望む回数支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、あなたがコントロールしている、その回数を最大とする数の土地を対象とする。原初の敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。その後、それらの土地は速攻を持つ３/３の狼・クリーチャーになる。それらは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'959c8346-ac08-4d9b-9cae-68823555c0be\', \'multiverseId\': 539020}, \'multiverseid\': 539020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick aus einer anderen Welt\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {1}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535147&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c76865-f382-498f-b20f-543fc3d15f50\', \'multiverseId\': 535147}, \'multiverseid\': 535147}, {\'name\': \'Mirada sobrenatural\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en tu cementerio y el resto en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b714cf-3540-4c0e-a959-57b1ae62bef9\', \'multiverseId\': 535463}, \'multiverseid\': 535463}, {\'name\': \'Regard fantasmagorique\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et remettez le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\nFlashback {1}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5adb6c4-b9f6-4598-80e6-3e149e91d70c\', \'multiverseId\': 535779}, \'multiverseid\': 535779}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo Soprannaturale\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\nFlashback {1}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d002c38d-3794-452d-aeb6-a2732c43ed0d\', \'multiverseId\': 536095}, \'multiverseid\': 536095}, {\'name\': \'異世界の凝視\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb2933f-b354-4895-a4a9-5ef902597948\', \'multiverseId\': 536411}, \'multiverseid\': 536411}, {\'name\': \'이계의 응시\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 무덤에 넣고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\\n회상 {1}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25e8078-ce90-476f-9f7c-68e4f70ac423\', \'multiverseId\': 536727}, \'multiverseid\': 536727}, {\'name\': \'Olhar do Outro Mundo\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque qualquer quantidade deles no seu cemitério e o restante no topo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\nRecapitular {1}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea0a129-1d7a-4eaf-9248-4c845043026b\', \'multiverseId\': 537043}, \'multiverseid\': 537043}, {\'name\': \'Потусторонний Взгляд\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите любое количество из них на ваше кладбище, а остальные — обратно на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\nВоспоминание {1}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8826b8-4e98-472f-8e43-58e3cc6fc854\', \'multiverseId\': 537359}, \'multiverseid\': 537359}, {\'name\': \'异界凝视\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中任意数量的牌置入你的坟墓场，其余则以任意顺序放回你的牌库顶。\\n返照{1}{U}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e09a6e1-afcf-4f55-8036-acaf52497cae\', \'multiverseId\': 537675}, \'multiverseid\': 537675}, {\'name\': \'異界凝視\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中任意數量的牌置入你的墳墓場，其餘則以任意順序放回你的牌庫頂。\\n返照{1}{U}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da9c91f-258b-4e22-aed3-d25bdcae023a\', \'multiverseId\': 537991}, \'multiverseid\': 537991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Widersacherin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Blutdürstige Widersacherin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {2}{R} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Blutdürstige Widersacherin. Schicke dann bis zu entsprechend viele Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil und kopiere sie. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54d0195e-563a-4282-9102-b3efb706eab9\', \'multiverseId\': 535221}, \'multiverseid\': 535221}, {\'name\': \'Adversaria sedienta de sangre\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Adversaria sedienta de sangre entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}{R} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Adversaria sedienta de sangre, luego exilia hasta esa misma cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio y cópialas. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de esas copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58193856-561c-454a-9e4e-459c23766b98\', \'multiverseId\': 535537}, \'multiverseid\': 535537}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}{R} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang, puis exilez jusqu\'à autant de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel ciblées avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière et copiez-les. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ca06ed-e846-424a-b30e-e7135186f570\', \'multiverseId\': 535853}, \'multiverseid\': 535853}, {\'name\': \'Avversaria Sanguinaria\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nQuando l\'Avversaria Sanguinaria entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}{R} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Avversaria Sanguinaria, poi esilia fino ad altrettante carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero e copiale. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di copie senza pagare il loro costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c95f68-d1bd-450c-80b1-a72537501c75\', \'multiverseId\': 536169}, \'multiverseid\': 536169}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた敵対者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n血に飢えた敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{2}{R}を望む回数支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、その回数を最大とする枚数の、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でインスタントやソーサリーであるカードを対象とする。血に飢えた敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。その後、対象としたカードを追放し、コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f62a447-c541-409a-a865-fb8a701a4962\', \'multiverseId\': 536485}, \'multiverseid\': 536485}, {\'name\': \'피에 굶주린 적수\', \'text\': \'신속\\n피에 굶주린 적수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 원하는 횟수만큼 {2}{R}를 지불할 수 있다. 당신이 이 비용을 한 번 이상 지불할 때, 피에 굶주린 적수에 그 수만큼 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓은 뒤, 당신의 무덤에 있는 마나 값이 3 이하인 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 그 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 추방하고 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들을 원하는 수만큼 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f158b9-4b8c-4615-8fcd-5c69c7e0a3a4\', \'multiverseId\': 536801}, \'multiverseid\': 536801}, {\'name\': \'Adversária Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nQuando Adversária Sanguinária entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {2}{R} qualquer número de vezes. Quando pagar esse custo uma ou mais vezes, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 em Adversária Sanguinária. Depois, exile até aquela quantidade de cards de mágica instantânea e/ou de feitiço alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério e copie-os. Você pode conjurar qualquer número dessas cópias sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e69acdb-b831-4696-9997-5f3899f5546f\', \'multiverseId\': 537117}, \'multiverseid\': 537117}, {\'name\': \'Кровожадный Противник\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nКогда Кровожадный Противник выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заплатить {2}{R} любое количество раз. Когда вы оплачиваете эту стоимость один или несколько раз, положите такое же количество жетонов +1/+1 на Кровожадного Противника, затем изгоните не более такого же количества целевых карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства с мановой ценностью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища и скопируйте их. Вы можете разыграть любое количество тех копий без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb14bf9e-4b3c-4f4d-9eab-4aa2c5c2e3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 537433}, \'multiverseid\': 537433}, {\'name\': \'嗜血仇敌\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当嗜血仇敌进战场时，你可以支付{2}{R}任意次数。当你支付一次或数次此费用时，根据该数量在嗜血仇敌上放置等量的+1/+1指示物，然后将至多等量之目标法术力值等于或小于3的瞬间和／或法术牌从你的坟墓场放逐并复制。你可以施放任意数量的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250264be-4aed-4293-92fe-91b6d46b9d58\', \'multiverseId\': 537749}, \'multiverseid\': 537749}, {\'name\': \'嗜血仇敵\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n當嗜血仇敵進戰場時，你可以支付{2}{R}任意次數。當你支付一次或數次此費用時，根據該數量在嗜血仇敵上放置等量的+1/+1指示物，然後將至多等量之目標魔法力值等於或小於3的瞬間和／或巫術牌從你的墳墓場放逐並複製。你可以施放任意數量的複製品，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500e2e29-5e98-4b9a-9855-16cc8d24a29a\', \'multiverseId\': 538065}, \'multiverseid\': 538065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Widersacherin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Blutdürstige Widersacherin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {2}{R} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Blutdürstige Widersacherin. Schicke dann bis zu entsprechend viele Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil und kopiere sie. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54f9c64-0b78-483b-b8fa-8ac82fd5c18c\', \'multiverseId\': 538767}, \'multiverseid\': 538767}, {\'name\': \'Adversaria sedienta de sangre\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Adversaria sedienta de sangre entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}{R} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Adversaria sedienta de sangre, luego exilia hasta esa misma cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio y cópialas. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de esas copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e34e327-dcc1-4a75-b057-3f12bfa1d42b\', \'multiverseId\': 538827}, \'multiverseid\': 538827}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}{R} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang, puis exilez jusqu\'à autant de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel ciblées avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière et copiez-les. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60855d5c-4510-429c-ae4a-007cfcbf029b\', \'multiverseId\': 538887}, \'multiverseid\': 538887}, {\'name\': \'Avversaria Sanguinaria\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nQuando l\'Avversaria Sanguinaria entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}{R} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Avversaria Sanguinaria, poi esilia fino ad altrettante carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero e copiale. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di copie senza pagare il loro costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70192dd2-27f2-4540-9409-b2b2b0ee9746\', \'multiverseId\': 538947}, \'multiverseid\': 538947}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた敵対者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n血に飢えた敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{2}{R}を望む回数支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、その回数を最大とする枚数の、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でインスタントやソーサリーであるカードを対象とする。血に飢えた敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。その後、対象としたカードを追放し、コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b854b780-50ca-4f1d-95eb-ff983a666a40\', \'multiverseId\': 539007}, \'multiverseid\': 539007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutlinien-Auslese\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Kreaturenspielsteine erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Vergiss deine menschlichen Vorfahren. Jetzt bist du Teil meiner Familie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea590df-9895-472f-966e-5bef17a22aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 535173}, \'multiverseid\': 535173}, {\'name\': \'Exterminio del linaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Las fichas de criatura obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Olvídate de tus ancestros humanos. Ahora formas parte de mi familia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fb97e8a-c514-4698-a282-366856c67f24\', \'multiverseId\': 535489}, \'multiverseid\': 535489}, {\'name\': \'Sacrifice de la lignée\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Les jetons de créature gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Oublie tes ancêtres humains. Tu fais désormais partie de ma famille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2882ece-3dd0-45a5-8b9b-8b87fdd4eb31\', \'multiverseId\': 535805}, \'multiverseid\': 535805}, {\'name\': \'Selezione della Stirpe\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Le pedine creatura prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dimentica i tuoi antenati umani. Ora fai parte della mia famiglia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'530f2d76-d5d6-493f-bc0d-fd433a956614\', \'multiverseId\': 536121}, \'multiverseid\': 536121}, {\'name\': \'血統の選別\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。\\n• ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャー・トークンは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「人間の先祖のことは忘れてしまいなさい。これからあなたは私の家族の一員なのですから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a0d29e-8140-4a67-ae8a-e875b58abe01\', \'multiverseId\': 536437}, \'multiverseid\': 536437}, {\'name\': \'혈통 솎아내기\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -5/-5를 받는다.\\n• 생물 토큰들은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네 인간 조상들은 잊어라. 너는 이제 내 가족의 일원이니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85932fc-34a3-4286-826a-db5a53414f45\', \'multiverseId\': 536753}, \'multiverseid\': 536753}, {\'name\': \'Ceifa da Linhagem\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -5/-5 até o final do turno.\\n• As fichas de criatura recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Esqueça seus ancestrais humanos. Agora vocês são parte da minha família."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f825d7-5618-4df1-980c-b60cead04ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 537069}, \'multiverseid\': 537069}, {\'name\': \'Выбраковка Кровной Линии\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо получает -5/-5 до конца хода.\\n• Фишки существ получают -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Забудь своих человеческих предков. Теперь ты из моей семьи».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70be4cbe-a5e1-4b8e-9714-3f38853005d7\', \'multiverseId\': 537385}, \'multiverseid\': 537385}, {\'name\': \'汰除血脉\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标生物得-5/-5直到回合结束。\\n•衍生生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「忘记你的人类族谱吧。你现在是我家的人了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c763360-dcb9-4f1a-9b28-f4baeba21820\', \'multiverseId\': 537701}, \'multiverseid\': 537701}, {\'name\': \'汰除血脈\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標生物得-5/-5直到回合結束。\\n•衍生生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「忘記你的人類族譜吧。你現在是我家的人了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b50dc8-64f9-4334-b6f5-f5717f8f9273\', \'multiverseId\': 538017}, \'multiverseid\': 538017}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutlinien-Auslese\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Kreaturenspielsteine erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538758&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991a1bf2-3af9-46c1-a175-a4d64881c6c3\', \'multiverseId\': 538758}, \'multiverseid\': 538758}, {\'name\': \'Exterminio del linaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Las fichas de criatura obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7615dcd2-1f10-407f-bb02-47667ac82bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 538818}, \'multiverseid\': 538818}, {\'name\': \'Sacrifice de la lignée\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Les jetons de créature gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13131c8-311f-4469-9498-8b0e8b77464a\', \'multiverseId\': 538878}, \'multiverseid\': 538878}, {\'name\': \'Selezione della Stirpe\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Le pedine creatura prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e85b0b-5267-4e44-8d71-7146c1008727\', \'multiverseId\': 538938}, \'multiverseid\': 538938}, {\'name\': \'血統の選別\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。\\n• ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャー・トークンは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76336618-c6f8-4177-9eaf-79cd3a3756e2\', \'multiverseId\': 538998}, \'multiverseid\': 538998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzehnt-Eintreiberin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Blutzehnt-Eintreiberin ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Für die kultivierteren Vampire ist es wesentlich befriedigender, den Willen eines Opfers zu brechen, als nur sein Blut zu trinken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535174&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9f6d315-85ed-4945-a9fc-221bf8da25e7\', \'multiverseId\': 535174}, \'multiverseid\': 535174}, {\'name\': \'Recolectora de diezmos de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Recolectora de diezmos de sangre entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente perdió vidas este turno, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para los vampiros más refinados, doblegar la voluntad de una víctima es mucho más satisfactorio que simplemente arrebatarle la sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daca9caa-bf3b-488f-a9d1-6313acb046d3\', \'multiverseId\': 535490}, \'multiverseid\': 535490}, {\'name\': \'Collectrice de la dîme de sang\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Collectrice de la dîme de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et noble\', \'flavor\': "Chez les vampires plus raffinés, briser la volonté d\'une victime est bien plus satisfaisant que de se contenter de boire son sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647a0643-adf3-44c6-a139-a12c4878963d\', \'multiverseId\': 535806}, \'multiverseid\': 535806}, {\'name\': \'Esattrice di Offerte di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Esattrice di Offerte di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno, ogni avversario scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Per i vampiri più raffinati, spezzare la forza di volontà delle vittime è più soddisfacente che berne il sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'545f59c9-540b-4a2a-acf2-35282e0e8db0\', \'multiverseId\': 536122}, \'multiverseid\': 536122}, {\'name\': \'税血の徴収者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n税血の徴収者が戦場に出たとき、このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていた場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'洗練された吸血鬼にとって、単に血を頂戴する事よりも被害者の意志をへし折る事の方が遥かに満足感を得られるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55908337-9e50-44b8-9099-ce28c3573be7\', \'multiverseId\': 536438}, \'multiverseid\': 536438}, {\'name\': \'피 십일조 수집가\', \'text\': \'비행\\n피 십일조 수집가가 전장에 들어올 때, 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있다면, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 귀족\', \'flavor\': \'좀 더 교양 있는 흡혈귀에게 있어서 피해자의 의지를 꺾는 일은 단순히 그들의 피를 취하는 것보다 더 만족스러운 일이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580c8eee-7fb7-4c54-9d15-cf7f676eecd3\', \'multiverseId\': 536754}, \'multiverseid\': 536754}, {\'name\': \'Coletora do Dízimo de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Coletora do Dízimo de Sangue entra no campo de batalha, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno, cada oponente descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'Para o vampiro mais refinado, subjugar a vontade da vítima é muito mais satisfatório que simplesmente beber seu sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a636b873-3636-4e80-8f5b-25d0176f35db\', \'multiverseId\': 537070}, \'multiverseid\': 537070}, {\'name\': \'Сборщица Кровавой Подати\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Сборщица Кровавой Подати выходит на поле битвы, если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу, каждый оппонент сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Аристократ\', \'flavor\': \'Наиболее утонченным вампирам ломать волю жертвы куда приятнее, чем просто забирать ее кровь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2d3ee6-a827-49f3-bede-87d492af9de4\', \'multiverseId\': 537386}, \'multiverseid\': 537386}, {\'name\': \'血税征收员\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当血税征收员进战场时，若有对手本回合中失去过生命，则每位对手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'对于有讲究的吸血鬼而言，粉碎心智要比单纯吸血更具乐趣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b692ee7-cf17-48d7-9704-a5b5020401a5\', \'multiverseId\': 537702}, \'multiverseid\': 537702}, {\'name\': \'血稅徵收員\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當血稅徵收員進戰場時，若有對手本回合中失去過生命，則每位對手各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／貴族\', \'flavor\': \'對於有講究的吸血鬼而言，粉碎心智要比單純吸血更具樂趣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e282e4-a851-460a-ab5d-817c731493b5\', \'multiverseId\': 538018}, \'multiverseid\': 538018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutweberin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn die Brutweberin stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/2 grünen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Reisende im Dämmerwald suchen den Boden nach Spuren von Werwölfen ab und bemerken nicht die Gefahren, die keine Spuren auf dem Boden hinterlassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f522fd4-ba4a-40f3-bd3d-ed93f6dba435\', \'multiverseId\': 535274}, \'multiverseid\': 535274}, {\'name\': \'Tejedora con crías\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando la Tejedora con crías muera, crea una ficha de criatura Araña verde 1/2 con la habilidad de alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'En Somberwald, los viajeros escrutan la tierra en busca de licántropos y otras amenazas, ajenos a lo que merodea sobre ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535330d3-50a8-47aa-beeb-b85ecfcfaf22\', \'multiverseId\': 535590}, \'multiverseid\': 535590}, {\'name\': \'Tisseuse de couvée\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nQuand la Tisseuse de couvée meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui voyagent dans Somberwald cherchent des traces de loups-garous et d\'autres menaces au sol, inconscients de ce qui rôde au-dessus d\'eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63197b84-2705-4c35-af53-53678291751f\', \'multiverseId\': 535906}, \'multiverseid\': 535906}, {\'name\': \'Tessitrice della Prole\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando la Tessitrice della Prole muore, crea una pedina creatura Ragno 1/2 verde con raggiungere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'I viaggiatori che si addentrano a Somberwald osservano il terreno in cerca di tracce di mannari e altri pericoli, ignari di ciò che si annida sopra le loro teste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3b0545-3011-4b18-907e-8bc424399a39\', \'multiverseId\': 536222}, \'multiverseid\': 536222}, {\'name\': \'群れの織り手\', \'text\': \'到達\\n群れの織り手が死亡したとき、到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'ソンバーワルドの旅人は人狼や他の脅威を警戒して地面を調べるが、頭上に潜むものには気づかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c06fab-5083-499e-b40d-64833336ec98\', \'multiverseId\': 536538}, \'multiverseid\': 536538}, {\'name\': \'무리 방직거미\', \'text\': \'대공\\n무리 방직거미가 죽을 때, 대공을 가진 1/2 녹색 거미 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'솜버왈드를 여행하는 사람들은 위쪽에 무엇이 숨어 있는지는 알지 못한 채 늑대인간과 다른 위협들을 경계하며 땅을 샅샅이 훑어본다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13679a7f-62f2-4f71-b1d4-26e394972082\', \'multiverseId\': 536854}, \'multiverseid\': 536854}, {\'name\': \'Tecelã da Prole\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Tecelã da Prole morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Aranha verde 1/2 com alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Os viajantes de Somberwald procuram lobisomens e outras ameaças no chão... sem saber o que espreita acima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf83ad81-1c63-4818-ad76-f5289b03aa6a\', \'multiverseId\': 537170}, \'multiverseid\': 537170}, {\'name\': \'Плетельщик Выводка\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nКогда Плетельщик Выводка умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 1/2 зеленый Паук с Захватом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Путешественники в Сомбервальде смотрят по сторонам, опасаясь вервольфов и других угроз, но не подозревают, что таится наверху.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72343727-7c2a-437b-9b0b-3e72a3595bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 537486}, \'multiverseid\': 537486}, {\'name\': \'守巢编蛛\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当守巢编蛛死去时，派出一个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'进到松柏森的旅人通常会仔细检查地面，查看有无狼人或其他威胁痕迹，而忽略了头顶动向。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025a2222-55bf-4deb-8725-e7017e01df13\', \'multiverseId\': 537802}, \'multiverseid\': 537802}, {\'name\': \'守巢編蛛\', \'text\': \'延勢\\n當守巢編蛛死去時，派出一個1/2綠色，具延勢異能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'進到松柏森的旅人通常會仔細檢查地面，查看有無狼人或其他威脅痕跡，而忽略了頭頂動向。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9209930f-075f-48a4-bb9c-635a3fcccbda\', \'multiverseId\': 538118}, \'multiverseid\': 538118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bäuerlicher Mut\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Sie erhält Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nRückblende {W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Komm schon, Unhold. Ich zerteile dich wie einen Schinken zum Erntefest."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c031c0-1e27-41a8-bc0a-58158331d096\', \'multiverseId\': 535096}, \'multiverseid\': 535096}, {\'name\': \'Coraje hogareño\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\\nRetrospectiva {W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos, demonio. Te cortaré en cachitos, como si fueses un jamón en la Cosechalia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8dc404-708f-491e-aa23-552afe257c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 535412}, \'multiverseid\': 535412}, {\'name\': \'Courage à la ferme\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Elle acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nFlashback {W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Approche, suppôt du mal. Je vais te découper comme un jambon à la Fête des moissons. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f01664-f66f-423b-9623-0ab536f57841\', \'multiverseId\': 535728}, \'multiverseid\': 535728}, {\'name\': \'Coraggio Contadino\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\\nFlashback {W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Fatti sotto, essere immondo. Ti affetterò come un prosciutto al Festival del Raccolto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f122357-1ec5-4513-9508-81a3692ff5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 536044}, \'multiverseid\': 536044}, {\'name\': \'農家の勇気\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「かかって来な、魔物め。収穫祭のハムのように刻んでやるよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e3702b-3478-43aa-aad1-b175d536ce9c\', \'multiverseId\': 536360}, \'multiverseid\': 536360}, {\'name\': \'주민의 용기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\\n회상 {W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"덤벼 봐, 악마 자식아. 수확철 햄처럼 썰어 줄 테니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28de660a-5a00-4538-8118-789f1d86bc34\', \'multiverseId\': 536676}, \'multiverseid\': 536676}, {\'name\': \'Coragem Campestre\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. Ela ganha vigilância até o final do turno.\\nRecapitular {W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Vem, demônio. Eu vou fatiar você como um presunto do Festival da Colheita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10bb1adb-dba2-40d9-aa4a-1718e7f27f10\', \'multiverseId\': 536992}, \'multiverseid\': 536992}, {\'name\': \'Мужество Домочадцев\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем. Оно получает Бдительность до конца хода.\\nВоспоминание {W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Давай, подходи, чёрт. Я тебя нашинкую, как ветчину на Седмицу Жатвы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ae9837-2ba1-4e2b-b8ca-2a9e6e345002\', \'multiverseId\': 537308}, \'multiverseid\': 537308}, {\'name\': \'护家之勇\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\\n返照{W}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「尽管过来，魔鬼。看我把你当成收成节的火腿一样剁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'131c636d-baf4-4610-b30e-14925deafab7\', \'multiverseId\': 537624}, \'multiverseid\': 537624}, {\'name\': \'護家之勇\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\\n返照{W}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「儘管過來，魔鬼。看我把你當成收成節的火腿一樣剁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce964353-4564-4d46-85e9-26bfe2cf2f63\', \'multiverseId\': 537940}, \'multiverseid\': 537940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Verstorbenen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Zombie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion der Verstorbenen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Er erhob sich für alle Schuster, Gerber und Dummköpfe, die im Sprengel abgeschlachtet worden waren, aus dem Grab — und sie erhoben sich mit und schlurften hinter ihm her.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630c09fb-d1b9-440b-9352-ad1fcfe4c2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 535175}, \'multiverseid\': 535175}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de los muertos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Zombie entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Campeón de los muertos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Se alzó de la tumba por cada zapatero, curtidor y bufón asesinado en la parroquia. Ellos se levantaron y se arrastraron tras él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f40762f3-3f07-4eb1-866b-654a0fd1b9e8\', \'multiverseId\': 535491}, \'multiverseid\': 535491}, {\'name\': \'Champion des trépassés\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre zombie arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Champion des trépassés.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Il revint du graf pour chaque cordonnier, tanneur et idiot massacré dans la paroisse... et ils revinrent pour le suivre d\'un pas traînant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbadd624-3605-4ab1-8cd7-6f7b64095606\', \'multiverseId\': 535807}, \'multiverseid\': 535807}, {\'name\': \'Campione dei Defunti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Zombie entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Campione dei Defunti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Si rialzò dalla tomba per ogni calzolaio, conciatore e folle che era stato ammazzato nella parrocchia... e loro si rialzarono con lui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a6d7b2-8bc1-4a7b-b1fe-d4d093df2533\', \'multiverseId\': 536123}, \'multiverseid\': 536123}, {\'name\': \'滅びし者の勇者\', \'text\': \'これでないゾンビ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、滅びし者の勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'彼は教区で殺戮された靴屋や皮職人や愚か者のために墓から蘇った―—そして、殺戮された人々も蘇り彼の後をよろめき進んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84b0c16-a960-45db-ae28-28e6b0c2de2d\', \'multiverseId\': 536439}, \'multiverseid\': 536439}, {\'name\': \'망자의 투사\', \'text\': \'다른 좀비가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 망자의 투사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'그는 교구에서 죽임을 당한 모든 구두수선공, 무두장이, 그리고 바보들이 묻혀 있는 무덤에서 되살아났다—그리고 그들 또한 되살아나 어기적거리며 그의 뒤를 따랐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a60fa71-75d4-4706-ae9a-afba116f7361\', \'multiverseId\': 536755}, \'multiverseid\': 536755}, {\'name\': \'Campeão dos Perecidos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Zumbi entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Campeão dos Perecidos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele se ergueu do cemitério por cada sapateiro, curtidor e imbecil que havia sido assassinado na paróquia, e eles se ergueram e claudicaram atrás dele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d635942-6e7d-478f-8c5d-24b3791ccdb8\', \'multiverseId\': 537071}, \'multiverseid\': 537071}, {\'name\': \'Заступник Павших\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой Зомби выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Заступника Павших.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Он поднялся из могильника за каждого убитого в приходе сапожника, кожевника и дурака — и те встали и поплелись за ним.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1d2273-51b1-4fda-8367-2accb2f37084\', \'multiverseId\': 537387}, \'multiverseid\': 537387}, {\'name\': \'墓躯斗士\', \'text\': \'每当另一个灵俑在你的操控下进战场时，在墓躯斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'他从埋葬教区里每一个遇难鞋匠，染匠，以及愚人的墓地中爬起～而他们也跟随挺身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1713924-6219-42fc-a9a3-be220f0b2660\', \'multiverseId\': 537703}, \'multiverseid\': 537703}, {\'name\': \'墓軀鬥士\', \'text\': \'每當另一個殭屍在你的操控下進戰場時，在墓軀鬥士上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'他從埋葬教區裡每一個遇難鞋匠，染匠，以及愚人的墓地中爬起～而他們也跟隨挺身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45241f5-4582-49af-bb41-563b630264ca\', \'multiverseId\': 538019}, \'multiverseid\': 538019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Verstorbenen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Zombie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion der Verstorbenen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538759&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527c3ced-eb8f-44f2-a7bc-f12c1c1bfe8d\', \'multiverseId\': 538759}, \'multiverseid\': 538759}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de los muertos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Zombie entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Campeón de los muertos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8054f736-a6e6-47ee-bf53-0d320df14ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 538819}, \'multiverseid\': 538819}, {\'name\': \'Champion des trépassés\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre zombie arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Champion des trépassés.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538879&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2c1233-c3ee-4bf7-8ec2-6efff0cb2ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 538879}, \'multiverseid\': 538879}, {\'name\': \'Campione dei Defunti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Zombie entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Campione dei Defunti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea93416-afc9-48c4-9769-efa6239a02a5\', \'multiverseId\': 538939}, \'multiverseid\': 538939}, {\'name\': \'滅びし者の勇者\', \'text\': \'これでないゾンビ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、滅びし者の勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f3cfdb-77b0-4df8-ab8f-f99a0b224eea\', \'multiverseId\': 538999}, \'multiverseid\': 538999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Verstorbenen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Zombie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion der Verstorbenen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73cf5ed6-03dd-472a-ac3b-bc4e3163f974\', \'multiverseId\': 539045}, \'multiverseid\': 539045}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de los muertos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Zombie entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Campeón de los muertos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406e8101-0b92-4536-a4af-dcc4ed61937f\', \'multiverseId\': 539046}, \'multiverseid\': 539046}, {\'name\': \'Champion des trépassés\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre zombie arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Champion des trépassés.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f981d5ef-cc3b-4b98-890e-4ddb56f14a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 539047}, \'multiverseid\': 539047}, {\'name\': \'Campione dei Defunti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Zombie entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Campione dei Defunti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb476750-2cb5-4995-96bd-23d241090109\', \'multiverseId\': 539048}, \'multiverseid\': 539048}, {\'name\': \'滅びし者の勇者\', \'text\': \'これでないゾンビ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、滅びし者の勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf62836-7b46-4882-aba5-d307b55f1b80\', \'multiverseId\': 539049}, \'multiverseid\': 539049}, {\'name\': \'망자의 투사\', \'text\': \'다른 좀비가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 망자의 투사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'297159c4-b1cd-4a88-a14d-38510652df8e\', \'multiverseId\': 539050}, \'multiverseid\': 539050}, {\'name\': \'Campeão dos Perecidos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Zumbi entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Campeão dos Perecidos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83c08a9-9abe-4dc9-bbb7-e1d6191db00d\', \'multiverseId\': 539051}, \'multiverseid\': 539051}, {\'name\': \'Заступник Павших\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой Зомби выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Заступника Павших.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cf64be-f3e9-4d87-9f7a-59ab54741b26\', \'multiverseId\': 539052}, \'multiverseid\': 539052}, {\'name\': \'墓躯斗士\', \'text\': \'每当另一个灵俑在你的操控下进战场时，在墓躯斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8439fa-38be-4f7a-b452-9b2286c42c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 539053}, \'multiverseid\': 539053}, {\'name\': \'墓軀鬥士\', \'text\': \'每當另一個殭屍在你的操控下進戰場時，在墓軀鬥士上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4aba2eb-bfe5-4521-9af8-3585049e52eb\', \'multiverseId\': 539054}, \'multiverseid\': 539054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Fleischhaken-Massaker\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Fleischhaken-Massaker ins Spiel kommt, erhält jede Kreatur -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535202&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cab2711-9cdb-47e7-8937-9087d90bb8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 535202}, \'multiverseid\': 535202}, {\'name\': \'La masacre de Ganchocarne\', \'text\': \'Cuando La masacre de Ganchocarne entre al campo de batalla, cada criatura obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1123799a-2892-4bc0-99cc-165ad7a82938\', \'multiverseId\': 535518}, \'multiverseid\': 535518}, {\'name\': \'Le massacre au croc de boucher\', \'text\': "Quand Le massacre au croc de boucher arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque créature gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626df09e-baf2-4341-903f-6cd3483ba1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 535834}, \'multiverseid\': 535834}, {\'name\': \'Il Massacro del Gancio da Carne\', \'text\': \'Quando il Massacro del Gancio da Carne entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni creatura prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8bc6c3-2023-485a-b068-11eef175cf78\', \'multiverseId\': 536150}, \'multiverseid\': 536150}, {\'name\': \'食肉鉤虐殺事件\', \'text\': \'食肉鉤虐殺事件が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ae5a55-0a63-4a32-a52a-7acdb036e65b\', \'multiverseId\': 536466}, \'multiverseid\': 536466}, {\'name\': \'고기갈고리 대학살\', \'text\': \'고기갈고리 대학살이 전장에 들어올 때, 각 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\\n상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc0c90e-8a2a-46b6-b9c1-d22c837d93e6\', \'multiverseId\': 536782}, \'multiverseid\': 536782}, {\'name\': \'O Massacre do Gancho de Carne\', \'text\': \'Quando O Massacre do Gancho de Carne entra no campo de batalha, cada criatura recebe -X/-X até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f5fccb7-77d3-42de-a70f-2f8c4188b8ac\', \'multiverseId\': 537098}, \'multiverseid\': 537098}, {\'name\': \'Резня Мясным Крюком\', \'text\': \'Когда Резня Мясным Крюком выходит на поле битвы, каждое существо получает -Х/-Х до конца хода.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под контролем оппонента умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa9cb9d-1d37-497f-b4cb-75ef5e8348c3\', \'multiverseId\': 537414}, \'multiverseid\': 537414}, {\'name\': \'肉钩大屠杀\', \'text\': \'当肉钩大屠杀进战场时，每个生物各得-X/-X直到回合结束。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba90d99-fafd-4a65-93b5-0800ea3f5eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 537730}, \'multiverseid\': 537730}, {\'name\': \'肉鉤大屠殺\', \'text\': \'當肉鉤大屠殺進戰場時，每個生物各得-X/-X直到回合結束。\\n每當一個由你操控的生物死去時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\\n每當一個由對手操控的生物死去時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebc0721-198f-41c2-b671-3f90e6ed4229\', \'multiverseId\': 538046}, \'multiverseid\': 538046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Fleischhaken-Massaker\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Fleischhaken-Massaker ins Spiel kommt, erhält jede Kreatur -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538764&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d262f8e1-cc59-44d3-9ecd-a6d5457d3ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 538764}, \'multiverseid\': 538764}, {\'name\': \'La masacre de Ganchocarne\', \'text\': \'Cuando La masacre de Ganchocarne entre al campo de batalla, cada criatura obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e709722-5a36-49fd-ae60-665a9722d9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 538824}, \'multiverseid\': 538824}, {\'name\': \'Le massacre au croc de boucher\', \'text\': "Quand Le massacre au croc de boucher arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque créature gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3978e8-00aa-4138-b72d-88441d05ae6a\', \'multiverseId\': 538884}, \'multiverseid\': 538884}, {\'name\': \'Il Massacro del Gancio da Carne\', \'text\': \'Quando il Massacro del Gancio da Carne entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni creatura prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d33ef16-3f56-4adb-9121-2d628466ed1f\', \'multiverseId\': 538944}, \'multiverseid\': 538944}, {\'name\': \'食肉鉤虐殺事件\', \'text\': \'食肉鉤虐殺事件が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a6bc6a-0d3e-45ac-9b90-49cf62fbcfa8\', \'multiverseId\': 539004}, \'multiverseid\': 539004}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Haus niederbrennen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Haus niederbrennen fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Teufel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, fügt sie einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu." Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e3b0ca-510f-4570-847c-b1053dc18de6\', \'multiverseId\': 535223}, \'multiverseid\': 535223}, {\'name\': \'Quemar la casa\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Quemar la casa hace 5 puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada planeswalker.\\n• Crea tres fichas de criatura Diablo rojas 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo". Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b948ff55-bbfa-44ed-af59-b21b3b51cd06\', \'multiverseId\': 535539}, \'multiverseid\': 535539}, {\'name\': \'Incendier la maison\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Incendier la maison inflige 5 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker.\\n• Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Diable avec « Quand cette créature meurt, elle inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. » Ils acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f5b01c-016e-4015-91bd-4987fe402231\', \'multiverseId\': 535855}, \'multiverseid\': 535855}, {\'name\': \'Incendiare la Casa\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Incendiare la Casa infligge 5 danni a ogni creatura e a ogni planeswalker.\\n• Crea tre pedine creatura Diavolo 1/1 rosse con "Quando questa creatura muore, infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio". Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'012b75da-4d4f-419a-8f78-afa42d43a2ab\', \'multiverseId\': 536171}, \'multiverseid\': 536171}, {\'name\': \'家の焼き払い\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 家の焼き払いは各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ５点のダメージを与える。\\n• 「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ赤の１/１のデビル・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6832c966-951d-4914-8304-31bfe3194b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 536487}, \'multiverseid\': 536487}, {\'name\': \'집 불태우기\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 집 불태우기는 각 생물 및 각 플레인즈워커에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\\n• "이 생물이 죽을 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다."를 가진 1/1 적색 악령 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed101c29-6150-4155-bb73-5d3c37ff5c87\', \'multiverseId\': 536803}, \'multiverseid\': 536803}, {\'name\': \'Incendiar a Casa\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Incendiar a Casa causa 5 pontos de dano a cada criatura e a cada planeswalker.\\n• Crie três fichas de criatura Diabo vermelha 1/1 com "Quando esta criatura morre, ela causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo". Eles ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7a9081-fcb4-4806-b244-fc232f661de8\', \'multiverseId\': 537119}, \'multiverseid\': 537119}, {\'name\': \'Сжечь Дом\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Сжечь Дом наносит по 5 повреждений каждому существу и каждому planeswalker\'у.\\n• Создайте три фишки существа 1/1 красный Дьявол со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, оно наносит 1 повреждение любой цели». Они получают Ускорение до конца хода.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e52ad098-44dd-48ed-93a2-76f0ca9d834d\', \'multiverseId\': 537435}, \'multiverseid\': 537435}, {\'name\': \'焚毁房屋\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•焚毁房屋对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成5点伤害。\\n•派出三个1/1红色魔鬼衍生生物，且具有「当此生物死去时，它对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。」它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9796708-d2cd-4c0b-a157-55845cdbbfbd\', \'multiverseId\': 537751}, \'multiverseid\': 537751}, {\'name\': \'焚燬房屋\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•焚燬房屋對每個生物和每個鵬洛客各造成5點傷害。\\n•派出三個1/1紅色魔鬼衍生生物，且具有「當此生物死去時，它對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。」它們獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d9ae04-79ee-4bfb-ac3c-50c15a32a13c\', \'multiverseId\': 538067}, \'multiverseid\': 538067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Haus niederbrennen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Haus niederbrennen fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Teufel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, fügt sie einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu." Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45cfe85d-30d9-4f5f-a947-8f4a53a4b446\', \'multiverseId\': 538768}, \'multiverseid\': 538768}, {\'name\': \'Quemar la casa\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Quemar la casa hace 5 puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada planeswalker.\\n• Crea tres fichas de criatura Diablo rojas 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo". Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ab494a-6bf2-4b88-af15-9579a4b29e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 538828}, \'multiverseid\': 538828}, {\'name\': \'Incendier la maison\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Incendier la maison inflige 5 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker.\\n• Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Diable avec « Quand cette créature meurt, elle inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. » Ils acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5089acb5-d44d-47e4-ab5e-9a504a2e0102\', \'multiverseId\': 538888}, \'multiverseid\': 538888}, {\'name\': \'Incendiare la Casa\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Incendiare la Casa infligge 5 danni a ogni creatura e a ogni planeswalker.\\n• Crea tre pedine creatura Diavolo 1/1 rosse con "Quando questa creatura muore, infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio". Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d8929c8-1571-4d6b-8212-dd60dff2b2ad\', \'multiverseId\': 538948}, \'multiverseid\': 538948}, {\'name\': \'家の焼き払い\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 家の焼き払いは各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ５点のダメージを与える。\\n• 「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ赤の１/１のデビル・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acff9f23-4fe3-4522-aefe-8c53ad51bdc9\', \'multiverseId\': 539008}, \'multiverseid\': 539008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Posten verlassen\', \'text\': \'Bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl können in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nRückblende {3}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Du musst nicht schneller rennen als der Werwolf; nur schneller als dein Kamerad von der Wache.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9501e234-40aa-4145-ac1a-94a4771f5f78\', \'multiverseId\': 535219}, \'multiverseid\': 535219}, {\'name\': \'Abandonar el puesto\', \'text\': \'Hasta dos criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'No hace falta que corras más rápido que el licántropo, basta con que corras más rápido que tu compañero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be2d591e-7fc5-4412-b2c6-00b6eb60d21d\', \'multiverseId\': 535535}, \'multiverseid\': 535535}, {\'name\': \'Abandon de poste\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Courir plus vite que le loup-garou n\'est pas utile ; il suffit de courir plus vite que l\'autre garde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'220c4f57-2972-4614-a603-6919851e0afb\', \'multiverseId\': 535851}, \'multiverseid\': 535851}, {\'name\': \'Abbandonare la Postazione\', \'text\': \'Fino a due creature bersaglio non possono bloccare in questo turno.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Non serve essere più veloci del mannaro, basta essere più veloci delle altre guardie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4f7db0f-235e-49d6-bea6-7ae001cf74d8\', \'multiverseId\': 536167}, \'multiverseid\': 536167}, {\'name\': \'前哨地の放棄\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。このターン、それらのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'人狼より速く走る必要はない。仲間の護衛より速ければいいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'921222b6-9ff8-422f-aa4a-9ed129a1c492\', \'multiverseId\': 536483}, \'multiverseid\': 536483}, {\'name\': \'초소 버리기\', \'text\': \'최대 두 개까지의 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\\n회상 {3}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'늑대인간보다 빠르게 도망갈 필요는 없다. 동료 경비병보다 빠르게 달리기만 하면 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a3f9d64-782f-4fe3-b6f3-3e62d5055168\', \'multiverseId\': 536799}, \'multiverseid\': 536799}, {\'name\': \'Abandonar o Posto\', \'text\': \'Até duas criaturas alvo não podem bloquear neste turno.\\nRecapitular {3}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Você não precisa correr mais que o lobisomem. Só precisa correr mais que seu colega da guarda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293cecd4-16b6-4b0f-9154-d991f6a8388b\', \'multiverseId\': 537115}, \'multiverseid\': 537115}, {\'name\': \'Покинуть Пост\', \'text\': \'До двух целевых существ не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\\nВоспоминание {3}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Тебе не нужно бежать быстрее вервольфа, нужно лишь бежать быстрее своего товарища-охранника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90eba999-b3b5-465a-b606-2ac49519edbe\', \'multiverseId\': 537431}, \'multiverseid\': 537431}, {\'name\': \'逃离哨位\', \'text\': \'至多两个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'你不用跑得比狼人快；你只要跑得比同伴快就行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86469996-7928-488a-b00a-d973ed044858\', \'multiverseId\': 537747}, \'multiverseid\': 537747}, {\'name\': \'逃離哨位\', \'text\': \'至多兩個目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'你不用跑得比狼人快；你只要跑得比同伴快就行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56eeab58-1766-4ebe-8b8b-734f85eb3c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 538063}, \'multiverseid\': 538063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Celestus\', \'text\': \'Falls es weder Tag noch Nacht ist, wird es Tag, sowie Der Celestus ins Spiel kommt.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{3}, {T}: Falls es Nacht ist, wird es Tag. Anderenfalls wird es Nacht. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nImmer wenn der Tag zur Nacht oder die Nacht zum Tag wird, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Du kannst eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a5c7bdd-6c65-4bcd-b8dd-3e0021204fad\', \'multiverseId\': 535365}, \'multiverseid\': 535365}, {\'name\': \'El Celestus\', \'text\': \'Si no es ni de día ni de noche, se hace de día en cuanto El Celestus entre al campo de batalla.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{3}, {T}: Si es de noche, se hace de día. De lo contrario, se hace de noche. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\nSiempre que se pase del día a la noche o de la noche al día, ganas 1 vida. Puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a93a55-34da-4597-ac62-e3d43e24153e\', \'multiverseId\': 535681}, \'multiverseid\': 535681}, {\'name\': \'Le Celestus\', \'text\': "Si ce n\'est ni le jour ni la nuit, on passe au jour au moment où Le Celestus arrive sur le champ de bataille.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{3}, {T} : Si c\'est la nuit, on passe au jour. Sinon, on passe à la nuit. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'on passe du jour à la nuit ou de la nuit au jour, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. Vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535997&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e93635b-0b6a-49cc-b03b-15cbc7f497d6\', \'multiverseId\': 535997}, \'multiverseid\': 535997}, {\'name\': \'Il Celestus\', \'text\': \'Se non è né giorno né notte, diventa giorno mentre Il Celestus entra nel campo di battaglia.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{3}, {T}: Se è notte, diventa giorno. Altrimenti, diventa notte. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\\nOgniqualvolta il giorno diventa notte o la notte diventa giorno, guadagni 1 punto vita. Puoi pescare una carta. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695c7aca-3f47-4f18-b1e0-c1fb04de402c\', \'multiverseId\': 536313}, \'multiverseid\': 536313}, {\'name\': \'セレスタス\', \'text\': \'セレスタスが戦場に出るに際し、昼でも夜でもないなら、昼になる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：夜であるなら、昼になる。そうでないなら、夜になる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n昼が夜になるか夜が昼になるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b195f6a-070d-475e-8edb-f69873d15170\', \'multiverseId\': 536629}, \'multiverseid\': 536629}, {\'name\': \'셀레스투스\', \'text\': \'낮도 밤도 아니라면, 셀레스투스가 전장에 들어오면서 낮이 된다.\\n{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{3}, {T}: 밤이라면, 낮이 된다. 그렇지 않다면, 밤이 된다. 집중마법 시기에만 활성화할 수 있다.\\n낮이 밤이 되거나 밤이 낮이 될 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다. 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc43ae7-8548-46c5-aff5-7aa7a58dcf14\', \'multiverseId\': 536945}, \'multiverseid\': 536945}, {\'name\': \'O Celestus\', \'text\': \'Se não for dia nem noite, torna-se dia conforme O Celestus entra no campo de batalha.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{3}, {T}: Se for noite, torna-se dia. Caso contrário, torna-se noite. Ative somente como um feitiço.\\nToda vez que o dia se torna noite ou a noite se torna dia, você ganha 1 ponto de vida. Você pode comprar um card. Se fizer isso, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f101f68-5461-4c65-a5aa-1f2cadbb7615\', \'multiverseId\': 537261}, \'multiverseid\': 537261}, {\'name\': \'Целестус\', \'text\': \'Если не стоит ни день, ни ночь, то при выходе Целестуса на поле битвы наступает день.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{3}, {T}: если стоит ночь, то наступает день. В противном случае наступает ночь. Активируйте только как волшебство.\\nКаждый раз, когда день становится ночью или ночь становится днем, вы получаете 1 жизнь. Вы можете взять карту. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd90f806-1ea6-4bc5-bee6-939f515105d9\', \'multiverseId\': 537577}, \'multiverseid\': 537577}, {\'name\': \'穹天仪\', \'text\': \'如果当前既非白昼也非黑夜，则于穹天仪进战场时成为白昼。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{3}，{T}：如果当前是黑夜，则成为白昼。若否，则成为黑夜。只能于法术时机起动。\\n每当白昼成为黑夜或黑夜成为白昼时，你获得1点生命。你可以抓一张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be408a4-d834-4a96-9f23-48cbac3165cc\', \'multiverseId\': 537893}, \'multiverseid\': 537893}, {\'name\': \'穹天儀\', \'text\': \'如果當前既非白晝也非黑夜，則於穹天儀進戰場時成為白晝。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{3}，{T}：如果當前是黑夜，則成為白晝。若否，則成為黑夜。只能於巫術時機起動。\\n每當白晝成為黑夜或黑夜成為白晝時，你獲得1點生命。你可以抽一張牌。若你如此作，則棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'498ba8fb-6dca-4511-bf74-1460d02b254a\', \'multiverseId\': 538209}, \'multiverseid\': 538209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Celestus\', \'text\': \'Falls es weder Tag noch Nacht ist, wird es Tag, sowie Der Celestus ins Spiel kommt.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{3}, {T}: Falls es Nacht ist, wird es Tag. Anderenfalls wird es Nacht. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nImmer wenn der Tag zur Nacht oder die Nacht zum Tag wird, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Du kannst eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2314566a-a746-41ba-bbdc-d373d6c97bd6\', \'multiverseId\': 538794}, \'multiverseid\': 538794}, {\'name\': \'El Celestus\', \'text\': \'Si no es ni de día ni de noche, se hace de día en cuanto El Celestus entre al campo de batalla.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{3}, {T}: Si es de noche, se hace de día. De lo contrario, se hace de noche. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\nSiempre que se pase del día a la noche o de la noche al día, ganas 1 vida. Puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc50e66-dec5-4ea3-aad3-67339d46a34c\', \'multiverseId\': 538854}, \'multiverseid\': 538854}, {\'name\': \'Le Celestus\', \'text\': "Si ce n\'est ni le jour ni la nuit, on passe au jour au moment où Le Celestus arrive sur le champ de bataille.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{3}, {T} : Si c\'est la nuit, on passe au jour. Sinon, on passe à la nuit. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'on passe du jour à la nuit ou de la nuit au jour, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. Vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'602b266f-d7da-4b2a-be9d-bed38eebb75b\', \'multiverseId\': 538914}, \'multiverseid\': 538914}, {\'name\': \'Il Celestus\', \'text\': \'Se non è né giorno né notte, diventa giorno mentre Il Celestus entra nel campo di battaglia.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{3}, {T}: Se è notte, diventa giorno. Altrimenti, diventa notte. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\\nOgniqualvolta il giorno diventa notte o la notte diventa giorno, guadagni 1 punto vita. Puoi pescare una carta. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd42de6-2677-4c4c-a0c7-cf97aaeac2df\', \'multiverseId\': 538974}, \'multiverseid\': 538974}, {\'name\': \'セレスタス\', \'text\': \'セレスタスが戦場に出るに際し、昼でも夜でもないなら、昼になる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：夜であるなら、昼になる。そうでないなら、夜になる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n昼が夜になるか夜が昼になるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2498f3b-5fb4-4fd8-9ae9-25ffb363769d\', \'multiverseId\': 539034}, \'multiverseid\': 539034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dickichtrüstung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Dickichtrüstung ins Spiel kommt, lege sie an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+1.\\nAusrüsten {4} ({4}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13dcc6ae-7414-4d4d-bc5b-d2cb1d551764\', \'multiverseId\': 535272}, \'multiverseid\': 535272}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de zarzas\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Armadura de zarzas entre al campo de batalla, anéxala a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+1.\\nEquipar {4}. ({4}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc392f22-d426-4004-89ff-4f004e6bbefb\', \'multiverseId\': 535588}, \'multiverseid\': 535588}, {\'name\': \'Armure de ronces\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Armure de ronces arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-la à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+1.\\nÉquipement {4} ({4} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a275a05d-621f-4d32-91b8-01f82f3b559f\', \'multiverseId\': 535904}, \'multiverseid\': 535904}, {\'name\': \'Corazza di Rovi\', \'text\': \'Quando la Corazza di Rovi entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnala a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+1.\\nEquipaggiare {4} ({4}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c83f7f-4ec7-497c-808c-571394d8a8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 536220}, \'multiverseid\': 536220}, {\'name\': \'棘茨の鎧\', \'text\': \'棘茨の鎧が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{4}（{4}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949cfca5-eef6-464e-87ff-918608192540\', \'multiverseId\': 536536}, \'multiverseid\': 536536}, {\'name\': \'덤불 갑옷\', \'text\': \'덤불 갑옷이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 덤불 갑옷을 그 생물에 부착한다.\\n장착된 생물은 +2/+1을 받는다.\\n장착 {4} ({4}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1d24df-d699-4a1c-9385-c62f5c5ade54\', \'multiverseId\': 536852}, \'multiverseid\': 536852}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Espinheiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Armadura de Espinheiro entrar no campo de batalha, anexe-a à criatura alvo que você controla.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +2/+1.\\nEquipar {4} ({4}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'183794b5-4e45-4ecd-90c8-4ecf36869323\', \'multiverseId\': 537168}, \'multiverseid\': 537168}, {\'name\': \'Терновый Доспех\', \'text\': \'Когда Терновый Доспех выходит на поле битвы, прикрепите его к целевому существу под вашим контролем.\\nСнаряженное существо получает +2/+1.\\nСнарядить {4} ({4}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa548d9-4738-4cb9-8a59-9c24d8ed0b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 537484}, \'multiverseid\': 537484}, {\'name\': \'刺藤甲\', \'text\': \'当刺藤甲进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n佩带{4}（{4}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f50d21-f091-4730-a262-dd7e14373a83\', \'multiverseId\': 537800}, \'multiverseid\': 537800}, {\'name\': \'刺藤甲\', \'text\': \'當刺藤甲進戰場時，將它貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。\\n佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n佩帶{4}（{4}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1066522-50a4-4c13-a28a-231f235ae152\', \'multiverseId\': 538116}, \'multiverseid\': 538116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn die Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen farblosen Hinweis-Artefaktspielstein mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nSolange du einen Spielstein kontrollierst, erhält die Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2888c8b-5177-432a-9e26-73e4754d148f\', \'multiverseId\': 535273}, \'multiverseid\': 535273}, {\'name\': \'Rastreadora de Puentespino\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando la Rastreadora de Puentespino entre al campo de batalla, investiga. (Crea una ficha de artefacto Pista incolora con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\\nMientras controles una ficha, la Rastreadora de Puentespino obtiene +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df6552f-0b11-4b99-afda-6b15d9e86e83\', \'multiverseId\': 535589}, \'multiverseid\': 535589}, {\'name\': \'Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand la Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore Indice avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nTant que vous contrôlez un jeton, la Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère gagne +2/+0.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691722cb-fe60-426d-bae5-cc6971511fef\', \'multiverseId\': 535905}, \'multiverseid\': 535905}, {\'name\': \'Battipista di Ponterovo\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando la Battipista di Ponterovo entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga. (Crea una pedina artefatto Indizio incolore con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nFintanto che controlli una pedina, la Battipista di Ponterovo prende +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea6ac500-28a8-415c-aaf0-b7ae6aef708b\', \'multiverseId\': 536221}, \'multiverseid\': 536221}, {\'name\': \'茨橋の追跡者\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n茨橋の追跡者が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。（「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つ無色の手掛かり・アーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。）\\nあなたがトークンをコントロールしているかぎり、茨橋の追跡者は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'335ddcb7-1dc7-4e23-ae3b-b23d4865217f\', \'multiverseId\': 536537}, \'multiverseid\': 536537}, {\'name\': \'들장미 교각 추적자\', \'text\': \'경계\\n들장미 교각 추적자가 전장에 들어올 때, 조사한다. ("{2}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 가진 무색 단서 마법물체 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\\n당신이 토큰을 조종하는 한, 들장미 교각 추적자는 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abcd9744-805c-4ce1-9131-8628ec4f35ea\', \'multiverseId\': 536853}, \'multiverseid\': 536853}, {\'name\': \'Rastreadora de Pontespinho\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nQuando Rastreadora de Pontespinho entrar no campo de batalha, investigue. (Crie uma ficha de artefato Pista incolor com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card".)\\nEnquanto você controla uma ficha, Rastreadora de Pontespinho recebe +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52239861-ea53-4408-93e5-15ae07278547\', \'multiverseId\': 537169}, \'multiverseid\': 537169}, {\'name\': \'Следопытка Тернового Пути\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКогда Следопытка Тернового Пути выходит на поле битвы, используйте Дознание. (Создайте одну фишку бесцветного артефакта Улика со способностью «{2}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: возьмите карту».)\\nПока под вашим контролем есть фишка, Следопытка Тернового Пути получает +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c79ee372-ce2c-487b-aacd-eb376ebcb3a9\', \'multiverseId\': 537485}, \'multiverseid\': 537485}, {\'name\': \'荆桥追迹人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当荆桥追迹人进战场时，探查。（派出一个无色线索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌。」）\\n只要你操控衍生物，荆桥追迹人便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f823ef-2970-419d-a022-221e78ed18a2\', \'multiverseId\': 537801}, \'multiverseid\': 537801}, {\'name\': \'荊橋追跡人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n當荊橋追跡人進戰場時，探查。（派出一個無色線索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，犧牲此神器：抽一張牌。」）\\n只要你操控衍生物，荊橋追跡人便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f28bd3-a699-4fec-ac49-37aae3c03767\', \'multiverseId\': 538117}, \'multiverseid\': 538117}]', "[{'name': 'Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn die Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nSolange du einen Spielstein kontrollierst, erhält die Dornstrauchweg-Sucherin +2/+0.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538778&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb738199-0034-48a6-9439-807a63c97543', 'multiverseId': 538778}, 'multiverseid': 538778}, {'name': 'Rastreadora de Puentespino', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\nCuando la Rastreadora de Puentespino entre al campo de batalla, investiga.\\nMientras controles una ficha, la Rastreadora de Puentespino obtiene +2/+0.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538838&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f47d3667-c5d6-4f47-b751-4107b36940f2', 'multiverseId': 538838}, 'multiverseid': 538838}, {'name': 'Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère', 'text': 'Vigilance\\nQuand la Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez.\\nTant que vous contrôlez un jeton, la Traqueuse du Pont de bruyère gagne +2/+0.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538898&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fde2216-8857-41fe-91b8-7fc619d6448d', 'multiverseId': 538898}, 'multiverseid': 538898}, {'name': 'Battipista di Ponterovo', 'text': 'Cautela\\nQuando la Battipista di Ponterovo entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga.\\nFintanto che controlli una pedina, la Battipista di Ponterovo prende +2/+0.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538958&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ceea5bb-60f3-401d-9714-47087143abe9', 'multiverseId': 538958}, 'multiverseid': 538958}, {'name': '茨橋の追跡者', 'text': '警戒\\n茨橋の追跡者が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。\\nあなたがトークンをコントロールしているかぎり、茨橋の追跡者は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539018&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57983e0e-1a66-430a-800b-e20a249ae40e', 'multiverseId': 539018}, 'multiverseid': 539018}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duell um die Vorherrschaft\', \'text\': \'Hexenzirkel — Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. Falls du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die bestimmte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Dann kämpfen die bestimmten Kreaturen gegeneinander. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dcd5736-43c1-4c91-b616-0e3533d49c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 535287}, \'multiverseid\': 535287}, {\'name\': \'Duelo por la supremacía\', \'text\': \'Aquelarre — Elige una criatura objetivo que controlas y una criatura objetivo que no controlas. Si controlas tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura elegida que controlas. Luego, las criaturas elegidas luchan entre sí. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5606ac5-56f8-46aa-9348-3a909028cfda\', \'multiverseId\': 535603}, \'multiverseid\': 535603}, {\'name\': \'Duel de domination\', \'text\': "Congrégation — Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez et une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Si vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature choisie que vous contrôlez. Puis les créatures choisies se battent l\'une contre l\'autre. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261fffc3-131b-45d7-bbc8-c90eadeb1989\', \'multiverseId\': 535919}, \'multiverseid\': 535919}, {\'name\': \'Duello per il Comando\', \'text\': "Congrega — Scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli e una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Se controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla creatura scelta che controlli. Poi le creature scelte lottano l\'una con l\'altra. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f8c48d-4c4d-4486-b910-5ad4267b4400\', \'multiverseId\': 536235}, \'multiverseid\': 536235}, {\'name\': \'支配を懸けた決闘\', \'text\': \'集会 — あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、その前者とその後者は互いに格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d75f8781-5e50-47ce-a5dc-d1bd270ec384\', \'multiverseId\': 536551}, \'multiverseid\': 536551}, {\'name\': \'우위를 결정하는 결투\', \'text\': \'집회 — 당신이 조종하는 생물 및 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신이 서로 공격력이 다른 생물을 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신이 조종하는 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 후 목표 생물들은 서로 싸운다. (그 생물들은 서로에게 각자 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead98ff1-07ce-44f4-936d-1e786b72a1f7\', \'multiverseId\': 536867}, \'multiverseid\': 536867}, {\'name\': \'Duelo pelo Domínio\', \'text\': \'Conventículo — Escolha uma criatura alvo que você controla e uma criatura alvo que você não controla. Se você controlar três ou mais criaturas com poderes diferentes, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura escolhida que você controla. Depois, as criaturas escolhidas lutam uma com a outra. (Cada uma causa à outra uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ebed1a-cc49-4684-83ee-da7d0a7f4f70\', \'multiverseId\': 537183}, \'multiverseid\': 537183}, {\'name\': \'Дуэль за Превосходство\', \'text\': \'Шабаш — Выберите целевое существо под вашим контролем и целевое существо не под вашим контролем. Если вы контролируете не менее трех существ с различными значениями силы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на выбранное существо под вашим контролем. Затем выбранные существа дерутся друг с другом. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6295dc6-b105-47fb-be5a-77550f446d66\', \'multiverseId\': 537499}, \'multiverseid\': 537499}, {\'name\': \'夺权决斗\', \'text\': \'鸠集～选择目标由你操控的生物和目标不由你操控的生物。如果你操控三个或更多力量各不相同的生物，则在所选之由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后所选的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f557f4c-bdb4-43fe-9eab-c3880b3ea312\', \'multiverseId\': 537815}, \'multiverseid\': 537815}, {\'name\': \'奪權決鬥\', \'text\': \'鳩集～選擇目標由你操控的生物和目標不由你操控的生物。如果你操控三個或更多力量各不相同的生物，則在所選之由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。然後所選的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b30a6394-f77a-43ed-a5bd-a3f270478a63\', \'multiverseId\': 538131}, \'multiverseid\': 538131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Duelltrainer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nHexenzirkel — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Nachsetzen ist das Entscheidende."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535087&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2153b8ae-1b03-4012-82d1-424b1ce345a8\', \'multiverseId\': 535087}, \'multiverseid\': 535087}, {\'name\': \'Entrenador de duelistas\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAquelarre — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, la criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay que marcar bien el movimiento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32dfa238-d00a-4fe9-9a76-60b3608994c9\', \'multiverseId\': 535403}, \'multiverseid\': 535403}, {\'name\': \'Instructeur de duel\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nCongrégation — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La clé, c\'est d\'accompagner le mouvement. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8408d3c7-9d2a-43b0-a878-28440fc1ab0b\', \'multiverseId\': 535719}, \'multiverseid\': 535719}, {\'name\': \'Addestratore Spadaccino\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nCongrega — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sta tutto nell\\\'accompagnare il colpo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae3dc79-691c-4858-bf71-87adb11f250b\', \'multiverseId\': 536035}, \'multiverseid\': 536035}, {\'name\': \'決闘策の教練者\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n集会 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「振り抜くことが大事なのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb76d4c-8632-4a27-a2d9-0b83150c8dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 536351}, \'multiverseid\': 536351}, {\'name\': \'결투술 교관\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n집회 — 당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 서로 공격력이 다른 생물을 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 이단공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"팔을 끝까지 쭉 밀어내는 게 핵심이지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850058ba-b01c-41bc-982e-971c77596993\', \'multiverseId\': 536667}, \'multiverseid\': 536667}, {\'name\': \'Treinador de Duelismo\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nConventículo — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controla três ou mais criaturas com poderes diferentes, a criatura alvo que você controla ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O segredo é o acompanhamento do golpe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1164138-a35d-464e-a534-970c0a14fc67\', \'multiverseId\': 536983}, \'multiverseid\': 536983}, {\'name\': \'Дуэльный Учитель\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nШабаш — В начале боя во время вашего хода, если вы контролируете не менее трех существ с различными значениями силы, целевое существо под вашим контролем получает Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Вся суть в завершении удара».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564b2a82-45bd-40d9-9cd6-36ce143688d4\', \'multiverseId\': 537299}, \'multiverseid\': 537299}, {\'name\': \'战艺训练师\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n鸠集～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控三个或更多力量各不相同的生物，则目标由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「顺势那一下才是重点。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54794388-7e53-4939-97a1-001ed627c8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 537615}, \'multiverseid\': 537615}, {\'name\': \'戰藝訓練師\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n鳩集～在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若你操控三個或更多力量各不相同的生物，則目標由你操控的生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「順勢那一下才是重點。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7730c2c7-84b2-4670-b643-e42810354d62\', \'multiverseId\': 537931}, \'multiverseid\': 537931}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dürstende Blutsauger\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Dürstenden Blutsauger ins Spiel kommen und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, erzeuge {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Aus Wut darüber, dass sie die Werkstatt leer vorgefunden hatten, verfielen die hungernden Vampire in Raserei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535230&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa3ab9c6-be5a-4617-add4-cbf2c071c60c\', \'multiverseId\': 535230}, \'multiverseid\': 535230}, {\'name\': \'Buscadores hambrientos\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Buscadores hambrientos entren al campo de batalla, si un oponente perdió vidas este turno, agrega {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Los vampiros hambrientos, furiosos al ver que el taller estaba vacío, entraron en frenesí.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db41fbd-b882-4ab7-87e4-8a605770b182\', \'multiverseId\': 535546}, \'multiverseid\': 535546}, {\'name\': \'Chasseurs affamés\', \'text\': "Quand les Chasseurs affamés arrivent sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci, ajoutez {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "Furieux de trouver l\'atelier vide, les vampires affamés devinrent hystériques.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a2a3ba-910e-4a35-80c7-a6a155fa6513\', \'multiverseId\': 535862}, \'multiverseid\': 535862}, {\'name\': \'Foraggieri Affamati\', \'text\': \'Quando i Foraggieri Affamati entrano nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno, aggiungi {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Delusi per aver trovato il laboratorio vuoto, i vampiri affamati si infuriarono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02382da7-5556-405d-bc03-8ba8d217909b\', \'multiverseId\': 536178}, \'multiverseid\': 536178}, {\'name\': \'飢えた餌あさり\', \'text\': \'飢えた餌あさりが戦場に出たとき、このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていた場合、{R}{R}{R}を加える。\\n{2}{R}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'無人の作業場に憤怒し、飢えた吸血鬼は狂乱のあまりに空を飛びまわった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02113c33-04fb-4e2d-b2e9-3103c4ccc7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 536494}, \'multiverseid\': 536494}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 약탈자들\', \'text\': \'굶주린 약탈자들이 전장에 들어올 때, 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있다면, {R}{R}{R}를 추가한다.\\n{2}{R}, 카드 한 장을 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'작업장이 텅 비어 있는 것을 알고 격분한 굶주린 뱀파이어들은 광란의 도가니에 빠졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cd8e9b9-76ae-4a9a-a201-a2fc2c757f37\', \'multiverseId\': 536810}, \'multiverseid\': 536810}, {\'name\': \'Forrageadores Famintos\', \'text\': \'Quando Forrageadores Famintos entrar no campo de batalha, se um oponente tiver perdido pontos de vida neste turno, adicione {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, descarte um card: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Furiosos por encontrarem a oficina vazia, os vampiros entraram em frenesi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5146354-baa0-4140-ba6a-5878e3d1a9d2\', \'multiverseId\': 537126}, \'multiverseid\': 537126}, {\'name\': \'Изголодавшиеся Добытчики\', \'text\': \'Когда Изголодавшиеся Добытчики выходят на поле битвы, если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу, добавьте {R}{R}{R}.\\n{2}{R}, сбросьте карту: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'Увидев, что мастерская пуста, голодные вампиры от ярости впали в безумие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57fcfe13-750a-4e0b-a1dc-d5d3f00de07c\', \'multiverseId\': 537442}, \'multiverseid\': 537442}, {\'name\': \'饥馑搜血客\', \'text\': \'当饥馑搜血客进战场时，若有对手本回合中失去过生命，则加{R}{R}{R}。\\n{2}{R}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'在愤怒地发现作坊内空无一人后，饥肠辘辘的吸血鬼顿时狂躁起来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7c82b6-1bf6-4d4c-bc54-f660bda3a288\', \'multiverseId\': 537758}, \'multiverseid\': 537758}, {\'name\': \'飢饉搜血客\', \'text\': \'當飢饉搜血客進戰場時，若有對手本回合中失去過生命，則加{R}{R}{R}。\\n{2}{R}，棄一張牌：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'在憤怒地發現作坊內空無一人後，飢腸轆轆的吸血鬼頓時狂躁起來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5511914a-04e3-4ffc-b25f-83c68d8d3d24\', \'multiverseId\': 538074}, \'multiverseid\': 538074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstergrab-Horde\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Düstergrab-Horde ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Verwesung. Wenn du dies tust, schicke bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus Friedhöfen ins Exil. (Eine Kreatur mit Verwesung kann nicht blocken. Wenn sie angreift, opfere sie am Ende des Kampfes.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535182&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb15931f-4f85-4fc4-be4b-15f433777c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 535182}, \'multiverseid\': 535182}, {\'name\': \'Horda de tumbanefasta\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Horda de tumbanefasta entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición. Cuando lo hagas, exilia hasta dos cartas objetivo de los cementerios. (Una criatura con la habilidad de descomposición no puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da763f51-59fa-45c2-8958-3b6ec199c7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 535498}, \'multiverseid\': 535498}, {\'name\': \'Horde du diregraf\', \'text\': "Quand la Horde du diregraf arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition. Quand vous faites ainsi, exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées depuis des cimetières. (Une créature avec la décomposition ne peut pas bloquer. Quand elle attaque, sacrifiez-la à la fin du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'067749fa-66f4-49d8-84b9-4983c8bc7031\', \'multiverseId\': 535814}, \'multiverseid\': 535814}, {\'name\': \'Orda del Cimitero di Guerra\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Orda del Cimitero di Guerra entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere con decomposto. Quando lo fai, esilia fino a due carte bersaglio dai cimiteri. (Una creatura con decomposto non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51b6505-e0db-4c1e-8732-b971f8b2591c\', \'multiverseId\': 536130}, \'multiverseid\': 536130}, {\'name\': \'戦墓の大群\', \'text\': \'戦墓の大群が戦場に出たとき、腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。そうしたとき、墓地にあるカード最大２枚を対象とする。それらを追放する。（腐乱を持つクリーチャーではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45a1ea0-71dd-4c0e-ae75-49cf9f6c39b7\', \'multiverseId\': 536446}, \'multiverseid\': 536446}, {\'name\': \'전장묘지 군단\', \'text\': \'전장묘지 군단이 전장에 들어올 때, 부패를 가진 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다. 그렇게 할 때, 무덤들에 있는 카드를 최대 두 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 추방한다. (부패를 가진 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d8ba1b-2a2d-4df3-921a-e1db1f0dc3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 536762}, \'multiverseid\': 536762}, {\'name\': \'Horda do Cemitério do Terror\', \'text\': \'Quando Horda do Cemitério do Terror entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2 com decomposto. Quando fizer isso, exile até dois cards alvo dos cemitérios. (Uma criatura com decomposto não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4f31d0-0221-42a0-a17e-115ca6bf04b9\', \'multiverseId\': 537078}, \'multiverseid\': 537078}, {\'name\': \'Орда с Места Резни\', \'text\': \'Когда Орда с Места Резни выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки существа 2/2 черный Зомби с Трупной гнилью. Когда вы это делаете, изгоните не более двух целевых карт из кладбищ. (Существо с Трупной гнилью не может блокировать. Когда оно атакует, пожертвуйте его в конце боя.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b4bdee-eb46-4ceb-92f4-15b3d18de4fd\', \'multiverseId\': 537394}, \'multiverseid\': 537394}, {\'name\': \'战墓大群\', \'text\': \'当战墓大群进战场时，派出两个2/2黑色，具败朽异能的灵俑衍生生物。当你如此作时，将至多两张目标牌从坟墓场放逐。（具败朽异能的生物不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2f2673-c44a-4108-b7ae-9c51a8a8698e\', \'multiverseId\': 537710}, \'multiverseid\': 537710}, {\'name\': \'戰墓大群\', \'text\': \'當戰墓大群進戰場時，派出兩個2/2黑色，具敗朽異能的殭屍衍生生物。當你如此作時，將至多兩張目標牌從墳墓場放逐。（具敗朽異能的生物不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7e20e0-4591-4c7a-a3ec-3273c591b742\', \'multiverseId\': 538026}, \'multiverseid\': 538026}]', "[{'name': 'Düstergrab-Wiedergeburt', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, {1} weniger.\\nBringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende {5}{B}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535330&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66a3c535-b1bf-4ba7-b325-fd2541ef7bab', 'multiverseId': 535330}, 'multiverseid': 535330}, {'name': 'Resurgimiento de tumbanefasta', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura que murió este turno.\\nRegresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{B}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535646&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f43e3fc6-1b07-4f4e-8341-8d8375ac7ba6', 'multiverseId': 535646}, 'multiverseid': 535646}, {'name': 'Renaissance du diregraf', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature qui est morte ce tour-ci.\\nRenvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535962&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26a493b8-e5e8-4c2f-9d25-83e45aca23da', 'multiverseId': 535962}, 'multiverseid': 535962}, {'name': 'Rinascita del Cimitero di Guerra', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura morta in questo turno.\\nRimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536278&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79ebfdb4-9b0d-4645-9b87-c21f66406dd2', 'multiverseId': 536278}, 'multiverseid': 536278}, {'name': '戦墓の再誕', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンに死亡したクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{B}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地からこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536594&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ccca176-6b01-4605-9359-34120b9017c5', 'multiverseId': 536594}, 'multiverseid': 536594}, {'name': '전장묘지 재탄생', 'text': '이 주문은 이 턴에 죽은 각 생물마다 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n회상 {5}{B}{G} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536910&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e0794b9-2d86-43c9-ab8c-a5f5c1b08584', 'multiverseId': 536910}, 'multiverseid': 536910}, {'name': 'Renascimento do Cemitério do Terror', 'text': 'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura que morreu neste turno.\\nDevolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nRecapitular {5}{B}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537226&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9d0b0d0-3f3e-4b4b-9a95-09c2425ae1fa', 'multiverseId': 537226}, 'multiverseid': 537226}, {'name': 'Возрождение Места Резни', 'text': 'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше за каждое существо, умершее в этом ходу.\\nВерните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\nВоспоминание {5}{B}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537542&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '074919e6-3aef-4954-b638-b04caf7d4aee', 'multiverseId': 537542}, 'multiverseid': 537542}, {'name': '战墓再生', 'text': '本回合中每有一个生物死去，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n返照{5}{B}{G}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537858&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab1ae4f3-62c2-4f80-a6d2-756a35bd093f', 'multiverseId': 537858}, 'multiverseid': 537858}, {'name': '戰墓再生', 'text': '本回合中每有一個生物死去，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\\n將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n返照{5}{B}{G}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538174&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c532705-a6b5-4c2f-9ddc-0d69b113694d', 'multiverseId': 538174}, 'multiverseid': 538174}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538237&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '250c99f9-6a5c-40ff-a703-f5ebfb45f8c3', 'multiverseId': 538237}, 'multiverseid': 538237}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538247&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89973efc-df45-434a-8eea-86d34ff62d18', 'multiverseId': 538247}, 'multiverseid': 538247}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538257&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '362bb7ad-b842-4edd-be41-06151127789d', 'multiverseId': 538257}, 'multiverseid': 538257}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538267&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acf67671-b7b4-4589-a9d4-23d952c71fab', 'multiverseId': 538267}, 'multiverseid': 538267}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538277&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '522cb02e-7409-4440-ab88-0ade572b6388', 'multiverseId': 538277}, 'multiverseid': 538277}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538287&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e95a154-482a-43f2-a45c-e11b65751761', 'multiverseId': 538287}, 'multiverseid': 538287}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538297&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd5f875d-cc08-4d1a-ac0d-d8fe0cae8132', 'multiverseId': 538297}, 'multiverseid': 538297}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538307&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12f3cbac-1f5a-47bd-9c54-8a33db3f65e8', 'multiverseId': 538307}, 'multiverseid': 538307}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538317&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0a80b62-ca78-4e06-9334-afec9d7727df', 'multiverseId': 538317}, 'multiverseid': 538317}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538327&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e5ade6b-3057-4f14-81b1-f6a0d22c54c2', 'multiverseId': 538327}, 'multiverseid': 538327}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538238&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '994010a5-473e-474c-94b8-ada4c5c7c3ed', 'multiverseId': 538238}, 'multiverseid': 538238}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538248&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '552ecd51-aefb-48a8-987c-2e99c07d288a', 'multiverseId': 538248}, 'multiverseid': 538248}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538258&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90a1cc19-f0e0-48e7-a980-ed40195f1f05', 'multiverseId': 538258}, 'multiverseid': 538258}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538268&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4cc171d-c240-46c7-96f6-c0f1a307fe1d', 'multiverseId': 538268}, 'multiverseid': 538268}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538278&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd3e7952-c4a8-4afa-aa07-3803c71d2021', 'multiverseId': 538278}, 'multiverseid': 538278}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538288&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48cde718-4efe-4a84-a0c2-1f805596c452', 'multiverseId': 538288}, 'multiverseid': 538288}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538298&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84517257-3512-421a-b05f-066b332d306e', 'multiverseId': 538298}, 'multiverseid': 538298}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538308&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55bdaaa0-daa5-44b1-9914-956bfec17ec7', 'multiverseId': 538308}, 'multiverseid': 538308}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538318&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cc6e4c6-0380-4edf-8ed1-f2b92041fd1f', 'multiverseId': 538318}, 'multiverseid': 538318}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538328&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '200206db-d279-4643-836a-fde0c0bb2ae4', 'multiverseId': 538328}, 'multiverseid': 538328}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538342&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c733b3db-771c-4f9d-b649-e10b017928c4', 'multiverseId': 538342}, 'multiverseid': 538342}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538347&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '281a482f-779a-4057-91d5-2399d6b0eb2c', 'multiverseId': 538347}, 'multiverseid': 538347}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538352&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e146309-1afa-4f79-8608-749fa1317c86', 'multiverseId': 538352}, 'multiverseid': 538352}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538357&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e212b9e0-6c73-4e70-825f-df3c8b72f07b', 'multiverseId': 538357}, 'multiverseid': 538357}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538362&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21c01107-e127-45d0-87ce-d4691d7488ce', 'multiverseId': 538362}, 'multiverseid': 538362}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538367&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3323d600-ad24-496e-9a3d-78b91f0a266e', 'multiverseId': 538367}, 'multiverseid': 538367}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538372&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3406993-a6e1-47f6-8dd6-0546b18b3f02', 'multiverseId': 538372}, 'multiverseid': 538372}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538377&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d6a5e35-3768-4efa-a14d-0ea4dd8eb597', 'multiverseId': 538377}, 'multiverseid': 538377}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538382&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0522130-54e7-4bf6-ab01-eda56f93f27a', 'multiverseId': 538382}, 'multiverseid': 538382}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538387&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bb17cdf-feb8-4182-8633-2a668f3ee18d', 'multiverseId': 538387}, 'multiverseid': 538387}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eingesperrt im Friedhof\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn Eingesperrt im Friedhof ins Spiel kommt und falls sich fünf oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, tappe die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Hilfe! Ich bin kein Zombie! Lasst mich raus!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca7f31b-4707-4795-b429-988d96854093\', \'multiverseId\': 535138}, \'multiverseid\': 535138}, {\'name\': \'Encerrado en el cementerio\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando Encerrado en el cementerio entre al campo de batalla, si hay cinco o más cartas en tu cementerio, gira la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Socorro! ¡No soy un zombie! ¡Sácame de aquí!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb82e6ea-3360-41dc-9bc6-09bf2715f6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 535454}, \'multiverseid\': 535454}, {\'name\': \'Enfermé dans le cimetière\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand Enfermé dans le cimetière arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il y a au moins cinq cartes dans votre cimetière, engagez la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Au secours ! Je ne suis pas un zombie ! Laissez-moi sortir ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc9cee7-6630-4023-9a15-f8a6b0f06f7b\', \'multiverseId\': 535770}, \'multiverseid\': 535770}, {\'name\': \'Rinchiuso nel Cimitero\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando Rinchiuso nel Cimitero entra nel campo di battaglia, se ci sono cinque o più carte nel tuo cimitero, TAPpa la creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Aiuto! Non sono uno zombie! Fatemi uscire!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a7fd6a-11f8-4606-b527-0fcb4805b130\', \'multiverseId\': 536086}, \'multiverseid\': 536086}, {\'name\': \'墓地への幽閉\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n墓地への幽閉が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地に５枚以上のカードがある場合、エンチャントしているクリーチャーをタップする。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「助けて！僕はゾンビなんかじゃない！出してくれよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71626669-3bfc-4977-8911-4c6ce341979c\', \'multiverseId\': 536402}, \'multiverseid\': 536402}, {\'name\': \'무덤에 갇히다\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n무덤에 갇히다가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 카드가 다섯 장 이상 있다면, 부여된 생물을 탭한다.\\n부여된 생물은 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"도와줘! 난 좀비가 아니야! 내보내줘!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71615eb-2752-48f9-85c4-d729d32793cc\', \'multiverseId\': 536718}, \'multiverseid\': 536718}, {\'name\': \'Trancado no Cemitério\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Trancado no Cemitério entrar no campo de batalha, se houver cinco ou mais cards em seu cemitério, vire a criatura encantada.\\nA criatura encantada não desvira durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Socorro! Eu não sou um zumbi! Me tira daqui!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c621840-3071-4122-84b2-dd6d4ee6d79d\', \'multiverseId\': 537034}, \'multiverseid\': 537034}, {\'name\': \'Запертый на Кладбище\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Запертый на Кладбище выходит на поле битвы, если на вашем кладбище есть пять или больше карт, поверните зачарованное существо.\\nЗачарованное существо не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Помогите! Я не зомби! Выпустите меня!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8788ff71-a5da-4572-a648-cd4955595f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 537350}, \'multiverseid\': 537350}, {\'name\': \'锁入墓地\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当锁入墓地进战场时，若你坟墓场中有五张或更多牌，则横置所结附的生物。\\n所结附的生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「救命！我不是灵俑！让我出去！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730cd120-7b0a-4a24-87d7-31237ac148d6\', \'multiverseId\': 537666}, \'multiverseid\': 537666}, {\'name\': \'鎖入墓地\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當鎖入墓地進戰場時，若你墳墓場中有五張或更多牌，則橫置所結附的生物。\\n所結附的生物於其操控者的重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「救命！我不是殭屍！讓我出去！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6969352-ce61-40f0-8693-ff88cfe20c86\', \'multiverseId\': 537982}, \'multiverseid\': 537982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrische Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\\nRückblende {3}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten und zusätzliche Kosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535227&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24119c22-2318-422e-a3c9-3153910638c4\', \'multiverseId\': 535227}, \'multiverseid\': 535227}, {\'name\': \'Revelación eléctrica\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva y cualquier coste adicional. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7388f46c-d191-4ded-89c2-2be62ca3cb88\', \'multiverseId\': 535543}, \'multiverseid\': 535543}, {\'name\': \'Révélation électrique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback et ses coûts supplémentaires. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c58f7e-14b0-4282-ba53-53b524992b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 535859}, \'multiverseid\': 535859}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Elettrica\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback e qualsiasi costo addizionale. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90102b67-3262-49a6-977a-af4aa578a88e\', \'multiverseId\': 536175}, \'multiverseid\': 536175}, {\'name\': \'電撃の啓示\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、フラッシュバック・コストと追加コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83068a85-f96f-41c4-93fe-283406df62d8\', \'multiverseId\': 536491}, \'multiverseid\': 536491}, {\'name\': \'전기적 계시\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\n회상 {3}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용과 추가비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e835504f-e52a-432b-9efe-9048ca146b63\', \'multiverseId\': 536807}, \'multiverseid\': 536807}, {\'name\': \'Revelação Elétrica\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, descarte um card.\\nCompre dois cards.\\nRecapitular {3}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular e quaisquer custos adicionais. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb597cce-ce73-45ce-ab1c-d7f7141efd0a\', \'multiverseId\': 537123}, \'multiverseid\': 537123}, {\'name\': \'Электрическое Откровение\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания сбросьте карту.\\nВозьмите две карты.\\nВоспоминание {3}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания и все дополнительные стоимости. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21af410-4268-4366-afee-0bf3ec438b86\', \'multiverseId\': 537439}, \'multiverseid\': 537439}, {\'name\': \'电激启示\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用及额外费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c1484f7-0e49-49e3-9348-54e5583ffed1\', \'multiverseId\': 537755}, \'multiverseid\': 537755}, {\'name\': \'電激啟示\', \'text\': \'棄一張牌，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n抽兩張牌。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用及額外費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708e98ea-c3a5-4846-b387-91f30960c58d\', \'multiverseId\': 538071}, \'multiverseid\': 538071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entflammendes Engelsfeuer\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht sie Trampelschaden und erhält Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung, Unzerstörbarkeit und Eile.\\nRückblende {2}{R}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Engel ist der Feuerstein und ich bin ihr Stahl."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535316&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31f466c9-8d1f-4b43-97e3-9fd12f1fcafd\', \'multiverseId\': 535316}, \'multiverseid\': 535316}, {\'name\': \'Ignición de fuego angelical\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana las habilidades de vigilancia, arrollar, vínculo vital, indestructible y prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi ángel es el pedernal y yo soy su acero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9030a1ca-a4bb-4557-8c55-22fc1efb1882\', \'multiverseId\': 535632}, \'multiverseid\': 535632}, {\'name\': \'Embrasement de feu angélique\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle acquiert la vigilance, le piétinement, le lien de vie, l\'indestructible et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nFlashback {2}{R}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon ange est le silex, et je suis son acier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063ddd64-968f-4a02-a54c-9c762b5f4e29\', \'multiverseId\': 535948}, \'multiverseid\': 535948}, {\'name\': \'Combustione di Fuoco Angelico\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Ha cautela, travolgere, legame vitale, indistruttibile e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nFlashback {2}{R}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio angelo è la scintilla e io la sua fiamma."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc004bb-bd0a-4558-a9c5-b535fa75be8a\', \'multiverseId\': 536264}, \'multiverseid\': 536264}, {\'name\': \'天使火の覚醒\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒とトランプルと絆魂と破壊不能と速攻を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私の天使は火打ち石で、私とともに火をおこすのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b586b0a2-b6b8-41a8-8b94-c8fb2822e1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 536580}, \'multiverseid\': 536580}, {\'name\': \'천사불꽃 점화\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 경계, 돌진, 생명연결, 무적 및 신속을 얻는다.\\n회상 {2}{R}{W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내 천사는 부싯돌이고, 나는 그녀의 강철이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c5aea1-dff6-4519-8fee-67164585b12b\', \'multiverseId\': 536896}, \'multiverseid\': 536896}, {\'name\': \'Ignição do Fogo Angélico\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ela ganha vigilância, atropelar, vínculo com a vida, indestrutível e ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nRecapitular {2}{R}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu anjo é a pedra e eu sou a lâmina."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c523abca-0ec6-4ad0-833a-f1749b81593d\', \'multiverseId\': 537212}, \'multiverseid\': 537212}, {\'name\': \'Возжигание Ангельских Огней\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо. Оно получает Бдительность, Пробивной удар, Цепь жизни, Неразрушимость и Ускорение до конца хода.\\nВоспоминание {2}{R}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мой ангел — кремень, а я — ее сталь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8f0980-c2da-4e0c-8ce4-cc77e01e0a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 537528}, \'multiverseid\': 537528}, {\'name\': \'燃亮天使焰\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。直到回合结束，它获得警戒、践踏、系命、不灭与敏捷异能。\\n返照{2}{R}{W}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「天使燃我战意，我愿当其尖刀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f015b6aa-1d1b-4070-badd-a6bb32eb3ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 537844}, \'multiverseid\': 537844}, {\'name\': \'燃亮天使焰\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。直到回合結束，它獲得警戒、踐踏、繫命、不滅與敏捷異能。\\n返照{2}{R}{W}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「天使燃我戰意，我願當其尖刀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb8ca40-b026-44e5-b24f-5df4367c6794\', \'multiverseId\': 538160}, \'multiverseid\': 538160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entflammendes Engelsfeuer\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht sie Trampelschaden und erhält Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung, Unzerstörbarkeit und Eile.\\nRückblende {2}{R}{W}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538784&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e950fd5-1d6e-4251-9ebd-6e57f44f1e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 538784}, \'multiverseid\': 538784}, {\'name\': \'Ignición de fuego angelical\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana las habilidades de vigilancia, arrollar, vínculo vital, indestructible y prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2323517c-9552-4b6b-b1af-171b23147058\', \'multiverseId\': 538844}, \'multiverseid\': 538844}, {\'name\': \'Embrasement de feu angélique\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle acquiert la vigilance, le piétinement, le lien de vie, l\'indestructible et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nFlashback {2}{R}{W}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc3e962-3a11-4bbd-b53b-c21be197682d\', \'multiverseId\': 538904}, \'multiverseid\': 538904}, {\'name\': \'Combustione di Fuoco Angelico\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Ha cautela, travolgere, legame vitale, indistruttibile e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nFlashback {2}{R}{W}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b5f05d-0327-4279-b002-6e884a344c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 538964}, \'multiverseid\': 538964}, {\'name\': \'天使火の覚醒\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒とトランプルと絆魂と破壊不能と速攻を得る。\\nフラッシュバック {2}{R}{W}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f34882dc-f846-4f0e-8b66-fff783d0f497\', \'multiverseId\': 539024}, \'multiverseid\': 539024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ernte der Ghulruferin\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Verwesung, wobei X gleich der Hälfte der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist, aufgerundet. (Eine Kreatur mit Verwesung kann nicht blocken. Wenn sie angreift, opfere sie am Ende des Kampfes.)\\nRückblende {3}{B}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535335&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd12d97-23c2-43a9-a643-f97d62bd6281\', \'multiverseId\': 535335}, \'multiverseid\': 535335}, {\'name\': \'Cosecha de la llamamuertos\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición, donde X es la mitad de la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, redondeando hacia arriba. (Una criatura con la habilidad de descomposición no puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\\nRetrospectiva {3}{B}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b058f6cc-ed37-4064-a3d0-c38d41606ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 535651}, \'multiverseid\': 535651}, {\'name\': \'Récolte de la meneuse de goule\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition, X étant la moitié du nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure. (Une créature avec la décomposition ne peut pas bloquer. Quand elle attaque, sacrifiez-la à la fin du combat.)\\nFlashback {3}{B}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67e5ac0-de6d-42a3-a78d-5cd1ee96989f\', \'multiverseId\': 535967}, \'multiverseid\': 535967}, {\'name\': "Raccolto dell\'Evocaghoul", \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere con decomposto, dove X è la metà del numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, arrotondata per eccesso. (Una creatura con decomposto non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)\\nFlashback {3}{B}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9f017a-b6ac-4931-be2b-180773d1db14\', \'multiverseId\': 536283}, \'multiverseid\': 536283}, {\'name\': \'グール呼びの収穫\', \'text\': \'腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数の端数を切り上げた半分に等しい。（腐乱を持つクリーチャーではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\\nフラッシュバック{3}{B}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f230415-12b6-4c25-8731-73e37cfdea79\', \'multiverseId\': 536599}, \'multiverseid\': 536599}, {\'name\': \'악귀소환술사의 수확\', \'text\': \'부패를 가진 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 X개를 만든다. X는 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 수의 절반을 올림한 수이다. (부패를 가진 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\\n회상 {3}{B}{G} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535e9a50-3d9c-4753-bb72-f86b6a6f096b\', \'multiverseId\': 536915}, \'multiverseid\': 536915}, {\'name\': \'Colheita da Invocadora de Carniçais\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2 com decomposto, sendo X metade do número de cards de criatura em seu cemitério arredondada para cima. (Uma criatura com decomposto não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\\nRecapitular {3}{B}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25b4949b-3b80-4765-ab91-ae4e4541cedb\', \'multiverseId\': 537231}, \'multiverseid\': 537231}, {\'name\': \'Урожай Призывательницы Упырей\', \'text\': \'Создайте X фишек существа 2/2 черный Зомби с Трупной гнилью, где Х — половина от количества карт существ на вашем кладбище, с округлением в большую сторону. (Существо с Трупной гнилью не может блокировать. Когда оно атакует, пожертвуйте его в конце боя.)\\nВоспоминание {3}{B}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0254c882-096f-472f-b33b-0ca63c4f27ae\', \'multiverseId\': 537547}, \'multiverseid\': 537547}, {\'name\': \'尸鬼牧者收成\', \'text\': \'派出X个2/2黑色，具败朽异能的灵俑衍生生物，X为你坟墓场中生物牌数量的一半，小数点后进位。（具败朽异能的生物不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\\n返照{3}{B}{G}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac977a45-6590-4465-acac-8a889ecfbe82\', \'multiverseId\': 537863}, \'multiverseid\': 537863}, {\'name\': \'屍鬼牧者收成\', \'text\': \'派出X個2/2黑色，具敗朽異能的殭屍衍生生物，X為你墳墓場中生物牌數量的一半，小數點後進位。（具敗朽異能的生物不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\\n返照{3}{B}{G}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10cbc9d-ecc5-4bd8-bb5c-28f859e26615\', \'multiverseId\': 538179}, \'multiverseid\': 538179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ernte der Ghulruferin\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Verwesung, wobei X gleich der Hälfte der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist, aufgerundet.\\nRückblende {3}{B}{G}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887b3b71-043e-4b6e-ab55-a96aaec84dad\', \'multiverseId\': 538789}, \'multiverseid\': 538789}, {\'name\': \'Cosecha de la llamamuertos\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición, donde X es la mitad de la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, redondeando hacia arriba.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{B}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d742615-88b6-4e69-8cd0-d2b9f5cbef33\', \'multiverseId\': 538849}, \'multiverseid\': 538849}, {\'name\': \'Récolte de la meneuse de goule\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition, X étant la moitié du nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure.\\nFlashback {3}{B}{G}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57b8596-1205-4479-a3d2-aa65bd369532\', \'multiverseId\': 538909}, \'multiverseid\': 538909}, {\'name\': "Raccolto dell\'Evocaghoul", \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere con decomposto, dove X è la metà del numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, arrotondata per eccesso.\\nFlashback {3}{B}{G}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45fa2cb6-1c86-4df0-9c6a-40f0d87354ae\', \'multiverseId\': 538969}, \'multiverseid\': 538969}, {\'name\': \'グール呼びの収穫\', \'text\': \'腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数の端数を切り上げた半分に等しい。\\nフラッシュバック {3}{B}{G}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13df558-91fb-4d2d-9128-04a060a34789\', \'multiverseId\': 539029}, \'multiverseid\': 539029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erntefest-Wächterin\', \'text\': \'Hexenzirkel — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du drei oder mehr Kreaturen mit unterschiedlicher Stärke kontrollierst, kann die Erntefest-Wächterin in diesem Zug von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie patrouilliert in der Dunkelheit, damit die anderen ihre Sorgen einen hellen Abend lang vergessen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb965f6-e150-4297-bd27-0b38e4f90958\', \'multiverseId\': 535289}, \'multiverseid\': 535289}, {\'name\': \'Centinela de la Cosechalia\', \'text\': \'Aquelarre — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas tres o más criaturas con fuerzas distintas, la Centinela de la Cosechalia no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Patrulla la noche para que los demás puedan olvidarse de sus preocupaciones durante una velada radiante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24bda3d-87c3-4146-aee8-ae4236ebf37d\', \'multiverseId\': 535605}, \'multiverseid\': 535605}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle de la Fête des moissons\', \'text\': \'Congrégation — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures avec des forces différentes, la Sentinelle de la Fête des moissons ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2 ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Elle patrouille dans les ténèbres pour que les autres oublient leurs soucis le temps d\'une joyeuse soirée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535921&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42d1bb2-cf02-4755-bfcd-bdbc03f1ddf7\', \'multiverseId\': 535921}, \'multiverseid\': 535921}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella del Festival del Raccolto\', \'text\': "Congrega — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli tre o più creature con forza diversa, la Sentinella del Festival del Raccolto non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2 in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': "Pattuglia l\'oscurità affinché gli altri possano dimenticare ogni preoccupazione per una sola, luminosa serata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c66b1a3-3599-42a7-b120-e0ed7f30f36c\', \'multiverseId\': 536237}, \'multiverseid\': 536237}, {\'name\': \'収穫祭の歩哨\', \'text\': \'集会 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがパワーが異なる３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、このターン、収穫祭の歩哨はパワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'煌々と照らされた一夜の間皆が心配事を忘れられるように、彼女は闇を巡回する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612e70e1-7b95-4fb7-aebb-642d652c049b\', \'multiverseId\': 536553}, \'multiverseid\': 536553}, {\'name\': \'수확철 보초병\', \'text\': \'집회 — 당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 서로 공격력이 다른 생물을 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 수확철 보초병은 이 턴에 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 다른 사람들이 하루라도 밝은 저녁을 보내며 그들의 걱정을 잊을 수 있도록 어둠 속을 순찰한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02dd9576-9327-4440-b8f2-db6c565e440d\', \'multiverseId\': 536869}, \'multiverseid\': 536869}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela do Festival da Colheita\', \'text\': \'Conventículo — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controla três ou mais criaturas com poderes diferentes, Sentinela do Festival da Colheita não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2 neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Ela patrulha a escuridão para que os outros possam se divertir despreocupados por uma noite de festa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e422466-f203-4e01-98f8-974c3c474587\', \'multiverseId\': 537185}, \'multiverseid\': 537185}, {\'name\': \'Стражница Седмицы Жатвы\', \'text\': \'Шабаш — В начале боя во время вашего хода, если вы контролируете не менее трех существ с различными значениями силы, Стражница Седмицы Жатвы не может быть заблокирована существами с силой 2 или меньше в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Она выходит в темноту, чтобы другие могли забыть о своих заботах на один светлый вечер.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca40b0e2-9539-4c90-a4cf-94dd0aa77d00\', \'multiverseId\': 537501}, \'multiverseid\': 537501}, {\'name\': \'收成节哨卫\', \'text\': \'鸠集～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控三个或更多力量各不相同的生物，则收成节哨卫本回合不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'她在黑暗中巡逻，好让他人能够忘却烦恼，尽情享受光明傍晚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'affdd221-7d27-4214-9206-e9c231260d51\', \'multiverseId\': 537817}, \'multiverseid\': 537817}, {\'name\': \'收成節哨衛\', \'text\': \'鳩集～在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若你操控三個或更多力量各不相同的生物，則收成節哨衛本回合不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'她在黑暗中巡邏，好讓他人能夠忘卻煩惱，盡情享受光明傍晚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b872e7cf-c351-46c0-8b18-38897d66c348\', \'multiverseId\': 538133}, \'multiverseid\': 538133}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwachen zum Gemetzel\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Ein Gegner bestimmt eine davon. Bringe die Karte auf deine Hand zurück. Bringe die andere unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\\nRückblende {4}{B}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec181a07-add4-4f7f-96cc-7f7d7a0af795\', \'multiverseId\': 535363}, \'multiverseid\': 535363}, {\'name\': \'Despertar para matar\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Un oponente elige una de ellas. Regresa esa carta a tu mano. Regresa la otra al campo de batalla bajo tu control. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{B}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63db7d6f-ee0f-441e-b169-dc757e6fba55\', \'multiverseId\': 535679}, \'multiverseid\': 535679}, {\'name\': \'Éveil pour le massacre\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées dans votre cimetière. Un adversaire choisit l\'une d\'elles. Renvoyez cette carte dans votre main. Renvoyez l\'autre sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nFlashback {4}{B}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535995&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19b0f3d-e015-4543-aed9-c935fd495ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 535995}, \'multiverseid\': 535995}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio del Massacro\', \'text\': "Scegli fino a due carte creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Un avversario ne sceglie una. Riprendi in mano quella carta. Rimetti l\'altra sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nFlashback {4}{B}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'370b0c53-6e68-477b-afd9-bd15555dcecb\', \'multiverseId\': 536311}, \'multiverseid\': 536311}, {\'name\': \'殺戮者の目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とする。対戦相手１人は、そのうち１枚を選ぶ。そのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。残りのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{B}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c4b61d-80a2-4593-b955-b31de91cda19\', \'multiverseId\': 536627}, \'multiverseid\': 536627}, {\'name\': \'학살을 위한 깨어남\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 최대 두 장까지 목표로 정한다. 상대가 그중 한 장을 선택한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 다른 카드는 당신의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다. 그 카드는 신속을 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n회상 {4}{B}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470717f2-d810-4123-89c9-bbfc668108ca\', \'multiverseId\': 536943}, \'multiverseid\': 536943}, {\'name\': \'Despertar para a Matança\', \'text\': \'Escolha até dois cards de criatura alvo em seu cemitério. Um oponente escolhe um deles. Devolva aquele card para sua mão. Devolva o outro ao campo de batalha sob seu controle. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final.\\nRecapitular {4}{B}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30259c7-9879-403b-b8d6-8b3171bd06f0\', \'multiverseId\': 537259}, \'multiverseid\': 537259}, {\'name\': \'Проснись и Режь\', \'text\': \'Выберите не более двух целевых карт существ на вашем кладбище. Оппонент выбирает одну из них. Верните ту карту в вашу руку. Верните вторую карту на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Она получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\nВоспоминание {4}{B}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1127cb76-dcf1-44a3-8953-feb483c4fac0\', \'multiverseId\': 537575}, \'multiverseid\': 537575}, {\'name\': \'醒转屠戮\', \'text\': \'选择至多两张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。任一对手从中选择一张。将该牌移回你手上。将另一张牌在你的操控下移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它放逐。\\n返照{4}{B}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a106b6-d81d-48a2-bd7f-4e28cc9d02f1\', \'multiverseId\': 537891}, \'multiverseid\': 537891}, {\'name\': \'醒轉屠戮\', \'text\': \'選擇至多兩張目標在你墳墓場中的生物牌。任一對手從中選擇一張。將該牌移回你手上。將另一張牌在你的操控下移回戰場。它獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它放逐。\\n返照{4}{B}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940df778-acb7-4e4a-bd59-e5c0b4d55d05\', \'multiverseId\': 538207}, \'multiverseid\': 538207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwachen zum Gemetzel\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Ein Gegner bestimmt eine davon. Bringe die Karte auf deine Hand zurück. Bringe die andere unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\\nRückblende {4}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'802f746f-ab2b-4631-b10a-eb47ac156458\', \'multiverseId\': 538793}, \'multiverseid\': 538793}, {\'name\': \'Despertar para matar\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Un oponente elige una de ellas. Regresa esa carta a tu mano. Regresa la otra al campo de batalla bajo tu control. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc268a17-e3c7-402e-bcbc-c655dce6f399\', \'multiverseId\': 538853}, \'multiverseid\': 538853}, {\'name\': \'Éveil pour le massacre\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées dans votre cimetière. Un adversaire choisit l\'une d\'elles. Renvoyez cette carte dans votre main. Renvoyez l\'autre sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nFlashback {4}{B}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154f4f37-acc1-4212-9f26-79324dd0f016\', \'multiverseId\': 538913}, \'multiverseid\': 538913}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio del Massacro\', \'text\': "Scegli fino a due carte creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Un avversario ne sceglie una. Riprendi in mano quella carta. Rimetti l\'altra sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nFlashback {4}{B}{R}", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd77457c-9456-4c3e-b310-b6f48aadee47\', \'multiverseId\': 538973}, \'multiverseid\': 538973}, {\'name\': \'殺戮者の目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とする。対戦相手１人は、そのうち１枚を選ぶ。そのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。残りのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\\nフラッシュバック {4}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a52f98-72c6-4987-bf86-d47c772d4a75\', \'multiverseId\': 539033}, \'multiverseid\': 539033}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exzentrische Farmerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Exzentrische Farmerin ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. Dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorsicht! Die Samen sollen doch nicht an deinen Fühlern festkleben wie letztes Mal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535288&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af1e1f4-c5a8-47c6-bac4-d9496cc42d07\', \'multiverseId\': 535288}, \'multiverseid\': 535288}, {\'name\': \'Granjera excéntrica\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Granjera excéntrica entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. Luego, puedes regresar una carta de tierra de tu cementerio a tu mano. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ten cuidado, no vaya a ser que las semillas se te peguen a las antenas como la otra vez".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbc1ead-6460-4050-94c6-2650380e97eb\', \'multiverseId\': 535604}, \'multiverseid\': 535604}, {\'name\': \'Fermière excentrique\', \'text\': \'Quand la Fermière excentrique arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': \'« Attention. Il ne faudrait pas que les graines collent à tes antennes comme la dernière fois. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc05223-8a4b-4487-a59c-845abe8cf13b\', \'multiverseId\': 535920}, \'multiverseid\': 535920}, {\'name\': \'Contadina Eccentrica\', \'text\': \'Quando la Contadina Eccentrica entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte, poi puoi riprendere in mano una carta terra dal tuo cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Fai attenzione. Non vorrai ritrovarti le antenne piene di semi come l\\\'ultima volta?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94718991-e2f3-4f24-a98c-f1024df43eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 536236}, \'multiverseid\': 536236}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな農夫\', \'text\': \'風変わりな農夫が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「気をつけて食べなよ。この前みたいに触角に種がくっついたら困るからね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f282d4-817a-4959-89ff-dd826caf130d\', \'multiverseId\': 536552}, \'multiverseid\': 536552}, {\'name\': \'기이한 농부\', \'text\': \'기이한 농부가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 세 장을 민 후, 당신은 당신의 무덤에서 대지 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다. (카드를 미는 것은, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣는 것이다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 소작농\', \'flavor\': \'"자, 조심해. 지난번처럼 씨앗이 더듬이에 끼게 하고 싶지는 않으니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfc28497-fdd1-4da6-87d0-eb0842e2d7b1\', \'multiverseId\': 536868}, \'multiverseid\': 536868}, {\'name\': \'Fazendeira Excêntrica\', \'text\': \'Quando Fazendeira Excêntrica entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards. Depois, você pode devolver um card de terreno de seu cemitério para sua mão. (Para triturar um card, coloque o card do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado agora, hein. Você não quer que as sementes grudem nas antenas que nem na última vez, não é?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d7019c2-fdc6-47d3-941e-d6f9a822f2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 537184}, \'multiverseid\': 537184}, {\'name\': \'Эксцентричная Фермерша\', \'text\': \'Когда Эксцентричная Фермерша выходит на поле битвы, скрутите три карты, затем вы можете вернуть карту земли из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. (Чтобы скрутить карту, положите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Простолюдин\', \'flavor\': \'«Осторожнее. Не хочу, чтобы семена застряли у тебя в усиках, как в прошлый раз».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c186967-299e-480d-bec9-ba1d0f9c6150\', \'multiverseId\': 537500}, \'multiverseid\': 537500}, {\'name\': \'古怪农夫\', \'text\': \'当古怪农夫进战场时，磨三张牌，然后你可以将一张地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「这次慢点吃。别像上次那样把南瓜籽沾得满触角都是。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5259086-48ef-48ef-b707-c17c5c9f118a\', \'multiverseId\': 537816}, \'multiverseid\': 537816}, {\'name\': \'古怪農夫\', \'text\': \'當古怪農夫進戰場時，磨三張牌，然後你可以將一張地牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。（磨一張牌的流程是將你牌庫頂的牌置入你的墳墓場。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「這次慢點吃。別像上次那樣把種南瓜籽沾得滿觸角都是。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431595c3-e56d-416f-8ca1-e82ecf6e214f\', \'multiverseId\': 538132}, \'multiverseid\': 538132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Falken-Scheußlichkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Falken-Scheußlichkeit ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verwesung. (Er kann nicht blocken. Wenn er angreift, opfere ihn am Ende des Kampfes.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Das übelste der Geflügel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7056719c-bf8c-41a8-ab0c-77a0aecda812\', \'multiverseId\': 535129}, \'multiverseid\': 535129}, {\'name\': \'Halcón abominable\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Halcón abominable entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición. (No puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Un ave del averno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135cd484-ab58-4b4e-a148-1dffc321fb97\', \'multiverseId\': 535445}, \'multiverseid\': 535445}, {\'name\': \'Abomination rapace\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Abomination rapace arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition. (Il ne peut pas bloquer. Quand il attaque, sacrifiez-le à la fin du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et oiseau\', \'flavor\': \'Le plus vil des volatiles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb98554-8e94-4c5c-baaf-ba467d4e0d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 535761}, \'multiverseid\': 535761}, {\'name\': \'Falcone Abominevole\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Falcone Abominevole entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera con decomposto. (Non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Il più ruspante dei volatili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a44022-e894-4306-9545-19ad5c50e60c\', \'multiverseId\': 536077}, \'multiverseid\': 536077}, {\'name\': \'異形の隼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n異形の隼が戦場に出たとき、腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。（それではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・鳥\', \'flavor\': \'この世で最も汚らわしい鳥だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70aaa5d1-ab3f-4c58-9414-0ded8b594b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 536393}, \'multiverseid\': 536393}, {\'name\': \'매형상 흉물\', \'text\': \'비행\\n매형상 흉물이 전장에 들어올 때, 부패를 가진 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (그 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 조류\', \'flavor\': \'가장 냄새나는 새다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35434d1-3d4b-431d-b44c-4e1709c85b22\', \'multiverseId\': 536709}, \'multiverseid\': 536709}, {\'name\': \'Abominação Aquilina\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Abominação Aquilina entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2 com decomposto. (Ela não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Ave\', \'flavor\': \'A mais pestilenta das aves.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a725e5aa-e734-492a-af34-6b76d058fb0f\', \'multiverseId\': 537025}, \'multiverseid\': 537025}, {\'name\': \'Соколиная Мерзость\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Соколиная Мерзость выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби с Трупной гнилью. (Она не может блокировать. Когда она атакует, пожертвуйте ее в конце боя.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Поганейшее из пернатых.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca8aa007-b0f9-406b-90ba-1fd300a1745b\', \'multiverseId\': 537341}, \'multiverseid\': 537341}, {\'name\': \'雄鹰憎恨兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当雄鹰憎恨兽进战场时，派出一个2/2黑色，具败朽异能的灵俑衍生生物。（它不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／鸟\', \'flavor\': \'禽类中的禽兽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7632e36-a48c-48b8-bd00-cacef857dfa4\', \'multiverseId\': 537657}, \'multiverseid\': 537657}, {\'name\': \'雄鷹憎恨獸\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當雄鷹憎恨獸進戰場時，派出一個2/2黑色，具敗朽異能的殭屍衍生生物。（它不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／鳥\', \'flavor\': \'禽類中的禽獸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834bbe57-aa0f-4a8d-86b3-5c70da849f44\', \'multiverseId\': 537973}, \'multiverseid\': 537973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallensteller aus Gaven\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Katharer-Elitesoldaten der Sprengelwächter trainieren alle möglichen Techniken, um die Bestien aufzuhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdad6af-28bf-4cac-b24b-d73806e04cea\', \'multiverseId\': 535094}, \'multiverseid\': 535094}, {\'name\': \'Trampero de Gavony\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los mejores cátaros de Acero de la parroquia aprenden todo tipo de técnicas para retrasar y frustrar a las bestias que cazan por los senderos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f8b954-17aa-4cec-bf91-207265b0a5f7\', \'multiverseId\': 535410}, \'multiverseid\': 535410}, {\'name\': \'Trappeur de Gavonie\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T} : Engagez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les cathares d\'élite de la Lame paroissiale s\'entraînent à toutes sortes de techniques destinées à freiner et à tenir en échec les bêtes qui chassent sur les routes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c25b20-2fe3-4010-af8d-597d7cfdbde3\', \'multiverseId\': 535726}, \'multiverseid\': 535726}, {\'name\': \'Trappolatore di Gavony\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "I catari d\'élite della Lama del Popolo si addestrano in ogni sorta di tecnica che possa rallentare e ostacolare le bestie che infestano i crocevia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7434df90-f24e-46a2-81c7-cd48feb59521\', \'multiverseId\': 536042}, \'multiverseid\': 536042}, {\'name\': \'ガヴォニーの罠師\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'教区刃の上級聖戦士は交差路で獲物を襲う獣の足をもつれさせ悩ませる様々な技を鍛えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2dea17-4f91-4495-b703-2a075f7cd7af\', \'multiverseId\': 536358}, \'multiverseid\': 536358}, {\'name\': \'가보니 덫사냥꾼\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'교구검의 정예 성전사들은 교차로를 사냥하는 짐승들을 지연시키고 좌절시키기 위해 고안된 모든 종류의 기술을 훈련한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35a8c99-ace1-4c04-b49d-a271d2ec2749\', \'multiverseId\': 536674}, \'multiverseid\': 536674}, {\'name\': \'Armadilheiro de Gavony\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os cátaros de elite das Lâminas Paroquiais conhecem todas as técnicas possíveis para retardar e dificultar o ataque das feras à espreita nas encruzilhadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229d3b11-9cec-433f-965d-7da7f2900b84\', \'multiverseId\': 536990}, \'multiverseid\': 536990}, {\'name\': \'Гевонский Капканщик\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Отборные катары из Приходских Клинков упражняются в самых разных приемах, позволяющих задержать и сбить с толку чудовищ, что охотятся на дорогах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d08fc2-f6c5-4388-b52a-8204841a9cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 537306}, \'multiverseid\': 537306}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼布陷人\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'护教军集结精锐组成教区尖刃队，学习各式能够拖延或阻挠猎道野兽的布陷技艺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30666ae-755d-4851-8aeb-a5977c56660b\', \'multiverseId\': 537622}, \'multiverseid\': 537622}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼佈陷人\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'護教軍集結精銳組成教區尖刃隊，學習各式能夠拖延或阻撓獵道野獸的佈陷技藝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'884f6606-749e-424f-892e-2d99e0bce80e\', \'multiverseId\': 537938}, \'multiverseid\': 537938}]', '[{\'name\': \'Faules Spiel\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger. Stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen farblosen Hinweis-Artefaktspielstein mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Beweise waren überwältigend. Tovolars Heulerrudel wurde mutiger, klüger und stärker.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535188&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d752596-4a53-4b2e-8ebb-2f3134e43ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 535188}, \'multiverseid\': 535188}, {\'name\': \'Juego sucio\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos. Investiga. (Crea una ficha de artefacto Pista incolora con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las pruebas eran abrumadoras: la jauría aullante de Tovolar era cada vez más audaz, inteligente y fuerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6250941d-77b0-4aa0-b240-4d84e4e9d6de\', \'multiverseId\': 535504}, \'multiverseid\': 535504}, {\'name\': \'Acte crapuleux\', \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 2. Enquêtez. (Créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore Indice avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les preuves étaient accablantes. La meute de Tovolar devenait plus audacieuse, plus rusée et plus forte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2657d34f-2832-49c1-8586-c80f0ba313c0\', \'multiverseId\': 535820}, \'multiverseid\': 535820}, {\'name\': \'Indizi di Delitto\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2. Indaga. (Crea una pedina artefatto Indizio incolore con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Le prove erano schiaccianti. L\'ulubranco di Tovolar stava diventando più sfacciato, più intelligente e più forte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2067afd-ceff-43ba-8263-117933bb60bf\', \'multiverseId\': 536136}, \'multiverseid\': 536136}, {\'name\': \'不正行為\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。調査を行う。（「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つ無色の手掛かり・アーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'圧倒的な証拠があった。トヴォラーの吠え群れはより大胆に、より賢く、より強くなっていたのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5ef342f-52d4-4be8-9174-f974c6b5d85a\', \'multiverseId\': 536452}, \'multiverseid\': 536452}, {\'name\': \'부정행위\', \'text\': \'공격력이 2 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 조사한다. ("{2}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 가진 무색 단서 마법물체 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'증거는 압도적이었다. 토볼라르의 포효떼는 더 대담해지고, 더 영리해지고, 더 강해지고 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546c626d-ba2b-4fe9-9f74-9656870320c0\', \'multiverseId\': 536768}, \'multiverseid\': 536768}, {\'name\': \'Trapaça\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 2. Investigue. (Crie uma ficha de artefato Pista incolor com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As provas eram conclusivas. A alcateia uivante de Tovolar estava ficando mais ousada, mais astuta e mais forte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68183951-e509-4883-a2c6-4baaac4a0ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 537084}, \'multiverseid\': 537084}, {\'name\': \'Грязная Игра\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с силой 2 или меньше. Используйте Дознание. (Создайте одну фишку бесцветного артефакта Улика со способностью «{2}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: возьмите карту».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Свидетельства были ошеломляющими. Стая Товолара становилась все смелее, умнее и сильнее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d835a9c5-135f-49c0-b479-3d58d80ab3af\', \'multiverseId\': 537400}, \'multiverseid\': 537400}, {\'name\': \'恶劣犯行\', \'text\': \'消灭目标力量等于或小于2的生物。探查。（派出一个无色线索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌。」）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'眼前证据已说明一切：托瓦拉嚎群越来越大胆、越来越聪明，也越来越强大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fcd256-6f48-4423-b402-07ac905dc454\', \'multiverseId\': 537716}, \'multiverseid\': 537716}, {\'name\': \'惡劣犯行\', \'text\': \'消滅目標力量等於或小於2的生物。探查。（派出一個無色線索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，犧牲此神器：抽一張牌。」）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'眼前證據已說明一切：托瓦拉嚎群越來越大膽、越來越聰明，也越來越強大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537dc4ad-bc09-452f-9c9d-3da95d8a29be\', \'multiverseId\': 538032}, \'multiverseid\': 538032}]', "[{'name': 'Felssturz-Tal', 'text': 'Das Felssturz-Tal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Panische Schreie hallen durch die engen Schluchten von Kessig, während Heulerrudel ihre Beute zusammentreiben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535381&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5152fb61-0e7a-4efd-9f14-89934e61001a', 'multiverseId': 535381}, 'multiverseid': 535381}, {'name': 'Valle de los desprendimientos', 'text': 'El Valle de los desprendimientos entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles otras dos o más tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los gritos de pánico retumban por los estrechos desfiladeros de Kessig cuando las jauría aullantes arrean a sus presas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535697&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37b0b87b-75d5-46af-8615-d4a9a82a0360', 'multiverseId': 535697}, 'multiverseid': 535697}, {'name': 'Val de Rocheruine', 'text': 'Le Val de Rocheruine arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux autres terrains.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Des cris de panique retentissaient le long des ravins étroits de Kessig tandis que les meutes rabattaient leur proie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536013&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fd5f179-b7f7-4753-a480-a60609947966', 'multiverseId': 536013}, 'multiverseid': 536013}, {'name': 'Valle delle Frane', 'text': 'La Valle delle Frane entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli altre due o più terre.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Grida di panico riecheggiano tra le strette gole del Kessig, mentre gli ulubranchi inseguono le loro prede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536329&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '084cd6b7-a248-4fa3-9235-0a33ac93d8b7', 'multiverseId': 536329}, 'multiverseid': 536329}, {'name': '落石の谷間', 'text': 'あなたがこれでない２つ以上の土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、落石の谷間はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '吠え群れが獲物を追う中、阿鼻叫喚がケッシグの狭い峡谷で鳴り響く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536645&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4994656-40f9-4f00-8189-01b8ba00f45e', 'multiverseId': 536645}, 'multiverseid': 536645}, {'name': '낙석 계곡', 'text': '낙석 계곡은 당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않는 한 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '포효떼가 멋잇감을 몰아 가면, 당황한 자들의 외침 소리가 메아리가 되어 케시그의 좁은 계곡을 따라 울려 퍼진다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536961&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47a9c7af-ead3-4218-8205-b6621c721949', 'multiverseId': 536961}, 'multiverseid': 536961}, {'name': 'Vale das Pedras Cadentes', 'text': 'Vale das Pedras Cadentes entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais outros terrenos.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Gritos de pânico ecoam pelos barrancos estreitos de Kessig quando as alcateias uivantes perseguem suas presas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537277&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcc4750b-1e3e-46b3-b02b-6987bfae65be', 'multiverseId': 537277}, 'multiverseid': 537277}, {'name': 'Долина Камнепадов', 'text': 'Долина Камнепадов выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если под вашим контролем менее двух других земель.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Панические крики эхом разносятся по узким ущельям Кессига, где воющие стаи загоняют свою добычу.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537593&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc1aa70a-2ace-4524-aec5-06e0b9cb91d5', 'multiverseId': 537593}, 'multiverseid': 537593}, {'name': '落石山谷', 'text': '除非你操控两个或更多其他地，否则落石山谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '嚎群在凯锡革狭窄山谷间追捕猎物，惊慌哀号回荡此处经久不绝。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537909&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ba665fe-1626-4c92-b2c2-95f2ceb2b6be', 'multiverseId': 537909}, 'multiverseid': 537909}, {'name': '落石山谷', 'text': '除非你操控兩個或更多其他地，否則落石山谷須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '嚎群在凱錫革狹窄山谷間追捕獵物，驚慌哀號迴盪此處經久不絕。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538225&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61608b4a-1248-4c85-835b-c1b64c83215c', 'multiverseId': 538225}, 'multiverseid': 538225}]", "[{'name': 'Felssturz-Tal', 'text': 'Das Felssturz-Tal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538444&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b04c9f28-ea1d-4f3a-8393-bc19bfe03429', 'multiverseId': 538444}, 'multiverseid': 538444}, {'name': 'Valle de los desprendimientos', 'text': 'El Valle de los desprendimientos entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles otras dos o más tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538449&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e2cab18-f8e8-4c29-b939-cbf7a85a7aeb', 'multiverseId': 538449}, 'multiverseid': 538449}, {'name': 'Val de Rocheruine', 'text': 'Le Val de Rocheruine arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux autres terrains.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538454&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26c339f4-6933-44c1-91e4-8addc32ae1b9', 'multiverseId': 538454}, 'multiverseid': 538454}, {'name': 'Valle delle Frane', 'text': 'La Valle delle Frane entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli altre due o più terre.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538459&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0665addc-2ea7-4e65-8291-9ca8356e2366', 'multiverseId': 538459}, 'multiverseid': 538459}, {'name': '落石の谷間', 'text': 'あなたがこれでない２つ以上の土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、落石の谷間はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538464&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4fcba6f-a56d-4cca-a5a7-084d560c413a', 'multiverseId': 538464}, 'multiverseid': 538464}, {'name': '낙석 계곡', 'text': '낙석 계곡은 당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않는 한 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538469&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd58d694-7e7c-40ca-880a-28f1cd556171', 'multiverseId': 538469}, 'multiverseid': 538469}, {'name': 'Vale das Pedras Cadentes', 'text': 'Vale das Pedras Cadentes entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais outros terrenos.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538474&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '896f7711-898c-4249-8b36-d4d61ff83523', 'multiverseId': 538474}, 'multiverseid': 538474}, {'name': 'Долина Камнепадов', 'text': 'Долина Камнепадов выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если под вашим контролем менее двух других земель.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538479&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'faf0bea4-dd6d-4289-acb6-225d6e53ce99', 'multiverseId': 538479}, 'multiverseid': 538479}, {'name': '落石山谷', 'text': '除非你操控两个或更多其他地，否则落石山谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538484&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c82d3185-e0b6-4a84-9a06-29c44b9caee9', 'multiverseId': 538484}, 'multiverseid': 538484}, {'name': '落石山谷', 'text': '除非你操控兩個或更多其他地，否則落石山谷須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538489&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e798470e-e5ce-48ce-b5f0-561e4f86e3f5', 'multiverseId': 538489}, 'multiverseid': 538489}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fenstersturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine nichtfliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kaplan hätte vielleicht ein wenig Trost gefunden, wenn er gewusst hätte, dass man das Ersatzfenster nach ihm benennen würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535181&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf7d3a0d-23b4-4a4b-948b-db9bf1b95248\', \'multiverseId\': 535181}, \'multiverseid\': 535181}, {\'name\': \'Defenestrar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo sin la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quizás al capellán le hubiese consolado un poco saber que se nombraría a la ventana de repuesto en su honor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a580ad03-b1ae-473c-a812-41591d57f655\', \'multiverseId\': 535497}, \'multiverseid\': 535497}, {\'name\': \'Défenestration\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature sans le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'aumônier aurait peut-être trouvé une maigre consolation en apprenant que la fenêtre de remplacement serait nommée en son honneur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b504627c-f723-41e3-8bc5-cab8cae4ea3c\', \'multiverseId\': 535813}, \'multiverseid\': 535813}, {\'name\': \'Defenestrare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio senza volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il cappellano avrebbe forse provato conforto nel sapere che la nuova finestra avrebbe portato il suo nome.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4711da55-5db6-459b-b4d4-94e9344ca697\', \'multiverseId\': 536129}, \'multiverseid\': 536129}, {\'name\': \'窓からの放り投げ\', \'text\': \'飛行を持たないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'司祭の魂を鎮めるために、取り替えられた窓にはその名誉を称えて彼の名がつけられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bebb36f-3001-47e8-b99b-296b6e5e01c8\', \'multiverseId\': 536445}, \'multiverseid\': 536445}, {\'name\': \'창밖으로 내던지기\', \'text\': \'비행이 없는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'교체된 창문에 그를 기리는 이름이 붙여졌다는 사실을 알았다면, 목사에게도 약간은 위안이 되었을 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28bff34-67b0-46e4-9d5a-6fcc935201fc\', \'multiverseId\': 536761}, \'multiverseid\': 536761}, {\'name\': \'Defenestrar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo sem voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Talvez o capelão tivesse algum consolo se soubesse que a nova janela seria batizada em sua honra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4a3634-8efd-41e9-a6c0-7778f59ce2c9\', \'multiverseId\': 537077}, \'multiverseid\': 537077}, {\'name\': \'Дефенестрация\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо без Полета.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Капеллан, возможно, нашел бы небольшое утешение в том, что окно для замены будет названо в его честь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89c47c2c-c036-46a7-81aa-43eb21293da1\', \'multiverseId\': 537393}, \'multiverseid\': 537393}, {\'name\': \'扔出窗外\', \'text\': \'消灭目标不具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'如果教士知道新换的楼窗会冠上他的名字，兴许还会好受一些。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf40d789-8f5b-41c2-8fea-26d7a5155663\', \'multiverseId\': 537709}, \'multiverseid\': 537709}, {\'name\': \'扔出窗外\', \'text\': \'消滅目標不具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'如果教士知道新換的樓窗會冠上他的名字，興許還會好受一些。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f30249-53aa-4c35-a432-8a9a6ee7d85b\', \'multiverseId\': 538025}, \'multiverseid\': 538025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fledermausflüsterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Fledermausflüsterin ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Fledermaus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine kleinen geflügelten Freunde berichten mir, welcher Stadtbewohner eine Kostprobe wert ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535170&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e493d7c-2bb3-4e45-b8fe-54eb2c7a031b\', \'multiverseId\': 535170}, \'multiverseid\': 535170}, {\'name\': \'Susurradora de murciélagos\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Susurradora de murciélagos entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente perdió vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Murciélago negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis amiguitos alados me dicen qué vecinos merecen ser uno de mis bocados".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffc6768-1cab-4065-9fde-983a29f6e03e\', \'multiverseId\': 535486}, \'multiverseid\': 535486}, {\'name\': \'Chuchoteuse de chauve-souris\', \'text\': \'Quand la Chuchoteuse de chauve-souris arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Chauve-souris avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Mes petites amies ailées m\'indiquent lesquels de ces villageois sont dignes d\'une petite dégustation. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c348c523-8122-4b68-9a9c-039a5801eb6f\', \'multiverseId\': 535802}, \'multiverseid\': 535802}, {\'name\': \'Sussurratrice dei Pipistrelli\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sussurratrice dei Pipistrelli entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Pipistrello 1/1 nera con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I miei amichetti alati mi consigliano quali tra i cittadini vale la pena di assaggiare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0261b45c-dc32-44ea-83ff-b91a39e549c7\', \'multiverseId\': 536118}, \'multiverseid\': 536118}, {\'name\': \'コウモリに囁く者\', \'text\': \'コウモリに囁く者が戦場に出たとき、このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていた場合、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のコウモリ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「私の小さな羽根つきの仲間たちがどの町民を味見すべきか教えてくれるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41aea52-55f2-45b9-96e8-0bb1cc3bceab\', \'multiverseId\': 536434}, \'multiverseid\': 536434}, {\'name\': \'박쥐에게 속삭이는 자\', \'text\': \'박쥐에게 속삭이는 자가 전장에 들어올 때, 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있다면, 비행을 가진 1/1 흑색 박쥐 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"내 날개 달린 작은 친구들이 이 마을사람들 중 어떤 녀석이 내가 맛볼 만한 가치가 있는지를 말해 주지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3ca6a5-eb42-4065-86e0-a69f829f3efa\', \'multiverseId\': 536750}, \'multiverseid\': 536750}, {\'name\': \'Encantadora de Morcegos\', \'text\': \'Quando Encantadora de Morcegos entrar no campo de batalha, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Morcego preta 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu amiguinho alado me diz quais moradores vale a pena provar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffc08217-bb9f-4405-9316-4a4cd000826f\', \'multiverseId\': 537066}, \'multiverseid\': 537066}, {\'name\': \'Заклинательница Нетопырей\', \'text\': \'Когда Заклинательница Нетопырей выходит на поле битвы, если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черная Летучая_мышь с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Мои маленькие крылатые друзья рассказывают мне, кого из горожан стоит попробовать на вкус».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6c7b0e-2948-46de-81d5-0d65b7b04d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 537382}, \'multiverseid\': 537382}, {\'name\': \'通蝠客\', \'text\': \'当通蝠客进战场时，若有对手本回合中失去过生命，则派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我的有翼伙伴会给出建议，哪些镇民值得去亲自品尝。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f97d1f-4902-419a-bb08-1e4ec9f1d9de\', \'multiverseId\': 537698}, \'multiverseid\': 537698}, {\'name\': \'通蝠客\', \'text\': \'當通蝠客進戰場時，若有對手本回合中失去過生命，則派出一個1/1黑色，具飛行異能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我的有翼伙伴會給出建議，哪些鎮民值得去親自品嚐。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba19bd7-0c68-4702-b017-0bd3c3d76b88\', \'multiverseId\': 538014}, \'multiverseid\': 538014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fleischeintreiber\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere Kreatur opferst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und wendest Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\n{1}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Der Fleischeintreiber erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'Eine seelenlose Hülle mit endlosem Hunger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535332&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407ac282-0764-4275-8e5d-90e0e1ab8764\', \'multiverseId\': 535332}, \'multiverseid\': 535332}, {\'name\': \'Despojacarnes\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques otra criatura, ganas 1 vida y adivinas 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{1}, sacrificar otra criatura: El Despojacarnes obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'Un cascarón desalmado con un apetito insaciable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98c049a2-2e8a-41e2-bc0a-ac54811323d7\', \'multiverseId\': 535648}, \'multiverseid\': 535648}, {\'name\': \'Preneur de chair\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une autre créature, vous gagnez 1 point de vie et regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{1}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Le Preneur de chair gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': "Une coquille sans âme à l\'appétit insatiable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da994b06-d0f1-4805-beed-b70901fff98b\', \'multiverseId\': 535964}, \'multiverseid\': 535964}, {\'name\': \'Ladro di Carne\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un\'altra creatura, guadagni 1 punto vita e profetizzi 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{1}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Il Ladro di Carne prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': "Un guscio senz\'anima di fame insaziabile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bd04d67-7e00-4213-90f9-ff5b17a6040b\', \'multiverseId\': 536280}, \'multiverseid\': 536280}, {\'name\': \'肉削ぎ屋\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得て占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\n{1}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、肉削ぎ屋は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'終わりなき飢餓に陥った、魂なき殻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05463ed3-d454-4389-bf77-760c30bd4b32\', \'multiverseId\': 536596}, \'multiverseid\': 536596}, {\'name\': \'살점수거꾼\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 생물을 희생할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻고 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\\n{1}, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 살점수거꾼은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 암살자\', \'flavor\': \'끝없는 굶주림을 가지고 있는 영혼 없는 껍질이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae408ca-4999-4a64-aa81-46d694991a37\', \'multiverseId\': 536912}, \'multiverseid\': 536912}, {\'name\': \'Pega-carne\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrifica outra criatura, você ganha 1 ponto de vida e usa vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{1}, sacrifique outra criatura: Pega-carne recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'Uma carcaça desalmada de fome insaciável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ff9cd8-9b2e-438c-93b6-179bef840386\', \'multiverseId\': 537228}, \'multiverseid\': 537228}, {\'name\': \'Забирающий Плоть\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете другое существо, вы получаете 1 жизнь и предсказываете 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\\n{1}, пожертвуйте другое существо: Забирающий Плоть получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Убийца\', \'flavor\': \'Бездушная оболочка бесконечного голода.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d09b43-d09d-43d6-a98e-c7709e982e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 537544}, \'multiverseid\': 537544}, {\'name\': \'采肉人\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲另一个生物时，你获得1点生命并占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n{1}，牺牲另一个生物：采肉人得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'无魂躯壳具有无尽饥渴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f32a2f5-569a-4d2f-a514-87e35ae0e7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 537860}, \'multiverseid\': 537860}, {\'name\': \'採肉人\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲另一個生物時，你獲得1點生命並占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\\n{1}，犧牲另一個生物：採肉人得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／殺手\', \'flavor\': \'無魂軀殼具有無盡飢渴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a2d7946-05fd-4301-b9cc-dae76d18b3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 538176}, \'multiverseid\': 538176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Florian, Voldaren-Nachkomme\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf schaust du dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme an Lebenspunkten ist, die deine Gegner in diesem Zug verloren haben. Schicke eine der Karten ins Exil und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eca94f2-3bac-4d18-989c-2f3aec720ddd\', \'multiverseId\': 535333}, \'multiverseid\': 535333}, {\'name\': \'Florian, vástago Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAl comienzo de tu fase principal poscombate, mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad total de vidas que perdieron tus oponentes este turno. Exilia una de esas cartas y pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f179f419-2f36-4109-b1c9-a640b16deb71\', \'multiverseId\': 535649}, \'multiverseid\': 535649}, {\'name\': \'Florian, scion Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la quantité totale de points de vie que vos adversaires ont perdus ce tour-ci. Exilez une de ces cartes et mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d91294e8-fd87-4543-a8cb-450f8d768175\', \'multiverseId\': 535965}, \'multiverseid\': 535965}, {\'name\': \'Florian, Discendente dei Voldaren\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nAll\'inizio della tua fase principale post-combattimento, guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è pari al totale dei punti vita che i tuoi avversari hanno perso in questo turno. Esilia una di quelle carte e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi giocare la carta esiliata in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a6e93a2-8dc0-4778-880f-a142eaa26bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 536281}, \'multiverseid\': 536281}, {\'name\': \'ヴォルダーレンの末裔、フロリアン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。Ｘはこのターンにすべての対戦相手が失ったライフの合計に等しい。それらのカードのうち１枚を追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。このターン、あなたはその追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff28c64-ff73-48cb-9f03-8cc054d71733\', \'multiverseId\': 536597}, \'multiverseid\': 536597}, {\'name\': \'볼다렌의 자손, 플로리안\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n당신의 전투 후 본단계 시작에, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 X장을 본다. X는 당신의 상대가 이 턴에 잃은 생명점의 총합이다. 그 카드들 중 한 장을 추방하고 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 추방된 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 귀족\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ded3207-2e2c-44a1-9dc5-d8a301461207\', \'multiverseId\': 536913}, \'multiverseid\': 536913}, {\'name\': \'Florian, Herdeiro dos Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nNo início de sua fase principal pós-combate, olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X o total de pontos de vida perdidos por seus oponentes neste turno. Exile um daqueles cards e coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. Você pode jogar o card exilado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae914ec-e25a-4947-888c-6dba350a67ba\', \'multiverseId\': 537229}, \'multiverseid\': 537229}, {\'name\': \'Флориан, Отпрыск Волдаренов\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nВ начале вашей главной фазы после боя посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где X — суммарное количество жизней, потерянных вашими оппонентами в этом ходу. Изгоните одну из тех карт и положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке. Вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Аристократ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'945da8ed-d231-4130-b0f4-20996f1435db\', \'multiverseId\': 537545}, \'multiverseid\': 537545}, {\'name\': \'沃达连后裔华伦安\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在你战斗后的行动阶段开始时，检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为本回合中对手失去的生命总数量。放逐其中一张，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0524a02e-6fa2-4227-bc02-d52542b2ad2b\', \'multiverseId\': 537861}, \'multiverseid\': 537861}, {\'name\': \'沃達連後裔華倫安\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在你戰鬥後的行動階段開始時，檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為本回合中對手失去的生命總數量。放逐其中一張，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816bfb41-5597-49ac-b4b9-8ec105286bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 538177}, \'multiverseid\': 538177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Florian, Voldaren-Nachkomme\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf schaust du dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme an Lebenspunkten ist, die deine Gegner in diesem Zug verloren haben. Schicke eine der Karten ins Exil und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d21ea53-89a8-4607-ad5c-b8482dd7055a\', \'multiverseId\': 538516}, \'multiverseid\': 538516}, {\'name\': \'Florian, vástago Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAl comienzo de tu fase principal poscombate, mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad total de vidas que perdieron tus oponentes este turno. Exilia una de esas cartas y pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c937118-a95d-4587-88d7-9f57a47dc860\', \'multiverseId\': 538533}, \'multiverseid\': 538533}, {\'name\': \'Florian, scion Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la quantité totale de points de vie que vos adversaires ont perdus ce tour-ci. Exilez une de ces cartes et mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d559aa04-772b-42f9-815b-e56d48609917\', \'multiverseId\': 538550}, \'multiverseid\': 538550}, {\'name\': \'Florian, Discendente dei Voldaren\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nAll\'inizio della tua fase principale post-combattimento, guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è pari al totale dei punti vita che i tuoi avversari hanno perso in questo turno. Esilia una di quelle carte e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi giocare la carta esiliata in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c1561d-e719-453b-a54e-3905f05e0cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 538567}, \'multiverseid\': 538567}, {\'name\': \'ヴォルダーレンの末裔、フロリアン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。Ｘはこのターンにすべての対戦相手が失ったライフの合計に等しい。それらのカードのうち１枚を追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。このターン、あなたはその追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d16cab2-c509-4931-a402-933d7b2cdf16\', \'multiverseId\': 538584}, \'multiverseid\': 538584}, {\'name\': \'볼다렌의 자손, 플로리안\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n당신의 전투 후 본단계 시작에, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 X장을 본다. X는 당신의 상대가 이 턴에 잃은 생명점의 총합이다. 그 카드들 중 한 장을 추방하고 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 추방된 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 귀족\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d25bb67-2784-447b-9f2c-b0757f99f035\', \'multiverseId\': 538601}, \'multiverseid\': 538601}, {\'name\': \'Florian, Herdeiro dos Voldaren\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nNo início de sua fase principal pós-combate, olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X o total de pontos de vida perdidos por seus oponentes neste turno. Exile um daqueles cards e coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. Você pode jogar o card exilado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855f05d2-3d06-4023-a91a-f6649f7d76f6\', \'multiverseId\': 538618}, \'multiverseid\': 538618}, {\'name\': \'Флориан, Отпрыск Волдаренов\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nВ начале вашей главной фазы после боя посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где X — суммарное количество жизней, потерянных вашими оппонентами в этом ходу. Изгоните одну из тех карт и положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке. Вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Аристократ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f569aec-bf32-4a95-8a53-6284c30c250f\', \'multiverseId\': 538635}, \'multiverseid\': 538635}, {\'name\': \'沃达连后裔华伦安\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在你战斗后的行动阶段开始时，检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为本回合中对手失去的生命总数量。放逐其中一张，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c5c42e-009b-49d0-8d1b-e2ad1887f32f\', \'multiverseId\': 538652}, \'multiverseid\': 538652}, {\'name\': \'沃達連後裔華倫安\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在你戰鬥後的行動階段開始時，檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為本回合中對手失去的生命總數量。放逐其中一張，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3becd68c-0e34-4c11-ab5a-0fadf5efb7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 538669}, \'multiverseid\': 538669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch der Überwachung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des verzauberten Spielers zieht eine beliebige Anzahl an Spielern deiner Wahl außer dem verzauberten Spieler jeweils so viele Karten, wie Flüche an den verzauberten Spieler angelegt sind.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Für jedes ausgestochene Auge öffneten sich zwei neue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd7bdb9-3c2d-473e-a2dc-a726b6f6614b\', \'multiverseId\': 535122}, \'multiverseid\': 535122}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de la vigilancia\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento del jugador encantado, cualquier cantidad de jugadores objetivo que no sean ese jugador roban cada uno una cantidad de cartas igual a la cantidad de Maldiciones anexadas a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'Por cada ojo que sacas, se abren dos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9297c8e0-3ae7-4a6a-9ace-ab02cce66c77\', \'multiverseId\': 535438}, \'multiverseid\': 535438}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de surveillance\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nAu début de l\'entretien du joueur enchanté, n\'importe quel nombre de joueurs ciblés autres que ce joueur piochent chacun un nombre de cartes égal au nombre de malédictions attachées à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': "Pour chaque œil crevé, deux s\'ouvraient.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc80da96-85a2-47c2-bcb8-a38f3753a214\', \'multiverseId\': 535754}, \'multiverseid\': 535754}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Sorveglianza\', \'text\': "Incanta giocatore\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento del giocatore incantato, un qualsiasi numero di giocatori bersaglio diversi da quel giocatore pescano carte pari al numero di Anatemi assegnati a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'Per ogni occhio cavato, due nuovi si aprono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404ed4d2-04ca-4a0a-a568-93352731a2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 536070}, \'multiverseid\': 536070}, {\'name\': \'監視の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤー以外の望む数のプレイヤーを対象とする。それらのプレイヤーはそれぞれ、この能力が誘発した時点でエンチャントしていたプレイヤーについている呪いの数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'目が一つえぐられるたび、もう二つ開いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48d9891-c3bf-472d-8e83-068071d04988\', \'multiverseId\': 536386}, \'multiverseid\': 536386}, {\'name\': \'감시의 저주\', \'text\': \'플레이어에게 부여\\n부여된 플레이어의 유지단 시작에, 그 플레이어를 제외한 다른 플레이어들을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어들은 각각 부여된 플레이어에게 부착된 저주의 수만큼 카드를 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': \'터뜨려 없앤 눈알 하나마다, 두 개가 새롭게 깜빡이며 솟아났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f616d258-5301-49d2-845f-b6e28165c532\', \'multiverseId\': 536702}, \'multiverseid\': 536702}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Vigilância\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nNo início da manutenção do jogador encantado, qualquer número de jogadores alvo que não sejam aquele jogador compra, cada um, uma quantidade de cards igual ao número de Maldições anexadas àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'Para cada olho arrancado, dois se abriam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c106c1fe-d48e-47d7-bbe1-6f35397802df\', \'multiverseId\': 537018}, \'multiverseid\': 537018}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Наблюдения\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nВ начале шага поддержки зачарованного игрока каждый из любого количества целевых игроков, отличных от того игрока, берет количество карт, равное числу Проклятий, прикрепленных к тому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'На каждый выколотый глаз приходилось два открывшихся новых.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee4f68a-9650-4a66-a133-7ee8f3ebccf0\', \'multiverseId\': 537334}, \'multiverseid\': 537334}, {\'name\': \'监视诅咒\', \'text\': \'结附于牌手\\n在所结附的牌手之维持开始时，选择任意数量目标该牌手以外的牌手。他们各抓若干牌，其数量等同于所结附的牌手上贴附的诅咒数量。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'每挖去一只眼，就会睁开两只来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84b3d95-5950-46ba-9382-94ccbab6aafa\', \'multiverseId\': 537650}, \'multiverseid\': 537650}, {\'name\': \'監視詛咒\', \'text\': \'結附於玩家\\n在所結附的玩家之維持開始時，選擇任意數量目標該玩家以外的玩家。他們各抽若干牌，其數量等同於所結附的玩家上貼附的詛咒數量。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'每挖去一隻眼，就會睜開兩隻來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3040a84e-95a5-46b0-9e22-3bc7a3d597a2\', \'multiverseId\': 537966}, \'multiverseid\': 537966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch der Überwachung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des verzauberten Spielers zieht eine beliebige Anzahl an Spielern deiner Wahl außer dem verzauberten Spieler jeweils so viele Karten, wie Flüche an den verzauberten Spieler angelegt sind.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7378e44-02a8-42da-9be4-552f8e5abafd\', \'multiverseId\': 538747}, \'multiverseid\': 538747}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de la vigilancia\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento del jugador encantado, cualquier cantidad de jugadores objetivo que no sean ese jugador roban cada uno una cantidad de cartas igual a la cantidad de Maldiciones anexadas a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73318d50-96fb-4b10-9982-52a5fdc9f743\', \'multiverseId\': 538807}, \'multiverseid\': 538807}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de surveillance\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nAu début de l\'entretien du joueur enchanté, n\'importe quel nombre de joueurs ciblés autres que ce joueur piochent chacun un nombre de cartes égal au nombre de malédictions attachées à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'802fb2e5-7483-4c76-ad9a-37786eb561fc\', \'multiverseId\': 538867}, \'multiverseid\': 538867}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Sorveglianza\', \'text\': "Incanta giocatore\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento del giocatore incantato, un qualsiasi numero di giocatori bersaglio diversi da quel giocatore pescano carte pari al numero di Anatemi assegnati a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e444a209-9a96-4e1b-b388-78af410f9609\', \'multiverseId\': 538927}, \'multiverseid\': 538927}, {\'name\': \'監視の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤー以外の望む数のプレイヤーを対象とする。それらのプレイヤーはそれぞれ、この能力が誘発した時点でエンチャントしていたプレイヤーについている呪いの数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4359309d-05c3-43ff-8d69-a51957263052\', \'multiverseId\': 538987}, \'multiverseid\': 538987}]', "[{'name': 'Fluch des Schweigens', 'text': 'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nSowie der Fluch des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kartennamen.\\nZaubersprüche mit dem bestimmten Namen, die der verzauberte Spieler wirkt, kosten beim Wirken {2} mehr.\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Zauberspruch mit dem bestimmten Namen wirkt, kannst du den Fluch des Schweigens opfern. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535086&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcf99d5e-a174-423a-af3c-e91764a0bfe6', 'multiverseId': 535086}, 'multiverseid': 535086}, {'name': 'Maldición del silencio', 'text': 'Encantar jugador.\\nEn cuanto la Maldición del silencio entre al campo de batalla, elige un nombre de carta.\\nAl jugador encantado le cuesta {2} más lanzar hechizos con el nombre elegido.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo con el nombre elegido, puedes sacrificar la Maldición del silencio. Si lo haces, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura maldición', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535402&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a51fec6-7e88-492d-b410-3806252f7f73', 'multiverseId': 535402}, 'multiverseid': 535402}, {'name': 'Malédiction de silence', 'text': 'Enchanter : joueur\\nAu moment où la Malédiction de silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un nom de carte.\\nLes sorts du nom choisi que le joueur enchanté lance coûtent {2} de plus à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort du nom choisi, vous pouvez sacrifier la Malédiction de silence. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura et malédiction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535718&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38ceb32c-170e-445b-b42b-b49cb250d008', 'multiverseId': 535718}, 'multiverseid': 535718}, {'name': 'Maledizione del Silenzio', 'text': 'Incanta giocatore\\nMentre la Maledizione del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli il nome di una carta.\\nLe magie con il nome scelto che il giocatore incantato lancia costano {2} in più per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia con il nome scelto, puoi sacrificare la Maledizione del Silenzio. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536034&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4bf9b5f-4fd1-4d7a-99ae-6d2a276bb77b', 'multiverseId': 536034}, 'multiverseid': 536034}, {'name': '静寂の呪い', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\n静寂の呪いが戦場に出るに際し、カードの名前１つを選ぶ。\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは静寂の呪いを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536350&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d010e27-4a9f-4ae0-98df-d49758bf339c', 'multiverseId': 536350}, 'multiverseid': 536350}, {'name': '침묵의 저주', 'text': '플레이어에게 부여\\n침묵의 저주가 전장에 들어오면서, 카드 이름 하나를 선택한다.\\n부여된 플레이어가 발동하는 그 이름을 가진 주문은 비용이 {2}만큼 더 든다.\\n부여된 플레이어가 선택된 이름을 가진 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 침묵의 저주를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진 저주', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536666&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c351cae9-e01b-4e8f-9099-2af8b9f8351d', 'multiverseId': 536666}, 'multiverseid': 536666}, {'name': 'Maldição do Silêncio', 'text': 'Encantar jogador\\nConforme Maldição do Silêncio entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um nome de card.\\nAs mágicas com o nome escolhido que o jogador encantado conjura custam {2} a mais para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado conjura uma mágica com o nome escolhido, você pode sacrificar Maldição do Silêncio. Se fizer isso, compre um card.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura Maldição', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536982&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4657f9f3-e2fb-4978-a55e-f824a4e257dc', 'multiverseId': 536982}, 'multiverseid': 536982}, {'name': 'Проклятие Безмолвия', 'text': 'Зачаровать игрока\\nПри выходе Проклятия Безмолвия на поле битвы выберите имя карты.\\nЗаклинания с выбранным именем, которые разыгрывает зачарованный игрок, стоят на {2} больше.\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованный игрок разыгрывает заклинание с выбранным именем, вы можете пожертвовать Проклятие Безмолвия. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура Проклятие', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537298&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dc78ab0-d73f-4b3d-b777-7c350a86f12c', 'multiverseId': 537298}, 'multiverseid': 537298}, {'name': '封口诅咒', 'text': '结附于牌手\\n于封口诅咒进战场时，选择一个牌名。\\n所结附的牌手施放之具该名称的咒语增加{2}来施放。\\n每当所结附的牌手施放具该名称的咒语时，你可以牺牲封口诅咒。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气／诅咒', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537614&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d30ff76-81a3-4f3a-a2bf-3cb50eb9cede', 'multiverseId': 537614}, 'multiverseid': 537614}, {'name': '封口詛咒', 'text': '結附於玩家\\n於封口詛咒進戰場時，選擇一個牌名。\\n所結附的玩家施放之具該名稱的咒語增加{2}來施放。\\n每當所結附的玩家施放具該名稱的咒語時，你可以犧牲封口詛咒。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣／詛咒', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537930&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c96bd591-9877-4727-8379-8385aa8ca379', 'multiverseId': 537930}, 'multiverseid': 537930}]", "[{'name': 'Fluch des Schweigens', 'text': 'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nSowie der Fluch des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kartennamen.\\nZaubersprüche mit dem bestimmten Namen, die der verzauberte Spieler wirkt, kosten beim Wirken {2} mehr.\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Zauberspruch mit dem bestimmten Namen wirkt, kannst du den Fluch des Schweigens opfern. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538738&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6c62a2a-e8be-497c-ae85-9fbf5c5b99a2', 'multiverseId': 538738}, 'multiverseid': 538738}, {'name': 'Maldición del silencio', 'text': 'Encantar jugador.\\nEn cuanto la Maldición del silencio entre al campo de batalla, elige un nombre de carta.\\nAl jugador encantado le cuesta {2} más lanzar hechizos con el nombre elegido.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo con el nombre elegido, puedes sacrificar la Maldición del silencio. Si lo haces, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura maldición', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538798&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '654b26fd-514f-42e3-a3ed-c7ae45cd97eb', 'multiverseId': 538798}, 'multiverseid': 538798}, {'name': 'Malédiction de silence', 'text': 'Enchanter : joueur\\nAu moment où la Malédiction de silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un nom de carte.\\nLes sorts du nom choisi que le joueur enchanté lance coûtent {2} de plus à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort du nom choisi, vous pouvez sacrifier la Malédiction de silence. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura et malédiction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538858&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69c3484e-d8dc-43b4-9574-0895b9936604', 'multiverseId': 538858}, 'multiverseid': 538858}, {'name': 'Maledizione del Silenzio', 'text': 'Incanta giocatore\\nMentre la Maledizione del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli il nome di una carta.\\nLe magie con il nome scelto che il giocatore incantato lancia costano {2} in più per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia con il nome scelto, puoi sacrificare la Maledizione del Silenzio. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538918&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9266f7c-61ac-435e-b08e-dbfdab57477c', 'multiverseId': 538918}, 'multiverseid': 538918}, {'name': '静寂の呪い', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\n静寂の呪いが戦場に出るに際し、カードの名前１つを選ぶ。\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは静寂の呪いを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー） — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538978&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3737e9f6-efe2-4dd6-8e1b-9a2af0a2ace3', 'multiverseId': 538978}, 'multiverseid': 538978}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des erschütterten Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Zauberspruch außer seinem ersten Zauberspruch in jedem Zug wirkt oder einen Zauberspruch kopiert, fügt ihm der Fluch des erschütterten Glaubens 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Sogar in den heiligen Hallen der Kapelle drang das Lachen der Teufel durch seine Gebete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535226&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0ed7d6-7215-4df5-bb37-9449205f46b0\', \'multiverseId\': 535226}, \'multiverseid\': 535226}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de la fe quebrantada\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo que no sea el primer hechizo que lanza cada turno o copie un hechizo, la Maldición de la fe quebrantada le hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de encontrarse dentro de los salones consagrados de la capilla, las risas de los diablos hendieron sus plegarias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7f9f00-d611-4440-a70d-596d8762e78a\', \'multiverseId\': 535542}, \'multiverseid\': 535542}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de foi ébranlée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort autre que le premier sort qu\'il lance à chaque tour ou qu\'il copie un sort, la Malédiction de foi ébranlée lui inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': \'Même dans la sainteté des salles de la chapelle, le rire des démons troublait ses prières.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c5b2cc-7070-4d8f-840f-b92a8d3e1f98\', \'multiverseId\': 535858}, \'multiverseid\': 535858}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Fede Incrinata\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia diversa dalla prima che ha lanciato in ogni turno o copia una magia, la Maledizione della Fede Incrinata infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'Persino tra le mura consacrate della cappella, le risate dei diavoli disturbavano le sue preghiere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'190b6f4c-85ec-4c96-ab33-4b9f199180ce\', \'multiverseId\': 536174}, \'multiverseid\': 536174}, {\'name\': \'揺らぐ信仰の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーが呪文をコピーするか各ターン内の自分の２つ目以降の呪文を唱えるたび、揺らぐ信仰の呪いはそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'礼拝堂の神聖な広間でさえも、悪魔の笑い声が彼の祈りを貫いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc334d3-41b1-4127-9776-1f878d7aabb6\', \'multiverseId\': 536490}, \'multiverseid\': 536490}, {\'name\': \'흔들리는 믿음의 저주\', \'text\': \'플레이어에게 부여\\n부여된 플레이어가 각 턴에 처음으로 발동하는 주문이 아닌 주문을 발동하거나 주문을 복사할 때마다, 흔들리는 믿음의 저주는 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': \'예배당의 신성한 전당 안에서도, 악령의 웃음소리가 그의 기도를 꿰뚫었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9a756b-ec63-4326-ae07-a404a040f27c\', \'multiverseId\': 536806}, \'multiverseid\': 536806}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Fé Abalada\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado conjura uma mágica que não seja a primeira de cada turno ou copia uma mágica, Maldição da Fé Abalada causa 2 pontos de dano a ele.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmo entre as santas paredes da capela a risada dos diabos perturbava suas preces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50326b5-3a0e-4335-ad40-0044561305ea\', \'multiverseId\': 537122}, \'multiverseid\': 537122}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Пошатнувшейся Веры\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованный игрок разыгрывает заклинание, кроме первого заклинания, которое он разыгрывает в каждом ходу, или копирует заклинание, Проклятие Пошатнувшейся Веры наносит ему 2 повреждения.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'Даже в священных залах часовни дьявольский смех заглушал его молитвы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc834e1f-63d2-46f1-ad9b-2799b3fb188b\', \'multiverseId\': 537438}, \'multiverseid\': 537438}, {\'name\': \'屈志诅咒\', \'text\': \'结附于牌手\\n每当所结附的牌手复制咒语或于其每回合施放的第一个咒语以外再施放咒语时，屈志诅咒对其造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'纵使是在礼拜堂的神圣大厅中，魔鬼邪笑仍能盖过他的祷告。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d14c833-10e0-4107-ae69-330f89e12673\', \'multiverseId\': 537754}, \'multiverseid\': 537754}, {\'name\': \'屈志詛咒\', \'text\': \'結附於玩家\\n每當所結附的玩家複製咒語或於其每回合施放的第一個咒語以外再施放咒語時，屈志詛咒對其造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'縱使是在禮拜堂的神聖大廳中，魔鬼邪笑仍能蓋過他的禱告。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77582f34-e3cf-42b6-8ffb-156278a8a9f9\', \'multiverseId\': 538070}, \'multiverseid\': 538070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des erschütterten Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Zauberspruch außer seinem ersten Zauberspruch in jedem Zug wirkt oder einen Zauberspruch kopiert, fügt ihm der Fluch des erschütterten Glaubens 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e8de3f-1f41-435e-aa70-40e97376f391\', \'multiverseId\': 538769}, \'multiverseid\': 538769}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de la fe quebrantada\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo que no sea el primer hechizo que lanza cada turno o copie un hechizo, la Maldición de la fe quebrantada le hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e846c9f-a201-49e0-b162-722f1518c38a\', \'multiverseId\': 538829}, \'multiverseid\': 538829}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de foi ébranlée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort autre que le premier sort qu\'il lance à chaque tour ou qu\'il copie un sort, la Malédiction de foi ébranlée lui inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c770870c-ad21-452b-9081-e9b1faa7af25\', \'multiverseId\': 538889}, \'multiverseid\': 538889}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Fede Incrinata\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia diversa dalla prima che ha lanciato in ogni turno o copia una magia, la Maledizione della Fede Incrinata infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc88c37-6ebf-4d82-85c5-3e9ea952a95e\', \'multiverseId\': 538949}, \'multiverseid\': 538949}, {\'name\': \'揺らぐ信仰の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーが呪文をコピーするか各ターン内の自分の２つ目以降の呪文を唱えるたび、揺らぐ信仰の呪いはそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bde8db1-90e3-4404-abc3-9fa0e89fe3df\', \'multiverseId\': 539009}, \'multiverseid\': 539009}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flut der Erinnerung\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich der Menge Mana ist, die ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {5}{U}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535141&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c146e122-9a06-44e6-83ea-d94da768fcf2\', \'multiverseId\': 535141}, \'multiverseid\': 535141}, {\'name\': \'Lluvia de recuerdos\', \'text\': \'Mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de maná usado para lanzar este hechizo. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{U}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0f76b7-20aa-4792-a67f-e2c92f1c3f98\', \'multiverseId\': 535457}, \'multiverseid\': 535457}, {\'name\': \'Déluge de réminiscences\', \'text\': "Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c082ccb-2cbc-409f-bdab-a27b12c2ffee\', \'multiverseId\': 535773}, \'multiverseid\': 535773}, {\'name\': \'Diluvio di Ricordi\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il mana speso per lanciare questa magia. Aggiungine due alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ce38dd-5380-4d2f-8801-efee3c6398b9\', \'multiverseId\': 536089}, \'multiverseid\': 536089}, {\'name\': \'記憶の氾濫\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払ったマナの点数に等しい。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{U}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9545c6d2-6565-4511-b3ed-4cf440dbf9be\', \'multiverseId\': 536405}, \'multiverseid\': 536405}, {\'name\': \'기억 쇄도\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 X장을 본다. X는 당신이 이 주문을 발동하기 위해 지불한 마나의 수다. 그중 두 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\\n회상 {5}{U}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201963d1-5241-4e39-bc42-500fef42a77c\', \'multiverseId\': 536721}, \'multiverseid\': 536721}, {\'name\': \'Dilúvio da Memória\', \'text\': \'Olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X a quantidade de mana gasta para conjurar esta mágica. Coloque dois deles em sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nRecapitular {5}{U}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e2f2e1d-69b7-4e63-9a24-73212fed8394\', \'multiverseId\': 537037}, \'multiverseid\': 537037}, {\'name\': \'Потоп Памяти\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где X — количество маны, потраченной на разыгрывание этого заклинания. Положите две из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nВоспоминание {5}{U}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1b85ea-d39e-4432-852f-d0075f5c7c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 537353}, \'multiverseid\': 537353}, {\'name\': \'记忆奔腾\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为施放此咒语时所支付的法术力数量。将其中两张置于你手上，其余的牌则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n返照{5}{U}{U}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7778cf10-4103-48b6-b64c-8092af2fe3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 537669}, \'multiverseid\': 537669}, {\'name\': \'記憶奔騰\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為施放此咒語時所支付的魔法力數量。將其中兩張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n返照{5}{U}{U}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5a5e25a-a16f-4bbb-b912-4780b9acdda4\', \'multiverseId\': 537985}, \'multiverseid\': 537985}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flut der Erinnerung\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich der Menge Mana ist, die ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {5}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538751&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d96ef6-896c-4814-91e7-23c0ffc7f645\', \'multiverseId\': 538751}, \'multiverseid\': 538751}, {\'name\': \'Lluvia de recuerdos\', \'text\': \'Mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de maná usado para lanzar este hechizo. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b62a424d-8375-4b60-8578-11fbef5d904c\', \'multiverseId\': 538811}, \'multiverseid\': 538811}, {\'name\': \'Déluge de réminiscences\', \'text\': "Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U}", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a419730c-6aaa-4b08-989a-a344933698d0\', \'multiverseId\': 538871}, \'multiverseid\': 538871}, {\'name\': \'Diluvio di Ricordi\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il mana speso per lanciare questa magia. Aggiungine due alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57e317f-c672-429c-ad6b-db61bce9cec1\', \'multiverseId\': 538931}, \'multiverseid\': 538931}, {\'name\': \'記憶の氾濫\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払ったマナの点数に等しい。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック {5}{U}{U}\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99cd9097-103e-412d-9910-f54ec15b84c8\', \'multiverseId\': 538991}, \'multiverseid\': 538991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtloser Widersacher\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Furchtlose Widersacher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {1}{W} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele Tapferkeitsmarken auf den Furchtlosen Widersacher.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Tapferkeitsmarke auf dem Furchtlosen Widersacher.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd11ab80-bc97-40dc-913c-068ccf68953c\', \'multiverseId\': 535097}, \'multiverseid\': 535097}, {\'name\': \'Adversario intrépido\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Adversario intrépido entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}{W} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores de valentía sobre el Adversario intrépido.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador de valentía sobre el Adversario intrépido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'633219fe-be19-46d9-a3bf-386368a801f9\', \'multiverseId\': 535413}, \'multiverseid\': 535413}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire intrépide\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Adversaire intrépide arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}{W} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs « courage » sur l\'Adversaire intrépide.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « courage » sur l\'Adversaire intrépide.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9f4355-038f-4e8c-89b9-985b6061fc99\', \'multiverseId\': 535729}, \'multiverseid\': 535729}, {\'name\': \'Avversario Intrepido\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nQuando l\'Avversario Intrepido entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}{W} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini valore sull\'Avversario Intrepido.\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino valore sull\'Avversario Intrepido.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4827f603-b348-4117-9e09-1128afc00897\', \'multiverseId\': 536045}, \'multiverseid\': 536045}, {\'name\': \'剛胆な敵対者\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n剛胆な敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは望む回数の{1}{W}を支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、剛胆な敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の武勇カウンターを置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、剛胆な敵対者の上にある武勇カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b0732c-8e9f-4682-b926-ed8aa56c562b\', \'multiverseId\': 536361}, \'multiverseid\': 536361}, {\'name\': \'용감무쌍한 적수\', \'text\': \'생명연결\\n용감무쌍한 적수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 원하는 횟수만큼 {1}{W}를 지불할 수 있다. 당신이 이 비용을 한 번 이상 지불할 때, 용감무쌍한 적수에 그 수만큼 용맹 카운터를 올려놓는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물들은 용감무쌍한 적수에 놓인 용맹 카운터 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9ad627c-ec4a-4d30-b739-19cdbe0e39ef\', \'multiverseId\': 536677}, \'multiverseid\': 536677}, {\'name\': \'Adversário Intrépido\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nQuando Adversário Intrépido entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {1}{W} qualquer número de vezes. Quando pagar esse custo uma ou mais vezes, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores de valor em Adversário Intrépido.\\nAs criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 para cada marcador de valor em Adversário Intrépido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'101a9aaf-16df-4bed-aed8-2de77b60d37b\', \'multiverseId\': 536993}, \'multiverseid\': 536993}, {\'name\': \'Бесстрашный Противник\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни\\nКогда Бесстрашный Противник выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заплатить {1}{W} любое количество раз. Когда вы оплачиваете эту стоимость один или несколько раз, положите такое же количество жетонов доблести на Бесстрашного Противника.\\nСущества под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 за каждый жетон доблести на Бесстрашном Противнике.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e642c1f-571b-4333-b3a2-251b266b251c\', \'multiverseId\': 537309}, \'multiverseid\': 537309}, {\'name\': \'无畏仇敌\', \'text\': \'系命\\n当无畏仇敌进战场时，你可以支付{1}{W}任意次数。当你支付此费用一次或数次时，根据该数量在无畏仇敌上放置等量的勇气指示物。\\n无畏仇敌上每有一个勇气指示物，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb357ca-f9c7-4547-8d6a-f0f4805fbc25\', \'multiverseId\': 537625}, \'multiverseid\': 537625}, {\'name\': \'無畏仇敵\', \'text\': \'繫命\\n當無畏仇敵進戰場時，你可以支付{1}{W}任意次數。當你支付此費用一次或數次時，根據該數量在無畏仇敵上放置等量的勇氣指示物。\\n無畏仇敵上每有一個勇氣指示物，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfbb0bb0-c91c-4c6c-aeb0-ae3ea162052d\', \'multiverseId\': 537941}, \'multiverseid\': 537941}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtloser Widersacher\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Furchtlose Widersacher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {1}{W} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele Tapferkeitsmarken auf den Furchtlosen Widersacher.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Tapferkeitsmarke auf dem Furchtlosen Widersacher.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70759db1-f402-4f91-bcb0-7a2f4e5cecd2\', \'multiverseId\': 538742}, \'multiverseid\': 538742}, {\'name\': \'Adversario intrépido\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Adversario intrépido entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}{W} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores de valentía sobre el Adversario intrépido.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador de valentía sobre el Adversario intrépido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'017fc314-474b-4f05-ae68-cef02c7d91b9\', \'multiverseId\': 538802}, \'multiverseid\': 538802}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire intrépide\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Adversaire intrépide arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}{W} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs « courage » sur l\'Adversaire intrépide.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « courage » sur l\'Adversaire intrépide.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d26d6364-4e9f-41dd-be20-321f7e3bfb7d\', \'multiverseId\': 538862}, \'multiverseid\': 538862}, {\'name\': \'Avversario Intrepido\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nQuando l\'Avversario Intrepido entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}{W} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando paghi questo costo una o più volte, metti altrettanti segnalini valore sull\'Avversario Intrepido.\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino valore sull\'Avversario Intrepido.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca5ee3f-e6b8-4463-acbf-04e301c1a66b\', \'multiverseId\': 538922}, \'multiverseid\': 538922}, {\'name\': \'剛胆な敵対者\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n剛胆な敵対者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは望む回数の{1}{W}を支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、剛胆な敵対者の上にその回数に等しい数の武勇カウンターを置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、剛胆な敵対者の上にある武勇カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa0c950-a5d1-4a87-9a0b-cf5e4d309121\', \'multiverseId\': 538982}, \'multiverseid\': 538982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürst der Verlorenen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt drei Karten.\\nBezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {C}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Zauberspruch aus deinem Friedhof zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44847a4a-4803-43b8-b8eb-72c22743a00f\', \'multiverseId\': 535200}, \'multiverseid\': 535200}, {\'name\': \'Señor de los olvidados\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\n{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: El jugador objetivo muele tres cartas.\\nPagar 1 vida: Agrega {C}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b16627c9-bf8d-44c7-9d97-3f516f90b656\', \'multiverseId\': 535516}, \'multiverseid\': 535516}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des oubliés\', \'text\': \'Vol, piétinement\\n{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Un joueur ciblé meule trois cartes.\\nPayez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f9d81f9-aee2-4e08-9b2a-6a3c824276c3\', \'multiverseId\': 535832}, \'multiverseid\': 535832}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\n{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio macina tre carte.\\nPaga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {C}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d57510-f1ba-44f7-8844-761efd1f9d27\', \'multiverseId\': 536148}, \'multiverseid\': 536148}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられし者の王\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n{B}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を切削する。\\n１点のライフを支払う：{C}を加える。このマナは、あなたの墓地から呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59bf1dd8-b94f-47b1-9a4c-17db40906863\', \'multiverseId\': 536464}, \'multiverseid\': 536464}, {\'name\': \'버림받은 자들의 군주\', \'text\': \'비행, 돌진\\n{B}, 다른 생물을 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 세 장을 민다.\\n생명 1점을 지불한다: {C}를 추가한다. 이 마나는 당신의 무덤에서 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ada5a33-9aac-49fb-b185-24a1d7288504\', \'multiverseId\': 536780}, \'multiverseid\': 536780}, {\'name\': \'Senhor dos Renegados\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\n{B}, sacrifique outra criatura: O jogador alvo tritura três cards.\\nPague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {C}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar uma mágica de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282680b2-4363-4cd1-81fc-9ebad7ccc486\', \'multiverseId\': 537096}, \'multiverseid\': 537096}, {\'name\': \'Владыка Отвергнутых\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар\\n{B}, пожертвуйте другое существо: целевой игрок скручивает три карты.\\nЗаплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {C}. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания из вашего кладбища.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875eddc9-b75b-438e-8b76-595de2ad116c\', \'multiverseId\': 537412}, \'multiverseid\': 537412}, {\'name\': \'弃世之王\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n{B}，牺牲另一个生物：目标牌手磨三张牌。\\n支付1点生命：加{C}。此法术力只能用来从你坟墓场中施放咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b616288-db13-4a32-9a4a-2fc579b6bc17\', \'multiverseId\': 537728}, \'multiverseid\': 537728}, {\'name\': \'棄世之王\', \'text\': \'飛行，踐踏\\n{B}，犧牲另一個生物：目標玩家磨三張牌。\\n支付1點生命：加{C}。此魔法力只能用來從你墳墓場中施放咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74bfbca3-dc45-4b9c-9a21-e25c351702d8\', \'multiverseId\': 538044}, \'multiverseid\': 538044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürst der Verlorenen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt drei Karten.\\nBezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {C}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Zauberspruch aus deinem Friedhof zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538762&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3ff346-abbd-4c8a-b97d-2d08d28aa308\', \'multiverseId\': 538762}, \'multiverseid\': 538762}, {\'name\': \'Señor de los olvidados\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\n{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: El jugador objetivo muele tres cartas.\\nPagar 1 vida: Agrega {C}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'781054b1-2bcc-43e8-9a22-af9091c4940a\', \'multiverseId\': 538822}, \'multiverseid\': 538822}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des oubliés\', \'text\': \'Vol, piétinement\\n{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Un joueur ciblé meule trois cartes.\\nPayez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b076faa1-d497-490d-afce-913e706e9b33\', \'multiverseId\': 538882}, \'multiverseid\': 538882}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\n{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio macina tre carte.\\nPaga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {C}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46812baf-81b0-40fc-8b9d-2e4d2b8dc310\', \'multiverseId\': 538942}, \'multiverseid\': 538942}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられし者の王\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n{B}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を切削する。\\n１点のライフを支払う：{C}を加える。このマナは、あなたの墓地から呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb2e5e01-57c0-4fee-948e-771ef25fa3b6\', \'multiverseId\': 539002}, \'multiverseid\': 539002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galvanische Iteration\', \'text\': \'Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nRückblende {1}{U}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Lieber wirkungsvoll als vorhersehbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597f9ca9-67c1-46db-8afa-8423a06e1c74\', \'multiverseId\': 535334}, \'multiverseid\': 535334}, {\'name\': \'Iteración galvánica\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{U}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Más vale potente que predecible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fce018e-c705-4dc5-9ae8-c804fd370322\', \'multiverseId\': 535650}, \'multiverseid\': 535650}, {\'name\': \'Itération zingante\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nFlashback {1}{U}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Mieux vaut être puissant que prévisible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc1dc7af-5c32-4c60-bdd0-5c71a52c5089\', \'multiverseId\': 535966}, \'multiverseid\': 535966}, {\'name\': \'Iterazione Galvanica\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci la tua prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in questo turno, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nFlashback {1}{U}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Meglio potente che prevedibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c1e45a-f5ea-46b0-8bcb-8e500b1d4ca3\', \'multiverseId\': 536282}, \'multiverseid\': 536282}, {\'name\': \'感電の反復\', \'text\': \'このターンにあなたが次にインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{U}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ありきたりより強力の方がいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b5aa9c4-8e0b-48ba-beb1-db60cd3555b0\', \'multiverseId\': 536598}, \'multiverseid\': 536598}, {\'name\': \'전기적 반복\', \'text\': \'이 턴에 다음으로 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\\n회상 {1}{U}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'예측할 수 있는 것보단 가능성을 가지고 있는 것이 낫다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577039d9-1c60-4f67-b348-af459b9acfb6\', \'multiverseId\': 536914}, \'multiverseid\': 536914}, {\'name\': \'Iteração Galvânica\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica instantânea ou feitiço neste turno, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nRecapitular {1}{U}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Potente é melhor que previsível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f433a26c-e4b1-4401-bd05-a603d45d7725\', \'multiverseId\': 537230}, \'multiverseid\': 537230}, {\'name\': \'Гальваническая Итерация\', \'text\': \'Когда вы будете разыгрывать ваше следующее мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в этом ходу, скопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\\nВоспоминание {1}{U}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Лучше мощный, чем предсказуемый.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634a684f-90e2-40ea-a70a-758be92e4ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 537546}, \'multiverseid\': 537546}, {\'name\': \'电流迭变\', \'text\': \'本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n返照{1}{U}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'宁要威力，不要规律。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4265fa49-88b2-4720-909d-594437d17925\', \'multiverseId\': 537862}, \'multiverseid\': 537862}, {\'name\': \'電流迭變\', \'text\': \'本回合中，當你施放你的下一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\\n返照{1}{U}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'寧要威力，不要規律。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce05b1ac-edfa-4726-809c-32106a467a30\', \'multiverseId\': 538178}, \'multiverseid\': 538178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galvanische Iteration\', \'text\': \'Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nRückblende {1}{U}{R}\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ddc04ed-d2e9-43a2-bc2f-c61e9679e16b\', \'multiverseId\': 538788}, \'multiverseid\': 538788}, {\'name\': \'Iteración galvánica\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1205a536-8309-4462-bda1-30aa4071208f\', \'multiverseId\': 538848}, \'multiverseid\': 538848}, {\'name\': \'Itération zingante\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nFlashback {1}{U}{R}", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5708dd8c-16a1-4e1d-97d4-9d95c3f3ce66\', \'multiverseId\': 538908}, \'multiverseid\': 538908}, {\'name\': \'Iterazione Galvanica\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci la tua prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in questo turno, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nFlashback {1}{U}{R}\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7c5653-4b92-42d4-8616-77b29f27c553\', \'multiverseId\': 538968}, \'multiverseid\': 538968}, {\'name\': \'感電の反復\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが次にインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nフラッシュバック {1}{U}{R}\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2cdbbe-b4de-4b38-8307-c17d97f9b57c\', \'multiverseId\': 539028}, \'multiverseid\': 539028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gaven-Dämmerwacht\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {1}\\nFalls es weder Tag noch Nacht ist, wird es Tag, sowie die Gaven-Dämmerwacht ins Spiel kommt.\\nImmer wenn der Tag zur Nacht oder die Nacht zum Tag wird, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1649eb4e-ea28-40be-8170-d4720777eb38\', \'multiverseId\': 535092}, \'multiverseid\': 535092}, {\'name\': \'Guarda del alba de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {1}.\\nSi no es ni de día ni de noche, se hace de día en cuanto la Guarda del alba de Gavony entre al campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que se pase del día a la noche o de la noche al día, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d4b77b-83eb-4cf3-af3d-6fe3952cc98e\', \'multiverseId\': 535408}, \'multiverseid\': 535408}, {\'name\': \'Garde-aube de Gavonie\', \'text\': "Parade {1}\\nSi ce n\'est ni le jour ni la nuit, on passe au jour au moment où la Garde-aube de Gavonie arrive sur le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'on passe du jour à la nuit ou de la nuit au jour, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535724&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'052136ce-81fc-4a51-83b4-d472cc700827\', \'multiverseId\': 535724}, \'multiverseid\': 535724}, {\'name\': "Guardia dell\'Alba di Gavony", \'text\': "Egida {1}\\nSe non è né giorno né notte, diventa giorno mentre la Guardia dell\'Alba di Gavony entra nel campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il giorno diventa notte o la notte diventa giorno, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ac00da-ab7b-4782-ae56-42da0dc85755\', \'multiverseId\': 536040}, \'multiverseid\': 536040}, {\'name\': \'ガヴォニーの黎明護衛\', \'text\': \'護法{1}\\nガヴォニーの黎明護衛が戦場に出るに際し、昼でも夜でもないなら、昼になる。\\n昼が夜になるか夜が昼になるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。あなたは「その中からマナ総量が３以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62803230-45b1-40ba-80ae-3f52eda3d446\', \'multiverseId\': 536356}, \'multiverseid\': 536356}, {\'name\': \'가보니 새벽경비병\', \'text\': \'보호진 {1}\\n낮도 밤도 아니라면, 가보니 새벽경비병이 전장에 들어오면서 낮이 된다.\\n낮이 밤이 되거나 밤이 낮이 될 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 마나 값이 3 이하인 생물 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e4bf7f-7bc6-42c6-8ddc-25c5bc0f250c\', \'multiverseId\': 536672}, \'multiverseid\': 536672}, {\'name\': \'Guardiã da Aurora de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {1}\\nSe não for dia nem noite, torna-se dia conforme Guardiã da Aurora de Gavony entra no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que o dia se tornar noite ou a noite se tornar dia, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0f04b6-d877-4791-b2e9-8944e84f3dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 536988}, \'multiverseid\': 536988}, {\'name\': \'Гевонская Стражница Зари\', \'text\': \'Оберег {1}\\nЕсли не стоит ни день, ни ночь, то при выходе Гевонской Стражницы Зари на поле битвы наступает день.\\nКаждый раз, когда день становится ночью или ночь становится днем, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа с мановой ценностью не более 3 и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe8be4f-3174-4523-8c1e-fbd95c008c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 537304}, \'multiverseid\': 537304}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼护晓兵\', \'text\': \'守护{1}\\n如果当前既非白昼也非黑夜，则于加渥尼护晓兵进战场时成为白昼。\\n每当白昼成为黑夜或黑夜成为白昼时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中一张法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'480807e9-5ca9-4882-8631-93d36b5dda63\', \'multiverseId\': 537620}, \'multiverseid\': 537620}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼護曉兵\', \'text\': \'守護{1}\\n如果當前既非白晝也非黑夜，則於加渥尼護曉兵進戰場時成為白晝。\\n每當白晝成為黑夜或黑夜成為白晝時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中一張魔法力值等於或小於3的生物牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfdba018-3dcd-4e65-a6c8-28743eddb596\', \'multiverseId\': 537936}, \'multiverseid\': 537936}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gaven-Dämmerwacht\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {1}\\nFalls es weder Tag noch Nacht ist, wird es Tag, sowie die Gaven-Dämmerwacht ins Spiel kommt.\\nImmer wenn der Tag zur Nacht oder die Nacht zum Tag wird, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'badee144-a2df-45a4-9ab3-6ab3a85c5a85\', \'multiverseId\': 539060}, \'multiverseid\': 539060}, {\'name\': \'Guarda del alba de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {1}.\\nSi no es ni de día ni de noche, se hace de día en cuanto la Guarda del alba de Gavony entre al campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que se pase del día a la noche o de la noche al día, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0cd04c-3ada-4ef9-8b29-9e9acbb13adf\', \'multiverseId\': 539065}, \'multiverseid\': 539065}, {\'name\': \'Garde-aube de Gavonie\', \'text\': "Parade {1}\\nSi ce n\'est ni le jour ni la nuit, on passe au jour au moment où la Garde-aube de Gavonie arrive sur le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'on passe du jour à la nuit ou de la nuit au jour, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9bc3333-b9c3-4c0d-8294-bc241bb08a2d\', \'multiverseId\': 539070}, \'multiverseid\': 539070}, {\'name\': "Guardia dell\'Alba di Gavony", \'text\': "Egida {1}\\nSe non è né giorno né notte, diventa giorno mentre la Guardia dell\'Alba di Gavony entra nel campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il giorno diventa notte o la notte diventa giorno, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c29130c-a7bc-4647-801d-e97cadb41f86\', \'multiverseId\': 539075}, \'multiverseid\': 539075}, {\'name\': \'ガヴォニーの黎明護衛\', \'text\': \'護法{1}\\nガヴォニーの黎明護衛が戦場に出るに際し、昼でも夜でもないなら、昼になる。\\n昼が夜になるか夜が昼になるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。あなたは「その中からマナ総量が３以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77983e0b-d448-4a70-a14b-6f21439f7738\', \'multiverseId\': 539080}, \'multiverseid\': 539080}, {\'name\': \'가보니 새벽경비병\', \'text\': \'보호진 {1}\\n낮도 밤도 아니라면, 가보니 새벽경비병이 전장에 들어오면서 낮이 된다.\\n낮이 밤이 되거나 밤이 낮이 될 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 마나 값이 3 이하인 생물 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59615ed1-7461-449b-99fc-c77daa1058fb\', \'multiverseId\': 539085}, \'multiverseid\': 539085}, {\'name\': \'Guardiã da Aurora de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {1}\\nSe não for dia nem noite, torna-se dia conforme Guardiã da Aurora de Gavony entra no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que o dia se tornar noite ou a noite se tornar dia, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7526cc-948a-4f63-a1cc-a0a82cbbab4b\', \'multiverseId\': 539090}, \'multiverseid\': 539090}, {\'name\': \'Гевонская Стражница Зари\', \'text\': \'Оберег {1}\\nЕсли не стоит ни день, ни ночь, то при выходе Гевонской Стражницы Зари на поле битвы наступает день.\\nКаждый раз, когда день становится ночью или ночь становится днем, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа с мановой ценностью не более 3 и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'151077d7-33ea-429d-876f-5d3abfdc2554\', \'multiverseId\': 539095}, \'multiverseid\': 539095}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼护晓兵\', \'text\': \'守护{1}\\n如果当前既非白昼也非黑夜，则于加渥尼护晓兵进战场时成为白昼。\\n每当白昼成为黑夜或黑夜成为白昼时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中一张法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65fc8ea7-8f0d-4a1e-a857-4dd4453001c5\', \'multiverseId\': 539100}, \'multiverseid\': 539100}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼護曉兵\', \'text\': \'守護{1}\\n如果當前既非白晝也非黑夜，則於加渥尼護曉兵進戰場時成為白晝。\\n每當白晝成為黑夜或黑夜成為白晝時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中一張魔法力值等於或小於3的生物牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a74b664-1b5b-421a-9cda-2663a58db65d\', \'multiverseId\': 539105}, \'multiverseid\': 539105}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538243&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dba6590d-3357-420c-9e9e-6eb46dbfa446', 'multiverseId': 538243}, 'multiverseid': 538243}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538253&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad843efa-983c-418e-b1ad-f8e4a38cf78e', 'multiverseId': 538253}, 'multiverseid': 538253}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538263&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7f37bbc-5904-4a9b-94a9-59038d43e24a', 'multiverseId': 538263}, 'multiverseid': 538263}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538273&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8ef03d0-84d2-433f-8f0f-6e5f90af8926', 'multiverseId': 538273}, 'multiverseid': 538273}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538283&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5eae682-dddf-4c7e-836b-047a5fd3b076', 'multiverseId': 538283}, 'multiverseid': 538283}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538293&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '672b9af9-7055-4039-b6b5-d517fd659380', 'multiverseId': 538293}, 'multiverseid': 538293}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538303&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa79d71a-1b3c-4016-a178-528ed0b9824e', 'multiverseId': 538303}, 'multiverseid': 538303}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538313&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85417223-962e-4ec1-8134-c55de40be961', 'multiverseId': 538313}, 'multiverseid': 538313}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538323&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dee1d62-2179-4522-b75f-6828b06875f8', 'multiverseId': 538323}, 'multiverseid': 538323}, {'name': '山脈', 'type': '基本地 ～山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538333&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a10ca10a-ee6c-4f67-98da-9708fb86cb6a', 'multiverseId': 538333}, 'multiverseid': 538333}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538244&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac505110-1047-41df-a972-c35faeccdcf4', 'multiverseId': 538244}, 'multiverseid': 538244}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538254&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8315e309-2160-46f9-9ad9-b51109f8c1e1', 'multiverseId': 538254}, 'multiverseid': 538254}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538264&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66653891-4d7c-4324-9806-95d6598d90a9', 'multiverseId': 538264}, 'multiverseid': 538264}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538274&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3c79d52-b5d2-4531-8587-1bd01b9e4ade', 'multiverseId': 538274}, 'multiverseid': 538274}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538284&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e59be37-0465-470e-b7e2-a3518b4115e3', 'multiverseId': 538284}, 'multiverseid': 538284}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538294&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48eae77f-e1d4-48a3-b1a6-bce48cd33053', 'multiverseId': 538294}, 'multiverseid': 538294}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538304&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9aa3acf8-6b2e-4096-8b1d-8374f3b9e838', 'multiverseId': 538304}, 'multiverseid': 538304}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538314&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b811dc2f-9f4f-42f1-996f-5f22fd147398', 'multiverseId': 538314}, 'multiverseid': 538314}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538324&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccfac9c4-7e70-4713-ba74-a2a30c6ea48f', 'multiverseId': 538324}, 'multiverseid': 538324}, {'name': '山脈', 'type': '基本地 ～山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538334&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56da66d9-8f0c-4068-b820-01cd1d7fedaf', 'multiverseId': 538334}, 'multiverseid': 538334}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538345&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b33e220-2a8c-4521-b68d-f98f529761ff', 'multiverseId': 538345}, 'multiverseid': 538345}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538350&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e2449e4-ee29-4900-8d40-fd4d9e317a97', 'multiverseId': 538350}, 'multiverseid': 538350}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538355&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '222152f2-5b42-48eb-823c-5dab983864de', 'multiverseId': 538355}, 'multiverseid': 538355}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538360&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '724dccc3-477a-4cf5-b20d-512865dd0e93', 'multiverseId': 538360}, 'multiverseid': 538360}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538370&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdc3cb05-7419-480d-afb2-fc364786dfe4', 'multiverseId': 538370}, 'multiverseid': 538370}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538375&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48a2798f-8305-4a5e-b210-e892a3bcbf1a', 'multiverseId': 538375}, 'multiverseid': 538375}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538380&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd63ad7e-b2fd-4e3f-bf85-7d3b6f347d91', 'multiverseId': 538380}, 'multiverseid': 538380}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538385&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8145a65a-49bb-4277-add4-391a44382760', 'multiverseId': 538385}, 'multiverseid': 538385}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geheimnisse des Schlüssels\', \'text\': \'Stelle Nachforschungen an. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, stelle stattdessen zweimal Nachforschungen an. (Um Nachforschungen anzustellen, erzeuge einen farblosen Hinweis-Artefaktspielstein mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nRückblende {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Während Sigarda und Sorin kämpften, bargen Arlinn und Teferi den Schlüssel aus den Markov-Katakomben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535155&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3273489e-d7af-4199-bcf3-9ea63fe8d24a\', \'multiverseId\': 535155}, \'multiverseid\': 535155}, {\'name\': \'Secretos de la llave\', \'text\': \'Investiga. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, en vez de eso, investiga dos veces. (Para investigar, crea una ficha de artefacto Pista incolora con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\\nRetrospectiva {3}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Sigarda y Sorin luchaban entre sí, Arlinn y Teferi recuperaron la llave de las catacumbas Markov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce67839e-0cbe-412b-9a65-b9160c34b4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 535471}, \'multiverseid\': 535471}, {\'name\': \'Secrets de la clé\', \'text\': "Enquêtez. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, enquêtez deux fois à la place. (Pour enquêter, créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore Indice avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nFlashback {3}{U}", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Tandis que Sigarda et Sorin combattaient, Arlinn et Téfeiri récupérèrent la clé dans les catacombes de Markov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c44aa25-c8c6-42fc-8372-fd21e3772928\', \'multiverseId\': 535787}, \'multiverseid\': 535787}, {\'name\': \'Segreti della Chiave\', \'text\': \'Indaga. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, invece indaga due volte. (Per indagare, crea una pedina artefatto Indizio incolore con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nFlashback {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre Sigarda e Sorin combattevano, Arlinn e Teferi recuperarono la chiave dalle catacombe Markov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b252c4-88af-4baf-b611-241ffd500852\', \'multiverseId\': 536103}, \'multiverseid\': 536103}, {\'name\': \'鍵の秘密\', \'text\': \'調査を行う。この呪文が墓地から唱えられたなら、代わりに２回調査を行う。（調査を行うとは、「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つ無色の手掛かり・アーティファクト・トークン１つを生成することである。）\\nフラッシュバック{3}{U}\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'シガルダとソリンが戦っている間に、アーリンとテフェリーはマルコフの地下墓地から鍵を見つけ出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7501fca7-7deb-4ab8-b314-e6e46779a63c\', \'multiverseId\': 536419}, \'multiverseid\': 536419}, {\'name\': \'열쇠의 비밀\', \'text\': \'조사한다. 이 주문이 무덤에서 발동되었다면, 대신 두 번 조사한다. (조사를 하려면, "{2}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 가진 무색 단서 마법물체 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\\n회상 {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'시가르다와 소린이 싸우는 동안, 아를린과 테페리는 마르코프 지하묘지에서 열쇠를 회수했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a524b4e-2199-46fa-b2c3-c9d22e9b26ad\', \'multiverseId\': 536735}, \'multiverseid\': 536735}, {\'name\': \'Segredos da Chave\', \'text\': \'Investigue. Se esta mágica tiver sido conjurada de um cemitério, em vez disso, investigue duas vezes. (Para investigar, crie uma ficha de artefato Pista incolor com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card".)\\nRecapitular {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto Sigarda e Sorin lutavam, Arlinn e Teferi resgatavam a chave das catacumbas dos Markov.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32ab56e-58e0-46a4-a4ae-be6b70cd9a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 537051}, \'multiverseid\': 537051}, {\'name\': \'Секреты Ключа\', \'text\': \'Используйте Дознание. Если это заклинание было разыграно из кладбища, вместо этого используйте Дознание дважды. (Чтобы использовать Дознание, создайте одну фишку бесцветного артефакта Улика со способностью «{2}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: возьмите карту».)\\nВоспоминание {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Пока Сигарда и Сорин сражались, Арлинн и Тефери добыли ключ из катакомб дома Марковых.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b99d6d-eabe-4e53-9a29-0fbba7427baf\', \'multiverseId\': 537367}, \'multiverseid\': 537367}, {\'name\': \'钥匙奥秘\', \'text\': \'探查。如果此咒语是从坟墓场中施放，则改为探查两次。（探查的流程是派出一个无色线索衍生神器，且其具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌。」）\\n返照{3}{U}\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'趁着席嘉妲和索霖交锋时，雅琳和泰菲力趁机从马可夫家墓穴中取回了钥匙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed6bf66-3372-4b81-adf4-e04264aa2bac\', \'multiverseId\': 537683}, \'multiverseid\': 537683}, {\'name\': \'鑰匙奧秘\', \'text\': \'探查。如果此咒語是從墳墓場中施放，則改為探查兩次。（探查的流程是派出一個無色線索衍生神器，且其具有「{2}，犧牲此神器：抽一張牌。」）\\n返照{3}{U}\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'趁著席嘉妲和索霖交鋒時，雅琳和泰菲力趁機從馬可夫家墓穴中取回了鑰匙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9f63be-ef9a-4f02-885b-ff1887a2584f\', \'multiverseId\': 537999}, \'multiverseid\': 537999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geheul der Jagd\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Geheul der Jagd ins Spiel kommt und falls die verzauberte Kreatur ein Wolf oder Werwolf ist, enttappe die Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a07f34-c227-4206-9f63-80659b62e075\', \'multiverseId\': 535292}, \'multiverseid\': 535292}, {\'name\': \'Aullido de la caza\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nCuando el Aullido de la caza entre al campo de batalla, si la criatura encantada es un Lobo o Licántropo, endereza esa criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c0f435-4d17-444e-bc7e-5005ed6f058a\', \'multiverseId\': 535608}, \'multiverseid\': 535608}, {\'name\': \'Hurlement de la chasse\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nQuand le Hurlement de la chasse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si la créature enchantée est un loup ou un loup-garou, dégagez cette créature.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36790787-687b-435d-be4e-96167974ebe0\', \'multiverseId\': 535924}, \'multiverseid\': 535924}, {\'name\': \'Ululato di Caccia\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nQuando l\'Ululato di Caccia entra nel campo di battaglia, se la creatura incantata è un Lupo o un Mannaro, STAPpa quella creatura.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha cautela.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0322b8a3-11e2-44f0-9c03-b27d0f421b65\', \'multiverseId\': 536240}, \'multiverseid\': 536240}, {\'name\': \'狩りの遠吠え\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n狩りの遠吠えが戦場に出たとき、エンチャントしているクリーチャーが狼や狼男である場合、そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123ea05c-edfe-4ef1-a96f-6ab8c1f307d2\', \'multiverseId\': 536556}, \'multiverseid\': 536556}, {\'name\': \'사냥의 울부짖음\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n생물에게 부여\\n사냥의 울부짖음이 전장에 들어올 때, 부여된 생물이 늑대 또는 늑대인간이라면, 그 생물을 언탭한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 경계를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98431d8-1478-43c6-8a49-35f28b8306bf\', \'multiverseId\': 536872}, \'multiverseid\': 536872}, {\'name\': \'Uivo da Caçada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nQuando Uivo da Caçada entrar no campo de batalha, se a criatura encantada for um Lobo ou Lobisomem, desvire aquela criatura.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58256c16-83f5-43d4-ac2f-ee2252f69dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 537188}, \'multiverseid\': 537188}, {\'name\': \'Охотничий Вой\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЗачаровать существо\\nКогда Охотничий Вой выходит на поле битвы, если зачарованное существо является Волком или Вервольфом, разверните то существо.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Бдительность.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a30335-f041-49e7-8ce6-ca72f408f663\', \'multiverseId\': 537504}, \'multiverseid\': 537504}, {\'name\': \'狩猎威嚎\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n当狩猎威嚎进战场时，若所结附的生物是狼或狼人，则重置该生物。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45931112-95e4-4f40-8d6e-66540c1c6487\', \'multiverseId\': 537820}, \'multiverseid\': 537820}, {\'name\': \'狩獵威嚎\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n結附於生物\\n當狩獵威嚎進戰場時，若所結附的生物是狼或狼人，則重置該生物。\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且具有警戒異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea70700d-eb46-4446-a15b-eaddc41b6ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 538136}, \'multiverseid\': 538136}]', "[{'name': 'Geist des Patriziers', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nAndere Geister, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nZaubersprüche, die du aus deinem Friedhof wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist, Ritter', 'flavor': 'Er reitet aufgeregt herum und ruft Dienern, die längst ihren Frieden gefunden haben, Befehle zu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535150&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '346d6e99-d8af-4436-a50d-f2a580e0b33b', 'multiverseId': 535150}, 'multiverseid': 535150}, {'name': 'Geist aristócrata', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLos otros Espíritus que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos desde tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Caballero espíritu', 'flavor': 'Cabalga en círculos inquietos lanzando órdenes a sirvientes que hace años que encontraron el reposo eterno.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535466&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4c4af9a-aaa5-4f86-a502-f1038998dca5', 'multiverseId': 535466}, 'multiverseid': 535466}, {'name': 'Geist patricien', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres esprits que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nLes sorts que vous lancez depuis votre cimetière coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et chevalier', 'flavor': 'Du haut de sa monture, il lance des ordres à des servants qui ont depuis longtemps déjà trouvé la paix.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535782&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c21dacf-85f4-4814-9174-29b50ff0457e', 'multiverseId': 535782}, 'multiverseid': 535782}, {'name': 'Geist Patrizio', 'text': 'Volare\\nGli altri Spiriti che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nLe magie che lanci dal tuo cimitero costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavaliere Spirito', 'flavor': 'Cavalca agitato in cerchio, dando ordini ai servitori che hanno ormai da tempo trovato la pace.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536098&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99d2b4b0-cb00-4951-8640-8881619a6320', 'multiverseId': 536098}, 'multiverseid': 536098}, {'name': '上流階級の霊', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのスピリットは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがあなたの墓地から呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・騎士', 'flavor': '彼は興奮しながらくるくると走り回り、とうの昔に安らぎを得た使用人に向けて命令を叫んでいた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536414&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81924a88-d423-4069-841f-9585e46fdba0', 'multiverseId': 536414}, 'multiverseid': 536414}, {'name': '귀족적인 심령', 'text': '비행\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 신령들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신이 무덤에서 발동하는 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.', 'type': '생물 — 신령 기사', 'flavor': '그는 안절부절못하는 듯이 빙글빙글 돌면서, 오래전에 평화를 찾은 하인들에게 명령을 내린다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536730&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '835c1299-a472-4fa7-af1e-28435b88f5a0', 'multiverseId': 536730}, 'multiverseid': 536730}, {'name': 'Geist Aristocrata', 'text': 'Voar\\nOs outros Espíritos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nAs mágicas que você conjura de seu cemitério custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espírito Cavaleiro', 'flavor': 'Ele cavalga agitado em círculos, dando ordens ríspidas a serviçais que descansam em paz há muito tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537046&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6011e18-c2b2-4e0c-8b8f-83bb4ec433b2', 'multiverseId': 537046}, 'multiverseid': 537046}, {'name': 'Привидение Патриция', 'text': 'Полет\\nДругие Духи под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nРазыгрываемые вами из вашего кладбища заклинания стоят на {1} меньше.', 'type': 'Существо — Дух Рыцарь', 'flavor': 'Он беспокойно скачет кругами, выкрикивая приказы слугам, которые давным-давно обрели покой.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537362&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bfabd88-5a09-4043-a65c-5a3734b87cb9', 'multiverseId': 537362}, 'multiverseid': 537362}, {'name': '显贵游魂', 'text': '飞行\\n由你操控的其他精怪得+1/+1。\\n你从你坟墓场中施放的咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '生物 ～精怪／骑士', 'flavor': '他焦躁不安地骑马踱圈，接连不断向早已安息的仆人发号施令。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537678&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5187d45-19e4-4cf3-922f-2ddb4a4b2267', 'multiverseId': 537678}, 'multiverseid': 537678}, {'name': '顯貴遊魂', 'text': '飛行\\n由你操控的其他精靈得+1/+1。\\n你從你墳墓場中施放的咒語減少{1}來施放。', 'type': '生物 ～精靈／騎士', 'flavor': '他焦躁不安地騎馬踱圈，接連不斷向早已安息的僕人發號施令。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537994&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76fc2274-7004-483f-8da8-5fbaf39d2818', 'multiverseId': 537994}, 'multiverseid': 537994}]", "[{'name': 'Geist des Patriziers', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nAndere Geister, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nZaubersprüche, die du aus deinem Friedhof wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538752&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db8a56de-82b3-4f0a-87d9-5286e8160575', 'multiverseId': 538752}, 'multiverseid': 538752}, {'name': 'Geist aristócrata', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLos otros Espíritus que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos desde tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Caballero espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538812&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61b4d3d1-b32f-422c-a5fc-ed49f28d2f82', 'multiverseId': 538812}, 'multiverseid': 538812}, {'name': 'Geist patricien', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres esprits que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nLes sorts que vous lancez depuis votre cimetière coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538872&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8da9e65-bf13-4c41-815c-5d59f2385687', 'multiverseId': 538872}, 'multiverseid': 538872}, {'name': 'Geist Patrizio', 'text': 'Volare\\nGli altri Spiriti che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nLe magie che lanci dal tuo cimitero costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavaliere Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538932&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1b46e48-909f-41af-9f7c-932715875ffa', 'multiverseId': 538932}, 'multiverseid': 538932}, {'name': '上流階級の霊', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのスピリットは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがあなたの墓地から呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538992&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5abbc59-4d1d-405c-a403-4e814dbf8e32', 'multiverseId': 538992}, 'multiverseid': 538992}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geistflammen-Reservoir\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, lege eine Ladungsmarke auf das Geistflammen-Reservoir.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, entferne eine beliebige Anzahl an Ladungsmarken vom Geistflammen-Reservoir: Es fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535236&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b34255e-5c08-4f6b-9b96-2205c0d68eca\', \'multiverseId\': 535236}, \'multiverseid\': 535236}, {\'name\': \'Depósito de llamas de los geists\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador de carga sobre el Depósito de llamas de los geists.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, remover cualquier cantidad de contadores de carga del Depósito de llamas de los geists: Hace esa misma cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af39d4d4-2f12-4e32-89ec-d8e6f93208ba\', \'multiverseId\': 535552}, \'multiverseid\': 535552}, {\'name\': \'Réservoir de flamme de geist\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur « charge » sur le Réservoir de flamme de geist.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, retirez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs « charge » du Réservoir de flamme de geist : Il inflige autant de blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{1}{R}, {T} : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08dc40f7-3072-4331-aa1b-1b39cf78dc22\', \'multiverseId\': 535868}, \'multiverseid\': 535868}, {\'name\': \'Serbatoio di Geistfiamma\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino carica sul Serbatoio di Geistfiamma.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Rimuovi un qualsiasi numero di segnalini carica dal Serbatoio di Geistfiamma: Infligge altrettanti danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d39e69-8ff3-4399-adfa-84674231e551\', \'multiverseId\': 536184}, \'multiverseid\': 536184}, {\'name\': \'霊炎貯蔵器\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、霊炎貯蔵器の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, 霊炎貯蔵器の上から望む数の蓄積カウンターを取り除く：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに、その個数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{R}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b90cdc-c014-4ae1-b069-2a252f7f2981\', \'multiverseId\': 536500}, \'multiverseid\': 536500}, {\'name\': \'심령화염 저장고\', \'text\': \'당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 심령화염 저장고에 충전 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, 심령화염 저장고에서 충전 카운터를 원하는 수만큼 제거한다: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 심령화염 저장고는 그 목표에게 그 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d6840e4-1c47-4b66-ba20-3abac3b42acf\', \'multiverseId\': 536816}, \'multiverseid\': 536816}, {\'name\': \'Reservatório de Flameogeist\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, coloque um marcador de carga em Reservatório de Flameogeist.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, remova qualquer número de marcadores de carga de Reservatório de Flameogeist: Ele causa aquela quantidade de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac475d22-ed51-4b7c-bab2-4a3d8a63e942\', \'multiverseId\': 537132}, \'multiverseid\': 537132}, {\'name\': \'Сосуд Пламени Привидений\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, положите один жетон заряда на Сосуд Пламени Привидений.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, удалите любое количество жетонов заряда с Сосуда Пламени Привидений: он наносит столько же повреждений любой цели.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688ca780-1f9e-48fc-9a45-9f12a2decb64\', \'multiverseId\': 537448}, \'multiverseid\': 537448}, {\'name\': \'游魂焰贮库\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，在游魂焰贮库上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，从游魂焰贮库上移去任意数量的充电指示物：它对任意一个目标造成等量的伤害。\\n{1}{R}，{T}：放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f19ff8-13d9-46ad-b1e1-7107a1535da2\', \'multiverseId\': 537764}, \'multiverseid\': 537764}, {\'name\': \'遊魂焰貯庫\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，在遊魂焰貯庫上放置一個充電指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，從遊魂焰貯庫上移去任意數量的充電指示物：它對任意一個目標造成等量的傷害。\\n{1}{R}，{T}：放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3795d170-6d81-4066-bb6a-a7ee5af41015\', \'multiverseId\': 538080}, \'multiverseid\': 538080}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geistflammen-Reservoir\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, lege eine Ladungsmarke auf das Geistflammen-Reservoir.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, entferne eine beliebige Anzahl an Ladungsmarken vom Geistflammen-Reservoir: Es fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe05b59-1066-4798-a794-7db30016b82c\', \'multiverseId\': 538771}, \'multiverseid\': 538771}, {\'name\': \'Depósito de llamas de los geists\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador de carga sobre el Depósito de llamas de los geists.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, remover cualquier cantidad de contadores de carga del Depósito de llamas de los geists: Hace esa misma cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc888e44-aaba-4b7a-ae8f-885cada86d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 538831}, \'multiverseid\': 538831}, {\'name\': \'Réservoir de flamme de geist\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur « charge » sur le Réservoir de flamme de geist.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, retirez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs « charge » du Réservoir de flamme de geist : Il inflige autant de blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{1}{R}, {T} : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2a6b46-45a7-4030-84d0-3183be6027b3\', \'multiverseId\': 538891}, \'multiverseid\': 538891}, {\'name\': \'Serbatoio di Geistfiamma\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino carica sul Serbatoio di Geistfiamma.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Rimuovi un qualsiasi numero di segnalini carica dal Serbatoio di Geistfiamma: Infligge altrettanti danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0245e797-884c-4c6b-b935-5ffd98b257d6\', \'multiverseId\': 538951}, \'multiverseid\': 538951}, {\'name\': \'霊炎貯蔵器\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、霊炎貯蔵器の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, 霊炎貯蔵器の上から望む数の蓄積カウンターを取り除く：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに、その個数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{R}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07c87a1d-8ce4-42bd-ad1d-647c1eb48aef\', \'multiverseId\': 539011}, \'multiverseid\': 539011}]', "[{'name': 'Geistschwall', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Falls du die bleibende Karte kontrolliert hast, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Nekro-Alchemisten gewannen während der Wirren an Beliebtheit, als Waffen mit Geist-Antrieb dazu beitrugen, Städte gegen wahnsinnige Kultisten und Eldrazi-Monstrositäten zu verteidigen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535134&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '175954a4-8311-4a1b-8d56-b6ea8dad909b', 'multiverseId': 535134}, 'multiverseid': 535134}, {'name': 'Onda de los geists', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario. Si controlabas ese permanente, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los necroalquimistas se ganaron el apoyo de las masas durante las Penurias, cuando las armas con almas de geists ayudaron a defender las ciudades ante los sectarios locos y las monstruosidades eldrazi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535450&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cdb837c-e06f-4a44-b7db-adc625883cc8', 'multiverseId': 535450}, 'multiverseid': 535450}, {'name': 'Onde-geist', 'text': 'Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire. Si vous contrôliez ce permanent, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les nécro-alchimistes reçurent le soutien de la population pendant les Calamités, lorsque les armes à geist aidèrent à protéger les villages contre les cultistes déments et les monstruosités eldrazi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535766&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '293925e4-927f-4034-a933-f1da9a797a5b', 'multiverseId': 535766}, 'multiverseid': 535766}, {'name': 'Geistraggio', 'text': 'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Se controllavi quel permanente, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I necro-alchimisti divennero popolari durante le Tribolazioni, quando le armi a energia geist permettevano loro di difendere le città dai cultisti impazziti e dalle mostruosità Eldrazi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536082&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd8487ad-d92f-4707-ba09-9371f6337d43', 'multiverseId': 536082}, 'multiverseid': 536082}, {'name': '霊波', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象する。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたがそのパーマネントをコントロールしていたなら、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '大患期に霊を燃料とする武器を使って狂信者やエルドラージの怪物から街を守ったことから屍錬金術師は広く支持されるようになった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536398&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23604a91-a3b4-4105-b40c-8ff772488136', 'multiverseId': 536398}, 'multiverseid': 536398}, {'name': '심령파동', 'text': '대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 그 지속물을 조종했다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '사령연금술사들은 고역을 겪던 기간 동안 유령의 힘이 주입된 무기로 미치광이 광신도들과 엘드라지 괴수들로부터 마을을 지키는 데 도움을 주면서 대중의 지지를 받았다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536714&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe7f92c8-b71e-4cb2-8d9a-2532f0dd704e', 'multiverseId': 536714}, 'multiverseid': 536714}, {'name': 'Onda de Geist', 'text': 'Devolva a permanente alvo não de terreno para a mão de seu dono. Se você controlava aquela permanente, compre um card.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os necroalquimistas ganharam apoio popular durante as Tribulações, quando armas movidas a geist ajudaram a defender as cidades contra os cultistas loucos e as monstruosidades Eldrazi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537030&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '569248f2-f0f3-43aa-b10d-312969c3b1c3', 'multiverseId': 537030}, 'multiverseid': 537030}, {'name': 'Волна Привидений', 'text': 'Верните целевой не являющийся землей перманент в руку его владельца. Если вы контролировали тот перманент, возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Некроалхимики заручились народной поддержкой во время периода Тягостей, когда заряженное привидениями оружие помогало защищать города от безумных культистов и чудовищ-Эльдрази.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537346&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6518f61d-def4-4fe7-88d9-ee93ccaffec7', 'multiverseId': 537346}, 'multiverseid': 537346}, {'name': '游魂波涛', 'text': '将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。如果你操控该永久物，则抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '死灵炼金术士在癫狂劫时期颇具声望。他们会用游魂武器协防城镇，保护民众免遭疯狂教徒与奥札奇恶怪侵扰。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537662&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e7bfee8-f512-496c-975e-88c660d76764', 'multiverseId': 537662}, 'multiverseid': 537662}, {'name': '遊魂波濤', 'text': '將目標非地永久物移回其擁有者手上。如果你操控該永久物，則抽一張牌。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '死靈鍊金術士在癲狂劫時期頗具聲望。他們會用遊魂武器協防城鎮，保護民眾免遭瘋狂教徒與奧札奇惡怪侵擾。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537978&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a38045d0-a3f1-4685-9448-7abc6bbca165', 'multiverseId': 537978}, 'multiverseid': 537978}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gemetzelmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Gemetzelmeisterin ins Spiel kommt, erzeugt jeder Gegner einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Gemetzelmeisterin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Von jedem Getöteten eine grauenhafte Trophäe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f7b1a1-1dde-4a67-b285-0e1f2b28b7ae\', \'multiverseId\': 535213}, \'multiverseid\': 535213}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en masacres\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Especialista en masacres entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Especialista en masacres.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'De cada muerte, un trofeo macabro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa489f5-b49c-4d5d-a8fe-c80943a5f433\', \'multiverseId\': 535529}, \'multiverseid\': 535529}, {\'name\': \'Spécialiste en massacre\', \'text\': "Quand la Spécialiste en massacre arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire crée un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Spécialiste en massacre.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque victime devient un trophée sinistre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462c3f17-11ad-4556-a307-5d028220b9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 535845}, \'multiverseid\': 535845}, {\'name\': \'Specialista del Massacro\', \'text\': \'Quando la Specialista del Massacro entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Specialista del Massacro.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Per ogni uccisione, un macabro trofeo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ecf36ce-941c-4325-b0c6-7079af1c308d\', \'multiverseId\': 536161}, \'multiverseid\': 536161}, {\'name\': \'殺戮の専門家\', \'text\': \'殺戮の専門家が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、殺戮の専門家の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'一人殺すたび、陰惨なトロフィーが増える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600d179b-6b47-4203-aa5c-8215b62003b9\', \'multiverseId\': 536477}, \'multiverseid\': 536477}, {\'name\': \'학살 전문가\', \'text\': \'학살 전문가가 전장에 들어올 때, 각 상대는 1/1 백색 인간 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 학살 전문가에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 전사\', \'flavor\': \'죽일 때마다, 끔찍한 트로피가 생겨난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcae2972-0d94-49ba-8f6c-e31ac14faac5\', \'multiverseId\': 536793}, \'multiverseid\': 536793}, {\'name\': \'Especialista em Matança\', \'text\': \'Quando Especialista em Matança entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente cria uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Especialista em Matança.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'De cada morte, um macabro troféu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799d9b4a-06b2-43eb-9801-6eec6284f41f\', \'multiverseId\': 537109}, \'multiverseid\': 537109}, {\'name\': \'Специалистка по Истреблению\', \'text\': \'Когда Специалистка по Истреблению выходит на поле битвы, каждый оппонент создает одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под контролем оппонента умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Специалистку по Истреблению.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Воин\', \'flavor\': \'От каждого убийства — ужасный трофей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d57391e8-ef1b-4ad1-ae79-00434235789d\', \'multiverseId\': 537425}, \'multiverseid\': 537425}, {\'name\': \'斩杀专家\', \'text\': \'当斩杀专家进战场时，每位对手各派出一个1/1白色人类衍生生物。\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，在斩杀专家上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'每杀一人，就多一件骇人纪念品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7775149-557e-42f0-90b4-fde02499fae4\', \'multiverseId\': 537741}, \'multiverseid\': 537741}, {\'name\': \'斬殺專家\', \'text\': \'當斬殺專家進戰場時，每位對手各派出一個1/1白色人類衍生生物。\\n每當一個由對手操控的生物死去時，在斬殺專家上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'每殺一人，就多一件駭人紀念品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b1ad17-bfdb-49de-95f3-6c298895c618\', \'multiverseId\': 538057}, \'multiverseid\': 538057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gemetzelmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Gemetzelmeisterin ins Spiel kommt, erzeugt jeder Gegner einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Gemetzelmeisterin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4805eb8-6ed9-463b-8acb-f795735a6ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 538765}, \'multiverseid\': 538765}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en masacres\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Especialista en masacres entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Especialista en masacres.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ad7bad-aab1-4a4b-bc9c-e055b6395f2c\', \'multiverseId\': 538825}, \'multiverseid\': 538825}, {\'name\': \'Spécialiste en massacre\', \'text\': "Quand la Spécialiste en massacre arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire crée un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Spécialiste en massacre.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d42a14f-46f3-4723-8f60-dfbed291946c\', \'multiverseId\': 538885}, \'multiverseid\': 538885}, {\'name\': \'Specialista del Massacro\', \'text\': \'Quando la Specialista del Massacro entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Specialista del Massacro.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22f576-82ab-41a5-adbc-b3722b54ddd0\', \'multiverseId\': 538945}, \'multiverseid\': 538945}, {\'name\': \'殺戮の専門家\', \'text\': \'殺戮の専門家が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、殺戮の専門家の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228c51f3-2ca7-48da-b195-27e32bf5e332\', \'multiverseId\': 539005}, \'multiverseid\': 539005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geraubte Lebenskraft\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls es dein Zug ist, verursacht die Kreatur Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges. Anderenfalls erhält sie Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es geht nichts über ein gutes Mahl, um die Stimmung wirklich zu heben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c394826e-858c-4831-9384-9adb5fe778db\', \'multiverseId\': 535259}, \'multiverseid\': 535259}, {\'name\': \'Vitalidad robada\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+1 hasta el final del turno. Si es tu turno, esa criatura gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. De lo contrario, gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay nada mejor que una comilona de muerte para levantar los ánimos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bc2469c-620f-4a72-8ab4-c43eddfc9dec\', \'multiverseId\': 535575}, \'multiverseid\': 535575}, {\'name\': \'Vol de vitalité\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si c\'est votre tour, cette créature acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Sinon, elle acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Rien de tel qu\'un bon repas pour se remonter le moral. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02177923-e32d-4a20-aa38-20273d4b56c1\', \'multiverseId\': 535891}, \'multiverseid\': 535891}, {\'name\': \'Vitalità Rubata\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+1 fino alla fine del turno. Se è il tuo turno, quella creatura ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno. Altrimenti, ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è niente di meglio di un buon pasto per sollevare lo spirito."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164aec54-c6cb-4d1f-b156-72473d2a2a2f\', \'multiverseId\': 536207}, \'multiverseid\': 536207}, {\'name\': \'盗まれた活力\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。あなたのターン中であるなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。そうでないなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「精神を高揚させるには良い食事に勝るものはない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb118dd5-2726-4781-8483-fbb96357bda9\', \'multiverseId\': 536523}, \'multiverseid\': 536523}, {\'name\': \'빼앗긴 활력\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+1을 받는다. 당신의 턴이라면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다. 그렇지 않다면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"기분을 북돋는 데에는 좋은 식사만 한 게 없지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'370e6dd8-6c9c-4c04-a143-dc12a3134a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 536839}, \'multiverseid\': 536839}, {\'name\': \'Vitalidade Roubada\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+1 até o final do turno. Se for o seu turno, aquela criatura ganha atropelar até o final do turno. Caso contrário, ela ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada como uma boa refeição para elevar o espírito."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a1392c-5ad5-4a85-bff8-bbcceb852d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 537155}, \'multiverseid\': 537155}, {\'name\': \'Краденая Живость\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+1 до конца хода. Если идет ваш ход, то существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода. В противном случае оно получает Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтобы повысить бодрость духа, ничто не сравнится с хорошей едой».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c271b3d-3429-41f8-8399-f766e93128e6\', \'multiverseId\': 537471}, \'multiverseid\': 537471}, {\'name\': \'窃取活力\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+1直到回合结束。如果当前是你的回合，则该生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。若否，则它获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「还是饱餐一顿最提神。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b229f30-7842-44ac-be94-ba0e9d2eaff3\', \'multiverseId\': 537787}, \'multiverseid\': 537787}, {\'name\': \'竊取活力\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+3/+1直到回合結束。如果當前是你的回合，則該生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。若否，則它獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「還是飽餐一頓最提神。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe623d75-7236-418c-a27a-b84b155a7efb\', \'multiverseId\': 538103}, \'multiverseid\': 538103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenkte Zeit\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geschenkte Zeit ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis die Geschenkte Zeit das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Teferi schritt ruhig ins Getümmel. Plötzlich hielt die Sonne am Himmel inne, und die knurrenden Gesichter der Werwölfe erstarrten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535075&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee4b605-6ff0-4774-94f0-ec5bb7c949a8\', \'multiverseId\': 535075}, \'multiverseid\': 535075}, {\'name\': \'Tiempo prestado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Tiempo prestado entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que el Tiempo prestado deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Teferi se unió a la batalla con calma. De repente, el sol se detuvo en el cielo y los gruñidos de los licántropos quedaron congelados en sus caras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6f65f77-8372-4140-8332-0a16da21618b\', \'multiverseId\': 535391}, \'multiverseid\': 535391}, {\'name\': \'Sursis\', \'text\': "Quand le Sursis arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que le Sursis quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Téfeiri s\'avança d\'un pas tranquille au cœur du combat. Soudain, la course du soleil dans le ciel s\'interrompit et le rictus des loups-garous se figea.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2806a7d9-3eaf-4a07-8160-01a3b961943a\', \'multiverseId\': 535707}, \'multiverseid\': 535707}, {\'name\': \'Tempo Rubato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tempo Rubato entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché il Tempo Rubato non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Teferi avanzò con calma. Improvvisamente il sole si fermò nel cielo e il ringhio dei mannari si congelò sui loro volti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f6cb3bd-59ab-42f5-8262-12f50137f662\', \'multiverseId\': 536023}, \'multiverseid\': 536023}, {\'name\': \'仮初めの時間\', \'text\': \'仮初めの時間が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。仮初めの時間が戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'テフェリーは平然と戦場に踏み込んだ。すると突如、太陽は宙に留まり、人狼の唸りもその口から動かなくなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7420c1-523b-49f8-888b-f8a36c26ade9\', \'multiverseId\': 536339}, \'multiverseid\': 536339}, {\'name\': \'빌린 시간\', \'text\': \'빌린 시간이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 빌린 시간이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'테페리는 침착하게 싸움 속으로 걸어 들어갔다. 갑자기 태양이 하늘에서 멈췄고 늑대인간들의 으르렁거리는 소리는 그들의 얼굴에서 얼어붙었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58169708-a396-4eb9-bdf9-75e5889945ac\', \'multiverseId\': 536655}, \'multiverseid\': 536655}, {\'name\': \'Tempo Extra\', \'text\': \'Quando Tempo Extra entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo não de terreno que um oponente controla até que Tempo Extra deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Teferi entrou calmamente na briga. Subitamente, o sol parou no céu e os rosnados dos lobisomens congelaram em seus rostos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98184744-26cb-40ee-bf25-863184db289d\', \'multiverseId\': 536971}, \'multiverseid\': 536971}, {\'name\': \'Время Взаймы\', \'text\': \'Когда Время Взаймы выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Время Взаймы не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Тефери спокойно ступил в гущу битвы. Вдруг солнце остановилось в небе и оскал оборотней застыл на их мордах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691d82f6-bf86-4969-bd9b-064df00469de\', \'multiverseId\': 537287}, \'multiverseid\': 537287}, {\'name\': \'暂免危难\', \'text\': \'当暂免危难进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物，直到暂免危难离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'泰菲力平静地踏入战局。空中太阳登时停滞不前，狼人脸上狰狞面容也凝固不动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664af3f0-e181-4117-a91f-33b570aecc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 537603}, \'multiverseid\': 537603}, {\'name\': \'暫免危難\', \'text\': \'當暫免危難進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的非地永久物，直到暫免危難離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'泰菲力平靜地踏入戰局。空中太陽登時停滯不前，狼人臉上猙獰面容也凝固不動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0c4893-8e51-483a-a976-748dd60c94b9\', \'multiverseId\': 537919}, \'multiverseid\': 537919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesegneter Widerstand\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich gehen muss, nehme ich dich mit!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d951ba9a-b02e-435a-a175-3c191b1d5363\', \'multiverseId\': 535074}, \'multiverseid\': 535074}, {\'name\': \'Desafío bendito\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. Cuando esa criatura muera este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Si este es mi fin, morirán conmigo!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5ee26a-5c74-44f8-ba20-2682c14857de\', \'multiverseId\': 535390}, \'multiverseid\': 535390}, {\'name\': \'Défiance bénie\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 et acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Si je dois mourir, je vous emporterai avec moi ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb15c350-0352-4788-a69e-7e10bad5eba8\', \'multiverseId\': 535706}, \'multiverseid\': 535706}, {\'name\': \'Audacia Benedetta\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 e ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se io cado, vi porterò con me!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938a2d04-600b-4d78-9257-095a5798a1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 536022}, \'multiverseid\': 536022}, {\'name\': \'祝福された反抗\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け絆魂を得る。このターンにそのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「どうせ逝くなら、お前らも道連れだ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a7c890-ba1e-4f56-9d2b-c140f03e317c\', \'multiverseId\': 536338}, \'multiverseid\': 536338}, {\'name\': \'축복받은 반항\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 생명연결을 얻는다. 그 생물이 이 턴에 죽을 때, 비행을 가진 1/1 백색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 죽어야 하면, 너도 같이 데려가겠어!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20bf6a2d-4d20-473f-8ed3-adb15364579d\', \'multiverseId\': 536654}, \'multiverseid\': 536654}, {\'name\': \'Desafio Abençoado\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+0 e ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno. Quando aquela criatura morrer neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se eu for, vocês vão comigo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94059fcf-a470-491c-aa98-78aa52c068e5\', \'multiverseId\': 536970}, \'multiverseid\': 536970}, {\'name\': \'Благословенная Дерзость\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 и Цепь жизни до конца хода. Когда то существо умирает в этом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если я и погибну, то возьму тебя с собой!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e070d87-6011-4fb5-b8d2-48056c56ea9b\', \'multiverseId\': 537286}, \'multiverseid\': 537286}, {\'name\': \'受福反抗\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+2/+0且获得系命异能。本回合中，当该生物死去时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我活不了，就带你一起走！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92373c56-8eeb-4f45-9f08-b5ad14b4cdd2\', \'multiverseId\': 537602}, \'multiverseid\': 537602}, {\'name\': \'受福反抗\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+2/+0且獲得繫命異能。本回合中，當該生物死去時，派出一個1/1白色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我活不了，就帶你一起走！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdc10d01-c4fa-4a12-80bb-6e26b8a12852\', \'multiverseId\': 537918}, \'multiverseid\': 537918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Getreue Wiederherstellung\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu, ziehst zwei Karten und wirfst dann zwei Karten ab.\\nRückblende {1}{W}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was geplündert wurde, kann wiederhergestellt werden. Die Kirche lebt in uns weiter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc2ebdb-7e6a-4b4d-a017-82182b8baefc\', \'multiverseId\': 535331}, \'multiverseid\': 535331}, {\'name\': \'Restauración fiel\', \'text\': \'Ganas 2 vidas, robas dos cartas y luego descartas dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{W}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que fue saqueado puede restaurarse. La iglesia sigue viva en nuestro interior".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'652dcc5b-a29f-4cb8-92d5-cff9981a5e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 535647}, \'multiverseid\': 535647}, {\'name\': \'Restauration fidèle\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie, vous piochez deux cartes, puis vous vous défaussez de deux cartes.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui a été pillé peut être restauré. L\'église perdure en nous. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535963&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f9beeaa-ba7d-4c13-bd1a-6d498e16b4d5\', \'multiverseId\': 535963}, \'multiverseid\': 535963}, {\'name\': \'Riparazione Devota\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita, peschi due carte, poi scarti due carte.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che è stato rubato può essere recuperato. La chiesa vive dentro di noi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07834125-012b-4ad9-a9ba-d2ff634c0564\', \'multiverseId\': 536279}, \'multiverseid\': 536279}, {\'name\': \'信仰の繕い\', \'text\': \'あなたは２点のライフを得て、カード２枚を引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{W}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「略奪されたものはまた戻せる。教会は我々の中で生き続ける。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b80014e-d9bf-425e-a73d-dd7c51104f50\', \'multiverseId\': 536595}, \'multiverseid\': 536595}, {\'name\': \'충실한 수복\', \'text\': \'당신은 생명 2점을 얻고, 카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n회상 {1}{W}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"약탈당한 것은 복구할 수 있습니다. 교회는 우리의 마음 속에서 살아 숨쉽니다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4ccf29-80db-4855-8f36-28be02e4cded\', \'multiverseId\': 536911}, \'multiverseid\': 536911}, {\'name\': \'Cura pela Fé\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida, compra dois cards e depois descarta dois cards.\\nRecapitular {1}{W}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O que foi saqueado pode ser restaurado. A igreja vive dentro de nós."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa4ee08-a100-41c8-9a05-9b1b50b5d269\', \'multiverseId\': 537227}, \'multiverseid\': 537227}, {\'name\': \'Верное Исправление\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 2 жизни, берете две карты, затем сбрасываете две карты.\\nВоспоминание {1}{W}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что было разграблено, может быть восстановлено. Церковь живет внутри нас».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c388d1f2-2178-4905-8150-b6fcf318afec\', \'multiverseId\': 537543}, \'multiverseid\': 537543}, {\'name\': \'虔心修补\', \'text\': \'你获得2点生命，抓两张牌，然后弃两张牌。\\n返照{1}{W}{U}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「遭掠之处可以复原。而教会长存心中。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60d8f41-6167-4279-8cd5-7ab72546c96b\', \'multiverseId\': 537859}, \'multiverseid\': 537859}, {\'name\': \'虔心修補\', \'text\': \'你獲得2點生命，抽兩張牌，然後棄兩張牌。\\n返照{1}{W}{U}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「遭掠之處可以復原。而教會長存心中。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae3c0ad7-fcf0-4a70-ac6b-c02ac3d0a20c\', \'multiverseId\': 538175}, \'multiverseid\': 538175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gezielter Schuss\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als Angriffe durch Werwölfe zunahmen, wurden brutale Waffen, die man seit den Wirren nicht mehr gesehen hatte, entstaubt und eingesetzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1595c7-58ec-4f33-88e0-cae9277e7cb3\', \'multiverseId\': 535278}, \'multiverseid\': 535278}, {\'name\': \'Disparo certero\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno. Hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Puesto que los ataques de los licántropos iban en aumento, se desempolvaron armas brutales que no se veían desde las Penurias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11846a28-bb05-4b96-95ad-daa2d4ad54b4\', \'multiverseId\': 535594}, \'multiverseid\': 535594}, {\'name\': \'Tir dégagé\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Avec l\'augmentation des attaques de loups-garous, des armes brutales inaperçues depuis les Calamités furent dépoussiérées pour reprendre du service.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24cf77f-8aef-4f83-927e-955f81ccc3ea\', \'multiverseId\': 535910}, \'multiverseid\': 535910}, {\'name\': \'Bersaglio Facile\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno. Infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Con l\'aumento degli attacchi di mannari, furono rispolverate e utilizzate armi brutali che non si vedevano dai tempi delle Tribolazioni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'788e0363-a698-460d-bedd-442223b6f12e\', \'multiverseId\': 536226}, \'multiverseid\': 536226}, {\'name\': \'直接射撃\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'人狼の襲撃が増えると、大患期以来使われていなかった粗暴な武器が、埃を払われて使われるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccacf489-e198-425f-beb1-bc1ec59ae31c\', \'multiverseId\': 536542}, \'multiverseid\': 536542}, {\'name\': \'완벽한 발사\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다. 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'늑대인간들의 공격이 증가함에 따라, 고역 이래로는 볼 수 없었던 잔혹한 무기들이 쌓여 있던 먼지를 털어내고 사용되기 시작했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d52482-f0d1-4efc-ad77-3d6cf726efd4\', \'multiverseId\': 536858}, \'multiverseid\': 536858}, {\'name\': \'Tiro Certeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno. Ela causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Com o aumento dos ataques de lobisomens, armas brutais em desuso desde as Tribulações foram desempoeiradas e colocadas em função.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8e43e0-6db6-4770-a84a-ca871e6834a7\', \'multiverseId\': 537174}, \'multiverseid\': 537174}, {\'name\': \'Чистый Выстрел\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 до конца хода. Оно наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Нападения вервольфов происходили все чаще, и суровое оружие, которого не видели со времен Тягостей, достали, отряхнули от пыли и пустили в ход.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28320dd6-96e3-400f-9a6b-95ac7d4ad0fd\', \'multiverseId\': 537490}, \'multiverseid\': 537490}, {\'name\': \'精准一击\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。它对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'随着狼人袭击渐频，癫狂劫后就未见过的强力武器又被取出清洁，重新服役。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61f4855-2d30-4c86-8c7c-006de5ddd953\', \'multiverseId\': 537806}, \'multiverseid\': 537806}, {\'name\': \'精準一擊\', \'text\': \'目標由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。它對目標不由你操控的生物造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'隨著狼人襲擊漸頻，癲狂劫後就未見過的強力武器又被取出清潔，重新服役。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d1e5064-b9a0-4b4e-8576-75aeb53958d1\', \'multiverseId\': 538122}, \'multiverseid\': 538122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gier der Neugeborenen\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger, falls du einen Vampir kontrollierst.\\nDie Gier der Neugeborenen fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt und ihrem Beherrscher 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir verbringen unser gesamtes Dasein damit, der Freude unseres ersten Festmahls nachzujagen."\\n—Anja Falkenrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37566dc8-1d6f-4129-bb27-0e921f00a127\', \'multiverseId\': 535246}, \'multiverseid\': 535246}, {\'name\': \'Goce de neonata\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo si controlas un Vampiro.\\nEl Goce de neonata hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo y 1 punto de daño a su controlador. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Pasamos el resto de nuestra existencia buscando el placer que sentimos con el manjar de la primera noche".\\n—Anje Falkenrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95bb58a5-6a50-44ad-b895-c78f6f530289\', \'multiverseId\': 535562}, \'multiverseid\': 535562}, {\'name\': \'Euphorie de la nouvelle-née\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer si vous contrôlez un vampire.\\nL\'Euphorie de la nouvelle-née inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée et 1 blessure à son contrôleur. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous passons toute notre existence à tenter de revivre la joie de notre premier festin nocturne. »\\n—Anje Falkenrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0345ca30-2482-417e-b839-8fe972ad905f\', \'multiverseId\': 535878}, \'multiverseid\': 535878}, {\'name\': \'Fervore dei Neonati\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata se controlli un Vampiro.\\nIl Fervore dei Neonati infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio e 1 danno al suo controllore. Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Passiamo la nostra intera esistenza in cerca della gioia del nostro primo banchetto notturno."\\n—Anje Falkenrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a908f750-f642-4da4-a4f8-627249a2b07b\', \'multiverseId\': 536194}, \'multiverseid\': 536194}, {\'name\': \'新生子の衝動\', \'text\': \'あなたが吸血鬼をコントロールしているなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。新生子の衝動はそれに１点のダメージ、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーに１点のダメージを与える。カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちは初夜の晩餐に味わった快感を一生涯かけて追い続けるの。」\\n――エインジー・ファルケンラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a4da91-22af-4818-a6e6-1f3b75980ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 536510}, \'multiverseid\': 536510}, {\'name\': \'신생흡혈귀의 기쁨\', \'text\': \'당신이 흡혈귀를 조종한다면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n생물을 목표로 정한다. 신생흡혈귀의 기쁨은 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입히고 그 생물의 조종자에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 첫 밤에 치르는 만찬의 기쁨을 추구하며 전 생애를 보내지."\\n—안지 팔켄라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edff23d-a4ec-4ec6-9d0a-2eea2d5bd695\', \'multiverseId\': 536826}, \'multiverseid\': 536826}, {\'name\': \'Arrebatamento da Neófita\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada se você controla um Vampiro.\\nArrebatamento da Neófita causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo e 1 ponto de dano ao controlador dela. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Passamos toda a nossa existência em busca da alegria do banquete de nossa primeira noite."\\n— Anje Falkenrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d45a465-9b2d-4cb4-af82-3e755babdbbb\', \'multiverseId\': 537142}, \'multiverseid\': 537142}, {\'name\': \'Волнение Новокровки\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше, если вы контролируете Вампира.\\nВолнение Новокровки наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу и 1 повреждение игроку, контролирующему то существо. Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы проводим все наше существование в погоне за радостью нашего первого ночного пиршества».\\n— Анже Фалькенрат\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9987fd2-1c26-4219-9364-4cb7db26e7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 537458}, \'multiverseid\': 537458}, {\'name\': \'稚儿血欲\', \'text\': \'如果你操控吸血鬼，则此咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n稚儿血欲对目标生物造成1点伤害，并对其操控者造成1点伤害。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们存在的意义，便是为了追求首夜盛宴的欢愉。」\\n～安姬伐肯纳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3210446a-54c9-4384-9c57-9f1cea0ffe26\', \'multiverseId\': 537774}, \'multiverseid\': 537774}, {\'name\': \'稚兒血欲\', \'text\': \'如果你操控吸血鬼，則此咒語減少{1}來施放。\\n稚兒血欲對目標生物造成1點傷害，並對其操控者造成1點傷害。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們存在的意義，便是為了追求首夜盛宴的歡愉。」\\n～安姬伐肯納\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbc1201-1eb2-457e-8066-c0bdab53316d\', \'multiverseId\': 538090}, \'multiverseid\': 538090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gisa, glorreiche Erweckerin\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du alle von Gisa, glorreiche Erweckerin, ins Exil geschickten Kreaturenkarten unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie erhalten Verwesung. (Eine Kreatur mit Verwesung kann nicht blocken. Wenn sie angreift, opfere sie am Ende des Kampfes.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c39d0ea-aa47-4378-898c-7751ad87f5c8\', \'multiverseId\': 535190}, \'multiverseid\': 535190}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, resucitadora gloriosa\', \'text\': \'Si una criatura que controla un oponente fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control todas las cartas de criatura exiliadas con Gisa, resucitadora gloriosa. Ganan la habilidad de descomposición. (Una criatura con la habilidad de descomposición no puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4944b06-3161-435f-b3d9-4284cb3c35e9\', \'multiverseId\': 535506}, \'multiverseid\': 535506}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, résurrectrice glorieuse\', \'text\': "Si une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle devait mourir, exilez-la à la place.\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, toutes les cartes de créature exilées par Gisa, résurrectrice glorieuse. Elles acquièrent la décomposition. (Une créature avec la décomposition ne peut pas bloquer. Quand elle attaque, sacrifiez-la à la fin du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21118db4-5313-4a68-83e4-cbb132e03a89\', \'multiverseId\': 535822}, \'multiverseid\': 535822}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, Resuscitatrice Gloriosa\', \'text\': "Se una creatura controllata da un avversario sta per morire, invece esiliala.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo tutte le carte creatura esiliate con Gisa, Resuscitatrice Gloriosa. Hanno decomposto. (Una creatura con decomposto non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4afff6e-8b6f-43e4-a929-e67258977d53\', \'multiverseId\': 536138}, \'multiverseid\': 536138}, {\'name\': \'素晴らしき復活術師、ギサ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、素晴らしき復活術師、ギサによって追放されたすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それらは腐乱を得る。（腐乱を持つクリーチャーではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86617aa4-47fd-4786-a486-2466183c37b2\', \'multiverseId\': 536454}, \'multiverseid\': 536454}, {\'name\': \'영광스러운 시체발굴자, 기샤\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽으려 한다면, 대신 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 영광스러운 시체발굴자, 기샤로 추방된 모든 생물 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 부패를 얻는다. (부패를 가진 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20588495-5a63-4999-99e9-3191e452fdee\', \'multiverseId\': 536770}, \'multiverseid\': 536770}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, Ressuscitadora Gloriosa\', \'text\': \'Se uma criatura que um oponente controla for morrer, em vez disso, exile-a.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque todos os cards de criatura exilados com Gisa, Ressuscitadora Gloriosa, no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Eles ganham decomposto. (Uma criatura com decomposto não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98493365-c380-4805-b335-0756e8b6390b\', \'multiverseId\': 537086}, \'multiverseid\': 537086}, {\'name\': \'Джиза, Славная Оживительница\', \'text\': \'Если существо под контролем оппонента должно умереть, изгоните его вместо этого.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите все изгнанные Джизой, Славной Оживительницей карты существ на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Они получают Трупную гниль. (Существо с Трупной гнилью не может блокировать. Когда оно атакует, пожертвуйте его в конце боя.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ff58309-5595-43b5-a46d-25712c648b24\', \'multiverseId\': 537402}, \'multiverseid\': 537402}, {\'name\': \'荣光复活师基沙\', \'text\': \'如果某个由对手操控的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\\n在你的维持开始时，将所有以荣光复活师基沙放逐的生物牌在你的操控下放进战场。它们获得败朽异能。（具败朽异能的生物不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a8460d-3cf4-4d7b-b5ff-f2e0511f9b70\', \'multiverseId\': 537718}, \'multiverseid\': 537718}, {\'name\': \'榮光復活師基沙\', \'text\': \'如果某個由對手操控的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\\n在你的維持開始時，將所有以榮光復活師基沙放逐的生物牌在你的操控下放進戰場。它們獲得敗朽異能。（具敗朽異能的生物不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e279e919-de43-4413-84c7-ec2375cdc0dc\', \'multiverseId\': 538034}, \'multiverseid\': 538034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gisa, glorreiche Erweckerin\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du alle von Gisa, glorreiche Erweckerin, ins Exil geschickten Kreaturenkarten unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie erhalten Verwesung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4ca4cb-a15e-4383-a121-e661f6281829\', \'multiverseId\': 538510}, \'multiverseid\': 538510}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, resucitadora gloriosa\', \'text\': \'Si una criatura que controla un oponente fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control todas las cartas de criatura exiliadas con Gisa, resucitadora gloriosa. Ganan la habilidad de descomposición.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831b9847-3c2d-4e35-8002-30b03099211f\', \'multiverseId\': 538527}, \'multiverseid\': 538527}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, résurrectrice glorieuse\', \'text\': "Si une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle devait mourir, exilez-la à la place.\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, toutes les cartes de créature exilées par Gisa, résurrectrice glorieuse. Elles acquièrent la décomposition.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b89b12-ab08-4646-92a0-adc428d2d29e\', \'multiverseId\': 538544}, \'multiverseid\': 538544}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, Resuscitatrice Gloriosa\', \'text\': "Se una creatura controllata da un avversario sta per morire, invece esiliala.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo tutte le carte creatura esiliate con Gisa, Resuscitatrice Gloriosa. Hanno decomposto.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c682fd06-ba74-4802-8040-9a43c53bc8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 538561}, \'multiverseid\': 538561}, {\'name\': \'素晴らしき復活術師、ギサ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、素晴らしき復活術師、ギサによって追放されたすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それらは腐乱を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1696e85-a9fc-4573-a6b7-25fe8da551f8\', \'multiverseId\': 538578}, \'multiverseid\': 538578}, {\'name\': \'영광스러운 시체발굴자, 기샤\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽으려 한다면, 대신 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 영광스러운 시체발굴자, 기샤로 추방된 모든 생물 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 부패를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82cc91b5-cfe6-42b8-97a8-82a98429efb0\', \'multiverseId\': 538595}, \'multiverseid\': 538595}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, Ressuscitadora Gloriosa\', \'text\': \'Se uma criatura que um oponente controla for morrer, em vez disso, exile-a.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque todos os cards de criatura exilados com Gisa, Ressuscitadora Gloriosa, no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Eles ganham decomposto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf76205-badd-4ad9-a53f-20c00a7a9981\', \'multiverseId\': 538612}, \'multiverseid\': 538612}, {\'name\': \'Джиза, Славная Оживительница\', \'text\': \'Если существо под контролем оппонента должно умереть, изгоните его вместо этого.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите все изгнанные Джизой, Славной Оживительницей карты существ на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Они получают Трупную гниль.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668d14f5-2fa0-4308-9e24-9e7ce377fda9\', \'multiverseId\': 538629}, \'multiverseid\': 538629}, {\'name\': \'荣光复活师基沙\', \'text\': \'如果某个由对手操控的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\\n在你的维持开始时，将所有以荣光复活师基沙放逐的生物牌在你的操控下放进战场。它们获得败朽异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'578bdd90-a659-4090-9c60-8ca64d9ec4af\', \'multiverseId\': 538646}, \'multiverseid\': 538646}, {\'name\': \'榮光復活師基沙\', \'text\': \'如果某個由對手操控的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\\n在你的維持開始時，將所有以榮光復活師基沙放逐的生物牌在你的操控下放進戰場。它們獲得敗朽異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d71ee32-f849-48fd-ad58-b811dc266c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 538663}, \'multiverseid\': 538663}]', "[{'name': 'Grizzly-Ghul', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Grizzly-Ghul kommt für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie, Bär', 'flavor': 'Die Jäger verbrachten den Abend damit, ihre Beute zu feiern, und den Rest der Nacht damit, vor ihr davonzulaufen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535336&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8513b21-3309-4aca-bc4c-a0585c22e009', 'multiverseId': 535336}, 'multiverseid': 535336}, {'name': 'Oso pardo necrófago', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nEl Oso pardo necrófago entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada criatura que murió este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Oso zombie', 'flavor': 'Los cazadores pasaron la tarde celebrando que lo habían matado, y la noche, huyendo de él.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535652&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '602a6814-afcd-48f6-80e4-1f881b24cdcb', 'multiverseId': 535652}, 'multiverseid': 535652}, {'name': 'Goule grizzli', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nLa Goule grizzli arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque créature qui est morte ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie et ours', 'flavor': 'Les chasseurs passèrent la soirée à célébrer leur gibier et le reste de la nuit à le fuir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535968&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '002f8a70-a3d3-4cb2-a81c-0957c3daefc2', 'multiverseId': 535968}, 'multiverseid': 535968}, {'name': 'Ghoul Grizzly', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nIl Ghoul Grizzly entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni creatura morta in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Orso Zombie', 'flavor': 'I cacciatori passarono la serata a festeggiare la loro preda e la notte a fuggire da essa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536284&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c48aea0f-c540-4ba3-8b84-3ecb27d32c7a', 'multiverseId': 536284}, 'multiverseid': 536284}, {'name': '灰色熊のグール', 'text': 'トランプル\\n灰色熊のグールは、このターンに死亡したクリーチャー１体につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・熊', 'flavor': '狩人たちはその夕方、収穫を祝った。その後、一晩中その収穫から逃げた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536600&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '586b7378-8659-4f18-b52c-3eb91f9f14d0', 'multiverseId': 536600}, 'multiverseid': 536600}, {'name': '회색곰 악귀', 'text': '돌진\\n회색곰 악귀는 이 턴에 죽은 생물 한 개당 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '생물 — 좀비 곰', 'flavor': '사냥꾼들은 그들이 죽인 것을 축하하며 저녁 시간을 보냈고 그것에게서 도망치면서 나머지 밤 시간을 보냈다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536916&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd88c9e78-9668-4ca1-b967-484d34128e08', 'multiverseId': 536916}, 'multiverseid': 536916}, {'name': 'Carniçal Pardo', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nCarniçal Pardo entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada criatura que morreu neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi Urso', 'flavor': 'Os caçadores passaram a noite celebrando o abate e a madrugada fugindo dele.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537232&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06626971-c1a1-4fea-b10f-0e729926ea32', 'multiverseId': 537232}, 'multiverseid': 537232}, {'name': 'Медвежий Упырь', 'text': 'Пробивной удар\\nМедвежий Упырь выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем за каждое существо, умершее в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Существо — Зомби Медведь', 'flavor': 'Охотники провели вечер, отмечая добычу, а остаток ночи спасались от нее бегством.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537548&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9128b4c-fedc-4021-9a03-89036d61433f', 'multiverseId': 537548}, 'multiverseid': 537548}, {'name': '灰尸熊', 'text': '践踏\\n灰尸熊进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于本回合中死去的生物数量。', 'type': '生物 ～灵俑／熊', 'flavor': '猎人傍晚还在为狩猎庆功，之后整晚都被所猎之物追捕、疲于奔命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537864&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b24767bc-8bff-4724-8a1b-6dd921ef1f1a', 'multiverseId': 537864}, 'multiverseid': 537864}, {'name': '灰屍熊', 'text': '踐踏\\n灰屍熊進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於本回合中死去的生物數量。', 'type': '生物 ～殭屍／熊', 'flavor': '獵人傍晚還在為狩獵慶功，之後整晚都被所獵之物追捕、疲於奔命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538180&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df823f9a-244b-4415-b913-42de695c495c', 'multiverseId': 538180}, 'multiverseid': 538180}]", '[{\'name\': \'Große Verlockung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält „Falls diese Kreatur sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil."\\nRückblende {3}{W}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod ist kein Grund, aufs Abendessen zu verzichten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aeed79f-5b6b-42c0-89aa-53072bdfb7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 535321}, \'multiverseid\': 535321}, {\'name\': \'Compromiso ineludible\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana "Si esta criatura fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala".\\nRetrospectiva {3}{W}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La muerte no es excusa para saltarse la cena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97e3a872-ee28-43fb-a097-06e0f981ff18\', \'multiverseId\': 535637}, \'multiverseid\': 535637}, {\'name\': \'Irrésistible\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. Elle acquiert « Si cette créature devait mourir, exilez-la à la place. »\\nFlashback {3}{W}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La mort n\'est pas une excuse pour ne pas dîner.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535953&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bc02ee4-3948-4520-ad44-61c9c18c2069\', \'multiverseId\': 535953}, \'multiverseid\': 535953}, {\'name\': \'Impossibile Resistere\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero. Ha "Se questa creatura sta per morire, invece esiliala".\\nFlashback {3}{W}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La morte non è una scusa per saltare la cena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14a553b-12f3-478d-a769-52421258f57e\', \'multiverseId\': 536269}, \'multiverseid\': 536269}, {\'name\': \'未練残り\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。それは「このクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにこれを追放する。」を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{W}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死すら夕食の妨げにはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a27bd448-6fef-493d-921a-5e7f71b2c5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 536585}, \'multiverseid\': 536585}, {\'name\': \'거부는 불가능\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 마나 값이 3 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다. 그 생물은 "이 생물이 죽으려고 하면, 대신 이 생물을 추방한다."를 얻는다.\\n회상 {3}{W}{B} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'죽음은 저녁 식사에 장애물이 되지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a7c01aa-063a-4cd9-8478-b0decd66a04d\', \'multiverseId\': 536901}, \'multiverseid\': 536901}, {\'name\': \'Irresistível\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha "Se esta criatura morreria, em vez disso, exile-a".\\nRecapitular {3}{W}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A morte não é uma desculpa para pular o jantar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e723dce-66d5-4aa5-b551-df109b9b7c4b\', \'multiverseId\': 537217}, \'multiverseid\': 537217}, {\'name\': \'Невозможно Удержаться\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа с мановой ценностью не более 3 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Она получает способность «Если это существо должно умереть, изгоните его вместо этого».\\nВоспоминание {3}{W}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Смерть — не препятствие для ужина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e82ef9a-88a7-4eed-84f3-b390af12ba9e\', \'multiverseId\': 537533}, \'multiverseid\': 537533}, {\'name\': \'难以抗拒\', \'text\': \'将目标法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得「如果此生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。」\\n返照{3}{W}{B}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'死亡不妨碍进食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4747e4c5-8878-4ec0-ba62-e4e8c8cf432f\', \'multiverseId\': 537849}, \'multiverseid\': 537849}, {\'name\': \'難以抗拒\', \'text\': \'將目標魔法力值等於或小於3的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。它獲得「如果此生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。」\\n返照{3}{W}{B}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'死亡不妨礙進食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7a0c494-fb12-43d2-8bb9-e38acead6657\', \'multiverseId\': 538165}, \'multiverseid\': 538165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Große Verlockung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält „Falls diese Kreatur sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil."\\nRückblende {3}{W}{B}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17493098-c2c8-46e0-8788-3cd593c9d153\', \'multiverseId\': 538785}, \'multiverseid\': 538785}, {\'name\': \'Compromiso ineludible\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana "Si esta criatura fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala".\\nRetrospectiva {3}{W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68aeb677-10a5-4d11-aea7-9bc14724ae03\', \'multiverseId\': 538845}, \'multiverseid\': 538845}, {\'name\': \'Irrésistible\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. Elle acquiert « Si cette créature devait mourir, exilez-la à la place. »\\nFlashback {3}{W}{B}\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d96f5f-9837-46e4-9d00-4cf804abd9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 538905}, \'multiverseid\': 538905}, {\'name\': \'Impossibile Resistere\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero. Ha "Se questa creatura sta per morire, invece esiliala".\\nFlashback {3}{W}{B}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ead4957-3d0e-4e70-9398-c1c9ee776068\', \'multiverseId\': 538965}, \'multiverseid\': 538965}, {\'name\': \'未練残り\', \'text\': \'• あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。それは「このクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにこれを追放する。」を得る。\\nフラッシュバック {3}{W}{B}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ada5188-f515-4ddd-8c00-f969a2dd5722\', \'multiverseId\': 539025}, \'multiverseid\': 539025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grubenkämpferin aus Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, wirf eine Karte ab, opfere einen Vampir: Ziehe zwei Karten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'In der Arena verzichten Vampire darauf, Ehre oder Zivilisiertheit vorzutäuschen, und kämpfen wie die Raubtiere, als die sie selbst sich kennen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535229&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d6c36b-2b76-479d-a189-9813059f4f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 535229}, \'multiverseid\': 535229}, {\'name\': \'Luchadora del foso de Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, descartar una carta, sacrificar un Vampiro: Roba dos cartas. Activa esto solo si un oponente perdió vidas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'En la arena, los vampiros dejan de lado toda pretensión de honor o civilización y luchan como los depredadores que son.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60966c48-f80c-4e7c-95d2-4daa88d139d2\', \'multiverseId\': 535545}, \'multiverseid\': 535545}, {\'name\': \'Combattante Falkenrath\', \'text\': "{1}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte, sacrifiez un vampire : Piochez deux cartes. N\'activez que si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Dans l\'arène, les vampires oubliaient tout simulacre d\'honneur ou de civilisation pour se battre tels les prédateurs qu\'ils avaient conscience d\'être.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524bc99e-9dd9-4da3-8a0b-eb9deca11bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 535861}, \'multiverseid\': 535861}, {\'name\': "Combattente dell\'Arena Falkenrath", \'text\': \'{1}{R}, Scarta una carta, Sacrifica un Vampiro: Pesca due carte. Attiva solo se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': "Nell\'arena, i vampiri mettono da parte ogni pretesa di onore o civiltà e combattono come i predatori che sanno di essere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be48ad12-c630-4371-b8b4-e4e31d654483\', \'multiverseId\': 536177}, \'multiverseid\': 536177}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの闘技士\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, カード１枚を捨てる, 吸血鬼１体を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。対戦相手がこのターンにライフを失っていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'闘技場では、誇りや文化的装いなどすべて捨て、本質的な捕食者として闘いに挑む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39075847-4797-4324-9f42-f7ccff2c799c\', \'multiverseId\': 536493}, \'multiverseid\': 536493}, {\'name\': \'팔켄라스 투기장 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, 카드 한 장을 버린다, 흡혈귀 한 개를 희생한다: 카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 이 턴에 생명점을 잃은 상대가 있는 경우에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 전사\', \'flavor\': \'투기장에서, 흡혈귀들은 명예나 문명 같은 겉치레를 제껴두고 자신들의 원래 모습이라고 생각하는 포식자처럼 싸운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc62389-7f55-408b-acff-6fc2d64834e8\', \'multiverseId\': 536809}, \'multiverseid\': 536809}, {\'name\': \'Lutadora da Liça Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, descarte um card, sacrifique um Vampiro: Compre dois cards. Ative somente se um oponente tiver perdido pontos de vida neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Na arena, os vampiros deixam de lado a fachada de honra e civilidade e lutam como os predadores que sabem que são.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f10deb-383c-4904-b14f-75a9079aa8f6\', \'multiverseId\': 537125}, \'multiverseid\': 537125}, {\'name\': \'Фалькенратская Гладиаторша\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, сбросьте карту, пожертвуйте Вампира: возьмите две карты. Активируйте, только если оппонент терял жизнь в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Воин\', \'flavor\': \'На арене вампиры отбрасывают все свое притворное благородство и цивилизованность и сражаются, как хищники, какими себя осознают.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7deaf65-3abf-467c-ab06-f68fc3789c66\', \'multiverseId\': 537441}, \'multiverseid\': 537441}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳死斗士\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，弃一张牌，牺牲一个吸血鬼：抓两张牌。只能于有对手失去过生命的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在斗技场中，吸血鬼撕下所有荣誉和斯文的伪装，像潜藏在心底深处的捕食者一般搏斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c015af-2cab-480b-b213-1b4c4ff6680e\', \'multiverseId\': 537757}, \'multiverseid\': 537757}, {\'name\': \'伐肯納死鬥士\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，棄一張牌，犧牲一個吸血鬼：抽兩張牌。只能於有對手失去過生命的回合中起動。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'在鬥技場中，吸血鬼撕下所有榮譽和斯文的偽裝，像潛藏在心底深處的捕食者一般搏鬥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b99b2f57-a373-4e9e-bbd3-fec39cb5eed1\', \'multiverseId\': 538073}, \'multiverseid\': 538073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grubenkämpferin aus Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, wirf eine Karte ab, opfere einen Vampir: Ziehe zwei Karten. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c146e6-0344-46c6-8f84-f78cd891477b\', \'multiverseId\': 538770}, \'multiverseid\': 538770}, {\'name\': \'Luchadora del foso de Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, descartar una carta, sacrificar un Vampiro: Roba dos cartas. Activa esto solo si un oponente perdió vidas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be92564-16fb-4ae7-aa93-a33c71da525a\', \'multiverseId\': 538830}, \'multiverseid\': 538830}, {\'name\': \'Combattante Falkenrath\', \'text\': "{1}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte, sacrifiez un vampire : Piochez deux cartes. N\'activez que si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f46abfe0-6038-45fb-a368-fe5dd5f65dcf\', \'multiverseId\': 538890}, \'multiverseid\': 538890}, {\'name\': "Combattente dell\'Arena Falkenrath", \'text\': \'{1}{R}, Scarta una carta, Sacrifica un Vampiro: Pesca due carte. Attiva solo se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea0faba-52a8-4ea5-b3b6-3eecc942678d\', \'multiverseId\': 538950}, \'multiverseid\': 538950}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの闘技士\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, カード１枚を捨てる, 吸血鬼１体を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。対戦相手がこのターンにライフを失っていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c607d2d4-9510-4195-b923-db0f64e1f885\', \'multiverseId\': 539010}, \'multiverseid\': 539010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hauptmann des Suchtrupps\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die du in diesem Zug als Angreifer deklariert hast, {1} weniger.\\nWenn der Hauptmann des Suchtrupps ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Werwölfe hinterlassen deutliche Spuren. Leicht zu verfolgen. Schwer zu vergessen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'464f423c-c726-4417-a5f6-26d52befb718\', \'multiverseId\': 535106}, \'multiverseid\': 535106}, {\'name\': \'Capitán del equipo de búsqueda\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura con la que atacaste este turno.\\nCuando el Capitán del equipo de búsqueda entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los licántropos dejan rastros turbulentos. Son fáciles de seguir, pero difíciles de olvidar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f6af1df-2d8d-484b-ab91-79b601bcb0f6\', \'multiverseId\': 535422}, \'multiverseid\': 535422}, {\'name\': "Capitaine de l\'équipe de recherche", \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature avec laquelle vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci.\\nQuand le Capitaine de l\'équipe de recherche arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Les loups-garous laissent des pistes répugnantes. Faciles à suivre. Difficiles à oublier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a881d2d-5074-4506-8740-a7fa5a4b27b2\', \'multiverseId\': 535738}, \'multiverseid\': 535738}, {\'name\': \'Capitano della Squadra di Ricerca\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura con cui hai attaccato in questo turno.\\nQuando il Capitano della Squadra di Ricerca entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I mannari lasciano tracce disordinate. Facili da seguire. Difficili da dimenticare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78af49f4-bb11-44d0-944f-557ad4d1d909\', \'multiverseId\': 536054}, \'multiverseid\': 536054}, {\'name\': \'捜索隊の隊長\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンにあなたが攻撃させたクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n捜索隊の隊長が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「人狼は乱雑な手掛かりを残す。追跡しやすいが、なかなか忘れる事ができない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ed6e0f-ea08-4313-9016-66de467fc5c5\', \'multiverseId\': 536370}, \'multiverseid\': 536370}, {\'name\': \'수색대 대장\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신이 이 턴에 공격한 각 생물마다 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n수색대 대장이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"늑대인간들은 지저분한 흔적을 남기지. 추적하기는 쉬워. 기억에서 지우기는 어렵고."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c6d47f-238a-4cba-bf38-8381ad63769f\', \'multiverseId\': 536686}, \'multiverseid\': 536686}, {\'name\': \'Capitão do Grupo de Busca\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura com que você tenha atacado neste turno.\\nQuando Capitão do Grupo de Busca entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lobisomens deixam rastros caóticos. Fáceis de seguir. Difíceis de esquecer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e742f2ff-8cca-437e-a968-b926d8a07643\', \'multiverseId\': 537002}, \'multiverseid\': 537002}, {\'name\': \'Капитан Искателей\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше за каждое существо, которым вы атаковали в этом ходу.\\nКогда Капитан Искателей выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Вервольфы оставляют грязные следы. По ним легко идти. Но сложно забыть».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8990965a-facc-4416-a768-dff6450fecae\', \'multiverseId\': 537318}, \'multiverseid\': 537318}, {\'name\': \'搜救队长\', \'text\': \'本回合中你每以一个生物攻击过，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n当搜救队长进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「狼人所到之处必留下混乱痕迹。这虽然方便追踪他们，但破坏惨状难以忘怀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a0b262-81ba-4923-aa0b-7c4d651d9ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 537634}, \'multiverseid\': 537634}, {\'name\': \'搜救隊長\', \'text\': \'本回合中你每以一個生物攻擊過，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\\n當搜救隊長進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「狼人所到之處必留下混亂痕跡。這雖然方便追蹤他們，但破壞慘狀難以忘懷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55626650-edd7-4f05-9c08-8c0c9df91312\', \'multiverseId\': 537950}, \'multiverseid\': 537950}]', "[{'name': 'Heilige Ruhepause', 'text': 'Schicke eine nichtlegendäre Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Falls sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. Anderenfalls tappe sie.\\nRückblende {1}{W}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535337&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cf8449d-4067-458e-85c0-327a02632ce2', 'multiverseId': 535337}, 'multiverseid': 535337}, {'name': 'Descanso consagrado', 'text': 'Exilia la criatura objetivo que no sea legendaria, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Si entró bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. De lo contrario, gírala.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{W}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535653&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afa21694-d2b6-414d-86f6-6011c15cb48a', 'multiverseId': 535653}, 'multiverseid': 535653}, {'name': 'Repos sacré', 'text': 'Exilez une créature non-légendaire ciblée, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Si elle est arrivée sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Sinon, engagez-la.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e3435a-c080-4aab-a43a-fb85df6dcea1', 'multiverseId': 535969}, 'multiverseid': 535969}, {'name': 'Sacro Riposo', 'text': 'Esilia una creatura non leggendaria bersaglio, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Se è entrata sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Altrimenti, TAPpala.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536285&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab20a597-65a5-457a-b759-a64f5d7e5e82', 'multiverseId': 536285}, 'multiverseid': 536285}, {'name': '神聖なる休止', 'text': '伝説でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。そうでないなら、それをタップする。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{W}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536601&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81ec3a43-5419-4862-9390-0435291263f5', 'multiverseId': 536601}, 'multiverseid': 536601}, {'name': '신성한 유예', 'text': '전설이 아닌 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다. 그 생물이 당신의 조종하에 들어왔다면, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그렇지 않다면, 그 생물을 탭한다.\\n회상 {1}{W}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536917&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd06d4647-cdc0-4e62-9c52-1586557f859c', 'multiverseId': 536917}, 'multiverseid': 536917}, {'name': 'Descanso Sagrado', 'text': 'Exile a criatura não lendária alvo e, em seguida, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono. Se ela entrar sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela. Caso contrário, vire-a.\\nRecapitular {1}{W}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537233&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb4f771a-206f-4528-9f41-684398c69ec6', 'multiverseId': 537233}, 'multiverseid': 537233}, {'name': 'Священная Передышка', 'text': 'Изгоните целевое нелегендарное существо, затем верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца. Если оно вышло на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите на него один жетон +1/+1. В противном случае поверните его.\\nВоспоминание {1}{W}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537549&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '136ec27f-7e94-4d1b-b0d9-037517790169', 'multiverseId': 537549}, 'multiverseid': 537549}, {'name': '神佑暂息', 'text': '放逐目标非传奇的生物，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。如果它是在你的操控下进战场，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。若否，则将之横置。\\n返照{1}{W}{U}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537865&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21ae6797-206e-41e7-816d-fa0f78da9775', 'multiverseId': 537865}, 'multiverseid': 537865}, {'name': '神祐暫息', 'text': '放逐目標非傳奇的生物，然後將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。如果它是在你的操控下進戰場，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。若否，則將之橫置。\\n返照{1}{W}{U}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538181&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8df22b58-22d6-4839-8cd8-232937e5ec0b', 'multiverseId': 538181}, 'multiverseid': 538181}]", "[{'name': 'Heilige Ruhepause', 'text': 'Schicke eine nichtlegendäre Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Falls sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. Anderenfalls tappe sie.\\nRückblende {1}{W}{U}', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538790&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a677902-f7a1-46bf-8e1d-0f7f0479c213', 'multiverseId': 538790}, 'multiverseid': 538790}, {'name': 'Descanso consagrado', 'text': 'Exilia la criatura objetivo que no sea legendaria, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Si entró bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. De lo contrario, gírala.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{W}{U}.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538850&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b547151-28c4-4c9f-b0a1-bc5079d91317', 'multiverseId': 538850}, 'multiverseid': 538850}, {'name': 'Repos sacré', 'text': 'Exilez une créature non-légendaire ciblée, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Si elle est arrivée sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Sinon, engagez-la.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U}', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538910&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c2e916b-56a3-4339-9a3e-a95439a322f9', 'multiverseId': 538910}, 'multiverseid': 538910}, {'name': 'Sacro Riposo', 'text': 'Esilia una creatura non leggendaria bersaglio, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Se è entrata sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Altrimenti, TAPpala.\\nFlashback {1}{W}{U}', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538970&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e29b1a8d-29f1-4551-83ba-eedcd8b4bb2a', 'multiverseId': 538970}, 'multiverseid': 538970}, {'name': '神聖なる休止', 'text': '伝説でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。そうでないなら、それをタップする。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{W}{U}', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539030&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '052e58a4-5b85-40d2-8553-ffff6485ce2b', 'multiverseId': 539030}, 'multiverseid': 539030}]", '[{\'name\': \'Heiliges Feuer\', \'text\': \'Das Heilige Feuer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nRückblende {4}{R}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Verwechsle nicht Gerechtigkeit mit Gnade."\\n—Odric, Orden von Sankt Traft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e87202f4-4fc2-47ef-b424-bef9abfe68a2\', \'multiverseId\': 535351}, \'multiverseid\': 535351}, {\'name\': \'Fuego sagrado\', \'text\': \'El Fuego sagrado hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú ganas 2 vidas.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{R}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No confundas la justicia con la misericordia".\\n—Odric, Orden de San Traft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f130c34-3983-4b2d-9a5c-f67cc537d1d7\', \'multiverseId\': 535667}, \'multiverseid\': 535667}, {\'name\': \'Feu sacré\', \'text\': "Le Feu sacré inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nFlashback {4}{R}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne confondez pas justice et pitié. »\\n—Odric, Ordre de Saint Traft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535983&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa9d5fc9-1a5f-46fd-a3b0-ee201b00d1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 535983}, \'multiverseid\': 535983}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Sacro\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Sacro infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nFlashback {4}{R}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non confondere la giustizia con la pietà."\\n—Odric, Ordine di San Traft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa7fe3ef-d955-438c-a924-64a44d7f150a\', \'multiverseId\': 536299}, \'multiverseid\': 536299}, {\'name\': \'聖なる火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。聖なる火はそれに２点のダメージを与え、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{R}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「正義と慈悲を混同してはいけない。」\\n――聖トラフト騎士団のオドリック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a088124-92b2-447c-bd11-563e29325dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 536615}, \'multiverseid\': 536615}, {\'name\': \'신성한 불꽃\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 신성한 불꽃은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입히고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n회상 {4}{R}{W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"정의를 자비와 혼동하지 마라."\\n—성 트라프트 교단의 오드릭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f49b3d-78cc-4b0e-9a52-fb75a5f1e4f0\', \'multiverseId\': 536931}, \'multiverseid\': 536931}, {\'name\': \'Fogo Sagrado\', \'text\': \'Fogo Sagrado causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nRecapitular {4}{R}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não confunda justiça com misericórdia."\\n— Odric, da Ordem de Santo Traft\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561a5a85-29f1-4780-bdc0-553ebc034c56\', \'multiverseId\': 537247}, \'multiverseid\': 537247}, {\'name\': \'Священный Огонь\', \'text\': \'Священный Огонь наносит 2 повреждения любой цели, а вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nВоспоминание {4}{R}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Не путайте правосудие с милосердием».\\n— Одрик из Ордена святого Трафта\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eff44d9-4891-4057-8272-f1f4d2b9ce23\', \'multiverseId\': 537563}, \'multiverseid\': 537563}, {\'name\': \'圣洁火焰\', \'text\': \'圣洁火焰对任意一个目标造成2点伤害，且你获得2点生命。\\n返照{4}{R}{W}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「切勿将正义与怜悯混为一谈。」\\n～圣沙弗骑士团的欧吉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdf48a4-185b-4629-a1c0-f331c9c42d17\', \'multiverseId\': 537879}, \'multiverseid\': 537879}, {\'name\': \'聖潔火焰\', \'text\': \'聖潔火焰對任意一個目標造成2點傷害，且你獲得2點生命。\\n返照{4}{R}{W}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「切勿將正義與憐憫混為一談。」\\n～聖沙弗騎士團的歐吉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fa1f216-1c6b-4654-845f-bc3fb18061cf\', \'multiverseId\': 538195}, \'multiverseid\': 538195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heiligmacherin des Celestus\', \'text\': \'Falls es weder Tag noch Nacht ist, wird es Tag, sowie die Heiligmacherin des Celestus ins Spiel kommt.\\nImmer wenn der Tag zur Nacht oder die Nacht zum Tag wird, schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege eine davon auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02521fd6-b7f1-4d5e-9863-9752734e677e\', \'multiverseId\': 535082}, \'multiverseid\': 535082}, {\'name\': \'Santificadora del Celestus\', \'text\': \'Si no es ni de día ni de noche, se hace de día en cuanto la Santificadora del Celestus entre al campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que se pase del día a la noche o de la noche al día, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce87837-2a84-4038-85be-efa2f2ae0db8\', \'multiverseId\': 535398}, \'multiverseid\': 535398}, {\'name\': \'Sanctificatrice du Celestus\', \'text\': "Si ce n\'est ni le jour ni la nuit, on passe au jour au moment où la Sanctificatrice du Celestus arrive sur le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'on passe du jour à la nuit ou de la nuit au jour, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d7a2c9b-554d-4ac8-aceb-ecf77fc17853\', \'multiverseId\': 535714}, \'multiverseid\': 535714}, {\'name\': \'Consacratrice del Celestus\', \'text\': \'Se non è né giorno né notte, diventa giorno mentre la Consacratrice del Celestus entra nel campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il giorno diventa notte o la notte diventa giorno, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Mettine una nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db97d999-1f9c-47e1-beab-45ce240744ef\', \'multiverseId\': 536030}, \'multiverseid\': 536030}, {\'name\': \'セレスタスの奉納者\', \'text\': \'セレスタスの奉納者が戦場に出るに際し、昼でも夜でもないなら、昼になる。\\n昼が夜になるか夜が昼になるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見る。それらのうち１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08bd4b5-5b64-42eb-8156-257384eaa527\', \'multiverseId\': 536346}, \'multiverseid\': 536346}, {\'name\': \'셀레스투스 성역화술사\', \'text\': \'낮도 밤도 아니라면, 셀레스투스 성역화술사가 전장에 들어오면서 낮이 된다.\\n낮이 밤이 되거나 밤이 낮이 될 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 무덤에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3691a0c1-92f7-4b49-b625-75151b982edb\', \'multiverseId\': 536662}, \'multiverseid\': 536662}, {\'name\': \'Santificadora do Celestus\', \'text\': \'Se não for dia nem noite, torna-se dia conforme Santificadora do Celestus entra no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que o dia se tornar noite ou a noite se tornar dia, olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123529d0-b278-4b61-b1d0-509bc71fb0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 536978}, \'multiverseid\': 536978}, {\'name\': \'Святительница Целестуса\', \'text\': \'Если не стоит ни день, ни ночь, то при выходе Святительницы Целестуса на поле битвы наступает день.\\nКаждый раз, когда день становится ночью или ночь становится днем, посмотрите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adead74d-39df-4fbb-8415-23dd6ce2402c\', \'multiverseId\': 537294}, \'multiverseid\': 537294}, {\'name\': \'穹天祝圣僧\', \'text\': \'如果当前既非白昼也非黑夜，则于穹天祝圣僧进战场时成为白昼。\\n每当白昼成为黑夜或黑夜成为白昼时，检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中一张置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a3a4a31-242a-4c25-8ba7-a765a03627cf\', \'multiverseId\': 537610}, \'multiverseid\': 537610}, {\'name\': \'穹天祝聖僧\', \'text\': \'如果當前既非白晝也非黑夜，則於穹天祝聖僧進戰場時成為白晝。\\n每當白晝成為黑夜或黑夜成為白晝時，檢視你牌庫頂的兩張牌。將其中一張置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c1bcb9-4729-43b1-bc6b-bfbbac6508dd\', \'multiverseId\': 537926}, \'multiverseid\': 537926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heißblütige Elementalistin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Heißblütige Elementalistin ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Während die Morgenlicht-Hexen ihre Magie auf Natur und Gemeinschaft fokussieren, sind andere Hexenzirkel mit Teufeln im Bunde und verdrehen die Elemente nach ihrem Willen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b829719-d348-4088-bf9f-95ce4ace6c37\', \'multiverseId\': 535220}, \'multiverseid\': 535220}, {\'name\': \'Elementalista ardiente\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Elementalista ardiente entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las brujas de las Ciervas del Alba centran su magia en la naturaleza y la comunidad, pero otros aquelarres tratan con diablos y manipulan los elementos a su antojo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85648875-ff60-481c-83fa-48869dfeb7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 535536}, \'multiverseid\': 535536}, {\'name\': \'Élémentaliste ardente\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Élémentaliste ardente arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que les envoûteuses de Cerf-orient concentrent leur magie sur la nature et la communauté, d\'autres cercles pactisent avec des démons et plient les éléments à leur volonté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30561430-5960-4fe1-90ce-912c483443e5\', \'multiverseId\': 535852}, \'multiverseid\': 535852}, {\'name\': \'Elementalista Ardente\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elementalista Ardente entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre le streghe Albacorno incanalano la propria magia sulla natura e sulla comunità, altre congreghe fraternizzano con i diavoli e piegano gli elementi al loro volere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8984dfb-d36c-4f35-96b8-cf169040153e\', \'multiverseId\': 536168}, \'multiverseid\': 536168}, {\'name\': \'献身的な精霊術士\', \'text\': \'献身的な精霊術士が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'ドーンハルトの魔女が自然や交流に魔法を使う一方、その他の集会は悪魔と交信して精霊を意のままに捻じ曲げる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567755ce-038e-46e0-9010-0dac4144b225\', \'multiverseId\': 536484}, \'multiverseid\': 536484}, {\'name\': \'열정적인 원소술사\', \'text\': \'열정적인 원소술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'새벽수사슴 마녀들이 자연과 공동체에 대한 마법에 집중하는 한편, 다른 마녀 집회들은 악령들과 어울리며 마음 내키는 대로 원소들을 비튼다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d364e294-96b4-4a2e-91c9-5ed91f20d04d\', \'multiverseId\': 536800}, \'multiverseid\': 536800}, {\'name\': \'Elementalista Ardente\', \'text\': \'Quando Elementalista Ardente entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto as bruxas do Cervo da Aurora concentram sua magia na natureza e na comunidade, outros conventículos fazem tratos com diabos e submetem os elementos à própria vontade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777f21fc-1342-42cf-bb28-3bbbb451569a\', \'multiverseId\': 537116}, \'multiverseid\': 537116}, {\'name\': \'Ярая Элементалистка\', \'text\': \'Когда Ярая Элементалистка выходит на поле битвы, верните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Это ведьмы Донхарта направляют свою магию на благо природы и общества. Другие ковены общаются с дьяволами и подчиняют стихии своей воле.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d27f0d6-833b-41c4-824a-14cec9dc5e28\', \'multiverseId\': 537432}, \'multiverseid\': 537432}, {\'name\': \'热诚元素师\', \'text\': \'当热诚元素师进战场时，将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'曙鹿集女巫将魔法聚焦于自然与社群，其他女巫集群则选择与魔共舞或曲物自用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03e4632-e88b-4599-944a-60ee783abaa7\', \'multiverseId\': 537748}, \'multiverseid\': 537748}, {\'name\': \'熱誠元素師\', \'text\': \'當熱誠元素師進戰場時，將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'曙鹿集女巫將魔法聚焦於自然與社群，其他女巫集群則選擇與魔共舞或曲物自用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a9fbd28-4978-46b8-aa04-6a930b3c534e\', \'multiverseId\': 538064}, \'multiverseid\': 538064}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexenhauch-Eindringling\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Hexenhauch-Eindringling ins Spiel kommt, erhält bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b298f18-1782-486f-98f9-fbfb8e71508c\', \'multiverseId\': 535144}, \'multiverseid\': 535144}, {\'name\': \'Intruso de la Nebelgast\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Intruso de la Nebelgast entre al campo de batalla, hasta una criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b620c67-67ea-4bd8-979f-38e2ccda8509\', \'multiverseId\': 535460}, \'multiverseid\': 535460}, {\'name\': \'Intrus du Nebelgast\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Intrus du Nebelgast arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58eacb27-592c-46d0-afe1-60138b9f35f6\', \'multiverseId\': 535776}, \'multiverseid\': 535776}, {\'name\': \'Intruso della Nebelgast\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando l\'Intruso della Nebelgast entra nel campo di battaglia, fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d2ebf9d-5142-4036-a7c0-f7cb638221fa\', \'multiverseId\': 536092}, \'multiverseid\': 536092}, {\'name\': \'ネベルガストの侵入者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nネベルガストの侵入者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e039ed2-1c32-4c6e-b342-ce5e53ad03a7\', \'multiverseId\': 536408}, \'multiverseid\': 536408}, {\'name\': \'네벨가스트 침입자\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n비행\\n네벨가스트 침입자가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3733e9-7375-4759-8a39-7eaa887957f1\', \'multiverseId\': 536724}, \'multiverseid\': 536724}, {\'name\': \'Intruso do Nebelgast\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nQuando Intruso do Nebelgast entra no campo de batalha, até uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -2/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddc5b81-6a17-4c07-b7d5-867a54c659cf\', \'multiverseId\': 537040}, \'multiverseid\': 537040}, {\'name\': \'Нарушитель из Небельгаста\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nКогда Нарушитель из Небельгаста выходит на поле битвы, не более одного целевого существа под контролем оппонента получает -2/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41bda20e-819a-4e6a-9492-dcd84bbe90a3\', \'multiverseId\': 537356}, \'multiverseid\': 537356}, {\'name\': \'鬼雾入侵灵\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当鬼雾入侵灵进战场时，至多一个目标由对手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'839a1b32-d4e5-4591-8d7c-d67a6d958bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 537672}, \'multiverseid\': 537672}, {\'name\': \'鬼霧入侵靈\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n飛行\\n當鬼霧入侵靈進戰場時，至多一個目標由對手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca681f2-b2ea-4808-bd94-3a227c7b5bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 537988}, \'multiverseid\': 537988}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hieb des Mondwüters\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls es Nacht ist.\\nDer Hieb des Mondwüters fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Katharer fielen wie Fallobst, als Tovolar selbst sich ins Getümmel stürzte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddfc87e1-be60-436b-bb13-f5c0d86301f8\', \'multiverseId\': 535243}, \'multiverseid\': 535243}, {\'name\': \'Zarpazo de iralunar\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si es de noche.\\nEl Zarpazo de iralunar hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los cátaros cayeron como moscas en cuanto el mismísimo Tovolar se unió a la batalla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5773ca29-6da4-4d0f-8033-a3b9f2c78bd9\', \'multiverseId\': 535559}, \'multiverseid\': 535559}, {\'name\': \'Balafre du furielune\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer si c\'est la nuit.\\nLa Balafre du furielune inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les cathares tombèrent comme des mouches quand Tovolar en personne rejoignit le combat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e628fba6-71e7-40d9-9220-8d52215d4124\', \'multiverseId\': 535875}, \'multiverseid\': 535875}, {\'name\': \'Squarcio della Guardia Lunare\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se è notte.\\nLo Squarcio della Guardia Lunare infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I catari cadevano come foglie mentre Tovolar in persona si lanciava nella mischia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a9b909-d190-4811-a6fe-61f8214bcb46\', \'multiverseId\': 536191}, \'multiverseid\': 536191}, {\'name\': \'月の憤怒獣の切りつけ\', \'text\': \'夜であるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。月の憤怒獣の切りつけはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'トヴォラーが戦場に参加すると、聖戦士は落ち葉のように散った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3b37b7a-ce32-4c2d-8e20-748366142ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 536507}, \'multiverseid\': 536507}, {\'name\': \'달빛분노전사의 난도질\', \'text\': \'밤이라면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\\n원하는 목표를 정한다. 달빛분노전사의 난도질은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'토볼라르 자신이 전투에 가담하자 성전사들은 낙엽처럼 쓰러졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3cec4bb-4c77-4473-bff4-19028b9cd598\', \'multiverseId\': 536823}, \'multiverseid\': 536823}, {\'name\': \'Laceração do Raivoso Lunar\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada se for noite.\\nLaceração do Raivoso Lunar causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os cátaros caíram como as folhas quando o próprio Tovolar entrou na luta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4161185-114d-438f-b401-11170917fca6\', \'multiverseId\': 537139}, \'multiverseid\': 537139}, {\'name\': \'Удар Лунояра\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2} меньше, если стоит ночь.\\nУдар Лунояра наносит 3 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Катары повалились, как осенние листья, когда сам Товолар вступил в бой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e175da-979b-4c1a-8e54-44083b020b50\', \'multiverseId\': 537455}, \'multiverseid\': 537455}, {\'name\': \'月怒狼挥击\', \'text\': \'如果当前是黑夜，则此咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n月怒狼挥击对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'待托瓦拉亲自上阵，便如同秋风扫落叶一般将护教军彻底击溃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167fc16e-4e80-47f7-abda-4ab256931d99\', \'multiverseId\': 537771}, \'multiverseid\': 537771}, {\'name\': \'月怒狼揮擊\', \'text\': \'如果當前是黑夜，則此咒語減少{2}來施放。\\n月怒狼揮擊對任意一個目標造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'待托瓦拉親自上陣，便如同秋風掃落葉一般將護教軍徹底擊潰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3dd47c-3c13-47f5-bd7a-4c5c8e91baaa\', \'multiverseId\': 538087}, \'multiverseid\': 538087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterhältige Vertuschung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen. Du kannst bis zu vier Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof in deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die neue Vogelscheuche der Witwe Weber schien mehr Krähen anzuziehen, als sie verscheuchte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb23b3fe-4f75-4034-9783-fd0d0017f8f4\', \'multiverseId\': 535125}, \'multiverseid\': 535125}, {\'name\': \'Encubrimiento ladino\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario. Puedes barajar hasta cuatro cartas objetivo de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El nuevo espantapájaros de la viuda Weber atraía a más cuervos de los que ahuyentaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'540bdd48-3a14-4846-a7d6-a806f0f47756\', \'multiverseId\': 535441}, \'multiverseid\': 535441}, {\'name\': \'Dissimulation fourbe\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire. Vous pouvez mélanger jusqu\'à quatre cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le nouvel épouvantail de la veuve Weber semblait attirer plus de corbeaux qu\'il n\'en repoussait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbde662-bd2a-4159-9e68-5ab11bc5cd95\', \'multiverseId\': 535757}, \'multiverseid\': 535757}, {\'name\': \'Insabbiamento Subdolo\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario. Puoi rimescolare nel tuo grimorio fino a quattro carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il nuovo spaventapasseri della vedova Weber sembrava attirare più corvi di quanti ne spaventasse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2aef89-23ee-40ce-bc15-a29e9501017e\', \'multiverseId\': 536073}, \'multiverseid\': 536073}, {\'name\': \'悪賢い隠蔽\', \'text\': \'呪文１つとあなたの墓地にあるカード最大４枚を対象とする。その前者の呪文を打ち消す。その呪文がこれにより打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。あなたは「その後者のカードをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'未亡人ウェバーの新しい案山子は鴉を追い払うどころか更に呼び寄せているかのように思えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f623eb6-907a-4e05-8b94-51fd42e61d66\', \'multiverseId\': 536389}, \'multiverseid\': 536389}, {\'name\': \'기만적인 위장 전술\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 이런 식으로 그 주문이 무효화되면, 그 카드를 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다. 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 최대 네 장까지 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드들을 서고에 섞어 넣을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'과부인 웨버가 새로 만든 허수아비는 쫓아내는 까마귀보다 불러들이는 까마귀가 더 많아 보였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ef1fdce-d4be-4abb-9cb7-d480ba0b6a46\', \'multiverseId\': 536705}, \'multiverseid\': 536705}, {\'name\': \'Abafamento Malicioso\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono. Você pode embaralhar até quatro cards alvo de seu cemitério em seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O novo espantalho da viúva Weber parecia atrair mais corvos do que espantava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe1f46f1-9bb9-493b-87d4-bc47738c4d0e\', \'multiverseId\': 537021}, \'multiverseid\': 537021}, {\'name\': \'Изощренная Уловка\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца. Вы можете втасовать не более четырех целевых карт из вашего кладбища в вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Казалось, что новое пугало вдовы Вебер привлекает больше ворон, чем отпугивает.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977d11fa-5940-46e2-8b59-e50442bdd497\', \'multiverseId\': 537337}, \'multiverseid\': 537337}, {\'name\': \'暗地掩饰\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入拥有者的坟墓场。你可以将至多四张目标牌从你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'寡妇温博新设的稻草人似乎是在招乌鸦，不是赶乌鸦。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7f38c3-155e-41e9-b4cd-61a341550248\', \'multiverseId\': 537653}, \'multiverseid\': 537653}, {\'name\': \'暗地掩飾\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入擁有者的墳墓場。你可以將至多四張目標牌從你的墳墓場洗入你的牌庫。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'寡婦溫博新設的稻草人似乎是在招烏鴉，不是趕烏鴉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04948863-1530-4f03-8e00-7635e18d6628\', \'multiverseId\': 537969}, \'multiverseid\': 537969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Horrorhund\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Horrorhund ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. (Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt oder eine Kreaturenkarte aus einer Bibliothek auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Er treibt Seelen zu ewiger Qual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535183&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242ac5d4-b265-4537-867d-2f14e7c31db0\', \'multiverseId\': 535183}, \'multiverseid\': 535183}, {\'name\': \'Sabueso del terror\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sabueso del terror entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. (Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\\nSiempre que una criatura muera o una carta de criatura vaya a un cementerio desde una biblioteca, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Arrea a las almas hacia el tormento eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f23600-5d60-4142-8f75-a348bcdbc1e7\', \'multiverseId\': 535499}, \'multiverseid\': 535499}, {\'name\': "Chien de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Quand le Chien de l\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes. (Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt ou qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis une bibliothèque, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et chien\', \'flavor\': \'Il rassemble les âmes pour les conduire à leur tourment éternel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7c7743-bef7-4a65-b644-69b4c6a0a98b\', \'multiverseId\': 535815}, \'multiverseid\': 535815}, {\'name\': \'Mastino Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mastino Terrificante entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura muore o una carta creatura viene messa in un cimitero da un grimorio, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Accompagna le anime verso il tormento eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6798c8f7-a90a-4bec-a1aa-4405824738f9\', \'multiverseId\': 536131}, \'multiverseid\': 536131}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の猟犬\', \'text\': \'戦慄の猟犬が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）\\nクリーチャー１体が死亡するか、クリーチャー・カード１枚がライブラリーから墓地に置かれるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・犬\', \'flavor\': \'それは魂の群れを永遠なる苦悩へと追い込むのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b398ad1d-af81-4c3a-abfe-519b3a3b6aef\', \'multiverseId\': 536447}, \'multiverseid\': 536447}, {\'name\': \'공포견\', \'text\': \'공포견이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 세 장을 민다. (당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.)\\n생물이 죽거나 생물 카드가 서고에서 무덤에 놓일 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마 개\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 영원한 고통을 향해서 영혼들을 몰아 간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f05e15-f627-4a44-87fc-7a7f1ea5c96d\', \'multiverseId\': 536763}, \'multiverseid\': 536763}, {\'name\': \'Sabujo do Pavor\', \'text\': \'Quando Sabujo do Pavor entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards. (Coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura morre ou um card de criatura é colocado em um cemitério vindo de um grimório, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio Cão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele pastoreia as almas rumo ao tormento eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36d1ac5-6ad2-4f85-a12b-54425720d9b9\', \'multiverseId\': 537079}, \'multiverseid\': 537079}, {\'name\': \'Гончая Ужаса\', \'text\': \'Когда Гончая Ужаса выходит на поле битвы, скрутите три карты. (Положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.)\\nКаждый раз, когда умирает существо или карта существа кладется на кладбище из библиотеки, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон Собака\', \'flavor\': \'Она гонит души к вечным мучениям.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7d7ef4-4643-4053-ab57-907964d2e9f4\', \'multiverseId\': 537395}, \'multiverseid\': 537395}, {\'name\': \'恐惧猎犬\', \'text\': \'当恐惧猎犬进战场时，磨三张牌。（将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\\n每当一个生物死去或一张生物牌从牌库进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔／狗\', \'flavor\': \'它把灵魂赶向无限苦难。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1bdacaf-e519-4626-8ff1-7906a7621154\', \'multiverseId\': 537711}, \'multiverseid\': 537711}, {\'name\': \'恐懼獵犬\', \'text\': \'當恐懼獵犬進戰場時，磨三張牌。（將你牌庫頂的三張牌置入你的墳墓場。）\\n每當一個生物死去或一張生物牌從牌庫進入墳墓場時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔／狗\', \'flavor\': \'牠把靈魂趕向無限苦難。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c929c72-cd3b-4812-b3ca-4548f3053502\', \'multiverseId\': 538027}, \'multiverseid\': 538027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Humpelnder Zombie\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Humpelnde Zombie stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verwesung. (Er kann nicht blocken. Wenn er angreift, opfere ihn am Ende des Kampfes.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sehe, jemand hat versucht, dich aufzuhalten, mein Hübscher. Wunderbar."\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362492a5-4c47-4e72-a6ba-b3e3471ec672\', \'multiverseId\': 535195}, \'multiverseid\': 535195}, {\'name\': \'Zombie cojo\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Zombie cojo muera, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 con la habilidad de descomposición. (No puede bloquear. Cuando ataque, sacrifícala al final del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Mascota mía, veo que alguien intentó detenerte. Qué maravilla".\\n—Gisa, la Llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ffe45d-2d25-4952-a167-15ba36b8f081\', \'multiverseId\': 535511}, \'multiverseid\': 535511}, {\'name\': \'Zombie boiteux\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel\\nQuand le Zombie boiteux meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie avec la décomposition. (Il ne peut pas bloquer. Quand il attaque, sacrifiez-le à la fin du combat.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Je vois qu\'on a essayé de t\'arrêter, mon petit. Comme c\'est adorable. »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff609336-e093-4a8c-9ce0-d3aa68b5db77\', \'multiverseId\': 535827}, \'multiverseid\': 535827}, {\'name\': \'Zombie Zoppicante\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando lo Zombie Zoppicante muore, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera con decomposto. (Non può bloccare. Quando attacca, sacrificala alla fine del combattimento.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedo che qualcuno ha cercato di fermarti, cucciolo mio. Dilettevole."\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59fb6ba2-4fc5-4721-98ff-6d90a177320e\', \'multiverseId\': 536143}, \'multiverseid\': 536143}, {\'name\': \'引きずり足のゾンビ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n引きずり足のゾンビが死亡したとき、腐乱を持つ黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。（それではブロックできない。それが攻撃したとき、戦闘終了時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「いい子ね。誰かがあなたを止めようとしたようだね。なんて喜ばしいことかしら。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d388ab41-7e6d-453d-b843-627af02e3093\', \'multiverseId\': 536459}, \'multiverseid\': 536459}, {\'name\': \'절뚝이는 좀비\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n절뚝이는 좀비가 죽을 때, 부패를 가진 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (그 생물은 방어할 수 없다. 그 생물이 공격할 때, 전투종료에 그 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"아가야, 누가 널 막으려고 하는 게 보이네. 참 즐겁구나."\\n—악귀소환술사 기샤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506cc0ab-4dbf-46da-b51d-43179dd1019f\', \'multiverseId\': 536775}, \'multiverseid\': 536775}, {\'name\': \'Zumbi Manco\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Zumbi Manco morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2 com decomposto. (Ela não pode bloquear. Quando ela atacar, sacrifique-a no final do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Vejo que alguém tentou deter você, meu bichinho. Que maravilha."\\n— Gisa, Invocadora de Carniçais\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a51d73-ce60-4485-a64e-3221a718c4ef\', \'multiverseId\': 537091}, \'multiverseid\': 537091}, {\'name\': \'Хромоногий Зомби\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Хромоногий Зомби умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби с Трупной гнилью. (Она не может блокировать. Когда она атакует, пожертвуйте ее в конце боя.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Я вижу, кто-то пытался остановить тебя, мой хороший. Как мило».\\n— призывательница упырей Джиза\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5312cf8f-78f6-4e17-9f5d-e9a7ec0e69a0\', \'multiverseId\': 537407}, \'multiverseid\': 537407}, {\'name\': \'蹒跚灵俑\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当蹒跚灵俑死去时，派出一个2/2黑色，具败朽异能的灵俑衍生生物。（它不能进行阻挡。当它攻击，在战斗结束时将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「好像有人想要阻止你，宝贝。真有趣。」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9949ec1-7707-49aa-83d5-97b7d0e62623\', \'multiverseId\': 537723}, \'multiverseid\': 537723}, {\'name\': \'蹣跚殭屍\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n當蹣跚殭屍死去時，派出一個2/2黑色，具敗朽異能的殭屍衍生生物。（它不能進行阻擋。當它攻擊，在戰鬥結束時將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「好像有人想要阻止你，寶貝。真有趣。」\\n～屍鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f323e6-a5ea-4a45-acc3-f8de19bad832\', \'multiverseId\': 538039}, \'multiverseid\': 538039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hunger nach mehr\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 3/1 schwarzen und roten Vampir-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung und Eile, der Trampelschaden verursacht. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\\nRückblende {1}{B}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b6d6856-633a-4f7b-a6cf-7f86368fbd10\', \'multiverseId\': 535338}, \'multiverseid\': 535338}, {\'name\': \'Sed de más\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Vampiro negra y roja 3/1 con las habilidades de arrollar, vínculo vital y prisa. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{B}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce9d231-e3ac-4cc5-af8d-3ea6ca7f0258\', \'multiverseId\': 535654}, \'multiverseid\': 535654}, {\'name\': \'Encore affamée\', \'text\': \'Créez un jeton de créature 3/1 rouge et noire Vampire avec le piétinement, le lien de vie et la célérité. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nFlashback {1}{B}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b956aa4d-d5b9-4ef5-97c9-f06ca8ff8f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 535970}, \'multiverseid\': 535970}, {\'name\': \'Appetito Implacabile\', \'text\': "Crea una pedina creatura Vampiro 3/1 nera e rossa con travolgere, legame vitale e rapidità. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nFlashback {1}{B}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc25626c-8db0-4748-93b3-fe4df76f72f1\', \'multiverseId\': 536286}, \'multiverseid\': 536286}, {\'name\': \'貪欲な食欲\', \'text\': \'トランプルと絆魂と速攻を持つ黒赤の３/１の吸血鬼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{B}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d12bdf6-e348-4fc2-b42e-8e8c6a571df0\', \'multiverseId\': 536602}, \'multiverseid\': 536602}, {\'name\': \'채워지지 않는 굶주림\', \'text\': \'돌진, 생명연결 및 신속을 가진 3/1 흑색 및 적색 흡혈귀 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 생물을 희생한다.\\n회상 {1}{B}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47381f89-94ec-4aa5-b111-ad871b7fdeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 536918}, \'multiverseid\': 536918}, {\'name\': \'Querendo Mais\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Vampiro preta e vermelha 3/1 com atropelar, vínculo com a vida e ímpeto. Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.\\nRecapitular {1}{B}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a672cb-0c3b-46af-861a-3c17166e7cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 537234}, \'multiverseid\': 537234}, {\'name\': \'Жажда Большего\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку существа 3/1 черный и красный Вампир с Пробивным ударом, Цепью жизни и Ускорением. Пожертвуйте ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\nВоспоминание {1}{B}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214c54dd-8249-481e-b9b4-419483670376\', \'multiverseId\': 537550}, \'multiverseid\': 537550}, {\'name\': \'饥渴无边\', \'text\': \'派出一个3/1，黑红双色，具践踏、系命与敏捷异能的吸血鬼衍生生物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\\n返照{1}{B}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69dccce9-daf8-459c-8a05-603be8bd902a\', \'multiverseId\': 537866}, \'multiverseid\': 537866}, {\'name\': \'飢渴無邊\', \'text\': \'派出一個3/1，黑紅雙色，具踐踏、繫命與敏捷異能的吸血鬼衍生生物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。\\n返照{1}{B}{R}（你可以從你墳墓場中施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f66055-79a0-4b66-b7bf-e8d667109ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 538182}, \'multiverseid\': 538182}]', "[{'name': 'Höllischer Griff', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Uralte Übel wohnen in der brennenden Kluft, die Aschenmaul genannt wird, stets bereit, jene zu verschlingen, die so töricht sind, alleine zu reisen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535196&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6e5b61e-5ac9-434c-b41b-6ceaafe90938', 'multiverseId': 535196}, 'multiverseid': 535196}, {'name': 'Agarre infernal', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Pierdes 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los males antiguos moran en el abismo ardiente de Bocaceniza, donde siempre están al acecho para devorar a los inconscientes que viajan solos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535512&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23df3cae-abd9-4c54-b91d-f7d690444bb6', 'multiverseId': 535512}, 'multiverseid': 535512}, {'name': 'Emprise infernale', 'text': 'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Vous perdez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Un mal ancien réside dans la gorge brûlante de Cendregueule, toujours prêt à dévorer ceux qui sont assez stupides pour voyager seuls.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=535828&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd41d756-bf92-4304-996a-4ee3205bdcda', 'multiverseId': 535828}, 'multiverseid': 535828}, {'name': 'Stretta Infernale', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Perdi 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Antichi diavoli abitano i baratri infuocati delle Fauci di Cenere, pronti a divorare chi è abbastanza folle da viaggiare da solo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536144&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b819549c-dcfa-43fa-91c9-0d141e65665d', 'multiverseId': 536144}, 'multiverseid': 536144}, {'name': '冥府の掌握', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '古の悪は灰口と呼ばれる燃え盛る裂け目に潜んでおり、愚かにも独りで旅する者を食い潰してしまう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536460&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '326a78c2-25d4-4bf5-81e7-2251cf823333', 'multiverseId': 536460}, 'multiverseid': 536460}, {'name': '지옥의 움켜쥠', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '고대의 악마들은 잿주둥이라고 불리는 불구덩이 속에서 살고 있으며, 혼자서 여행할 정도로 어리석은 자들을 집어삼킬 만반의 준비가 되어 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=536776&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45531695-8652-4ecd-a366-f636906670dc', 'multiverseId': 536776}, 'multiverseid': 536776}, {'name': 'Garras Infernais', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo. Você perde 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'O ardente desfiladeiro conhecido como Boca Cinzenta é habitado por males ancestrais, ansiosos por devorar os incautos que se arriscam em viagens solitárias.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537092&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9c7da6b-ec0b-4ce3-8a18-77e109edefe8', 'multiverseId': 537092}, 'multiverseid': 537092}, {'name': 'Хватка Преисподней', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Вы теряете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Древнее зло обитает в горящем разломе, что зовется Пепельной пропастью. Оно всегда готово поглотить тех наглецов, кому хватило глупости путешествовать в одиночку.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537408&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df62c731-f57a-4b2a-afcf-0cc87b43ce2c', 'multiverseId': 537408}, 'multiverseid': 537408}, {'name': '炼狱之攫', 'text': '消灭目标生物。你失去2点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '人称烬口的喷火裂谷内住有古老邪物，随时准备吞噬胆敢单独上路的愚蠢旅人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=537724&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7161b63-3b68-44de-9444-fe4a5d720ad4', 'multiverseId': 537724}, 'multiverseid': 537724}, {'name': '煉獄之攫', 'text': '消滅目標生物。你失去2點生命。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '人稱燼口的噴火裂谷內住有古老邪物，隨時準備吞噬膽敢單獨上路的愚蠢旅人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538040&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b51bad1-717e-4adb-aa62-1ec6369aba8b', 'multiverseId': 538040}, 'multiverseid': 538040}]", "[{'name': 'Höllischer Griff', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Uralte Übel wohnen in der brennenden Kluft, die Aschenmaul genannt wird, stets bereit, jene zu verschlingen, die so töricht sind, alleine zu reisen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539062&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c7ca8f1-0e0b-4416-9d3d-f5eb3fe08029', 'multiverseId': 539062}, 'multiverseid': 539062}, {'name': 'Agarre infernal', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Pierdes 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los males antiguos moran en el abismo ardiente de Bocaceniza, donde siempre están al acecho para devorar a los inconscientes que viajan solos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539067&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e5a6af9-f254-4038-8109-bb66db51515b', 'multiverseId': 539067}, 'multiverseid': 539067}, {'name': 'Emprise infernale', 'text': 'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Vous perdez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Un mal ancien réside dans la gorge brûlante de Cendregueule, toujours prêt à dévorer ceux qui sont assez stupides pour voyager seuls.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539072&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d86fc14-b3e7-47f0-969c-8d55ed27cc1b', 'multiverseId': 539072}, 'multiverseid': 539072}, {'name': 'Stretta Infernale', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Perdi 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Antichi diavoli abitano i baratri infuocati delle Fauci di Cenere, pronti a divorare chi è abbastanza folle da viaggiare da solo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539077&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d75638f-9d35-428a-a6eb-157dcae6a30f', 'multiverseId': 539077}, 'multiverseid': 539077}, {'name': '冥府の掌握', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '古の悪は灰口と呼ばれる燃え盛る裂け目に潜んでおり、愚かにも独りで旅する者を食い潰してしまう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539082&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48c6ad9e-768a-4de7-a90c-3917bb38ba4b', 'multiverseId': 539082}, 'multiverseid': 539082}, {'name': '지옥의 움켜쥠', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '고대의 악마들은 잿주둥이라고 불리는 불구덩이 속에서 살고 있으며, 혼자서 여행할 정도로 어리석은 자들을 집어삼킬 만반의 준비가 되어 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539087&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38c5e190-ab4d-4ac2-ab9e-e76eab76f855', 'multiverseId': 539087}, 'multiverseid': 539087}, {'name': 'Garras Infernais', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo. Você perde 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'O ardente desfiladeiro conhecido como Boca Cinzenta é habitado por males ancestrais, ansiosos por devorar os incautos que se arriscam em viagens solitárias.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539092&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e7a24bd-eff7-4907-a8ef-b0d1d8ff9fe3', 'multiverseId': 539092}, 'multiverseid': 539092}, {'name': 'Хватка Преисподней', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Вы теряете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Древнее зло обитает в горящем разломе, что зовется Пепельной пропастью. Оно всегда готово поглотить тех наглецов, кому хватило глупости путешествовать в одиночку.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539097&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6db78ca8-c7f3-4570-96a1-dd7908b28574', 'multiverseId': 539097}, 'multiverseid': 539097}, {'name': '炼狱之攫', 'text': '消灭目标生物。你失去2点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '人称烬口的喷火裂谷内住有古老邪物，随时准备吞噬胆敢单独上路的愚蠢旅人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539102&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c330f463-0251-4686-aeed-8a6b9791b0dd', 'multiverseId': 539102}, 'multiverseid': 539102}, {'name': '煉獄之攫', 'text': '消滅目標生物。你失去2點生命。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '人稱燼口的噴火裂谷內住有古老邪物，隨時準備吞噬膽敢單獨上路的愚蠢旅人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=539107&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c08aeb5d-aaf5-48db-8fe0-2b0854fa93ea', 'multiverseId': 539107}, 'multiverseid': 539107}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538239&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33f7598b-bde9-4d4f-ad1e-7baa8c2dff61', 'multiverseId': 538239}, 'multiverseid': 538239}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538249&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97665229-fe3e-4fc3-8390-a3f3fbc51eb3', 'multiverseId': 538249}, 'multiverseid': 538249}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538259&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b47e8da-e814-49fc-a3b8-25fb1df432dd', 'multiverseId': 538259}, 'multiverseid': 538259}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538269&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd20308e3-9249-4fff-8b91-8c18c7cb751d', 'multiverseId': 538269}, 'multiverseid': 538269}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538279&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddaee6a6-1d24-42fc-8217-67a23d469148', 'multiverseId': 538279}, 'multiverseid': 538279}, {'name': '섬', 'type': '기본 대지 — 섬', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=538289&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62ca8bc5-3182-44b0-9d77-4c5bc44542c6', '